Dialogue: 5,0:01:06.88,0:01:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ I remember ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:01:10.09,0:01:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ That night in May ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:01:13.42,0:01:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ The stars were bright above ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:01:20.00,0:01:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ I'll hope and I'll pray ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.13,0:01:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ To keep Your precious love... ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:01:36.92,0:01:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我年轻的时候 以为刷房子真就是刷房子
Dialogue: 4,0:01:36.92,0:01:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}When I was young, I thought house painters painted houses.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:42.50,0:01:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我懂什么
Dialogue: 4,0:01:42.50,0:01:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What did I know?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:44.50,0:01:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我当时是个工人
Dialogue: 4,0:01:44.50,0:01:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I was a working guy.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:46.88,0:01:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}南费城的卡车司机107号地方工会的工会代表
Dialogue: 4,0:01:46.88,0:01:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A business agent for Teamster Local 107 out of South Philly.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:51.88,0:01:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}千百个工人中的一员
Dialogue: 4,0:01:51.88,0:01:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}One of a thousand working stiffs...
Dialogue: 5,0:01:56.96,0:01:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}直到我不再是了
Dialogue: 4,0:01:56.96,0:01:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}until I wasn't no more.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:00.75,0:02:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}然后
Dialogue: 4,0:02:00.75,0:02:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And then...
Dialogue: 5,0:02:02.96,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我开始刷房子
Dialogue: 4,0:02:02.96,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I started painting houses...
Dialogue: 5,0:02:06.71,0:02:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}亲自
Dialogue: 4,0:02:06.71,0:02:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}myself.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:13.21,0:02:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们女儿的婚礼
Dialogue: 4,0:02:13.21,0:02:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}格蕾丝·安妮·巴法利诺
Dialogue: 3,0:02:13.21,0:02:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}嫁给
Dialogue: 2,0:02:13.21,0:02:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗伯特·里特
Dialogue: 5,0:02:24.00,0:02:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在这件事情上
Dialogue: 4,0:02:24.00,0:02:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}In this particular matter,
Dialogue: 5,0:02:25.38,0:02:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一切都是围绕着婚礼的
Dialogue: 4,0:02:25.38,0:02:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the whole thing was built around the wedding.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:31.13,0:02:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}比尔·巴法利诺的女儿在底特律结婚
Dialogue: 4,0:02:31.13,0:02:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Bill Bufalino's daughter was getting married in Detroit.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:34.55,0:02:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}比尔是卡车司机工会的律师 但更重要的是
Dialogue: 4,0:02:34.55,0:02:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Bill was a Teamster lawyer, but more important,
Dialogue: 5,0:02:36.71,0:02:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他是罗素·巴法利诺的表亲
Dialogue: 4,0:02:36.71,0:02:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he was Russell Bufalino's cousin.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:40.00,0:02:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素不想坐飞机
Dialogue: 4,0:02:40.00,0:02:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Now, Russell didn't want to fly,
Dialogue: 5,0:02:42.42,0:02:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所以我打算开车送他去参加婚礼
Dialogue: 4,0:02:42.42,0:02:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}so I was gonna drive him to the wedding.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:46.30,0:02:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他想顺路处理一些生意上的事情
Dialogue: 4,0:02:46.30,0:02:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He wanted to take care of some business along the way,
Dialogue: 5,0:02:48.63,0:02:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对罗素而言 这就意味着一件事
Dialogue: 4,0:02:48.63,0:02:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}which in Russell's case meant only one thing:
Dialogue: 5,0:02:52.34,0:02:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}钱 收钱
Dialogue: 4,0:02:52.34,0:02:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Money... collecting it.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:54.21,0:02:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所以我们开车去的
Dialogue: 4,0:02:54.21,0:02:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So we'd drive.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:55.71,0:02:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他和他老婆凯丽 以及我和我老婆艾琳
Dialogue: 4,0:02:55.71,0:02:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Him and his wife Carrie and me and my wife Irene.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:58.96,0:03:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我喊她琳妮
Dialogue: 4,0:02:58.96,0:03:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Or I call her Reenie.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:02.34,0:03:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我想着我们走费城外的476号公路
Dialogue: 4,0:03:02.34,0:03:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I figured we would take 476 out of Philly,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:06.00,0:03:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}然后我们到匹兹顿接上罗素
Dialogue: 4,0:03:06.00,0:03:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and then we go up to Pittston and pick up Russ,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:08.50,0:03:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们一般都是这么走的
Dialogue: 4,0:03:08.50,0:03:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}which is usually how we did it,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:10.13,0:03:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}然后沿80号州际公路西段开过宾州
Dialogue: 4,0:03:10.13,0:03:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and then Interstate 80 West through the rest of Pennsylvania,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:15.25,0:03:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}然后我们横穿俄亥俄州到托莱多
Dialogue: 4,0:03:15.25,0:03:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and then we'd go across Ohio, all the way to Toledo,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:19.50,0:03:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}接着我们沿着75号公路北上底特律
Dialogue: 4,0:03:19.50,0:03:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and then we would go 75 North to Detroit.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:26.00,0:03:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}总共要花三天
Dialogue: 4,0:03:26.00,0:03:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It was gonna take about three days
Dialogue: 5,0:03:28.25,0:03:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}算上所有谈生意以及抽烟的时间
Dialogue: 4,0:03:28.25,0:03:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}with all the business breaks and cigarette stops,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:31.59,0:03:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为罗素不允许任何人在车里面抽烟
Dialogue: 4,0:03:31.59,0:03:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}since Russell didn't allow nobody to smoke in the car.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:34.84,0:03:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他说蓝眼睛吉米和迈尔·兰斯基
Dialogue: 4,0:03:34.84,0:03:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He says Jimmy Blue Eyes and Meyer Lansky
Dialogue: 5,0:03:37.80,0:03:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}说服他戒了烟
Dialogue: 4,0:03:37.80,0:03:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}convinced him to stop smoking
Dialogue: 5,0:03:39.46,0:03:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}当时他们从自己在古巴的赌场里被赶了出去
Dialogue: 4,0:03:39.46,0:03:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}when they were getting kicked out of their casinos in Cuba
Dialogue: 5,0:03:41.92,0:03:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还被卡斯特罗开枪打了
Dialogue: 4,0:03:41.92,0:03:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and getting shot at by Castro.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:44.00,0:03:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我也说不清楚 也许是那种
Dialogue: 4,0:03:44.00,0:03:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't know. It might have been one of those,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:46.09,0:03:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"上帝啊如果我活着度过这一劫
Dialogue: 4,0:03:46.09,0:03:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"Please-God-if-I-ever-get-out- of-this-fucking-thing-alive-
Dialogue: 5,0:03:49.88,0:03:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我就再也不抽烟了"的情况
Dialogue: 4,0:03:49.88,0:03:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'll-never-smoke-again things too."
Dialogue: 5,0:03:51.34,0:03:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我知道从卡斯特罗那件事开始
Dialogue: 4,0:03:51.34,0:03:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But I do know that from Castro on,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:54.71,0:03:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素就再也不许别人在车里抽烟了
Dialogue: 4,0:03:54.71,0:03:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Russ wouldn't allow nobody to smoke in his car,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:57.25,0:03:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就连凯丽也不行
Dialogue: 4,0:03:57.25,0:03:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}not even Carrie.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:00.13,0:04:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}听说
Dialogue: 5,0:04:03.96,0:04:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你
Dialogue: 5,0:04:08.96,0:04:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}刷房子
Dialogue: 5,0:04:17.05,0:04:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}能尽快停车吗
Dialogue: 4,0:04:17.05,0:04:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Can we stop soon?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:21.38,0:04:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们刚上车两分钟 亲爱的
Dialogue: 4,0:04:21.38,0:04:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We're only in the car two minutes, honey.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:24.21,0:04:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}甚至还没上公路呢
Dialogue: 4,0:04:24.21,0:04:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We're not even near the highway.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:25.67,0:04:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道 罗素 但你不喜欢在公路上停车
Dialogue: 4,0:04:25.67,0:04:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know, Russell. But you don't like to stop on the highway.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:30.09,0:04:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}也不能这么说
Dialogue: 4,0:04:30.09,0:04:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, it's not that so much.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:31.34,0:04:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是他们不允许你在公路上停车
Dialogue: 4,0:04:31.34,0:04:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They don't let you stop on the highway.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:35.00,0:04:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好吧 那我们就在车里抽吧
Dialogue: 4,0:04:35.00,0:04:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay, so then we'll smoke in the car.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:38.34,0:04:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我的白内障怎么办
Dialogue: 4,0:04:38.34,0:04:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And what about my cataracts?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:41.96,0:04:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我会开窗的
Dialogue: 4,0:04:41.96,0:04:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'll crack the window.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:46.05,0:04:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}凯丽 我发过誓的 记得吗
Dialogue: 4,0:04:46.05,0:04:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Carrie, I made a vow. Remember?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:49.46,0:04:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}记得我发过誓吗 凯丽
Dialogue: 4,0:04:49.46,0:04:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Remember I made a vow, Carrie?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:51.34,0:04:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好吧 这下我不能在...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:51.34,0:04:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, now I can't smoke on...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:53.75,0:04:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}行吧 这下我不能抽烟了
Dialogue: 4,0:04:53.75,0:04:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All right, and now I can't smoke.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:14.88,0:05:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}看见我们到哪了吗
Dialogue: 4,0:05:14.88,0:05:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}See where we are?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:21.46,0:05:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那是...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:21.46,0:05:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Is... Is that...
Dialogue: 5,0:05:24.80,0:05:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}太巧了吧
Dialogue: 4,0:05:24.80,0:05:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What are those odds?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:28.17,0:05:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}德士古石油
Dialogue: 5,0:06:28.88,0:06:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}出什么问题了 小子
Dialogue: 4,0:06:28.88,0:06:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What's the problem, kid?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:34.21,0:06:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不知道 感觉车坏了
Dialogue: 4,0:06:34.21,0:06:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't... I don't know. It sounds funny.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:36.30,0:06:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}车停了 再启动 就没动力了
Dialogue: 4,0:06:36.30,0:06:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It stops, it starts, it loses power.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:40.42,0:06:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我看看能不能给你搭把手
Dialogue: 4,0:06:40.42,0:06:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Let me see if I can give you a hand.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:44.34,0:06:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我看看 检查一下这些塞子
Dialogue: 4,0:06:44.34,0:06:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Let me see. Check all these plugs.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:48.00,0:06:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}火花塞没问题
Dialogue: 4,0:06:48.00,0:06:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Spark plugs are okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:50.30,0:06:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}分电盘盖也没问题
Dialogue: 4,0:06:50.30,0:06:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The distributor cap's okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:52.71,0:06:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}很好
Dialogue: 4,0:06:52.71,0:06:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Good.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:53.96,0:06:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一定是这个...出问题了
Dialogue: 4,0:06:53.96,0:06:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's gotta be something with... with this.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:57.71,0:06:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}定时链
Dialogue: 4,0:06:57.71,0:06:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Timing chain.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:59.46,0:07:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就是这么回事 这上面有个塞子
Dialogue: 4,0:06:59.46,0:07:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is what this is. There's a cap on it.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:02.00,0:07:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这个塞子松了 不应该松的
Dialogue: 4,0:07:02.00,0:07:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This cap is loose. It ain't supposed to be loose.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:05.63,0:07:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所以这意味着它们已经老化了
Dialogue: 4,0:07:05.63,0:07:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So that means they're getting worn out.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:07.55,0:07:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你得...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:07.55,0:07:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You just gotta...
Dialogue: 5,0:07:08.96,0:07:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}试试 拧紧它
Dialogue: 4,0:07:08.96,0:07:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Try that now. Tighten it up.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:16.80,0:07:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我会开车 但不会修车
Dialogue: 4,0:07:16.80,0:07:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I can drive 'em. I can't fix 'em.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:19.42,0:07:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你可以重新上路了 小子
Dialogue: 4,0:07:19.42,0:07:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're back in business, kid.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:21.55,0:07:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谢了
Dialogue: 4,0:07:21.55,0:07:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Thanks.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:24.71,0:07:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我怎么回报你呢 -不用
Dialogue: 4,0:07:24.71,0:07:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I owe you anything? - No.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:26.30,0:07:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你不用回报我
Dialogue: 4,0:07:26.30,0:07:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, you don't owe me anything.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:28.71,0:07:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谢了
Dialogue: 4,0:07:28.71,0:07:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Thanks.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:29.50,0:07:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我叫弗兰克 -你好 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,0:07:29.50,0:07:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Frank. - Hey, Frank. How ya doing?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:34.92,0:07:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你叫什么
Dialogue: 4,0:07:34.92,0:07:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What's your name?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:39.46,0:07:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你是哪里人
Dialogue: 4,0:07:39.46,0:07:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Where you from?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:41.50,0:07:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-费城 -你是费城人啊
Dialogue: 4,0:07:41.50,0:07:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Philly. - Oh, you're from Philly.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:43.42,0:07:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是的
Dialogue: 4,0:07:43.42,0:07:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:46.30,0:07:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在费城你一般去哪玩
Dialogue: 4,0:07:46.30,0:07:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Where you hang out there?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:48.55,0:07:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卡拉汉
Dialogue: 4,0:07:48.55,0:07:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Callahan's.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:50.25,0:07:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}滚球俱乐部
Dialogue: 4,0:07:50.25,0:07:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Bocce Club.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:51.54,0:07:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但那是个酒吧 不是玩滚球的俱乐部
Dialogue: 4,0:07:51.54,0:07:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But it's a bar, it's not a bocce club.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:53.96,0:07:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是嘛 你玩滚球吗
Dialogue: 4,0:07:53.96,0:07:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Oh, yeah. You play bocce?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:55.92,0:07:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不玩
Dialogue: 4,0:07:55.92,0:07:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Nah.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:58.13,0:08:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好了 弗兰克 把那玩意修好
Dialogue: 4,0:07:58.13,0:08:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All right, Frankie... get that fixed.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:01.09,0:08:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为它肯定还会掉链子的 我告诉你
Dialogue: 4,0:08:01.09,0:08:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Because it'll go again on you, I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:02.92,0:08:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-谢谢 -好了
Dialogue: 4,0:08:02.92,0:08:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Thank you. - All right.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:03.59,0:08:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我会去修的 再次感谢
Dialogue: 4,0:08:03.59,0:08:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I will. Thanks again.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:04.62,0:08:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}祝你好运 小兄弟
Dialogue: 4,0:08:04.62,0:08:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Good luck, buddy.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:08.42,0:08:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我以为他是加油站老板
Dialogue: 4,0:08:08.42,0:08:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, I thought maybe he owned the gas station.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:11.05,0:08:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为他一定是个老板 看得出来
Dialogue: 4,0:08:11.05,0:08:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}'Cause he owned something, you could tell.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:13.46,0:08:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}结果发现整条路都是他的
Dialogue: 4,0:08:13.46,0:08:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, it turns out he owned the whole road.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:29.50,0:08:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I Hear You Knockin' - Smiley Lewis
Dialogue: 5,0:08:29.50,0:08:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ You went away and left me long time ago ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:08:30.63,0:08:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}牛排和猪排
Dialogue: 5,0:08:33.10,0:08:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}友好酒吧
Dialogue: 5,0:08:35.20,0:08:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ And now you're knocking on my door ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:08:37.38,0:08:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这只吗
Dialogue: 4,0:08:37.38,0:08:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This one?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:39.91,0:08:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ I hear you knocking ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:08:42.09,0:08:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}敬礼 干了 朋友们
Dialogue: 4,0:08:42.09,0:08:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Salute! Drink up, fellas.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:43.96,0:08:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}上帝保佑
Dialogue: 4,0:08:43.96,0:08:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}God bless.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:45.34,0:08:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}走着 走着 今天一起赚点钱
Dialogue: 4,0:08:45.34,0:08:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Let's go. Let's go. Let's make some money today.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:48.55,0:08:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这可是个酒吧
Dialogue: 4,0:08:48.55,0:08:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's a bar.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:50.42,0:08:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}向你老婆问好
Dialogue: 4,0:08:50.42,0:08:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Say hello to your wife, huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:52.34,0:08:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我有个赚钱的法子 推销那些后腿肉
Dialogue: 4,0:08:52.34,0:08:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I got a way you can earn, to push those hindquarters.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:56.00,0:08:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这里有个人 他会为此出大价钱的
Dialogue: 4,0:08:56.00,0:08:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There's a guy in here, he'll pay a lot of money for them.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:58.67,0:09:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}来吧 我们先干了再谈生意
Dialogue: 4,0:08:58.67,0:09:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Come on, let's shoot this first and then we'll talk business.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:03.17,0:09:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在酒吧的另一头 十二点钟方向...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:03.17,0:09:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}At the other end of the bar, at twelve o'clock...
Dialogue: 5,0:09:05.13,0:09:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}看见他了吗 有点秃的那个
Dialogue: 4,0:09:05.13,0:09:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You see him? He's got a rescinding hairline.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:06.96,0:09:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没错 他能让你赚大钱
Dialogue: 4,0:09:06.96,0:09:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, you'll make a lot of money with him.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:08.46,0:09:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}看见他了吗 瘦剃刀 他是这地方的老板
Dialogue: 4,0:09:08.46,0:09:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}See him there? Skinny Razor. He owns the place.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:11.46,0:09:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}剃刀
Dialogue: 4,0:09:11.46,0:09:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Razor?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:12.55,0:09:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他放高利贷 还在酒吧开了个赌注站
Dialogue: 4,0:09:12.55,0:09:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He shylocks and runs a little book out of the joint.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:14.75,0:09:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他挺能耐的 人脉很广
Dialogue: 4,0:09:14.75,0:09:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's got a lot of good action, good connections.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:17.55,0:09:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-他叫剃刀 -是的 他曾经在肉店工作
Dialogue: 4,0:09:17.55,0:09:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Razor's his name? - Yeah, he used to work at a butcher shop.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:24.09,0:09:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我朋友爱尔兰人弗兰克在这里
Dialogue: 4,0:09:24.09,0:09:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}My friend Frank Irish is here.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:25.51,0:09:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我和你说过的那个
Dialogue: 4,0:09:25.51,0:09:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The one I told you about?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:29.34,0:09:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-开卡车的 -对 运后腿肉
Dialogue: 4,0:09:29.34,0:09:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Oh, the truck. - Yeah, hindquarters.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:32.50,0:09:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我是弗兰克·希兰
Dialogue: 4,0:09:32.50,0:09:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank Sheeran.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:35.38,0:09:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你喜欢牛排吗
Dialogue: 4,0:09:35.38,0:09:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You like steak?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:37.63,0:09:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}喜欢
Dialogue: 4,0:09:37.63,0:09:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I do.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:38.80,0:09:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我送牛排
Dialogue: 4,0:09:38.80,0:09:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I deliver steak.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:40.96,0:09:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是吗
Dialogue: 4,0:09:40.96,0:09:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Do ya?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:41.96,0:09:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}上好的牛排
Dialogue: 4,0:09:41.96,0:09:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Good steak.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:43.88,0:09:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我可以给你送牛排
Dialogue: 4,0:09:43.88,0:09:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I could deliver you steak.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:48.92,0:09:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-可以吗 -可以
Dialogue: 4,0:09:48.92,0:09:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Could ya? - I could.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:51.67,0:09:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}价格也公道 最低价
Dialogue: 4,0:09:51.67,0:09:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Good price too. The best.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:56.00,0:09:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我们晚点再聊 -好的
Dialogue: 4,0:09:56.00,0:09:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- We'll talk later. - Okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:57.75,0:09:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谢了 瘦子
Dialogue: 4,0:09:57.75,0:09:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Thanks, Skinny.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:03.38,0:10:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}外面冷死了
Dialogue: 4,0:10:03.38,0:10:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's freezing out there.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:04.82,0:10:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不介意
Dialogue: 4,0:10:04.82,0:10:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't mind it.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:06.13,0:10:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不行 我怕冷
Dialogue: 4,0:10:06.13,0:10:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Not me. I hate it.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:08.84,0:10:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}帮我个忙 你出去的时候...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:08.84,0:10:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hey, do me a favor. When you go outside...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:11.50,0:10:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}帮我把封条装上
Dialogue: 4,0:10:11.50,0:10:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}put the seal on for me.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:15.46,0:10:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-好吧 反正我得出去 -我欠你个人情
Dialogue: 4,0:10:15.46,0:10:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- All right. I gotta go out anyway. - I owe you one.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:18.75,0:10:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ You'd better go back to your used-to-be ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:10:24.50,0:10:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Because your love's no good to me ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:10:29.46,0:10:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ I hear you knocking ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:10:30.09,0:10:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}友好酒吧
Dialogue: 5,0:10:33.96,0:10:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ But you can't come in ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:10:41.09,0:10:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ I hear you knocking ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:10:45.50,0:10:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Go back where you've been ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:11:16.21,0:11:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ They call, they call me the fat man ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:11:19.92,0:11:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 'Cause I weigh two hundred pounds... ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:11:20.75,0:11:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}25块 A级后腿肉
Dialogue: 5,0:11:23.30,0:11:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}给 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,0:11:23.30,0:11:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There you go, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:25.34,0:11:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-下次见 -好的 托尼 谢了
Dialogue: 4,0:11:25.34,0:11:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- See you next time. - All right, Tony. Thanks.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:29.88,0:11:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好多了 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,0:11:29.88,0:11:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Much better, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:31.55,0:11:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不碰特选级 只运极佳级
Dialogue: 5,0:11:31.55,0:11:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}美国牛肉分级制度中
Dialogue: 4,0:11:31.55,0:11:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't go near Choice. I only do Prime. That's it.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:31.55,0:11:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}极佳级和特选级
Dialogue: 2,0:11:31.55,0:11:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}分别为最好的前两个等级
Dialogue: 5,0:11:34.84,0:11:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}下周二能再给我搞一些来吗
Dialogue: 4,0:11:34.84,0:11:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Can I get some more for next Tuesday?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:37.13,0:11:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你想要多少
Dialogue: 4,0:11:37.13,0:11:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}How many you want?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:40.09,0:11:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}至少五块
Dialogue: 4,0:11:40.09,0:11:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}At least five.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:43.05,0:11:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好的 给你五块
Dialogue: 4,0:11:43.05,0:11:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay. Five, you got.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:54.67,0:11:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-阿门 -阿门
Dialogue: 4,0:11:54.67,0:11:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Amen. - Amen.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:56.63,0:11:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}阿门
Dialogue: 4,0:11:56.63,0:11:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Amen.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:05.34,0:12:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这他妈是怎么回事
Dialogue: 4,0:12:05.34,0:12:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What the fuck is this?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:08.46,0:12:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}托尼 我不...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:08.46,0:12:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tony, I don't...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:09.96,0:12:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这他妈是怎么回事 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,0:12:09.96,0:12:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What the fuck is this, Frank?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:11.14,0:12:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不知道
Dialogue: 4,0:12:11.14,0:12:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't... I don't know.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:13.42,0:12:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我是说...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:13.42,0:12:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:14.75,0:12:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}车不是我装的
Dialogue: 4,0:12:14.75,0:12:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't load the truck.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:16.63,0:12:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是装车的人装的车
Dialogue: 4,0:12:16.63,0:12:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The loaders are supposed to load the truck.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:18.25,0:12:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}也许他们没干好自己的活儿 我不知道
Dialogue: 4,0:12:18.25,0:12:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Maybe they didn't do their work. I don't know.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:19.55,0:12:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你没意识到车变轻了吗
Dialogue: 4,0:12:19.55,0:12:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You didn't realize you were driving a light horse?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:22.05,0:12:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没有 我只是...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:22.05,0:12:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No. I just...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:22.99,0:12:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没意识到 感觉挺正常的
Dialogue: 4,0:12:22.99,0:12:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Nothing. It felt fine.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:24.13,0:12:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}拜托 弗兰克 拜托
Dialogue: 4,0:12:24.13,0:12:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Oh, come on, Frank. Come on.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:26.17,0:12:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我说的是真的 我...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:26.17,0:12:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm telling you. I...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:29.21,0:12:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}千真万确 我真不知道是怎么回事
Dialogue: 4,0:12:29.21,0:12:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}God's truth. I just don't know what happened.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:31.38,0:12:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不知道 也许是...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:31.38,0:12:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't know. Maybe some...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:36.75,0:12:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-车是空的 -我知道
Dialogue: 4,0:12:36.75,0:12:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- It's empty. - I know it is.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:39.84,0:12:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道
Dialogue: 4,0:12:39.84,0:12:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know it is.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:41.88,0:12:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们看什么看 回去工作
Dialogue: 4,0:12:41.88,0:12:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What are you guys looking at? Go back to work.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:44.63,0:12:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所有人
Dialogue: 4,0:12:44.63,0:12:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All of youse!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:47.80,0:12:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我怎么和老板交待
Dialogue: 4,0:12:47.80,0:12:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What am I gonna tell the boss?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:49.30,0:12:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我说了我真不知道是怎么回事
Dialogue: 4,0:12:49.30,0:12:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, I'm telling you that I don't know what's going on.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:51.25,0:12:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别问我 因为我...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:51.25,0:12:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Just don't look at me 'cause I, you know...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:53.09,0:12:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那我还能去问谁
Dialogue: 4,0:12:53.09,0:12:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, who else can I look at?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:54.38,0:12:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这件事可不能怪在我头上 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,0:12:54.38,0:12:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is not gonna be on me, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:56.00,0:12:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我都说了 -也怪不到我头上
Dialogue: 4,0:12:56.00,0:12:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I'm telling you right now. - Not gonna be on me,
Dialogue: 5,0:12:57.13,0:12:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我只是开车的 别的什么都没干
Dialogue: 4,0:12:57.13,0:12:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I just drive the truck. That's all I do.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:58.55,0:13:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好吧 弗兰克·希兰 是叫这个吗
Dialogue: 4,0:12:58.55,0:13:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay, Frank Sheeran. Am I saying that right?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:59.75,0:13:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}律师
Dialogue: 3,0:12:59.75,0:13:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}威廉·E·巴法利诺
Dialogue: 5,0:13:01.34,0:13:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是的 就是这名字
Dialogue: 4,0:13:01.34,0:13:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, you said right.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:03.00,0:13:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}根据合同 这得感谢吉米·霍法
Dialogue: 4,0:13:03.00,0:13:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Under the contract, thanks to Jimmy Hoffa...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:07.21,0:13:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}管理层只能在有非常具体的指控时才能开除司机
Dialogue: 4,0:13:07.21,0:13:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}management can only fire a driver on very specific charges.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:10.59,0:13:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你上班迟到过吗 -没有
Dialogue: 4,0:13:10.59,0:13:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- So, you ever show up late? - No.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:12.92,0:13:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-有任何交通违规吗 -没有
Dialogue: 4,0:13:12.92,0:13:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Do you have any moving violations? - No.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:14.63,0:13:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你在工作期间喝酒吗 -不喝
Dialogue: 4,0:13:14.63,0:13:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Do you drink on the job? - No.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:16.42,0:13:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你打过人吗
Dialogue: 4,0:13:16.42,0:13:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You ever hit anybody?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:18.38,0:13:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-在工作期间吗 -对
Dialogue: 4,0:13:18.38,0:13:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- On the job? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:19.55,0:13:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-那没有 -好的
Dialogue: 4,0:13:19.55,0:13:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- No. - Okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:21.75,0:13:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}偷窃不算吗
Dialogue: 4,0:13:21.75,0:13:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What about stealing, that ain't grounds?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:24.30,0:13:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这个嘛
Dialogue: 4,0:13:24.30,0:13:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:26.00,0:13:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们能证明吗
Dialogue: 4,0:13:26.00,0:13:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}can they prove it?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:28.21,0:13:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}应该不能
Dialogue: 4,0:13:28.21,0:13:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:29.25,0:13:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那就没什么好担心的了
Dialogue: 4,0:13:29.25,0:13:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All right then, we don't have nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:34.25,0:13:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如果他们能证明
Dialogue: 4,0:13:34.25,0:13:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If they can prove it,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:36.21,0:13:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们也只是想让你供出其他同伙的名字
Dialogue: 4,0:13:36.21,0:13:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}they're just gonna want names from you. Accomplices.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:38.84,0:13:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}仅此而已 你交代几个名字就能回家了
Dialogue: 4,0:13:38.84,0:13:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's all. You give them a couple of names, you go home.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:41.30,0:13:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还能保住你的工作
Dialogue: 4,0:13:41.30,0:13:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Keep your job.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:43.59,0:13:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你觉得怎么样
Dialogue: 4,0:13:43.59,0:13:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What do you think about that?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:44.50,0:13:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你会交代名字吗 -不
Dialogue: 4,0:13:44.50,0:13:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Would you give them names? - No.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:46.96,0:13:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没有名字
Dialogue: 4,0:13:46.96,0:13:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No names.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:52.38,0:13:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道吧 我并不...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:52.38,0:13:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know, I don't, uh...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:54.13,0:13:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我并不关心你到底做没做
Dialogue: 4,0:13:54.13,0:13:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't care whether you did it or not.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:56.30,0:13:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对我来说没有区别
Dialogue: 4,0:13:56.30,0:13:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That makes no difference to me.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:57.50,0:14:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我知道 -我是来帮你辩护的 对吧
Dialogue: 4,0:13:57.50,0:14:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Yeah, I know. - I'm here to defend you. Right?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:00.17,0:14:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对
Dialogue: 4,0:14:00.17,0:14:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Right.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:06.09,0:14:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}怎么 你想知道我到底做没做吗
Dialogue: 4,0:14:06.09,0:14:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What, you want to know if I did it or not?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:07.67,0:14:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这个嘛
Dialogue: 4,0:14:07.67,0:14:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:11.00,0:14:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不管怎样我都会替你辩护
Dialogue: 4,0:14:11.00,0:14:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm gonna defend you either way.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:12.25,0:14:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道 只是...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:12.25,0:14:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, all right, but...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:16.17,0:14:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我没偷他们东西时可是勤勤恳恳工作的
Dialogue: 4,0:14:16.17,0:14:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I, I work hard for them when I ain't stealing from 'em.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:22.21,0:14:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}法官大人 如果这是是非对错的问题
Dialogue: 4,0:14:22.21,0:14:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Your Honor, if this was about right or wrong,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:24.63,0:14:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}公司应该早就开除希兰先生了
Dialogue: 4,0:14:24.63,0:14:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the company would have sought Mr. Sheeran's dismissal.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:27.21,0:14:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}可他们没有
Dialogue: 4,0:14:27.21,0:14:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They didn't.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:28.46,0:14:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们指控希兰先生
Dialogue: 4,0:14:28.46,0:14:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They only accused Mr. Sheeran
Dialogue: 5,0:14:30.21,0:14:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}只是因为公司希望他能指认同伙
Dialogue: 4,0:14:30.21,0:14:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}because the company hoped he could name conspirators,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:32.71,0:14:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}而他没法指认 因为并不存在什么同伙
Dialogue: 4,0:14:32.71,0:14:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}which he couldn't do because they don't exist.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:35.92,0:14:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不存在同伙是因为他并没有偷东西
Dialogue: 4,0:14:35.92,0:14:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They don't exist because he didn't steal anything.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:38.71,0:14:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他没偷东西是因为他是个模范员工
Dialogue: 4,0:14:38.71,0:14:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He didn't steal anything because he's an exemplary employee,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:42.38,0:14:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}工作八年都没请过一天病假
Dialogue: 4,0:14:42.38,0:14:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}who in eight years has never taken a day of sick leave.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:46.38,0:14:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他唯一违反过的只有他自己工会的规矩
Dialogue: 4,0:14:46.38,0:14:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The only rule he ever broke is his own union's,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:48.46,0:14:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在冷死人的大冬天 帮其他人把半扇半扇的牛肉
Dialogue: 4,0:14:48.46,0:14:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}by helping others carry sides of beef from his truck
Dialogue: 5,0:14:51.75,0:14:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}从他的卡车上搬进他们的冷藏库里
Dialogue: 4,0:14:51.75,0:14:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to their refrigerators in the dead of winter.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:57.42,0:14:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}全体起立
Dialogue: 4,0:14:57.42,0:14:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All rise.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:58.50,0:14:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}现在开庭
Dialogue: 4,0:14:58.50,0:14:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Court is in session.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:00.88,0:15:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我要驳回此案并给予警告
Dialogue: 4,0:15:00.88,0:15:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm dismissing this case with a warning.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:03.09,0:15:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好的 法官大人
Dialogue: 4,0:15:03.09,0:15:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yes, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:04.09,0:15:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不 不是警告你 希兰先生
Dialogue: 4,0:15:04.09,0:15:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, no, not you, Mr. Sheeran.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:06.05,0:15:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们下次要是再把工人告上法庭
Dialogue: 4,0:15:06.05,0:15:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You bring another working man before this court
Dialogue: 5,0:15:08.55,0:15:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没有证据而只有威胁
Dialogue: 4,0:15:08.55,0:15:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}with threats instead of evidence,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:10.25,0:15:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}相信我 你们会后悔的
Dialogue: 4,0:15:10.25,0:15:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}believe me, you'll be sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:11.92,0:15:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}要是我持有这家公司的股份 我一定赶紧卖了
Dialogue: 4,0:15:11.92,0:15:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If I owned stock in this company, I would sell it.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:15.67,0:15:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不知道他怎么做到的 我也不会问
Dialogue: 4,0:15:15.67,0:15:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't know how he did it, and I ain't gonna ask.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:18.05,0:15:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我只知道比尔·巴法利诺帮我摆脱了一件
Dialogue: 4,0:15:18.05,0:15:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All I know is that Bill Bufalino got me out of
Dialogue: 5,0:15:21.09,0:15:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我原本绝无可能脱身的案子
Dialogue: 4,0:15:21.09,0:15:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}a case where I should never have gotten away with it.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:21.75,0:15:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗马别墅餐厅酒吧
Dialogue: 5,0:15:24.05,0:15:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我本该彻底败诉的
Dialogue: 4,0:15:24.05,0:15:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I should've been down for the count.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:25.55,0:15:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}人们会感谢你今天的所作所为 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,0:15:25.55,0:15:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}People are gonna appreciate what you did today, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:28.05,0:15:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们有家人 有孩子
Dialogue: 4,0:15:28.05,0:15:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know, they got families, they got kids.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:32.05,0:15:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们需要这些工作
Dialogue: 4,0:15:32.05,0:15:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They need those jobs.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:35.05,0:15:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}然而 我们却在外庆祝
Dialogue: 4,0:15:35.05,0:15:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Instead, we went out celebrating...
Dialogue: 5,0:15:37.17,0:15:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素
Dialogue: 4,0:15:37.17,0:15:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Russell!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:37.88,0:15:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}而我则就此走上了
Dialogue: 4,0:15:37.88,0:15:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...and I met what was gonna turn out to be
Dialogue: 5,0:15:40.59,0:15:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}余生的道路
Dialogue: 4,0:15:40.59,0:15:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:41.50,0:15:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我就觉得刚进来的人是你
Dialogue: 4,0:15:41.50,0:15:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know, I thought that was you walking in outside.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:43.71,0:15:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}当然了 这可是我们的地盘
Dialogue: 4,0:15:43.71,0:15:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, yeah, you know, this is our place.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:45.55,0:15:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我给你介绍个叫弗兰克的新人吧
Dialogue: 4,0:15:45.55,0:15:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Can I introduce you to this new guy Frank?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:47.92,0:15:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}当然 好的
Dialogue: 4,0:15:47.92,0:15:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:49.34,0:15:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克 来见见我的表兄罗素·巴法利诺
Dialogue: 4,0:15:49.34,0:15:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank, I want you to meet my cousin Russell Bufalino.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:51.88,0:15:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你好啊 -你好 幸会
Dialogue: 4,0:15:51.88,0:15:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- How are ya? - Hi, nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:53.50,0:15:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}几个月前你帮我修过我的卡车
Dialogue: 4,0:15:53.50,0:15:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You helped me with my truck a couple of months ago.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:55.75,0:15:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没错 想起来了 定时链坏了
Dialogue: 4,0:15:55.75,0:15:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Oh, yeah, yeah, that's right. The timing chain.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:58.09,0:15:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-对 -你找人修了吗
Dialogue: 4,0:15:58.09,0:15:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Yeah. - Did you get it fixed?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:59.59,0:16:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我第二天就找人修了 -好样的
Dialogue: 4,0:15:59.59,0:16:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I fixed it the next day, yeah. - Attaboy.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:01.75,0:16:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-再次感谢你 -不客气
Dialogue: 4,0:16:01.75,0:16:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Thanks again. - Oh, you're welcome.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:03.80,0:16:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我的荣幸 你修好了就好
Dialogue: 4,0:16:03.80,0:16:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}My pleasure. I'm glad you fixed it.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:11.34,0:16:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你最好注意点
Dialogue: 4,0:16:11.34,0:16:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You better watch.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:12.00,0:16:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这里有很多不好惹的家伙 他跟你说了吗
Dialogue: 4,0:16:12.00,0:16:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There's a lot of tough guys around here. Did he tell ya?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:15.88,0:16:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你并不怕不好惹的家伙 是吧
Dialogue: 4,0:16:15.88,0:16:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're not afraid of tough guys, are ya?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:17.30,0:16:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对
Dialogue: 4,0:16:17.30,0:16:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:18.25,0:16:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我想也是 回见
Dialogue: 4,0:16:18.25,0:16:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I didn't think so. I'll see you around.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:20.34,0:16:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-好的 -谢了 罗素
Dialogue: 4,0:16:20.34,0:16:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Okay. - Thanks, Russell.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:21.96,0:16:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你表兄之前帮了我大忙
Dialogue: 4,0:16:21.96,0:16:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Your cousin saved my ass.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:23.96,0:16:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不然我可能会损失一整车的货
Dialogue: 4,0:16:23.96,0:16:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I could've lost the whole load.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:25.46,0:16:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是啊 他非常了解卡车
Dialogue: 4,0:16:25.46,0:16:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, yeah. Well, he knows everything about trucks, really.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:28.21,0:16:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他在汽水公司干过很长时间
Dialogue: 4,0:16:28.21,0:16:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, he worked at Canada Dry for a long time.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:30.05,0:16:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-维托 你好吗 -幸会
Dialogue: 4,0:16:30.05,0:16:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Vito, how are you? - Pleasure.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:31.09,0:16:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们去坐卡座吧
Dialogue: 4,0:16:31.09,0:16:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I think, uh... Let's take the booth.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:33.13,0:16:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}来吧 你会喜欢这里的
Dialogue: 4,0:16:33.13,0:16:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Come on. You're gonna love this.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:34.55,0:16:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}也许我当时还不知道罗素·巴法利诺是谁
Dialogue: 4,0:16:34.55,0:16:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Maybe I didn't know who Russell Bufalino was back then,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:38.75,0:16:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我在报纸上看过无数照片和报道
Dialogue: 4,0:16:38.75,0:16:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but I'd seen enough pictures and stories in the newspapers
Dialogue: 5,0:16:41.59,0:16:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}足以知道当时跟他一起吃饭的是安吉洛·布鲁诺
Dialogue: 4,0:16:41.59,0:16:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to know he was eatin' with Angelo Bruno.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:43.88,0:16:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}布鲁诺当时刚成为
Dialogue: 4,0:16:43.88,0:16:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, Bruno, he... he was just made
Dialogue: 5,0:16:46.38,0:16:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}费城的新任老大
Dialogue: 4,0:16:46.38,0:16:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the new boss of Philadelphia.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:48.34,0:16:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}从费城到大西洋城的一切都由他负责
Dialogue: 4,0:16:48.34,0:16:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He took care of everything from Philadelphia to Atlantic City.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:51.46,0:16:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这点我是知道的
Dialogue: 4,0:16:51.46,0:16:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That, I knew.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:55.13,0:17:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}安吉洛·布鲁诺
Dialogue: 4,0:16:55.13,0:17:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}1980年在自家门外的自家车里
Dialogue: 3,0:16:55.13,0:17:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}头部中枪而亡
Dialogue: 5,0:17:00.09,0:17:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}而我当时只需知道这些
Dialogue: 4,0:17:00.09,0:17:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And that was all I had to know
Dialogue: 5,0:17:02.05,0:17:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就能知道罗素·巴法利诺
Dialogue: 4,0:17:02.05,0:17:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to know that Russell Bufalino
Dialogue: 5,0:17:03.80,0:17:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}绝不是汽水公司的卡车维修工
Dialogue: 4,0:17:03.80,0:17:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}was no truck mechanic from Canada Dry.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:11.59,0:17:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这面包真棒
Dialogue: 4,0:17:11.59,0:17:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This bread is very good.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:13.96,0:17:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-好吃吧 -好吃
Dialogue: 4,0:17:13.96,0:17:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Good, eh? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:16.92,0:17:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你这样的爱尔兰人是在哪学的意大利语
Dialogue: 4,0:17:16.92,0:17:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Where did an Irisher like you learn to speak Italian?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:21.67,0:17:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在意大利 二战的时候
Dialogue: 4,0:17:21.67,0:17:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}In Italy - the war.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:24.67,0:17:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}意大利哪里
Dialogue: 4,0:17:24.67,0:17:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Where?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:26.46,0:17:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}萨莱诺
Dialogue: 4,0:17:26.46,0:17:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Salerno.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:28.80,0:17:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}安齐奥
Dialogue: 4,0:17:28.80,0:17:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Anzio.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:30.92,0:17:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}西西里岛
Dialogue: 4,0:17:30.92,0:17:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Sicily...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:32.30,0:17:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卡塔尼亚附近
Dialogue: 4,0:17:32.30,0:17:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}around Catania.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:33.46,0:17:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卡塔尼亚 我就是卡塔尼亚人
Dialogue: 4,0:17:33.46,0:17:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Catania? I'm from Catania.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:36.42,0:17:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是吗 我就觉得你有点卡塔尼亚口音
Dialogue: 4,0:17:36.42,0:17:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah? I thought you had an accent like Catania.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:43.30,0:17:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你参战了多久
Dialogue: 4,0:17:43.30,0:17:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}How long were you in the war?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:46.55,0:17:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}四年
Dialogue: 4,0:17:46.55,0:17:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Four years.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:48.21,0:17:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}411天在战场上
Dialogue: 4,0:17:48.21,0:17:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}411 days in combat...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:51.88,0:17:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}122天在安齐奥
Dialogue: 4,0:17:51.88,0:17:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}122 at Anzio.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:54.55,0:17:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}45步兵团的
Dialogue: 4,0:17:54.55,0:17:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Forty-fifth Infantry.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:57.50,0:17:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我的天
Dialogue: 4,0:17:57.50,0:17:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Minchia.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:59.30,0:18:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-是啊 -天啊
Dialogue: 4,0:17:59.30,0:18:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Yeah. - Minchia.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:00.52,0:18:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对的
Dialogue: 4,0:18:00.52,0:18:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:03.25,0:18:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你当时怕死吗
Dialogue: 4,0:18:03.25,0:18:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Were you afraid of dying?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:07.55,0:18:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一直很怕
Dialogue: 4,0:18:07.55,0:18:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Always afraid.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:09.50,0:18:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}要是有人说他不怕可千万别信
Dialogue: 4,0:18:09.50,0:18:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And don't let anybody tell you that they weren't afraid.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:12.92,0:18:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-那纯属胡扯 知道吗 -是啊
Dialogue: 4,0:18:12.92,0:18:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- That's a lot of bullshit. You know? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:15.21,0:18:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}人人都很害怕 而且会经常祈祷
Dialogue: 4,0:18:15.21,0:18:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Everybody's afraid. And you pray a lot.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:18.09,0:18:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我就经常祈祷
Dialogue: 4,0:18:18.09,0:18:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I prayed a lot.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:19.71,0:18:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我祈祷说 要是能活着离开
Dialogue: 4,0:18:19.71,0:18:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I prayed that I'd never sin again as long as I live
Dialogue: 5,0:18:22.34,0:18:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我这辈子一定再也不沾染罪恶
Dialogue: 4,0:18:22.34,0:18:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}if I could just get out of here.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:25.50,0:18:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但紧接着战斗就开始了
Dialogue: 4,0:18:25.50,0:18:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But then the fighting starts
Dialogue: 5,0:18:26.75,0:18:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你就把一切都忘了
Dialogue: 4,0:18:26.75,0:18:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and then you forget about everything.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:29.21,0:18:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你只想活下来 保住小命
Dialogue: 4,0:18:29.21,0:18:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're just trying to survive, stay alive.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:33.75,0:18:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}当我明白自己撑过了战争时
Dialogue: 4,0:18:33.75,0:18:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Once I saw that I was getting through the war,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:36.46,0:18:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我看了看自己的周围 说...
Dialogue: 4,0:18:36.46,0:18:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I looked around me, I said...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:39.09,0:18:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我说 "从现在起 一切顺其自然"
Dialogue: 4,0:18:39.09,0:18:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I said, "From now on, whatever happens, happens."
Dialogue: 5,0:18:43.46,0:18:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}听天由命 去他的
Dialogue: 4,0:18:43.46,0:18:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Che successe successe. Fuck it.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:46.75,0:18:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你懂的 你接到命令就得奉命行事
Dialogue: 4,0:18:46.75,0:18:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know, you got orders, you follow them.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:49.38,0:18:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们让你带几个俘虏去树林里
Dialogue: 4,0:18:49.38,0:18:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They tell you to bring some prisoners into... into the woods,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:52.59,0:18:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们并不会告诉你该怎么做
Dialogue: 4,0:18:52.59,0:18:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you know, and they don't tell you what to do...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:56.59,0:18:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们只说 "动作快点"
Dialogue: 4,0:18:56.59,0:18:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But they just say, you know, "Hurry up."
Dialogue: 5,0:19:01.92,0:19:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}说来疯狂 但我一直不能理解
Dialogue: 4,0:19:01.92,0:19:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's crazy, but I never understood
Dialogue: 5,0:19:04.42,0:19:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们怎么会乖乖听话
Dialogue: 4,0:19:04.42,0:19:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}how they would just keep digging
Dialogue: 5,0:19:07.25,0:19:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}挖自己的坟墓
Dialogue: 4,0:19:07.25,0:19:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}their own graves, you know. I mean...
Dialogue: 5,0:19:08.71,0:19:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}停
Dialogue: 4,0:19:08.71,0:19:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Stop!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:10.46,0:19:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}上来
Dialogue: 4,0:19:10.46,0:19:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Raus!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:15.09,0:19:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}可能他们觉得如果干得好
Dialogue: 4,0:19:15.09,0:19:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, I mean, maybe they thought if they did a good job,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:19.00,0:19:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那个拿枪的人
Dialogue: 4,0:19:19.00,0:19:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the guy with the gun
Dialogue: 5,0:19:21.05,0:19:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就会改变主意
Dialogue: 4,0:19:21.05,0:19:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}would change his mind.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:39.13,0:19:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素 他立刻就对我有了好感
Dialogue: 4,0:19:39.13,0:19:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Russell, he... he took a shine to me right away.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:43.55,0:19:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不久之后
Dialogue: 4,0:19:43.55,0:19:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}After a while,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:45.42,0:19:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他就开始给我分派些小任务了
Dialogue: 4,0:19:45.42,0:19:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he started giving me little things to do.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:49.17,0:19:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不过那时候 安吉洛本人
Dialogue: 4,0:19:49.17,0:19:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But then Angelo himself,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:51.42,0:19:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}也开始交给我一些小任务了
Dialogue: 4,0:19:51.42,0:19:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he started giving me little things to do too.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:57.59,0:19:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素的老婆 凯丽
Dialogue: 4,0:19:57.59,0:19:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Russ's wife, Carrie,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:59.59,0:20:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她的家族很久很久以前
Dialogue: 4,0:19:59.59,0:20:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}her family goes all the way back, way, way back
Dialogue: 5,0:20:01.25,0:20:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在西西里岛跟巴法利诺家族是一个镇上的
Dialogue: 4,0:20:01.25,0:20:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to the same town in Sicily as the Bufalinos.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:05.38,0:20:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们总会谈论这事
Dialogue: 4,0:20:05.38,0:20:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They talked about it all the time.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:07.84,0:20:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她来自黑帮中的皇室 可以这么说
Dialogue: 4,0:20:07.84,0:20:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}She came from mob royalty, if you want to call it that.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:11.25,0:20:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}希安德拉家族
Dialogue: 5,0:20:11.30,0:20:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}希安德拉家族 对他们来说 就好像他们是早期
Dialogue: 4,0:20:11.30,0:20:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The Sciandras. To them, it was like they came over on the...
Dialogue: 5,0:20:15.13,0:20:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}乘坐意大利五月花号来到美国的
Dialogue: 4,0:20:15.13,0:20:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the Italian Mayflower.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:15.15,0:20:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}五月花号是英国移民驶往北美的
Dialogue: 3,0:20:15.15,0:20:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一艘最为著名的船只
Dialogue: 5,0:20:44.55,0:20:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你上楼去吧 清洗一下
Dialogue: 4,0:20:44.55,0:20:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Why don't you go upstairs, wash up.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:48.09,0:20:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}衣服给我 我去处理
Dialogue: 4,0:20:48.09,0:20:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Give me those clothes. I'll get rid of them.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:54.13,0:20:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别忘了脱鞋 罗素
Dialogue: 4,0:20:54.13,0:20:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Don't forget your shoes, Russell.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:05.17,0:21:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,0:21:05.17,0:21:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hey, Frank,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:07.09,0:21:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}能尽快停车吗
Dialogue: 4,0:21:07.09,0:21:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}can we stop soon?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:08.67,0:21:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}问问你老公吧 罗素
Dialogue: 4,0:21:08.67,0:21:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, yeah, well, ask your husband. Russell?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:12.96,0:21:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他都睡死了
Dialogue: 4,0:21:12.96,0:21:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's out cold.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:24.42,0:21:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不用 我能行
Dialogue: 4,0:21:24.42,0:21:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, no, I got it.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:25.67,0:21:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-能行吗 -行
Dialogue: 4,0:21:25.67,0:21:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Sure? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:33.34,0:21:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们到哪了
Dialogue: 4,0:21:33.34,0:21:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Where are we?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:34.50,0:21:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}快到路易斯堡了
Dialogue: 4,0:21:34.50,0:21:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We're close to Lewisburg.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:37.09,0:21:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}到了告诉我 提醒我一下
Dialogue: 4,0:21:37.09,0:21:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Let me know when we get there. Remind me.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:38.80,0:21:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我有几个地方要去 -好的
Dialogue: 4,0:21:38.80,0:21:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I got some stops to make. - Okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:52.75,0:21:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素的生意无所不包
Dialogue: 4,0:21:52.75,0:21:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Russell had a piece of everything.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:58.30,0:22:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他在皮茨顿有家店叫佩恩布帘店
Dialogue: 4,0:21:58.30,0:22:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He had this store in Pittston called Penn Drape & Curtains.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:02.05,0:22:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他在那里经营着一切生意
Dialogue: 4,0:22:02.05,0:22:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And he ran everything out of there.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:04.75,0:22:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谁知道都有些什么
Dialogue: 4,0:22:04.75,0:22:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Who knew what it all was?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:06.59,0:22:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他肯定有合伙人
Dialogue: 4,0:22:06.59,0:22:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, I'm sure the man had partners.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:08.42,0:22:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这种人总是有合伙人的
Dialogue: 4,0:22:08.42,0:22:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They always have partners.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:10.21,0:22:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没人能独占所有钱财
Dialogue: 4,0:22:10.21,0:22:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Nobody keeps all the money.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:13.34,0:22:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但人人都听罗素的 这点我能确定
Dialogue: 4,0:22:13.34,0:22:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But everybody listened to Russ. That I can tell you.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:16.63,0:22:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你想贿赂一个法官 先问问罗素
Dialogue: 4,0:22:16.63,0:22:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You wanted to bribe a judge, you asked Russell.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:20.34,0:22:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你不知道该贿赂法官多少钱
Dialogue: 4,0:22:20.34,0:22:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You didn't know how much to bribe him,
Dialogue: 5,0:22:22.21,0:22:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素会告诉你
Dialogue: 4,0:22:22.21,0:22:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Russell was gonna tell you.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:24.71,0:22:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好 行 我马上就去
Dialogue: 4,0:22:24.71,0:22:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All right, all right. I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:28.25,0:22:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}来吧 交给我就行 别担心
Dialogue: 4,0:22:28.25,0:22:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Come on. I'll take care of it. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:30.21,0:22:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你想提拔一个手下
Dialogue: 4,0:22:30.21,0:22:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You want to promote one of your guys,
Dialogue: 5,0:22:32.88,0:22:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素会告诉你行或不行
Dialogue: 4,0:22:32.88,0:22:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Russ would tell you you could or you could not.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:35.50,0:22:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}帮我个忙
Dialogue: 4,0:22:35.50,0:22:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Do me a favor.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:36.88,0:22:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}跟史蒂夫去他那 带上维托
Dialogue: 4,0:22:36.88,0:22:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Go with Steve down to his place. Take Vito with you.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:39.50,0:22:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在那边逗留一会
Dialogue: 4,0:22:39.50,0:22:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And just hang around for a while.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:40.75,0:22:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有几个家伙一直来找麻烦 摆平他们
Dialogue: 4,0:22:40.75,0:22:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}These guys keep coming around, so straighten them out.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:43.00,0:22:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我会处理的 罗素 -好的
Dialogue: 4,0:22:43.00,0:22:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I'll take care of it, Russ. - Okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:44.50,0:22:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-谢谢 -不客气
Dialogue: 4,0:22:44.50,0:22:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Thank you. - No problem.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:45.71,0:22:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那谁...你在这里
Dialogue: 4,0:22:45.71,0:22:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Where's... Oh, here you are.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:46.88,0:22:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我在这里
Dialogue: 4,0:22:46.88,0:22:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm right here.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:47.84,0:22:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你想让某人消失
Dialogue: 4,0:22:47.84,0:22:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You want to make somebody disappear,
Dialogue: 5,0:22:49.55,0:22:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你得争得罗素的同意
Dialogue: 4,0:22:49.55,0:22:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you got to get Russell's permission.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:51.46,0:22:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没有第二条路
Dialogue: 4,0:22:51.46,0:22:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know, no two ways about it.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:53.21,0:22:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-不 我一点都不担心 -我想也是
Dialogue: 4,0:22:53.21,0:22:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- No, I wasn't worried. - I didn't think so.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:56.17,0:22:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-帮我给你父亲带个好 -我会的 谢谢
Dialogue: 4,0:22:56.17,0:22:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Tell your father I said "Hi." - I'll tell him. Thanks.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:59.00,0:23:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你怎么还在这里 我刚跟布鲁诺说了
Dialogue: 4,0:22:59.00,0:23:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What are you doing here? I just told Bruno.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:00.67,0:23:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你得跟布鲁诺一起去
Dialogue: 4,0:23:00.67,0:23:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You gotta go with Bruno.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:01.75,0:23:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-好的 我马上去 -去吧 小心
Dialogue: 4,0:23:01.75,0:23:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Oh, yeah. Yeah, I'm on my way. - Yeah. Take care.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:03.42,0:23:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}而当你为罗素办事时
Dialogue: 4,0:23:03.42,0:23:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And when you did something for Russ,
Dialogue: 5,0:23:05.34,0:23:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你得亲力亲为
Dialogue: 4,0:23:05.34,0:23:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you did it yourself.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:07.13,0:23:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}正如罗素常说的
Dialogue: 4,0:23:07.13,0:23:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Like Russ used to say...
Dialogue: 5,0:23:09.00,0:23:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我让人替我去处理事情的时候
Dialogue: 4,0:23:09.00,0:23:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}When I ask somebody to take care of something for me,
Dialogue: 5,0:23:11.38,0:23:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我希望他们能亲自处理
Dialogue: 4,0:23:11.38,0:23:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I expect them to take care of it themselves.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:13.80,0:23:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不需要几个人处理同一件事
Dialogue: 4,0:23:13.80,0:23:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't need two roads coming back to me.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:18.85,0:24:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}佩恩布帘店
Dialogue: 5,0:24:20.67,0:24:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}阿尔伯特·安纳斯塔夏
Dialogue: 5,0:24:20.67,0:24:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}安纳斯塔夏在理发店被杀时
Dialogue: 4,0:24:20.67,0:24:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}黑手党"谋杀集团"首领
Dialogue: 3,0:24:20.67,0:24:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}1957年死于纽约一家理发店
Dialogue: 2,0:24:20.67,0:24:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}When Anastasia got killed in the barbershop,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:23.59,0:24:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素被请出来安定人心
Dialogue: 4,0:24:23.59,0:24:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}it was Russell they brought in to calm things down,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:26.34,0:24:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好让大家不要大开杀戒
Dialogue: 4,0:24:26.34,0:24:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}so that everybody wasn't just going around killing everybody
Dialogue: 5,0:24:29.09,0:24:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}并把事情摆平
Dialogue: 4,0:24:29.09,0:24:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and it could all get straightened out.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:32.67,0:24:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们知道出了什么事
Dialogue: 4,0:24:32.67,0:24:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We know what happened.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:34.38,0:24:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们也无能为力 木已成舟
Dialogue: 4,0:24:34.38,0:24:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We can't change it. It is what it is.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:36.46,0:24:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}请转告我的朋友 我很乐意帮忙
Dialogue: 4,0:24:36.46,0:24:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Please tell my friend I'm happy to help.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:39.21,0:24:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}光看外表你永远猜不到他的身份
Dialogue: 4,0:24:39.21,0:24:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You'd never know it by looking at this guy,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:41.96,0:24:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但条条大路通罗素
Dialogue: 4,0:24:41.96,0:24:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but all roads led back to Russ.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:52.75,0:24:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}钱在哪里
Dialogue: 4,0:24:52.75,0:24:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Where's the money?
Dialogue: 5,0:24:53.92,0:24:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-他没有 -他没有
Dialogue: 4,0:24:53.92,0:24:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- He don't have it. - He don't have it?
Dialogue: 5,0:24:56.17,0:24:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他说了点他妈妈的事...
Dialogue: 4,0:24:56.17,0:24:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He said something about his mother...
Dialogue: 5,0:24:58.55,0:24:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}停 别跟我说
Dialogue: 4,0:24:58.55,0:24:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Stop. Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:59.63,0:25:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}让我猜猜
Dialogue: 4,0:24:59.63,0:25:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:01.13,0:25:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他妈死了 然后葬礼花了他一大笔钱
Dialogue: 4,0:25:01.13,0:25:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}His mother died and the funeral set him back.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:03.71,0:25:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-是不是 -对 完全正确
Dialogue: 4,0:25:03.71,0:25:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Yeah? - Yeah. Exactly. Exactly.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:06.12,0:25:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他该死的老娘
Dialogue: 4,0:25:06.12,0:25:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}His fucking mother's...
Dialogue: 5,0:25:07.75,0:25:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在过去十年死了又死
Dialogue: 4,0:25:07.75,0:25:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}fucking dying over and over for the last ten years.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:12.55,0:25:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我要怎么办
Dialogue: 4,0:25:12.55,0:25:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What do I do?
Dialogue: 5,0:25:13.51,0:25:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}留在这里
Dialogue: 4,0:25:13.51,0:25:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Don't leave.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:27.35,0:25:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}拿着
Dialogue: 4,0:25:27.35,0:25:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Here.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:28.38,0:25:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}给他看看 别用
Dialogue: 4,0:25:28.38,0:25:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Just show it to him. Don't use it.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:49.24,0:25:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}看
Dialogue: 4,0:25:49.24,0:25:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Look.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:49.97,0:25:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,0:25:49.97,0:25:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hey, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:52.92,0:25:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}瘦子想见你 上车
Dialogue: 4,0:25:52.92,0:25:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Skinny wants to see you. You get in the car.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:55.29,0:25:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我正要去见他 -快上车
Dialogue: 4,0:25:55.29,0:25:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I was just gonna go see him. - Get in the fucking car.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:58.61,0:25:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我正要... -上车
Dialogue: 4,0:25:58.61,0:25:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I was just gonna... - Get in the fucking car!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:59.99,0:26:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我正要去见他 -别跟我耍滑头
Dialogue: 4,0:25:59.99,0:26:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I was just gonna go see him! - Yeah, don't get cute with me.
Dialogue: 5,0:26:02.05,0:26:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你跟我扯了那堆你妈死了的屁话
Dialogue: 4,0:26:02.05,0:26:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You give me that bullshit about your mother.
Dialogue: 5,0:26:03.31,0:26:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}赶紧上车
Dialogue: 4,0:26:03.31,0:26:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Get in the fucking car!
Dialogue: 5,0:26:04.57,0:26:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克 我对天发誓 我正要...
Dialogue: 4,0:26:04.57,0:26:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank, I swear to God, I was just gonna...
Dialogue: 5,0:26:05.87,0:26:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}给我上车
Dialogue: 4,0:26:05.87,0:26:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Get in the fucking car!
Dialogue: 5,0:26:12.36,0:26:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}想跟我耍滑头
Dialogue: 4,0:26:12.36,0:26:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You want to get cute with me?
Dialogue: 5,0:26:13.70,0:26:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}扯了一堆你妈病了死了
Dialogue: 4,0:26:13.70,0:26:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All that fucking bullshit about your mother
Dialogue: 5,0:26:15.44,0:26:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}之类的鬼话
Dialogue: 4,0:26:15.44,0:26:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and sick and all that and dying.
Dialogue: 5,0:26:17.45,0:26:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我发誓我正要去见他
Dialogue: 4,0:26:17.45,0:26:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I swear, I was just gonna go see him.
Dialogue: 5,0:26:19.74,0:26:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我对天发誓 我本来打算明天来见你的
Dialogue: 4,0:26:19.74,0:26:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I swear to God, I was gonna come see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 5,0:26:21.33,0:26:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-明天 -明天 我对天发誓
Dialogue: 4,0:26:21.33,0:26:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Tomorrow? - Tomorrow. I swear to God.
Dialogue: 5,0:26:22.99,0:26:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}明天 来这里
Dialogue: 4,0:26:22.99,0:26:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tomorrow. Here.
Dialogue: 5,0:26:24.78,0:26:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-什么时间 -你要我什么时候来
Dialogue: 4,0:26:24.78,0:26:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- What time? - What time do you want me?
Dialogue: 5,0:26:26.05,0:26:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一点如何 我一点来
Dialogue: 4,0:26:26.05,0:26:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}One o'clock? I'll be here at 1:00.
Dialogue: 5,0:26:27.09,0:26:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一点 怎么 你还要睡懒觉吗
Dialogue: 4,0:26:27.09,0:26:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}One o'clock? What, are you sleeping in?
Dialogue: 5,0:26:29.86,0:26:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你说个时间
Dialogue: 4,0:26:29.86,0:26:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You tell me.
Dialogue: 5,0:26:31.69,0:26:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}十点 到这里
Dialogue: 4,0:26:31.69,0:26:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Ten o'clock. Here.
Dialogue: 5,0:26:32.92,0:26:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-十点 -明天
Dialogue: 4,0:26:32.92,0:26:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Ten o'clock. - Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 5,0:26:33.77,0:26:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}明天
Dialogue: 4,0:26:33.77,0:26:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 5,0:26:34.40,0:26:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}用你妈发誓 用你妈发誓
Dialogue: 4,0:26:34.40,0:26:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Swear on your mother. Swear on your mother!
Dialogue: 5,0:26:37.14,0:26:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-用你妈发誓 -我以我妈发誓
Dialogue: 4,0:26:37.14,0:26:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Swear on your mother! - I swear on my mother!
Dialogue: 5,0:26:39.14,0:26:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我以我妈发誓
Dialogue: 4,0:26:39.14,0:26:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I swear on my mother!
Dialogue: 5,0:26:40.09,0:26:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你明天什么时间到这里
Dialogue: 4,0:26:40.09,0:26:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What time you gonna be here tomorrow?
Dialogue: 5,0:26:41.34,0:26:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我十点就到 -十点
Dialogue: 4,0:26:41.34,0:26:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I'll be here at ten o'clock. - Ten o'clock?
Dialogue: 5,0:26:43.08,0:26:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-明天 -好
Dialogue: 4,0:26:43.08,0:26:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Tomorrow. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:26:44.02,0:26:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-到这里 -好的
Dialogue: 4,0:26:44.02,0:26:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Here. - Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:26:45.23,0:26:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我明天就把钱带来 一分不少
Dialogue: 4,0:26:45.23,0:26:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'll bring you the money tomorrow. The whole thing.
Dialogue: 5,0:26:47.53,0:26:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}把他丢出去
Dialogue: 4,0:26:47.53,0:26:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Get him out of here.
Dialogue: 5,0:26:49.76,0:26:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}出去 出去
Dialogue: 4,0:26:49.76,0:26:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Get out of here. Get out of here.
Dialogue: 5,0:26:51.25,0:26:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我对天发誓我会来的 -出去
Dialogue: 4,0:26:51.25,0:26:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I swear to God, I'll be here. - Get out of here.
Dialogue: 5,0:26:52.31,0:26:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我要怎么回家
Dialogue: 4,0:26:52.31,0:26:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}How am I supposed to get home?
Dialogue: 5,0:26:53.24,0:26:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-出去 -搭公交
Dialogue: 4,0:26:53.24,0:26:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Get out of here. - Take the fucking bus!
Dialogue: 5,0:26:58.06,0:26:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}让他妈来接他
Dialogue: 4,0:26:58.06,0:26:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Let his mother pick him up.
Dialogue: 5,0:27:10.21,0:27:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她怎么了
Dialogue: 4,0:27:10.21,0:27:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What's the matter with her?
Dialogue: 5,0:27:12.30,0:27:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没什么 她在杂货店碰翻了点东西
Dialogue: 4,0:27:12.30,0:27:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Nothing. She knocked something over
Dialogue: 5,0:27:13.57,0:27:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}把地上弄得一团糟
Dialogue: 4,0:27:13.57,0:27:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}at the grocery store and made a mess,
Dialogue: 5,0:27:16.48,0:27:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-店主就吼了她 -吼了她
Dialogue: 4,0:27:16.48,0:27:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- and the grocer yelled at her. - He yelled at her?
Dialogue: 5,0:27:18.40,0:27:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对 然后推了她
Dialogue: 4,0:27:18.40,0:27:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, and he shoved her.
Dialogue: 5,0:27:19.80,0:27:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他推了她
Dialogue: 4,0:27:19.80,0:27:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He shoved her?
Dialogue: 5,0:27:22.23,0:27:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对
Dialogue: 4,0:27:22.23,0:27:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:27:23.29,0:27:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他推你了吗
Dialogue: 4,0:27:23.29,0:27:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Did he shove you?
Dialogue: 5,0:27:25.88,0:27:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他叫什么 杂货店的那个家伙
Dialogue: 4,0:27:25.88,0:27:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Who was this? The guy at the store?
Dialogue: 5,0:27:27.03,0:27:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}拐角那个杂货店吗 乔吗
Dialogue: 4,0:27:27.03,0:27:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The grocery store on the corner? Joe?
Dialogue: 5,0:27:32.73,0:27:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他推了吗
Dialogue: 4,0:27:32.73,0:27:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Did he?
Dialogue: 5,0:27:34.46,0:27:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}宝贝 他推你了吗
Dialogue: 4,0:27:34.46,0:27:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Honey, did he shove you?
Dialogue: 5,0:27:37.89,0:27:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}回话 他推你了吗
Dialogue: 4,0:27:37.89,0:27:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Just answer me. Did he push you?
Dialogue: 5,0:27:39.64,0:27:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他推你了吗 不论如何 他推了吗
Dialogue: 4,0:27:39.64,0:27:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Did he shove you? Whatever it is, did he do that?
Dialogue: 5,0:27:42.72,0:27:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们走
Dialogue: 4,0:27:42.72,0:27:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Let's go.
Dialogue: 5,0:27:46.68,0:27:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,0:27:46.68,0:27:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank.
Dialogue: 5,0:27:47.83,0:27:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克 那人不是故意的 只是意外
Dialogue: 4,0:27:47.83,0:27:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank, he didn't mean it, the man. It just happened.
Dialogue: 5,0:27:50.46,0:27:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}什么意思 什么叫他不是故意的
Dialogue: 4,0:27:50.46,0:27:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What do you mean, he didn't mean it?
Dialogue: 5,0:27:51.25,0:27:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他碰了她 你在说笑吗
Dialogue: 4,0:27:51.25,0:27:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He touched her. What, are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 5,0:27:52.78,0:27:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他无权推她 碰她
Dialogue: 4,0:27:52.78,0:27:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He has no right to push her. Touch her.
Dialogue: 5,0:27:54.58,0:27:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}碰她一下都不行
Dialogue: 4,0:27:54.58,0:27:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Not even put one pinky on her.
Dialogue: 5,0:28:03.50,0:28:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就是他吧
Dialogue: 4,0:28:03.50,0:28:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's him, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:28:05.24,0:28:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你留在这里 留在这里
Dialogue: 4,0:28:05.24,0:28:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Stay here. Stay here.
Dialogue: 5,0:28:10.21,0:28:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克 我很抱歉 但你女儿犯了错
Dialogue: 4,0:28:10.21,0:28:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank, I'm sorry, but your kid was out of line.
Dialogue: 5,0:28:12.56,0:28:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我只做了 -你碰了我女儿吗
Dialogue: 4,0:28:12.56,0:28:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I only did what... - You touched my daughter?
Dialogue: 5,0:28:20.19,0:28:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}天啊 对不起
Dialogue: 4,0:28:20.19,0:28:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}God, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:28:22.35,0:28:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不 求你 不 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,0:28:22.35,0:28:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No. Please. No, no, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,0:28:23.69,0:28:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克 求你了 不
Dialogue: 4,0:28:23.69,0:28:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank, please, please, please. No.
Dialogue: 5,0:28:33.22,0:28:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不 弗兰克 不
Dialogue: 4,0:28:33.22,0:28:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, no, Frank! No!
Dialogue: 5,0:28:38.60,0:28:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-受着吧 你这混蛋 -不 别这样
Dialogue: 4,0:28:38.60,0:28:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Take that, you motherfucker! - No! Come on!
Dialogue: 5,0:28:43.75,0:28:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我的手 我的手
Dialogue: 4,0:28:43.75,0:28:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Oh, my fucking hand. My fucking hand!
Dialogue: 5,0:29:13.17,0:29:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}多洛莉丝
Dialogue: 4,0:29:13.17,0:29:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Dolores.
Dialogue: 5,0:29:22.29,0:29:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-阿门 -阿门
Dialogue: 4,0:29:22.29,0:29:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Amen. - Amen.
Dialogue: 5,0:29:24.34,0:29:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素和凯丽为我们刚出生的女儿多洛莉丝施了洗礼
Dialogue: 4,0:29:24.34,0:29:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Russell and Carrie baptized our new daughter, Dolores.
Dialogue: 5,0:29:27.82,0:29:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}场面很棒 我们都很荣幸
Dialogue: 4,0:29:27.82,0:29:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It was a wonderful occasion, and we were honored.
Dialogue: 5,0:29:32.11,0:29:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}大家都来了
Dialogue: 4,0:29:32.11,0:29:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Everybody showed up.
Dialogue: 5,0:29:33.64,0:29:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-阿门 -阿门
Dialogue: 4,0:29:33.64,0:29:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Amen. - Amen.
Dialogue: 5,0:29:54.09,0:29:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}阿门
Dialogue: 4,0:29:54.09,0:29:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Amen.
Dialogue: 5,0:29:54.89,0:29:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-阿门 -阿门
Dialogue: 4,0:29:54.89,0:29:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Amen. - Amen.
Dialogue: 5,0:29:55.87,0:29:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}唯一的问题是
Dialogue: 4,0:29:55.87,0:29:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The only thing is,
Dialogue: 5,0:29:57.00,0:29:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}孩子多了 要赚的钱也多了
Dialogue: 4,0:29:57.00,0:29:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you got more kids, you gotta earn more money.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:02.85,0:30:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你想赚一万块的快钱吗
Dialogue: 4,0:30:02.85,0:30:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You wanna make a quick ten grand?
Dialogue: 5,0:30:05.37,0:30:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}悄悄话迪图里奥 不是那个
Dialogue: 4,0:30:05.37,0:30:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Whispers DiTullio. Not the Whispers
Dialogue: 5,0:30:07.29,0:30:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}差不多同一时间在车里被炸死的悄悄话
Dialogue: 4,0:30:07.29,0:30:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}they blew up in that car around the same time.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:11.33,0:30:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是另一个悄悄话
Dialogue: 4,0:30:11.33,0:30:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This was the other Whispers.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:12.76,0:30:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这个会赚钱的好悄悄话
Dialogue: 4,0:30:12.76,0:30:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The good one who knew how to make money.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:15.57,0:30:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我把借钱借给了一家店
Dialogue: 4,0:30:15.57,0:30:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I got this place I front money to.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:17.32,0:30:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这家店生意很好 真的很好
Dialogue: 4,0:30:17.32,0:30:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's a good business. Really good business.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:19.74,0:30:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是一家洗衣店
Dialogue: 4,0:30:19.74,0:30:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's a laundry.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:20.70,0:30:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们的业务是从大西洋城的
Dialogue: 4,0:30:20.70,0:30:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What they do is, they collect the linen, towels,
Dialogue: 5,0:30:23.21,0:30:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}各种大小酒店饭店
Dialogue: 4,0:30:23.21,0:30:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}sheets and everything from
Dialogue: 5,0:30:24.31,0:30:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}收布制品 毛巾床单之类的
Dialogue: 4,0:30:24.31,0:30:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}all the hotels and restaurants in Atlantic City.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:27.06,0:30:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}清洗并熨烫
Dialogue: 4,0:30:27.06,0:30:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They wash it, they iron it.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:28.35,0:30:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}正常情况下 赚钱就跟印钞一样容易
Dialogue: 4,0:30:28.35,0:30:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Normally, it's like a license to print fucking money.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:32.12,0:30:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但最近情况有变
Dialogue: 4,0:30:32.12,0:30:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Until recently.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:33.70,0:30:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}特拉华出现了一家公司
Dialogue: 4,0:30:33.70,0:30:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There's this other company that opened up down in Delaware.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:36.82,0:30:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们想把我们挤走
Dialogue: 4,0:30:36.82,0:30:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They're trying to put us out of business.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:38.51,0:30:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}典范布品
Dialogue: 5,0:30:39.07,0:30:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们降价 恐吓我们的司机
Dialogue: 4,0:30:39.07,0:30:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They're cutting their prices. They're scaring our drivers.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:42.63,0:30:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}抢我们的客户
Dialogue: 4,0:30:42.63,0:30:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They're trying to take our customers from us.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:45.52,0:30:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}说实话 我有点担忧
Dialogue: 4,0:30:45.52,0:30:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}To tell you the truth, I'm a little concerned.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:48.89,0:30:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别人说他们有点担心
Dialogue: 4,0:30:48.89,0:30:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Whenever anybody says they're a little concerned,
Dialogue: 5,0:30:51.74,0:30:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}说明他们特别担心
Dialogue: 4,0:30:51.74,0:30:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}they're very concerned.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:53.33,0:30:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}其实
Dialogue: 4,0:30:53.33,0:30:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}As a matter of fact,
Dialogue: 5,0:30:54.99,0:30:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我担心得不止一点
Dialogue: 4,0:30:54.99,0:30:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm really more than a little concerned.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:57.46,0:31:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们说自己不止是一点点担心
Dialogue: 4,0:30:57.46,0:31:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And when they say they're more than a little concerned,
Dialogue: 5,0:31:00.85,0:31:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}说明他们已经绝望了
Dialogue: 4,0:31:00.85,0:31:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}they're desperate.
Dialogue: 5,0:31:01.97,0:31:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我想把他们的公司炸了
Dialogue: 4,0:31:01.97,0:31:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I want this fucking place bombed,
Dialogue: 5,0:31:04.09,0:31:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}烧了 焚了 你怎么整都行
Dialogue: 4,0:31:04.09,0:31:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}burnt, torched, whatever the fuck you have to do.
Dialogue: 5,0:31:06.64,0:31:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你打过仗 你知道该怎么办
Dialogue: 4,0:31:06.64,0:31:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You were in the war. You know what to do.
Dialogue: 5,0:31:08.82,0:31:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们怎么对柏林就怎么对那地方
Dialogue: 4,0:31:08.82,0:31:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Leave that fucking place like you left Berlin.
Dialogue: 5,0:31:11.53,0:31:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}把那里夷为平地
Dialogue: 4,0:31:11.53,0:31:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Burnt to the fucking ground.
Dialogue: 5,0:31:13.13,0:31:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我要让他们倒闭
Dialogue: 4,0:31:13.13,0:31:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I want them out of fucking business.
Dialogue: 5,0:31:15.48,0:31:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们是谁
Dialogue: 4,0:31:15.48,0:31:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Who... who are they?
Dialogue: 5,0:31:16.66,0:31:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}特拉华的典范布品服务公司
Dialogue: 4,0:31:16.66,0:31:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's the Cadillac Linen Service in Delaware.
Dialogue: 5,0:31:20.72,0:31:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一群犹太人开的
Dialogue: 4,0:31:20.72,0:31:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's run by a bunch of Jews.
Dialogue: 5,0:31:22.91,0:31:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}让他们拿他们的保险赔偿
Dialogue: 4,0:31:22.91,0:31:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Let them collect their insurance,
Dialogue: 5,0:31:24.44,0:31:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们肯定投了不少保险
Dialogue: 4,0:31:24.44,0:31:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}which I'm sure they have plenty,
Dialogue: 5,0:31:26.16,0:31:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}然后滚出这里
Dialogue: 4,0:31:26.16,0:31:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and leave this fucking other place alone,
Dialogue: 5,0:31:28.42,0:31:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别碰我的地盘
Dialogue: 4,0:31:28.42,0:31:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the one I'm involved in.
Dialogue: 5,0:31:31.61,0:31:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-这可不是一万 -这里有两千
Dialogue: 4,0:31:31.61,0:31:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- This ain't ten grand. - It's two grand.
Dialogue: 5,0:31:33.46,0:31:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你让那些该死的犹太洗衣妇失业之后
Dialogue: 4,0:31:33.46,0:31:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}When you put these Jew fucking washerwomen out of business,
Dialogue: 5,0:31:36.74,0:31:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我就把剩下的钱给你
Dialogue: 4,0:31:36.74,0:31:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}then you get the rest of your money.
Dialogue: 5,0:31:39.14,0:31:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我之所以现在手头有点紧
Dialogue: 4,0:31:39.14,0:31:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The reason I'm a little short on the money right now,
Dialogue: 5,0:31:41.80,0:31:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是因为我不想找瘦子
Dialogue: 4,0:31:41.80,0:31:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't wanna go to Skinny,
Dialogue: 5,0:31:42.96,0:31:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不想找那些放高利贷的
Dialogue: 4,0:31:42.96,0:31:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't wanna ask anybody when they're gonna charge me a vig,
Dialogue: 5,0:31:45.54,0:31:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为那样我就得还一辈子债
Dialogue: 4,0:31:45.54,0:31:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and I'm gonna be paying them forever.
Dialogue: 5,0:31:47.39,0:31:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我要从别的地方弄钱
Dialogue: 4,0:31:47.39,0:31:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm getting the money somewhere else.
Dialogue: 5,0:31:50.03,0:31:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别人不必知道
Dialogue: 4,0:31:50.03,0:31:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And nobody has to know.
Dialogue: 5,0:31:51.40,0:31:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}特别是瘦子
Dialogue: 4,0:31:51.40,0:31:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Especially not Skinny
Dialogue: 5,0:31:52.57,0:31:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为我不找他借钱
Dialogue: 4,0:31:52.57,0:31:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}because I'm not getting the money from him.
Dialogue: 5,0:31:56.30,0:31:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你看起来有点犹豫
Dialogue: 4,0:31:56.30,0:31:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And I see you look a little hesitant.
Dialogue: 5,0:31:58.19,0:32:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}相信我 我知道你的能耐
Dialogue: 4,0:31:58.19,0:32:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Believe me, I know what you can do.
Dialogue: 5,0:32:00.50,0:32:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}要是我少付了你的钱
Dialogue: 4,0:32:00.50,0:32:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If I stiff you on the money,
Dialogue: 5,0:32:02.37,0:32:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你肯定会让我没有好下场
Dialogue: 4,0:32:02.37,0:32:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you're gonna do something terrible to me.
Dialogue: 5,0:32:04.61,0:32:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不想要那样
Dialogue: 4,0:32:04.61,0:32:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I do not want that.
Dialogue: 5,0:32:18.45,0:32:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我中彩票了
Dialogue: 4,0:32:18.45,0:32:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I hit the number.
Dialogue: 5,0:32:20.06,0:32:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}奖金大概有一千五
Dialogue: 4,0:32:20.06,0:32:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's about 1,500.
Dialogue: 5,0:32:22.04,0:32:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我几个小时后回来
Dialogue: 4,0:32:22.04,0:32:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'll see you in a few hours.
Dialogue: 5,0:32:43.81,0:32:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}典范布品
Dialogue: 5,0:32:48.98,0:32:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}典范布品
Dialogue: 5,0:33:45.02,0:33:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}炸药
Dialogue: 5,0:34:06.33,0:34:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,0:34:06.33,0:34:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank.
Dialogue: 5,0:34:09.62,0:34:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}安吉洛想见你
Dialogue: 4,0:34:09.62,0:34:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Angelo wants to see you.
Dialogue: 5,0:34:12.12,0:34:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-现在吗 -对 就现在
Dialogue: 4,0:34:12.12,0:34:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Now? - Yeah, now is good.
Dialogue: 5,0:34:15.11,0:34:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}什么事
Dialogue: 4,0:34:15.11,0:34:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What's it about?
Dialogue: 5,0:34:16.88,0:34:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不知道 来吧 我开车送你
Dialogue: 4,0:34:16.88,0:34:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't know. Come on. I'll drive you.
Dialogue: 5,0:34:44.10,0:34:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}抱歉 打烊了
Dialogue: 5,0:34:52.05,0:34:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}坐吧 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,0:34:52.05,0:34:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Sit down, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,0:35:05.74,0:35:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你去特拉华做什么
Dialogue: 4,0:35:05.74,0:35:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What're you doing in Delaware?
Dialogue: 5,0:35:14.06,0:35:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}炸一家洗衣店
Dialogue: 4,0:35:14.06,0:35:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Bombing out a laundry place.
Dialogue: 5,0:35:22.67,0:35:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我就是赚点外快
Dialogue: 4,0:35:22.67,0:35:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I was just doing a job to make some extra money.
Dialogue: 5,0:35:28.04,0:35:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}让那家店没法经营
Dialogue: 4,0:35:28.04,0:35:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Putting this place out of action.
Dialogue: 5,0:35:31.17,0:35:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}让那家店倒闭
Dialogue: 4,0:35:31.17,0:35:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Putting this... putting this place out of commission.
Dialogue: 5,0:35:36.46,0:35:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谁让你干的
Dialogue: 4,0:35:36.46,0:35:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}For who?
Dialogue: 5,0:35:48.60,0:35:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}现在可不是保持沉默的时候
Dialogue: 4,0:35:48.60,0:35:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Now is not the time to not say.
Dialogue: 5,0:35:55.74,0:35:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}悄悄话
Dialogue: 4,0:35:55.74,0:35:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Whispers.
Dialogue: 5,0:35:57.12,0:35:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}另一个悄悄话
Dialogue: 4,0:35:57.12,0:35:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The other Whispers.
Dialogue: 5,0:36:02.82,0:36:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道典范布品服务公司的老板是谁吗
Dialogue: 4,0:36:02.82,0:36:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know who owns the Cadillac Linen Service?
Dialogue: 5,0:36:06.17,0:36:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}做洗衣行业的犹太人
Dialogue: 4,0:36:06.17,0:36:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Some Jews in the laundry business.
Dialogue: 5,0:36:08.12,0:36:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-雇主是这么说的 -他们只占部分股份
Dialogue: 4,0:36:08.12,0:36:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- That's what they told me. - They own a part of it.
Dialogue: 5,0:36:11.11,0:36:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还有人是老板
Dialogue: 4,0:36:11.11,0:36:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Somebody else got an interest in that.
Dialogue: 5,0:36:13.03,0:36:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你知道是谁吗 -不
Dialogue: 4,0:36:13.03,0:36:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- You know who? - No.
Dialogue: 5,0:36:14.42,0:36:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}也可以理解为"是我"
Dialogue: 5,0:36:14.42,0:36:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道
Dialogue: 4,0:36:14.42,0:36:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I do.
Dialogue: 5,0:36:15.88,0:36:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-是谁 -不 是我
Dialogue: 4,0:36:15.88,0:36:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Who? - No. I do.
Dialogue: 5,0:36:18.76,0:36:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}其他的股份是我的
Dialogue: 4,0:36:18.76,0:36:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I own the other part.
Dialogue: 5,0:36:20.23,0:36:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}而不是我认识持有剩余股份的人
Dialogue: 4,0:36:20.23,0:36:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Not I know somebody who owns the other part.
Dialogue: 5,0:36:26.95,0:36:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}安吉洛 我不知道你有这家公司的股份
Dialogue: 4,0:36:26.95,0:36:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Angelo, I didn't know you had any part of it.
Dialogue: 5,0:36:29.73,0:36:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我要是知道的话
Dialogue: 4,0:36:29.73,0:36:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I would never have done what I did
Dialogue: 5,0:36:31.52,0:36:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是绝对不会那么做的 我不知道
Dialogue: 4,0:36:31.52,0:36:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}if I knew you were involved. I didn't know.
Dialogue: 5,0:36:33.39,0:36:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我绝不会对你做这种事
Dialogue: 4,0:36:33.39,0:36:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I would never, never do that against you.
Dialogue: 5,0:36:35.90,0:36:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}悄悄话没说老板是犹太黑帮吗
Dialogue: 4,0:36:35.90,0:36:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Whispers didn't tell you it was Jew mob?
Dialogue: 5,0:36:37.60,0:36:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没有 他说是犹太洗衣妇
Dialogue: 4,0:36:37.60,0:36:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, he said Jew washerwomen.
Dialogue: 5,0:36:42.59,0:36:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}犹太洗衣妇
Dialogue: 4,0:36:42.59,0:36:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jew washerwomen.
Dialogue: 5,0:36:45.45,0:36:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他还说了什么
Dialogue: 4,0:36:45.45,0:36:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What else he say?
Dialogue: 5,0:36:47.52,0:36:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我猜他让你保密
Dialogue: 4,0:36:47.52,0:36:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I bet he said keep it to yourself.
Dialogue: 5,0:36:49.67,0:36:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别跟城里其他人透露一个字
Dialogue: 4,0:36:49.67,0:36:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Don't say nothing to nobody Downtown.
Dialogue: 5,0:36:55.00,0:36:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}的确
Dialogue: 4,0:36:55.00,0:36:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He did.
Dialogue: 5,0:37:01.69,0:37:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我没核实
Dialogue: 4,0:37:01.69,0:37:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I didn't check.
Dialogue: 5,0:37:03.45,0:37:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对不起 我应该先核实一下的
Dialogue: 4,0:37:03.45,0:37:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm sorry. I should've checked.
Dialogue: 5,0:37:05.21,0:37:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我能把钱退给他吗 -他用不着了
Dialogue: 4,0:37:05.21,0:37:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Can I give him his money back? - He won't need it.
Dialogue: 5,0:37:07.87,0:37:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你留着吧
Dialogue: 4,0:37:07.87,0:37:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You can keep it.
Dialogue: 5,0:37:09.34,0:37:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不想惹麻烦
Dialogue: 4,0:37:09.34,0:37:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I... I don't want no trouble.
Dialogue: 5,0:37:10.51,0:37:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我把钱退给他吧 我没关系
Dialogue: 4,0:37:10.51,0:37:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'll just give it back to him and I'm okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:37:13.77,0:37:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他用不着了
Dialogue: 4,0:37:13.77,0:37:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He won't need it.
Dialogue: 5,0:37:19.47,0:37:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好吧 谢谢
Dialogue: 4,0:37:19.47,0:37:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 5,0:37:20.95,0:37:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谢罗素吧
Dialogue: 4,0:37:20.95,0:37:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Thank Russell.
Dialogue: 5,0:37:22.87,0:37:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我本来不想浪费时间
Dialogue: 4,0:37:22.87,0:37:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I wouldn't have wasted my time.
Dialogue: 5,0:37:23.93,0:37:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}打算让犹太黑帮找你算账
Dialogue: 4,0:37:23.93,0:37:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'd have let the Jew mob have you.
Dialogue: 5,0:37:28.92,0:37:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你这个朋友真没得说
Dialogue: 4,0:37:28.92,0:37:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You got a good friend here.
Dialogue: 5,0:37:31.04,0:37:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你不知道他多仗义
Dialogue: 4,0:37:31.04,0:37:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You don't know how good a friend you got.
Dialogue: 5,0:37:33.98,0:37:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我知道 -不 你不知道
Dialogue: 4,0:37:33.98,0:37:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I... I know. - No, you don't know.
Dialogue: 5,0:37:39.86,0:37:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}去吧台那等着吧
Dialogue: 4,0:37:39.86,0:37:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Wait by the bar, would you?
Dialogue: 5,0:37:57.97,0:37:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}像这种情况
Dialogue: 4,0:37:57.97,0:37:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}In a case like this,
Dialogue: 5,0:37:59.45,0:38:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}最好的办法就是用全新的家伙
Dialogue: 4,0:37:59.45,0:38:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the best thing to do is you use something brand new.
Dialogue: 5,0:38:02.85,0:38:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}刚开箱的
Dialogue: 4,0:38:02.85,0:38:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Right out of the box.
Dialogue: 5,0:38:04.32,0:38:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}否则 你不知道它在哪里被用过
Dialogue: 4,0:38:04.32,0:38:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Otherwise, you don't know where it's been.
Dialogue: 5,0:38:06.37,0:38:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}或被谁用过
Dialogue: 4,0:38:06.37,0:38:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You don't know who's used it,
Dialogue: 5,0:38:08.19,0:38:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}跟什么案子有关联
Dialogue: 4,0:38:08.19,0:38:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}what crime it was connected to.
Dialogue: 5,0:38:10.54,0:38:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那无异于找死
Dialogue: 4,0:38:10.54,0:38:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's suicide.
Dialogue: 5,0:38:12.20,0:38:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所以我推荐用全新的 刚开箱的
Dialogue: 4,0:38:12.20,0:38:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So I recommend something new, straight out of the... the box.
Dialogue: 5,0:38:16.30,0:38:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}冰冷 干净
Dialogue: 4,0:38:16.30,0:38:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Stone cold. Clean.
Dialogue: 5,0:38:22.01,0:38:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你来了
Dialogue: 4,0:38:22.01,0:38:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There you are.
Dialogue: 5,0:38:22.91,0:38:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不知道你会从哪边过来
Dialogue: 4,0:38:22.91,0:38:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I didn't know which way you were coming from.
Dialogue: 5,0:38:24.92,0:38:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不知道你从哪边...
Dialogue: 4,0:38:24.92,0:38:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I didn't know which way you were...
Dialogue: 5,0:38:33.42,0:38:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}当然 下一步就是
Dialogue: 4,0:38:33.42,0:38:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Naturally, the next thing you wanna do
Dialogue: 5,0:38:34.89,0:38:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}把家伙扔掉 你得毁灭证据
Dialogue: 4,0:38:34.89,0:38:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}is throw the thing away. You wanna get rid of it.
Dialogue: 5,0:38:39.49,0:38:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}大家都扔在斯古吉尔河的一个地方
Dialogue: 4,0:38:39.49,0:38:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There's a spot in the Schuylkill River everybody uses.
Dialogue: 5,0:38:43.83,0:38:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如果派人潜到河底
Dialogue: 4,0:38:43.83,0:38:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If they ever send divers down there,
Dialogue: 5,0:38:45.08,0:38:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}找到的武器够武装一个小国家了
Dialogue: 4,0:38:45.08,0:38:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}they'd be able to arm a small country.
Dialogue: 5,0:38:52.98,0:38:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一名男子在人行道上被枪杀
Dialogue: 5,0:39:11.83,0:39:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对我来说 杀死悄悄话后 一切都变了
Dialogue: 4,0:39:11.83,0:39:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}For me, everything changed after Whispers.
Dialogue: 5,0:39:19.16,0:39:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这就像在军队
Dialogue: 4,0:39:19.16,0:39:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It was like the army.
Dialogue: 5,0:39:21.95,0:39:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你服从命令
Dialogue: 4,0:39:21.95,0:39:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You followed orders.
Dialogue: 5,0:39:25.62,0:39:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}听吩咐做事
Dialogue: 4,0:39:25.62,0:39:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You did the right thing.
Dialogue: 5,0:39:27.68,0:39:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就会得到相应的奖赏
Dialogue: 4,0:39:27.68,0:39:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You got rewarded.
Dialogue: 5,0:39:29.74,0:39:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗马别墅餐厅酒吧
Dialogue: 5,0:39:30.74,0:39:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我替罗素做事
Dialogue: 4,0:39:30.74,0:39:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And when I handled things for Russell,
Dialogue: 5,0:39:33.70,0:39:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}从来都不是为钱
Dialogue: 4,0:39:33.70,0:39:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}it was never for money,
Dialogue: 5,0:39:35.15,0:39:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}而是为了表达尊重
Dialogue: 4,0:39:35.15,0:39:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but as a show of respect.
Dialogue: 5,0:39:37.21,0:39:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你给他跑跑腿 帮帮忙
Dialogue: 4,0:39:37.21,0:39:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}When you ran a little errand, you did a little favor,
Dialogue: 5,0:39:39.85,0:39:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}当你需要帮忙的时候 他也还你人情
Dialogue: 4,0:39:39.85,0:39:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you got a little favor back if you ever needed it.
Dialogue: 5,0:39:42.73,0:39:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你总是会需要帮忙的
Dialogue: 4,0:39:42.73,0:39:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And you always hurried back.
Dialogue: 5,0:39:44.79,0:39:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-菲尔 你好啊 -你好
Dialogue: 4,0:39:44.79,0:39:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Phil, how you doing? - How are you?
Dialogue: 5,0:39:45.57,0:39:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ See the pyramids along the Nile ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:39:45.57,0:39:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}See the Pyramids Along the Nile - Patti Page
Dialogue: 5,0:39:46.11,0:39:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}菲尔·泰斯塔
Dialogue: 4,0:39:46.11,0:39:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}1981年3月15日于自家门廊被一枚钉子炸弹炸死
Dialogue: 5,0:39:52.01,0:39:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你好 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,0:39:52.01,0:39:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}How you doing, Frank?
Dialogue: 5,0:39:52.72,0:39:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Watch the sun rise on a tropic isle ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:39:54.45,0:39:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克·辛德文
Dialogue: 4,0:39:54.45,0:39:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}1980年10月29日身中三枪死于巷子内
Dialogue: 5,0:39:57.93,0:40:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Just remember, darling, all the while ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:40:03.36,0:40:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谢谢 维托
Dialogue: 4,0:40:03.36,0:40:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Thank you, Vito.
Dialogue: 5,0:40:04.67,0:40:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ You belong to me... ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:40:07.35,0:40:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你好 弗兰克 -你好
Dialogue: 4,0:40:07.35,0:40:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Hi. Frank. - Hi.
Dialogue: 5,0:40:08.95,0:40:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你要来点什么吗
Dialogue: 4,0:40:08.95,0:40:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What can I get for you?
Dialogue: 5,0:40:11.88,0:40:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}先给我上杯酒吧
Dialogue: 4,0:40:11.88,0:40:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm just gonna get the wine now.
Dialogue: 5,0:40:15.20,0:40:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好的
Dialogue: 4,0:40:15.20,0:40:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:40:15.94,0:40:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有需要尽管叫我
Dialogue: 4,0:40:15.94,0:40:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Just call me if you need anything.
Dialogue: 5,0:40:18.24,0:40:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好的
Dialogue: 4,0:40:18.24,0:40:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I will.
Dialogue: 5,0:40:24.25,0:40:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-慢用 弗兰克 -谢谢
Dialogue: 4,0:40:24.25,0:40:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Help yourself, Frank. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 5,0:40:27.34,0:40:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}情况变了
Dialogue: 4,0:40:27.34,0:40:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Things change.
Dialogue: 5,0:40:32.91,0:40:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-她是新来的吧 -对
Dialogue: 4,0:40:32.91,0:40:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- She's the new one, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:40:35.95,0:40:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她是个好姑娘 好姑娘
Dialogue: 4,0:40:35.95,0:40:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A nice kid. Nice kid.
Dialogue: 5,0:40:39.09,0:40:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是啊
Dialogue: 4,0:40:39.09,0:40:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:40:39.75,0:40:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ I'll be so alone without you ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:40:48.50,0:40:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}什么时候都不应该离开你的妻子
Dialogue: 4,0:40:48.50,0:40:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No time is a good time to leave your wife,
Dialogue: 5,0:40:52.08,0:40:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}汽车旅馆
Dialogue: 5,0:40:52.24,0:40:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我就是那时候离开妻子的
Dialogue: 4,0:40:52.24,0:40:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but that's when I left mine.
Dialogue: 5,0:41:02.58,0:41:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}阿德斯里埃克斯汽车旅馆
Dialogue: 4,0:41:02.58,0:41:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}授权人签字
Dialogue: 5,0:41:04.29,0:41:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}埃拉 最近还好吗
Dialogue: 4,0:41:04.29,0:41:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Ira, what's going on?
Dialogue: 5,0:41:05.55,0:41:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-挺好的 你呢 -我也是
Dialogue: 4,0:41:05.55,0:41:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Good. All well? - Yes.
Dialogue: 5,0:41:09.40,0:41:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-有遇到什么麻烦吗 -没有 一切顺利
Dialogue: 4,0:41:09.40,0:41:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Any problems? - No. Everything's good.
Dialogue: 5,0:41:12.36,0:41:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谢谢你
Dialogue: 4,0:41:12.36,0:41:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 5,0:41:14.62,0:41:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就停在这辆凯迪拉克后面
Dialogue: 4,0:41:14.62,0:41:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Right after this Caddy, pull over.
Dialogue: 5,0:41:16.96,0:41:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}到了 美丽皮草店
Dialogue: 4,0:41:16.96,0:41:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There it is. Fair Furriers.
Dialogue: 5,0:41:21.19,0:41:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}美丽皮草店
Dialogue: 5,0:41:22.68,0:41:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他在等你
Dialogue: 4,0:41:22.68,0:41:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's expecting you.
Dialogue: 5,0:41:37.95,0:41:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}美丽皮草店
Dialogue: 5,0:41:49.87,0:41:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}菲尔 你的店真不错
Dialogue: 4,0:41:49.87,0:41:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Phil, you got a nice shop here.
Dialogue: 5,0:41:52.06,0:41:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谢谢
Dialogue: 4,0:41:52.06,0:41:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Thanks.
Dialogue: 5,0:41:53.00,0:41:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}人们喜欢来这里逛
Dialogue: 4,0:41:53.00,0:41:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}People like to come to this store.
Dialogue: 5,0:41:55.08,0:41:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但你儿子真是个瘪三
Dialogue: 4,0:41:55.08,0:41:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But your kid is a real sfigato.
Dialogue: 5,0:41:57.47,0:42:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}明白吗 他很讨人厌
Dialogue: 4,0:41:57.47,0:42:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You understand? He's a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 5,0:42:00.32,0:42:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他太野了 你得管管他
Dialogue: 4,0:42:00.32,0:42:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's a wild kid. You gotta learn to control him.
Dialogue: 5,0:42:02.87,0:42:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如果你不管
Dialogue: 4,0:42:02.87,0:42:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And if you don't,
Dialogue: 5,0:42:03.87,0:42:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就再也没人想来这里逛了
Dialogue: 4,0:42:03.87,0:42:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}nobody's gonna want to shop here anymore.
Dialogue: 5,0:42:06.27,0:42:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如果你的生意不好 对我也没有好处
Dialogue: 4,0:42:06.27,0:42:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If it's not good for you, it's not good for me.
Dialogue: 5,0:42:10.02,0:42:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你明白我的意思吧
Dialogue: 4,0:42:10.02,0:42:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You understand what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 5,0:42:12.99,0:42:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素 他给你惹麻烦了 我向你道歉
Dialogue: 4,0:42:12.99,0:42:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I want to apologize, Russell, for the aggravation.
Dialogue: 5,0:42:14.10,0:42:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这份是我和罗素送的 那份是你和弗兰克送的
Dialogue: 4,0:42:14.10,0:42:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is from Russell and I. That's from you and Frank.
Dialogue: 5,0:42:17.50,0:42:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这个是我们俩送的
Dialogue: 4,0:42:17.50,0:42:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This one'll be from you and me.
Dialogue: 5,0:42:19.43,0:42:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}要不送把宝宝汤匙吧
Dialogue: 4,0:42:19.43,0:42:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, what about a baby spoon?
Dialogue: 5,0:42:21.67,0:42:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她要宝宝汤匙有什么用
Dialogue: 4,0:42:21.67,0:42:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What's she gonna do with a baby spoon?
Dialogue: 5,0:42:23.19,0:42:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-他们还没结婚 -生个孩子就能用了
Dialogue: 4,0:42:23.19,0:42:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- They're not even married. - Have a baby.
Dialogue: 5,0:42:24.49,0:42:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们都还没结婚呢
Dialogue: 4,0:42:24.49,0:42:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They're not even married yet.
Dialogue: 5,0:42:26.08,0:42:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我向你保证 罗素
Dialogue: 4,0:42:26.08,0:42:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I give you my word, Russ.
Dialogue: 5,0:42:27.51,0:42:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-好的 你的话我信 菲尔 -谢谢
Dialogue: 4,0:42:27.51,0:42:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- All right. Your word's good, Phil. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 5,0:42:29.99,0:42:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好了 我们走吧 女士们
Dialogue: 4,0:42:29.99,0:42:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay, let's go, girls.
Dialogue: 5,0:42:31.70,0:42:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-完事了 -是的 弄完了
Dialogue: 4,0:42:31.70,0:42:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Okay, we're done? - Yes, we're done.
Dialogue: 5,0:42:34.32,0:42:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你在搞什么
Dialogue: 4,0:42:34.32,0:42:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 5,0:42:37.14,0:42:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你什么时候才能机灵点 -什么
Dialogue: 4,0:42:37.14,0:42:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- When the hell are you gonna wise up, huh? - What?
Dialogue: 5,0:42:52.47,0:42:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好样的 不愧是我女儿
Dialogue: 4,0:42:52.47,0:42:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There we go. That's my girl.
Dialogue: 5,0:42:55.16,0:42:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}天呐
Dialogue: 4,0:42:55.16,0:42:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 5,0:43:02.25,0:43:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}太棒了
Dialogue: 4,0:43:02.25,0:43:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yes!
Dialogue: 5,0:43:07.47,0:43:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}佩琪
Dialogue: 4,0:43:07.47,0:43:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Peggy.
Dialogue: 5,0:43:10.50,0:43:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}过来一下
Dialogue: 4,0:43:10.50,0:43:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Come over here.
Dialogue: 5,0:43:14.92,0:43:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我说不好 我...
Dialogue: 4,0:43:14.92,0:43:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't know. I don't...
Dialogue: 5,0:43:17.46,0:43:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我感觉她不喜欢我
Dialogue: 4,0:43:17.46,0:43:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I get the feeling she don't like me.
Dialogue: 5,0:43:18.91,0:43:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-她好像有点怕我 -不 不是的
Dialogue: 4,0:43:18.91,0:43:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Like she's afraid of me. - No, no.
Dialogue: 5,0:43:20.44,0:43:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她就是这样
Dialogue: 4,0:43:20.44,0:43:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's the way she is.
Dialogue: 5,0:43:22.12,0:43:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有时她也会怕我
Dialogue: 4,0:43:22.12,0:43:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}She's afraid of me at times too.
Dialogue: 5,0:43:23.47,0:43:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她就是有点敏感
Dialogue: 4,0:43:23.47,0:43:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So, uh, it's just she's a sensitive kid,
Dialogue: 5,0:43:25.94,0:43:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}敏感而已
Dialogue: 4,0:43:25.94,0:43:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but that's all it is.
Dialogue: 5,0:43:26.94,0:43:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我能理解她怕我
Dialogue: 4,0:43:26.94,0:43:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I can understand her being afraid of me,
Dialogue: 5,0:43:28.56,0:43:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但是她不应该怕你 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,0:43:28.56,0:43:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but she shouldn't be scared of you, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,0:43:30.18,0:43:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是
Dialogue: 4,0:43:30.18,0:43:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, well...
Dialogue: 5,0:43:31.16,0:43:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有时她会在报纸上看到关于我的报道
Dialogue: 4,0:43:31.16,0:43:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And then she hears about me in the papers sometimes...
Dialogue: 5,0:43:33.55,0:43:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-真的吗 -是啊
Dialogue: 4,0:43:33.55,0:43:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:43:34.94,0:43:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你要跟自己的孩子亲一点 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,0:43:34.94,0:43:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You gotta be close to your kids, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,0:43:37.21,0:43:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们很亲近
Dialogue: 4,0:43:37.21,0:43:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I am. I am.
Dialogue: 5,0:43:38.41,0:43:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有孩子是你的福分
Dialogue: 4,0:43:38.41,0:43:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're blessed to have them.
Dialogue: 5,0:43:39.57,0:43:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}凯丽和我没有小孩 我跟你说过
Dialogue: 4,0:43:39.57,0:43:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, Carrie and I can't have kids. I told you.
Dialogue: 5,0:43:41.76,0:43:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你真是有福气 有福气
Dialogue: 4,0:43:41.76,0:43:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But you're blessed. You're blessed.
Dialogue: 5,0:43:44.79,0:43:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}叫她一下 叫她过来
Dialogue: 4,0:43:44.79,0:43:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Call her. Call her. Tell her to come over.
Dialogue: 5,0:43:46.55,0:43:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}佩琪宝贝 过来
Dialogue: 4,0:43:46.55,0:43:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Sweetheart. Peggy. Come here.
Dialogue: 5,0:43:48.63,0:43:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}过来
Dialogue: 4,0:43:48.63,0:43:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Come here.
Dialogue: 5,0:43:55.14,0:43:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-过来 -到罗素伯伯这里来
Dialogue: 4,0:43:55.14,0:43:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Come here. - Come over by Uncle Russ.
Dialogue: 5,0:43:57.96,0:44:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你好吗 -挺好的
Dialogue: 4,0:43:57.96,0:44:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- How are you? - Good.
Dialogue: 5,0:44:00.72,0:44:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道为什么上帝会把天空造这么高吗
Dialogue: 4,0:44:00.72,0:44:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Do you know why God made the sky so high?
Dialogue: 5,0:44:05.06,0:44:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不知道
Dialogue: 4,0:44:05.06,0:44:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No.
Dialogue: 5,0:44:06.59,0:44:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这样小鸟在天上飞的时候
Dialogue: 4,0:44:06.59,0:44:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So that the little birdies don't bunk their head on it
Dialogue: 5,0:44:09.41,0:44:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}才不会碰到头啊
Dialogue: 4,0:44:09.41,0:44:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}when they're flying around.
Dialogue: 5,0:44:12.38,0:44:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}可爱吧
Dialogue: 4,0:44:12.38,0:44:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Isn't that cute?
Dialogue: 5,0:44:13.62,0:44:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是一个小笑话
Dialogue: 4,0:44:13.62,0:44:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A little joke.
Dialogue: 5,0:44:15.33,0:44:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不好笑吗
Dialogue: 4,0:44:15.33,0:44:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Isn't that funny?
Dialogue: 5,0:44:16.74,0:44:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你要吃点糖果什么的吗
Dialogue: 4,0:44:16.74,0:44:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You want some candy or something?
Dialogue: 5,0:44:18.92,0:44:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不用了
Dialogue: 4,0:44:18.92,0:44:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No.
Dialogue: 5,0:44:19.45,0:44:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不 你们不想吃糖
Dialogue: 4,0:44:19.45,0:44:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, you guys don't want any candy.
Dialogue: 5,0:44:23.37,0:44:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}需要我为你做点什么吗
Dialogue: 4,0:44:23.37,0:44:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There's nothing I could do for you?
Dialogue: 5,0:44:25.53,0:44:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不用了
Dialogue: 4,0:44:25.53,0:44:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No.
Dialogue: 5,0:44:26.37,0:44:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}需要的话你要告诉罗素伯伯
Dialogue: 4,0:44:26.37,0:44:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, if there is, you let Uncle Russell know.
Dialogue: 5,0:44:29.02,0:44:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好
Dialogue: 4,0:44:29.02,0:44:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:44:30.21,0:44:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}回去玩吧
Dialogue: 4,0:44:30.21,0:44:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Go back. Have some fun.
Dialogue: 5,0:44:34.41,0:44:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}知道我什么意思了吗
Dialogue: 4,0:44:34.41,0:44:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You see what I mean?
Dialogue: 5,0:44:35.89,0:44:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}明白我的感觉了吗
Dialogue: 4,0:44:35.89,0:44:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You see that feeling I get?
Dialogue: 5,0:44:37.40,0:44:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她就是 腼腆而已
Dialogue: 4,0:44:37.40,0:44:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}She's just... She's shy, that's all.
Dialogue: 5,0:44:39.49,0:44:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她没有恶意
Dialogue: 4,0:44:39.49,0:44:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}She... She don't mean nothing.
Dialogue: 5,0:44:41.70,0:44:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有时候 父母离婚了
Dialogue: 4,0:44:41.70,0:44:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Sometimes, when the parents get divorced,
Dialogue: 5,0:44:44.13,0:44:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}孩子们就会迷茫 然后他们会充满恨意
Dialogue: 4,0:44:44.13,0:44:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the kids get all confused, and then they get resentful
Dialogue: 5,0:44:46.93,0:44:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不知道该向谁发泄
Dialogue: 4,0:44:46.93,0:44:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and they don't know who to take it out on,
Dialogue: 5,0:44:48.72,0:44:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}或是站哪边
Dialogue: 4,0:44:48.72,0:44:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}or, you know, which side, or...
Dialogue: 5,0:44:50.48,0:44:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不 你说得对
Dialogue: 4,0:44:50.48,0:44:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, you're right.
Dialogue: 5,0:44:51.53,0:44:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但是这一点我很幸运
Dialogue: 4,0:44:51.53,0:44:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm lucky in that way because
Dialogue: 5,0:44:53.57,0:44:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为琳妮和玛丽相处得很好
Dialogue: 4,0:44:53.57,0:44:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Reenie and Mary, they get along like gangbusters,
Dialogue: 5,0:44:56.93,0:44:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}孩子们轮流在两家住 没什么问题
Dialogue: 4,0:44:56.93,0:44:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}so the kids go back and forth with no problem.
Dialogue: 5,0:44:59.45,0:45:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}要把家人留在身边 留意这一点
Dialogue: 4,0:44:59.45,0:45:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Keep your family close. Keep an eye on that.
Dialogue: 5,0:45:01.51,0:45:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我就是提醒你一下
Dialogue: 4,0:45:01.51,0:45:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Anyway, I'm just telling you, you know.
Dialogue: 5,0:45:03.31,0:45:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我想我就是运气好
Dialogue: 4,0:45:03.31,0:45:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, I'm... I'm just lucky.
Dialogue: 5,0:45:06.68,0:45:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是啊
Dialogue: 4,0:45:06.68,0:45:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:45:10.32,0:45:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}工会的工作怎么样
Dialogue: 4,0:45:10.32,0:45:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}How's it going with the union?
Dialogue: 5,0:45:12.57,0:45:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}工会是世界上最好的
Dialogue: 4,0:45:12.57,0:45:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The union's the best in the world.
Dialogue: 5,0:45:14.04,0:45:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你喜欢 -是啊 只是...
Dialogue: 4,0:45:14.04,0:45:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- You like it, huh? - Yeah, well, it's just...
Dialogue: 5,0:45:15.88,0:45:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我想要找个稳定点的工作 不过
Dialogue: 4,0:45:15.88,0:45:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, I wish I had something more steady, but...
Dialogue: 5,0:45:19.00,0:45:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就是有些
Dialogue: 4,0:45:19.00,0:45:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, it's...
Dialogue: 5,0:45:20.33,0:45:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-管理怎么样 -好啊
Dialogue: 4,0:45:20.33,0:45:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- How about organizing? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:45:22.65,0:45:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我想干那个 可是 -怎么
Dialogue: 4,0:45:22.65,0:45:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I would like to do that. But... - Yeah?
Dialogue: 5,0:45:24.47,0:45:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}很多人都等着呢
Dialogue: 4,0:45:24.47,0:45:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}there's a long line.
Dialogue: 5,0:45:26.17,0:45:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-换句话说 等候名单很长 -是
Dialogue: 4,0:45:26.17,0:45:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- A long waiting list, if you will. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:45:29.25,0:45:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们的一个朋友遇到了一点麻烦
Dialogue: 4,0:45:29.25,0:45:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, a friend of ours is having a little trouble.
Dialogue: 5,0:45:32.86,0:45:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-高层的朋友 -谁啊
Dialogue: 4,0:45:32.86,0:45:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Friend at the top. - Who's that?
Dialogue: 5,0:45:36.36,0:45:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}高层
Dialogue: 4,0:45:36.36,0:45:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The top.
Dialogue: 5,0:45:37.72,0:45:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}霍法
Dialogue: 4,0:45:37.72,0:45:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hoffa?
Dialogue: 5,0:45:39.00,0:45:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}嗯
Dialogue: 4,0:45:39.00,0:45:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:45:40.35,0:45:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}之前我听说
Dialogue: 4,0:45:40.35,0:45:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I heard the other day
Dialogue: 5,0:45:42.22,0:45:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有人要用水管揍他
Dialogue: 4,0:45:42.22,0:45:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}that some guys tried to pipe him
Dialogue: 5,0:45:44.35,0:45:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-因为一个工人的赔偿问题 -是的
Dialogue: 4,0:45:44.35,0:45:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- because of a workman's comp case. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:45:46.58,0:45:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}听说他把他们打得落花流水
Dialogue: 4,0:45:46.58,0:45:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, I heard he beat the shit out of them.
Dialogue: 5,0:45:48.99,0:45:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是 可他那样能撑多久呢
Dialogue: 4,0:45:48.99,0:45:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, but how long is he gonna keep doing that?
Dialogue: 5,0:45:51.10,0:45:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}总有这事儿那事儿
Dialogue: 4,0:45:51.10,0:45:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Things are gonna keep happening.
Dialogue: 5,0:45:52.32,0:45:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他身边需要一个可靠的人
Dialogue: 4,0:45:52.32,0:45:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He needs somebody he can trust around him.
Dialogue: 5,0:45:54.42,0:45:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一个可以一直跟着他的人
Dialogue: 4,0:45:54.42,0:45:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Somebody to be with him all the time.
Dialogue: 5,0:45:56.70,0:45:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是
Dialogue: 4,0:45:56.70,0:45:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:46:01.67,0:46:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我让麦基接电话
Dialogue: 4,0:46:01.67,0:46:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Let me put McGee on the phone.
Dialogue: 5,0:46:04.99,0:46:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}喂
Dialogue: 4,0:46:04.99,0:46:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hello.
Dialogue: 5,0:46:07.00,0:46:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我的朋友 你好吗
Dialogue: 4,0:46:07.00,0:46:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hiya, my friend. How are you?
Dialogue: 5,0:46:09.50,0:46:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我找来了我跟你说过的那个年轻人
Dialogue: 4,0:46:09.50,0:46:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Listen, I got that kid I was talking to you about here.
Dialogue: 5,0:46:12.88,0:46:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我让他接电话 你跟他说 好吗
Dialogue: 4,0:46:12.88,0:46:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm gonna put him on the phone, let you talk to him, okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:46:16.01,0:46:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好的
Dialogue: 4,0:46:16.01,0:46:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All right.
Dialogue: 5,0:46:19.09,0:46:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你好
Dialogue: 4,0:46:19.09,0:46:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hello.
Dialogue: 5,0:46:20.46,0:46:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-是弗兰克吧 -是我
Dialogue: 4,0:46:20.46,0:46:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Is that Frank? - Yes.
Dialogue: 5,0:46:22.13,0:46:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克你好 我是吉米·霍法
Dialogue: 4,0:46:22.13,0:46:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hiya, Frank. This is Jimmy Hoffa.
Dialogue: 5,0:46:24.30,0:46:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你好 很高兴认识你
Dialogue: 4,0:46:24.30,0:46:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, yeah. Glad to meet you.
Dialogue: 5,0:46:25.99,0:46:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我也很高兴认识你 虽然是在电话上
Dialogue: 4,0:46:25.99,0:46:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, glad to meet you, too, even if it's over the phone.
Dialogue: 5,0:46:30.79,0:46:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}听说你刷房子
Dialogue: 4,0:46:30.79,0:46:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I heard you paint houses.
Dialogue: 5,0:46:33.27,0:46:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是的 先生 是的
Dialogue: 4,0:46:33.27,0:46:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yes. Yes, sir, I... I do. I do.
Dialogue: 5,0:46:35.61,0:46:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我还
Dialogue: 4,0:46:35.61,0:46:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And I, uh...
Dialogue: 5,0:46:37.09,0:46:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}自己做木工
Dialogue: 4,0:46:37.09,0:46:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I also do my own carpentry.
Dialogue: 5,0:46:39.30,0:46:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}很高兴你这么说
Dialogue: 4,0:46:39.30,0:46:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 5,0:46:41.65,0:46:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}听说你是工会的兄弟
Dialogue: 4,0:46:41.65,0:46:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I understand you're a brother of mine.
Dialogue: 5,0:46:43.42,0:46:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是的 先生 从1947年就在107号地方工会了
Dialogue: 4,0:46:43.42,0:46:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yes, sir. Local 107. Since 1947.
Dialogue: 5,0:46:46.77,0:46:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是吧
Dialogue: 4,0:46:46.77,0:46:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah! You know, uh,
Dialogue: 5,0:46:48.56,0:46:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们的朋友对你评价非常高
Dialogue: 4,0:46:48.56,0:46:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}our friend speaks very highly of you.
Dialogue: 5,0:46:50.89,0:46:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谢谢
Dialogue: 4,0:46:50.89,0:46:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 5,0:46:52.53,0:46:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-他这个人要求可不低 -我尽力而为
Dialogue: 4,0:46:52.53,0:46:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- He's not an easy man to please. - Well, I do my best.
Dialogue: 5,0:46:56.36,0:46:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有这么个情况
Dialogue: 4,0:46:56.36,0:46:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, you know, there's a situation...
Dialogue: 5,0:46:57.96,0:47:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如今 年轻人不知道吉米·霍法是谁
Dialogue: 4,0:46:57.96,0:47:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Nowadays, young people, they don't know who Jimmy Hoffa was.
Dialogue: 5,0:47:00.90,0:47:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米·霍法
Dialogue: 5,0:47:02.30,0:47:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们完全没概念
Dialogue: 4,0:47:02.30,0:47:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They don't have a clue.
Dialogue: 5,0:47:04.17,0:47:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们可能知道他消失了什么的
Dialogue: 4,0:47:04.17,0:47:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, maybe they know that he disappeared or something,
Dialogue: 5,0:47:07.06,0:47:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但仅此而已
Dialogue: 4,0:47:07.06,0:47:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but that's about it.
Dialogue: 5,0:47:08.92,0:47:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}可在当时 全国上下
Dialogue: 4,0:47:08.92,0:47:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But back then, there wasn't nobody in this country
Dialogue: 5,0:47:12.20,0:47:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没人不知道吉米·霍法是谁
Dialogue: 4,0:47:12.20,0:47:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}who didn't know who Jimmy Hoffa was.
Dialogue: 5,0:47:14.17,0:47:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}上帝保佑 吉米
Dialogue: 4,0:47:14.17,0:47:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}God bless, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,0:47:15.68,0:47:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你做的一切 你是个真正的绅士
Dialogue: 4,0:47:15.68,0:47:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Everything you've done, you're a real gentleman.
Dialogue: 5,0:47:17.70,0:47:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}很好
Dialogue: 4,0:47:17.70,0:47:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's good.
Dialogue: 5,0:47:18.64,0:47:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}50年代的时候 他和猫王一样受欢迎
Dialogue: 4,0:47:18.64,0:47:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}In the '50s, he was as big as Elvis.
Dialogue: 5,0:47:22.36,0:47:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}60年代的时候 他和披头士一样受欢迎
Dialogue: 4,0:47:22.36,0:47:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}In the '60s, he was like the Beatles.
Dialogue: 5,0:47:25.18,0:47:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}除了总统以外
Dialogue: 4,0:47:25.18,0:47:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Next to the president,
Dialogue: 5,0:47:26.15,0:47:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他是国内最有权力的人 无人可及
Dialogue: 4,0:47:26.15,0:47:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he was like the most powerful man in the country. Bar none.
Dialogue: 5,0:47:28.77,0:47:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卡车司机工会
Dialogue: 5,0:47:29.13,0:47:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你如果买东西
Dialogue: 4,0:47:29.13,0:47:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If you got it,
Dialogue: 5,0:47:31.18,0:47:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卡车会把东西送过去
Dialogue: 4,0:47:31.18,0:47:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}a truck brought it to you.
Dialogue: 5,0:47:34.97,0:47:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如果你买食物 衣服
Dialogue: 4,0:47:34.97,0:47:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If you got your food, your clothing,
Dialogue: 5,0:47:38.12,0:47:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}药物 家用燃料
Dialogue: 4,0:47:38.12,0:47:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}your medicine, if you got fuel for your homes,
Dialogue: 5,0:47:41.40,0:47:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}工业用燃料
Dialogue: 4,0:47:41.40,0:47:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}fuel for your industries,
Dialogue: 5,0:47:44.13,0:47:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卡车会把东西送去给他们
Dialogue: 4,0:47:44.13,0:47:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}a truck brought it to them!
Dialogue: 5,0:47:48.06,0:47:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们卡车停下的那天
Dialogue: 4,0:47:48.06,0:47:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The day our trucks stop,
Dialogue: 5,0:47:51.51,0:47:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就是美国停下的那天
Dialogue: 4,0:47:51.51,0:47:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}America stops!
Dialogue: 5,0:47:55.63,0:47:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}现在出了点状况 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,0:47:55.63,0:47:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, there's a situation going on now, Frank,
Dialogue: 5,0:47:58.22,0:47:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}需要处理
Dialogue: 4,0:47:58.22,0:47:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}that needs to be attended to.
Dialogue: 5,0:48:00.16,0:48:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们想分裂工会
Dialogue: 4,0:48:00.16,0:48:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know, they're trying to tear the union apart.
Dialogue: 5,0:48:02.92,0:48:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}大公司和政府联手
Dialogue: 4,0:48:02.92,0:48:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Big business and the government working together,
Dialogue: 5,0:48:05.31,0:48:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}想要拉我们下马
Dialogue: 4,0:48:05.31,0:48:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}trying to pull us down.
Dialogue: 5,0:48:05.85,0:48:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}大公司在进攻
Dialogue: 4,0:48:05.85,0:48:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Big business is on the attack!
Dialogue: 5,0:48:08.66,0:48:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们来了 来势汹汹
Dialogue: 4,0:48:08.66,0:48:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They're coming! They're coming hard
Dialogue: 5,0:48:10.70,0:48:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}长驱直入
Dialogue: 4,0:48:10.70,0:48:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and they're coming fast!
Dialogue: 5,0:48:12.16,0:48:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}大公司和政府
Dialogue: 4,0:48:12.16,0:48:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Big business and the government
Dialogue: 5,0:48:14.13,0:48:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}想要在我们的阶层里埋下异议的种子
Dialogue: 4,0:48:14.13,0:48:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}are trying to sow the seeds of dissent among our ranks,
Dialogue: 5,0:48:18.18,0:48:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}而此时我们正需要联合
Dialogue: 4,0:48:18.18,0:48:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}at a time when we need unity!
Dialogue: 5,0:48:21.72,0:48:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们需要团结
Dialogue: 4,0:48:21.72,0:48:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We need solidarity!
Dialogue: 5,0:48:24.49,0:48:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我想把这话写在空中
Dialogue: 4,0:48:24.49,0:48:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I want to write it in the sky.
Dialogue: 5,0:48:27.05,0:48:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}团结
Dialogue: 4,0:48:27.05,0:48:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Solidarity!
Dialogue: 5,0:48:29.77,0:48:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}团结
Dialogue: 4,0:48:29.77,0:48:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Solidarity!
Dialogue: 5,0:48:32.45,0:48:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}团结
Dialogue: 4,0:48:32.45,0:48:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Solidarity!
Dialogue: 5,0:48:34.30,0:48:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你想加入这场战斗吗
Dialogue: 4,0:48:34.30,0:48:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You wanna be a part of this fight?
Dialogue: 5,0:48:36.26,0:48:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是的 先生
Dialogue: 4,0:48:36.26,0:48:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yes, I do, sir.
Dialogue: 5,0:48:37.72,0:48:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你想成为这历史的一部分吗
Dialogue: 4,0:48:37.72,0:48:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Would you like to be a part of this history?
Dialogue: 5,0:48:40.30,0:48:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是的 我想
Dialogue: 4,0:48:40.30,0:48:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yes, I would.
Dialogue: 5,0:48:42.35,0:48:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}无论你需要我做什么 我都随叫随到
Dialogue: 4,0:48:42.35,0:48:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Whatever you need me to do, I'm available.
Dialogue: 5,0:48:44.84,0:48:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你明天能来芝加哥吗
Dialogue: 4,0:48:44.84,0:48:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Can you come to Chicago tomorrow?
Dialogue: 5,0:48:46.67,0:48:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}可以 先生
Dialogue: 4,0:48:46.67,0:48:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yes, I can, sir.
Dialogue: 5,0:48:48.09,0:48:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那好 到时见
Dialogue: 4,0:48:48.09,0:48:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All right, then. See you then.
Dialogue: 5,0:48:54.11,0:48:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-他喜欢说话 对吗 -是的
Dialogue: 4,0:48:54.11,0:48:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- He likes to talk, don't he? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:49:01.26,0:49:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还以为我是在跟巴顿将军说话
Dialogue: 4,0:49:01.26,0:49:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Thought I was talking to General Patton.
Dialogue: 5,0:49:08.10,0:49:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克 你过来的唯一原因是
Dialogue: 4,0:49:08.10,0:49:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know, Frank, the only reason why you're here,
Dialogue: 5,0:49:10.94,0:49:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}海员工会 他们想和我们一样
Dialogue: 4,0:49:10.94,0:49:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the Seafarers Union, they're signing up
Dialogue: 5,0:49:13.33,0:49:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}签约非工会的
Dialogue: 5,0:49:13.33,0:49:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}俄罗斯人和土耳其人浴室
Dialogue: 4,0:49:13.33,0:49:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the same non-union cab drivers
Dialogue: 5,0:49:16.21,0:49:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}出租车司机
Dialogue: 4,0:49:16.21,0:49:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}as we want to do.
Dialogue: 5,0:49:18.01,0:49:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没人知道你是谁
Dialogue: 4,0:49:18.01,0:49:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Nobody knows who you are
Dialogue: 5,0:49:20.00,0:49:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没人知道你在这做什么 好吗
Dialogue: 4,0:49:20.00,0:49:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and nobody knows what the fuck you're doing here. Okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:49:23.20,0:49:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-嗯 -只有你我知道你为何来此
Dialogue: 4,0:49:23.20,0:49:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Yeah. - You and I know why you're here.
Dialogue: 5,0:49:25.22,0:49:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们得签约这些司机
Dialogue: 4,0:49:25.22,0:49:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We gotta be able to sign these drivers up
Dialogue: 5,0:49:28.01,0:49:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这样保罗·霍尔的工会就签约不了他们
Dialogue: 4,0:49:28.01,0:49:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}so Paul Hall doesn't get 'em for his fucking union.
Dialogue: 5,0:49:31.12,0:49:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不知为何 女同性恋
Dialogue: 4,0:49:31.12,0:49:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}For some reason, lesbians.
Dialogue: 5,0:49:33.62,0:49:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这些司机大多都是该死的女同性恋
Dialogue: 4,0:49:33.62,0:49:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Most of these drivers are fucking lesbians.
Dialogue: 5,0:49:35.62,0:49:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不知道为什么
Dialogue: 4,0:49:35.62,0:49:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I have no reason why.
Dialogue: 5,0:49:37.67,0:49:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}保罗·霍尔四处宣传
Dialogue: 4,0:49:37.67,0:49:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Paul Hall's running around
Dialogue: 5,0:49:39.20,0:49:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}说他可以比我们的哥们吉米
Dialogue: 4,0:49:39.20,0:49:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}saying that he's gonna get a better contract
Dialogue: 5,0:49:41.42,0:49:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}提供一份更好的合同
Dialogue: 4,0:49:41.42,0:49:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}than our boy fucking Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,0:49:43.32,0:49:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他就是个狗杂种
Dialogue: 4,0:49:43.32,0:49:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's a cocksucker. Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:49:45.64,0:49:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米收买了戴利市长
Dialogue: 4,0:49:45.64,0:49:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy has Mayor fucking Daley in his pocket.
Dialogue: 5,0:49:49.69,0:49:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们做什么警察都不会管
Dialogue: 4,0:49:49.69,0:49:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The cops are okay with whatever the fuck we do.
Dialogue: 5,0:49:52.15,0:49:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们不会帮我们把车推下水
Dialogue: 4,0:49:52.15,0:49:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They're not gonna help us push these cars in,
Dialogue: 5,0:49:54.48,0:49:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但他们也绝对不会让任何人阻止我们
Dialogue: 4,0:49:54.48,0:49:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but they certainly are not gonna let anybody fucking stop us.
Dialogue: 5,0:49:57.70,0:49:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}懂吗
Dialogue: 4,0:49:57.70,0:49:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:50:18.86,0:50:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}用力 大伙儿用力
Dialogue: 4,0:50:18.86,0:50:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Come on! All of you guys. Come on!
Dialogue: 5,0:50:20.96,0:50:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}把车子推下去 小心点
Dialogue: 4,0:50:20.96,0:50:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Let's get this fucking thing in there. Watch yourself!
Dialogue: 5,0:50:26.14,0:50:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}太费劲了
Dialogue: 4,0:50:26.14,0:50:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is a lot of work.
Dialogue: 5,0:50:27.67,0:50:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你有想过用糖果吗
Dialogue: 4,0:50:27.67,0:50:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, you ever think of using candy?
Dialogue: 5,0:50:29.44,0:50:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-什么 -糖果
Dialogue: 4,0:50:29.44,0:50:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- What? - Candy.
Dialogue: 5,0:50:31.07,0:50:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}糖果是什么鬼
Dialogue: 4,0:50:31.07,0:50:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What the fuck is candy?
Dialogue: 5,0:50:34.60,0:50:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}炸药 轻拿轻放
Dialogue: 5,0:50:38.10,0:50:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卢 把门打开
Dialogue: 4,0:50:38.10,0:50:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hey, Lou, open the fucking gate.
Dialogue: 5,0:50:40.01,0:50:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}知道 知道
Dialogue: 4,0:50:40.01,0:50:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I got it. I got it.
Dialogue: 5,0:50:41.76,0:50:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}来 你把汽油拿着
Dialogue: 4,0:50:41.76,0:50:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Here, you take the gas.
Dialogue: 5,0:51:00.45,0:51:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克 吉米有个特点
Dialogue: 4,0:51:00.45,0:51:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank, there's one thing about Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,0:51:02.46,0:51:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他不喜欢等人
Dialogue: 4,0:51:02.46,0:51:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Don't ever make him wait.
Dialogue: 5,0:51:04.31,0:51:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如果你和他约好见面 你一定要准时到场
Dialogue: 4,0:51:04.31,0:51:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If you make a meeting with him, you get there on time.
Dialogue: 5,0:51:06.90,0:51:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}最好是提前到
Dialogue: 4,0:51:06.90,0:51:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Better yet, get there early.
Dialogue: 5,0:51:08.34,0:51:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我必须强调这一点
Dialogue: 4,0:51:08.34,0:51:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I can't stress this enough.
Dialogue: 5,0:51:09.82,0:51:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他觉得时间很可贵
Dialogue: 4,0:51:09.82,0:51:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}His problem is that time is of essence.
Dialogue: 5,0:51:13.18,0:51:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是最重要的
Dialogue: 4,0:51:13.18,0:51:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And that's the important thing.
Dialogue: 5,0:51:15.12,0:51:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我还要跟你说件事 吉米不喝酒
Dialogue: 4,0:51:15.12,0:51:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I gotta tell you one more thing. Jimmy doesn't drink.
Dialogue: 5,0:51:18.44,0:51:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是的 世界上最大的货运工会的老大
Dialogue: 4,0:51:18.44,0:51:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah. The head of the largest trucking union in the world,
Dialogue: 5,0:51:20.67,0:51:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他不喝酒
Dialogue: 4,0:51:20.67,0:51:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he don't drink.
Dialogue: 5,0:51:21.60,0:51:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这事最糟的地方在于
Dialogue: 4,0:51:21.60,0:51:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The worst part about it is,
Dialogue: 5,0:51:23.04,0:51:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他不允许别人在他身边喝酒
Dialogue: 4,0:51:23.04,0:51:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he doesn't allow anybody to drink around him.
Dialogue: 5,0:51:30.67,0:51:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还有件事
Dialogue: 4,0:51:30.67,0:51:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Another thing about him,
Dialogue: 5,0:51:32.05,0:51:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米讨厌西瓜
Dialogue: 4,0:51:32.05,0:51:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy hates fucking watermelon.
Dialogue: 5,0:51:37.43,0:51:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我们喜欢西瓜
Dialogue: 4,0:51:37.43,0:51:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But we're gonna like watermelon.
Dialogue: 5,0:51:39.90,0:51:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 你当时真该去看看
Dialogue: 4,0:51:39.90,0:51:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy, you shoulda seen it,
Dialogue: 5,0:51:41.83,0:51:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}慢慢沉下水
Dialogue: 4,0:51:41.83,0:51:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}sinking in the water.
Dialogue: 5,0:51:44.44,0:51:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一辆接一辆 我敢打赌 等他们隔天醒来
Dialogue: 4,0:51:44.44,0:51:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}One by one. I bet you, when they woke up the next morning,
Dialogue: 5,0:51:47.69,0:51:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那些该死的出租车司机
Dialogue: 4,0:51:47.69,0:51:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}those fucking cab drivers,
Dialogue: 5,0:51:49.45,0:51:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们去找自己的出租车
Dialogue: 4,0:51:49.45,0:51:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}they went to look for their cabs,
Dialogue: 5,0:51:51.03,0:51:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们根本不知道发生了什么
Dialogue: 4,0:51:51.03,0:51:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}they didn't know what the fuck hit 'em.
Dialogue: 5,0:51:53.12,0:51:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}真是个好主意 乔伊
Dialogue: 4,0:51:53.12,0:51:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's a great idea, Joey.
Dialogue: 5,0:51:55.18,0:51:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好主意
Dialogue: 4,0:51:55.18,0:51:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Great idea.
Dialogue: 5,0:51:56.40,0:51:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不是我想出来的
Dialogue: 4,0:51:56.40,0:51:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, it wasn't my idea.
Dialogue: 5,0:51:59.02,0:52:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我哥们弗兰克 是他的主意
Dialogue: 4,0:51:59.02,0:52:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}My man Frank. It was his idea.
Dialogue: 5,0:52:01.76,0:52:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我跟你说
Dialogue: 4,0:52:01.76,0:52:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 5,0:52:03.11,0:52:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克去了码头 他接管了码头
Dialogue: 4,0:52:03.11,0:52:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank hit that pier, he took over the pier.
Dialogue: 5,0:52:06.08,0:52:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不管他叫他们做什么 不管他说什么
Dialogue: 4,0:52:06.08,0:52:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Whatever he told them to do, whatever he said,
Dialogue: 5,0:52:08.18,0:52:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们都照做
Dialogue: 4,0:52:08.18,0:52:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}they did it, you know.
Dialogue: 5,0:52:10.61,0:52:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我从没见过任何人像他那样穿过人群
Dialogue: 4,0:52:10.61,0:52:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I never seen a guy walk through a crowd like he does.
Dialogue: 5,0:52:14.02,0:52:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他一个人都不碰
Dialogue: 4,0:52:14.02,0:52:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He doesn't touch a fucking person!
Dialogue: 5,0:52:15.40,0:52:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所有人都自觉让路
Dialogue: 4,0:52:15.40,0:52:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Everybody gets out of the way.
Dialogue: 5,0:52:17.15,0:52:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我没开玩笑 我发誓
Dialogue: 4,0:52:17.15,0:52:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm not kidding you. I swear.
Dialogue: 5,0:52:18.62,0:52:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那些人和他素不相识 就像
Dialogue: 4,0:52:18.62,0:52:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Guys he never met in his life. You know, it was like...
Dialogue: 5,0:52:20.94,0:52:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就像摩西 记得摩西吗
Dialogue: 4,0:52:20.94,0:52:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}like Moses. Remember Moses?
Dialogue: 5,0:52:23.07,0:52:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他走进海洋还是大海
Dialogue: 4,0:52:23.07,0:52:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}When he walked into the ocean, the sea,
Dialogue: 5,0:52:25.12,0:52:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不管是什么 水面就分开了
Dialogue: 4,0:52:25.12,0:52:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}whatever the fuck it was, and it opened up!
Dialogue: 5,0:52:27.49,0:52:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就是他 相信我 吉米 他有那能力
Dialogue: 4,0:52:27.49,0:52:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's him. I'm telling you. Jimmy, he's got it.
Dialogue: 5,0:52:30.63,0:52:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你觉得如何
Dialogue: 4,0:52:30.63,0:52:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 5,0:52:31.61,0:52:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你还需要他在这待几天吗
Dialogue: 4,0:52:31.61,0:52:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You need him a couple of days more?
Dialogue: 5,0:52:33.87,0:52:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是的 我们还有一些零碎的事要处理
Dialogue: 4,0:52:33.87,0:52:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, we gotta clear up a few dribs and drabs.
Dialogue: 5,0:52:38.83,0:52:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们真喜欢西瓜啊
Dialogue: 4,0:52:38.83,0:52:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You guys sure like watermelon.
Dialogue: 5,0:52:41.05,0:52:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}想吃一口吗
Dialogue: 4,0:52:41.05,0:52:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Want a bite?
Dialogue: 5,0:52:41.95,0:52:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}决不
Dialogue: 4,0:52:41.95,0:52:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Not on your life.
Dialogue: 5,0:52:45.46,0:52:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你当时在场 你亲眼看到了
Dialogue: 4,0:52:45.46,0:52:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You were there. You saw it firsthand.
Dialogue: 5,0:52:47.76,0:52:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那些人不是工会
Dialogue: 4,0:52:47.76,0:52:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Those guys ain't union.
Dialogue: 5,0:52:49.99,0:52:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们就像是纳粹同谋 在战场后方行动
Dialogue: 4,0:52:49.99,0:52:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They're like Nazi collaborators, operating behind the lines.
Dialogue: 5,0:52:53.96,0:52:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你懂的 你打过仗 -没错
Dialogue: 4,0:52:53.96,0:52:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- You know. You were in the war. - I sure do.
Dialogue: 5,0:52:57.23,0:53:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在战争期间 你从一个地方转移到另一个地方
Dialogue: 4,0:52:57.23,0:53:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}In a war, you go from point A to point B.
Dialogue: 5,0:53:02.80,0:53:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有时候
Dialogue: 4,0:53:02.80,0:53:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Sometimes,
Dialogue: 5,0:53:04.61,0:53:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你会在路上洒一些啤酒
Dialogue: 4,0:53:04.61,0:53:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you spill a little beer along the way.
Dialogue: 5,0:53:09.25,0:53:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你觉得这哲学有道理吗
Dialogue: 4,0:53:09.25,0:53:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That philosophy make sense to you?
Dialogue: 5,0:53:11.05,0:53:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}当然
Dialogue: 4,0:53:11.05,0:53:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Sure does.
Dialogue: 5,0:53:13.14,0:53:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}很好
Dialogue: 4,0:53:13.14,0:53:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Good.
Dialogue: 5,0:53:31.27,0:53:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 他不是因为喜欢我
Dialogue: 4,0:53:31.27,0:53:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy, he didn't make me stay in his suite
Dialogue: 5,0:53:33.21,0:53:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}而让我住他的套房
Dialogue: 4,0:53:33.21,0:53:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}because he liked me.
Dialogue: 5,0:53:35.45,0:53:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他让我跟他一起住是因为他不想让我
Dialogue: 4,0:53:35.45,0:53:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He made me stay with him because he didn't want me
Dialogue: 5,0:53:37.46,0:53:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}用我的名字在酒店登记
Dialogue: 4,0:53:37.46,0:53:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}registering in my name at the hotel.
Dialogue: 5,0:53:41.08,0:53:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这样 就没有证据证明我去过芝加哥
Dialogue: 4,0:53:41.08,0:53:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This way, there was no proof I was even in Chicago.
Dialogue: 5,0:53:53.79,0:53:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}加油 吉米 你落后好多
Dialogue: 4,0:53:53.79,0:53:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Come on, Jimmy, you're way behind.
Dialogue: 5,0:53:56.54,0:53:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}什么都阻止不了她
Dialogue: 4,0:53:56.54,0:53:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Nothing stops her.
Dialogue: 5,0:53:57.67,0:54:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}芝加哥那事之后 我和吉米走得更近了
Dialogue: 4,0:53:57.67,0:54:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}After Chicago, Jimmy and I got close.
Dialogue: 5,0:54:00.52,0:54:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}老婆们也相处得很融洽
Dialogue: 4,0:54:00.52,0:54:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The wives hit it off.
Dialogue: 5,0:54:02.24,0:54:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为吉米和约瑟芬的孩子
Dialogue: 4,0:54:02.24,0:54:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And with Jimmy and Josephine's kids
Dialogue: 5,0:54:03.94,0:54:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}大多已成年 离开了家
Dialogue: 4,0:54:03.94,0:54:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}mostly grown up and out of the house,
Dialogue: 5,0:54:05.95,0:54:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们从我们孩子身上也获得不少乐趣
Dialogue: 4,0:54:05.95,0:54:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}they got a kick out of our kids too.
Dialogue: 5,0:54:07.73,0:54:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 佩琪 来拍张照
Dialogue: 4,0:54:07.73,0:54:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy, Peggy, let's get a picture.
Dialogue: 5,0:54:09.47,0:54:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"约"·霍法
Dialogue: 5,0:54:09.88,0:54:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好 快来
Dialogue: 4,0:54:09.88,0:54:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Oh. Yes. Come on.
Dialogue: 5,0:54:10.86,0:54:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}尤其是佩琪
Dialogue: 4,0:54:10.86,0:54:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Especially Peggy.
Dialogue: 5,0:54:12.50,0:54:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她和吉米 他们一下就喜欢上了对方
Dialogue: 4,0:54:12.50,0:54:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}She and Jimmy, they fell for each other right away.
Dialogue: 5,0:54:16.03,0:54:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道比起拍照我更喜欢什么吗
Dialogue: 4,0:54:16.03,0:54:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know what I like even better than getting my picture took?
Dialogue: 5,0:54:19.86,0:54:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}什么
Dialogue: 4,0:54:19.86,0:54:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What?
Dialogue: 5,0:54:22.90,0:54:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}惊喜吧
Dialogue: 4,0:54:22.90,0:54:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Surprise!
Dialogue: 5,0:54:25.08,0:54:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}佩琪
Dialogue: 4,0:54:25.08,0:54:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Peggy!
Dialogue: 5,0:54:25.81,0:54:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对佩琪来说 吉米不像罗素
Dialogue: 4,0:54:25.81,0:54:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}To Peggy, Jimmy wasn't like Russ,
Dialogue: 5,0:54:26.26,0:54:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}韦尔冰淇淋店
Dialogue: 5,0:54:28.05,0:54:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不像瘦子也不像我
Dialogue: 4,0:54:28.05,0:54:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}or Skinny or even me.
Dialogue: 5,0:54:29.99,0:54:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}抱歉各位 这是买给我和佩琪的
Dialogue: 4,0:54:29.99,0:54:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Sorry, everybody. This is just for Peggy and I.
Dialogue: 5,0:54:33.27,0:54:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一方面 吉米没有绰号
Dialogue: 4,0:54:33.27,0:54:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}For one thing, Jimmy didn't have a nickname
Dialogue: 5,0:54:35.47,0:54:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}比如"剃刀"或者"钟楼怪人"
Dialogue: 4,0:54:35.47,0:54:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}like "The Razor," Or "The Hunchback,"
Dialogue: 5,0:54:37.40,0:54:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}或者"黄鼠狼"亦或者"悄悄话"
Dialogue: 4,0:54:37.40,0:54:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}or "The Weasel," Or "Whispers."
Dialogue: 5,0:54:40.00,0:54:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}怎么不说谢谢
Dialogue: 4,0:54:40.00,0:54:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So what happened to "Thank you"?
Dialogue: 5,0:54:42.05,0:54:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谢谢
Dialogue: 4,0:54:42.05,0:54:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 5,0:54:43.67,0:54:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还有 对她来说 他是在帮助人
Dialogue: 4,0:54:43.67,0:54:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And also, to her, he was helping people.
Dialogue: 5,0:54:46.27,0:54:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他在帮他们赚更多钱 过得更好
Dialogue: 4,0:54:46.27,0:54:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He was helping them make more money, live better lives.
Dialogue: 5,0:54:49.47,0:54:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他没有踩别人的手
Dialogue: 4,0:54:49.47,0:54:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He wasn't stomping on somebody's hand.
Dialogue: 5,0:54:53.81,0:54:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"如果你买东西 卡车会把东西送过去"
Dialogue: 4,0:54:53.81,0:54:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"'If you have it, a truck brought it to you."
Dialogue: 5,0:54:56.11,0:54:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是霍法先生说的
Dialogue: 4,0:54:56.11,0:54:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is what Mr. Hoffa says.
Dialogue: 5,0:54:57.56,0:55:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}职业介绍日 1960年
Dialogue: 5,0:54:58.01,0:55:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他是卡车司机工会的主席
Dialogue: 4,0:54:58.01,0:55:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's the president of the Teamsters Union
Dialogue: 5,0:55:00.18,0:55:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}成员超过一百万
Dialogue: 4,0:55:00.18,0:55:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}with over a million members.
Dialogue: 5,0:55:02.43,0:55:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们都支持他因为他们有稳定的工作
Dialogue: 4,0:55:02.43,0:55:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They all support him because they have steady jobs,
Dialogue: 5,0:55:05.18,0:55:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我是吉米·霍法的朋友
Dialogue: 5,0:55:05.33,0:55:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}丰厚的薪水以及退休后的养老金
Dialogue: 4,0:55:05.33,0:55:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}great pay and a pension for when they retire.
Dialogue: 5,0:55:09.66,0:55:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卡车司机养老基金
Dialogue: 4,0:55:09.66,0:55:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The Teamster Pension Fund
Dialogue: 5,0:55:11.11,0:55:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有八十亿美元
Dialogue: 4,0:55:11.11,0:55:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}had eight billion dollars in it.
Dialogue: 5,0:55:13.28,0:55:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}全部都由吉米控制
Dialogue: 4,0:55:13.28,0:55:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And Jimmy had complete control over every bit of it.
Dialogue: 5,0:55:16.71,0:55:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}沙丘酒店
Dialogue: 5,0:55:17.24,0:55:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这模型是不是很美
Dialogue: 4,0:55:17.24,0:55:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Isn't this a beautiful presentation?
Dialogue: 5,0:55:19.01,0:55:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我只想要一笔过渡性贷款 吉米
Dialogue: 4,0:55:19.01,0:55:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, a bridge loan is really all I'm asking, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,0:55:22.83,0:55:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不会把工会成员的养老金
Dialogue: 4,0:55:22.83,0:55:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm not gonna piss away my members' pension dough
Dialogue: 5,0:55:25.53,0:55:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}投资在风险过大的项目上
Dialogue: 4,0:55:25.53,0:55:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}on something too risky.
Dialogue: 5,0:55:26.76,0:55:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这没有风险 吉米
Dialogue: 4,0:55:26.76,0:55:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is not a risk, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,0:55:28.66,0:55:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}《明斯基的荒唐事》这个节目是我的
Dialogue: 4,0:55:28.66,0:55:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I got Minsky's Follies.
Dialogue: 5,0:55:31.06,0:55:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}赌城大道第一个露乳舞女秀是我的
Dialogue: 4,0:55:31.06,0:55:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I got the first topless act on the Strip.
Dialogue: 5,0:55:33.42,0:55:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}相信我 我们在那的生意可好了
Dialogue: 4,0:55:33.42,0:55:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm telling you, we're booming in there.
Dialogue: 5,0:55:34.90,0:55:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}酒都卖不过来...
Dialogue: 4,0:55:34.90,0:55:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I can't get the drinks out...
Dialogue: 5,0:55:36.14,0:55:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我就想要建一个高尔夫球场
Dialogue: 4,0:55:36.14,0:55:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Just asking for a golf course.
Dialogue: 5,0:55:37.71,0:55:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道我从未让你损失一分钱
Dialogue: 4,0:55:37.71,0:55:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know you never lost a dime with me.
Dialogue: 5,0:55:39.25,0:55:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 我们会很感激
Dialogue: 4,0:55:39.25,0:55:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy, we'd really just appreciate
Dialogue: 5,0:55:41.16,0:55:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你帮杰克做的事的
Dialogue: 4,0:55:41.16,0:55:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}whatever you could do to help Jake along here.
Dialogue: 5,0:55:42.96,0:55:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我只需要150万的完工保证金
Dialogue: 4,0:55:42.96,0:55:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}One-five is all I need for a completion bond.
Dialogue: 5,0:55:48.22,0:55:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好吧 去拿钱吧
Dialogue: 4,0:55:48.22,0:55:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay. Okay. Go to the bank.
Dialogue: 5,0:55:51.44,0:55:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谢谢 这个项目会大获成功的
Dialogue: 4,0:55:51.44,0:55:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Thank you. It's gonna be a big success.
Dialogue: 5,0:55:52.97,0:55:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谢谢你 吉米 你是王子
Dialogue: 4,0:55:52.97,0:55:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Thank you, Jimmy. You're a prince.
Dialogue: 5,0:55:55.02,0:55:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你是好人 -是的 我是好人
Dialogue: 4,0:55:55.02,0:55:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- You're a mensch. - Yeah, I'm a mensch.
Dialogue: 5,0:56:05.51,0:56:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}多亏了霍法先生
Dialogue: 4,0:56:05.51,0:56:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And, because of Mr. Hoffa,
Dialogue: 5,0:56:07.76,0:56:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}工人生病时有医疗保险
Dialogue: 4,0:56:07.76,0:56:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}workers have medical insurance for when they get sick,
Dialogue: 5,0:56:10.85,0:56:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们知道退休后 不会挨饿
Dialogue: 4,0:56:10.85,0:56:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and know when they retire, they're not going to go hungry.
Dialogue: 5,0:56:15.96,0:56:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}当时有太多的文书工作
Dialogue: 4,0:56:15.96,0:56:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There was so much paperwork back then
Dialogue: 5,0:56:18.13,0:56:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米只能用一个叫艾伦·多夫曼的年轻人开的
Dialogue: 4,0:56:18.13,0:56:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}that Jimmy had to use an insurance company
Dialogue: 5,0:56:20.47,0:56:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一家保险公司来处理贷款
Dialogue: 4,0:56:20.47,0:56:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}that was run by this kid, Allen Dorfman, to work out the loans.
Dialogue: 5,0:56:23.78,0:56:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不 一分钱都不借
Dialogue: 4,0:56:23.78,0:56:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, no, nothing for nothing.
Dialogue: 5,0:56:25.23,0:56:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}下次 试试口气好一点
Dialogue: 4,0:56:25.23,0:56:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Next time, try asking a little bit fucking nicer.
Dialogue: 5,0:56:27.61,0:56:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}艾伦·多夫曼 1979年
Dialogue: 3,0:56:27.61,0:56:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在芝加哥的一处停车场头中八枪身亡
Dialogue: 5,0:56:32.71,0:56:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}然后呢 进展如何
Dialogue: 4,0:56:32.71,0:56:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And? And? How'd it go?
Dialogue: 5,0:56:34.83,0:56:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}情况一度很危急
Dialogue: 4,0:56:34.83,0:56:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It was a little touch and go for a little bit.
Dialogue: 5,0:56:37.40,0:56:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-但是最后还是顺利达成了 -很好
Dialogue: 4,0:56:37.40,0:56:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- But at the end, fine. - Good.
Dialogue: 5,0:56:39.20,0:56:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是罗素让吉米
Dialogue: 4,0:56:39.20,0:56:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It was Russ who got Jimmy
Dialogue: 5,0:56:40.34,0:56:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}给戈特利布这样的人贷款
Dialogue: 4,0:56:40.34,0:56:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to give guys like Gottlieb the loans,
Dialogue: 5,0:56:42.41,0:56:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他能分到一成
Dialogue: 4,0:56:42.41,0:56:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and, you know, he would get like 10% of that.
Dialogue: 5,0:56:45.42,0:56:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我也不知道 也许更多
Dialogue: 4,0:56:45.42,0:56:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Or whatever, you know. Maybe more.
Dialogue: 5,0:56:47.59,0:56:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}听着 你告诉马尔特杜佐我很感激
Dialogue: 4,0:56:47.59,0:56:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Listen, you tell Marteduzzo from me that I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 5,0:56:50.99,0:56:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}人人都会感激
Dialogue: 4,0:56:50.99,0:56:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And everybody's gonna appreciate it.
Dialogue: 5,0:56:52.68,0:56:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是好事
Dialogue: 4,0:56:52.68,0:56:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's a good thing.
Dialogue: 5,0:56:53.60,0:56:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}行 我会的
Dialogue: 4,0:56:53.60,0:56:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay. I'll do that.
Dialogue: 5,0:56:54.59,0:56:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那时 你不能去普通银行
Dialogue: 4,0:56:54.59,0:56:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Back then, you couldn't go to regular banks
Dialogue: 5,0:56:56.61,0:56:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为钱是用来赌博的
Dialogue: 4,0:56:56.61,0:56:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}because the money was for gambling.
Dialogue: 5,0:56:58.41,0:57:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}千真万确 就是这样 我没开玩笑 不能去
Dialogue: 4,0:56:58.41,0:57:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}God's truth, that's what it was. I'm serious. You couldn't.
Dialogue: 5,0:57:01.10,0:57:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所以黑手党 他们怎么办呢
Dialogue: 4,0:57:01.10,0:57:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So the Mob, what did they do?
Dialogue: 5,0:57:02.91,0:57:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们找卡车司机工会贷款
Dialogue: 4,0:57:02.91,0:57:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They went to the Teamsters for the money.
Dialogue: 5,0:57:04.84,0:57:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是卡车司机工会介入其中
Dialogue: 4,0:57:04.84,0:57:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It was the Teamsters that stepped in
Dialogue: 5,0:57:06.69,0:57:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们借出的钱打造了拉斯维加斯
Dialogue: 4,0:57:06.69,0:57:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and lent the money that built Las Vegas.
Dialogue: 5,0:57:08.96,0:57:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-这是红木 -别 比利
Dialogue: 4,0:57:08.96,0:57:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- This is the mahogany... - Don't, Billy.
Dialogue: 5,0:57:10.47,0:57:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-别碰 -我不碰
Dialogue: 4,0:57:10.47,0:57:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Don't touch the stuff. - I won't.
Dialogue: 5,0:57:11.82,0:57:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-该上哪去上哪去 -好
Dialogue: 4,0:57:11.82,0:57:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Just go where you gotta go. - Okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:57:13.11,0:57:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}当时的生意多得让人应接不暇
Dialogue: 4,0:57:13.11,0:57:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There was more business than anybody could handle.
Dialogue: 5,0:57:16.51,0:57:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所以吉米把一些生意
Dialogue: 4,0:57:16.51,0:57:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So Jimmy had to shove some of the deals
Dialogue: 5,0:57:18.26,0:57:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}塞给了他老婆约
Dialogue: 4,0:57:18.26,0:57:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}off on to his wife Jo,
Dialogue: 5,0:57:20.01,0:57:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她完全不知道
Dialogue: 4,0:57:20.01,0:57:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}who had no idea she had 22%
Dialogue: 5,0:57:22.23,0:57:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她拥有一个叫"太阳谷"的
Dialogue: 4,0:57:22.23,0:57:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}of a Florida land deal
Dialogue: 5,0:57:23.23,0:57:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}佛州土地交易公司22%的股份
Dialogue: 4,0:57:23.23,0:57:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}called "Sun Valley,"
Dialogue: 5,0:57:25.00,0:57:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}几艘包租渔船
Dialogue: 4,0:57:25.00,0:57:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}some charter fishing boats,
Dialogue: 5,0:57:26.73,0:57:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}以及一个带私家雪山的滑雪度假屋
Dialogue: 4,0:57:26.73,0:57:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and a ski lodge with its own mountain.
Dialogue: 5,0:57:34.62,0:57:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米有个客户叫山姆·詹卡纳 绰号"莫莫"
Dialogue: 4,0:57:34.62,0:57:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}One of Jimmy's clients was Sam "Momo" Giancana,
Dialogue: 5,0:57:37.71,0:57:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他和肯尼迪家族是世交
Dialogue: 4,0:57:37.71,0:57:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}who was friends with the Kennedys from back
Dialogue: 5,0:57:39.37,0:57:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这两家自约翰·肯尼迪的父亲在禁酒令期间走私酒
Dialogue: 4,0:57:39.37,0:57:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}when Jack's father made his fortune with the Italians
Dialogue: 5,0:57:42.09,0:57:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}和意大利人一起赚大钱时就认识了
Dialogue: 4,0:57:42.09,0:57:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}as a bootlegger during Prohibition.
Dialogue: 5,0:57:44.29,0:57:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}露希尔·亨特
Dialogue: 4,0:57:44.29,0:57:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}刘易斯·康宁汉姆
Dialogue: 3,0:57:44.29,0:57:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}玛丽昂·希克斯
Dialogue: 2,0:57:44.29,0:57:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}德妮思·鲍威尔
Dialogue: 1,0:57:44.29,0:57:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}艾米特·伍兹
Dialogue: 5,0:57:44.60,0:57:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}莫莫和辛纳屈跟肯尼迪家族混
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.60,0:57:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Momo, Sinatra hung out together with the Kennedys.
Dialogue: 5,0:57:46.75,0:57:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}艾米特·伍兹
Dialogue: 5,0:57:49.37,0:57:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}莫莫和肯尼迪
Dialogue: 4,0:57:49.37,0:57:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Momo and Kennedy,
Dialogue: 5,0:57:51.22,0:57:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不管你信不信 甚至有同一个女友
Dialogue: 4,0:57:51.22,0:57:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}believe it or not, even had the same girlfriend.
Dialogue: 5,0:57:53.81,0:57:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在同一时期
Dialogue: 4,0:57:53.81,0:57:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Together. At the same time.
Dialogue: 5,0:57:56.51,0:57:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}真是太疯狂了
Dialogue: 4,0:57:56.51,0:57:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Talk about crazy.
Dialogue: 5,0:57:58.39,0:58:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所以对黑手党来说 帮助乔·肯尼迪
Dialogue: 4,0:57:58.39,0:58:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So it was easy for the Mob to help Joe Kennedy
Dialogue: 5,0:58:00.53,0:58:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}让他儿子当选总统很容易 非常容易
Dialogue: 4,0:58:00.53,0:58:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}get his son elected president. That was easy.
Dialogue: 5,0:58:03.72,0:58:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们操控了选票
Dialogue: 4,0:58:03.72,0:58:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They just punched up the vote a little
Dialogue: 5,0:58:05.63,0:58:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}确保他在伊利诺伊州胜出
Dialogue: 4,0:58:05.63,0:58:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to make sure that he won in Illinois.
Dialogue: 5,0:58:06.66,0:58:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}雷蒙德·克拉克
Dialogue: 5,0:58:10.17,0:58:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}艾米特·伍兹
Dialogue: 5,0:58:11.74,0:58:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}作为交换
Dialogue: 4,0:58:11.74,0:58:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}In exchange for that,
Dialogue: 5,0:58:13.45,0:58:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}新上台的总统要把卡斯特罗从古巴赶下台
Dialogue: 4,0:58:13.45,0:58:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the new president was supposedly gonna get Castro out of Cuba
Dialogue: 5,0:58:16.68,0:58:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这样我们的人就能拿回他们的赌场
Dialogue: 4,0:58:16.68,0:58:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}so our guys could get their casinos back,
Dialogue: 5,0:58:19.45,0:58:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}赛马场 捕虾船
Dialogue: 4,0:58:19.45,0:58:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and race tracks, and shrimp boats,
Dialogue: 5,0:58:21.53,0:58:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}以及他们在哈瓦那
Dialogue: 4,0:58:21.53,0:58:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and everything else that they had,
Dialogue: 5,0:58:22.78,0:58:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}曾拥有的一切
Dialogue: 4,0:58:22.78,0:58:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and owned down there from Havana back.
Dialogue: 5,0:58:25.44,0:58:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不过那事没成
Dialogue: 4,0:58:25.44,0:58:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But that... that didn't happen.
Dialogue: 5,0:58:33.11,0:58:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}投民主党
Dialogue: 5,0:58:34.70,0:58:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}意大利人想让爱尔兰人肯尼迪当总统
Dialogue: 4,0:58:34.70,0:58:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The Italians wanted Kennedy the Irishman for president,
Dialogue: 5,0:58:38.89,0:58:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们如愿了
Dialogue: 4,0:58:38.89,0:58:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and that's what they got.
Dialogue: 5,0:58:42.39,0:58:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}习惯吧 因为以后我们每时每刻都得看到了
Dialogue: 4,0:58:42.39,0:58:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Get used to it, because we're gonna be seeing it 24/7.
Dialogue: 5,0:58:45.47,0:58:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}狗娘养的
Dialogue: 4,0:58:45.47,0:58:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 5,0:58:46.78,0:58:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}该死的肯尼迪家族
Dialogue: 4,0:58:46.78,0:58:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Goddamn Kennedys.
Dialogue: 5,0:58:48.04,0:58:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我在看该死的肯尼迪家族
Dialogue: 4,0:58:48.04,0:58:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm looking at the goddamn Kennedys.
Dialogue: 5,0:58:49.48,0:58:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 孩子们都在呢 注意言辞
Dialogue: 4,0:58:49.48,0:58:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy, the kids. Language.
Dialogue: 5,0:58:51.64,0:58:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有什么差别
Dialogue: 4,0:58:51.64,0:58:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What difference does it make?
Dialogue: 5,0:58:53.64,0:58:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们迟早都要学会的
Dialogue: 4,0:58:53.64,0:58:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, they gotta learn sooner or later.
Dialogue: 5,0:58:55.15,0:58:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们要和这些人开战
Dialogue: 4,0:58:55.15,0:58:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We're going to war with these people.
Dialogue: 5,0:58:57.45,0:58:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}开战
Dialogue: 4,0:58:57.45,0:58:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}War!
Dialogue: 5,0:58:59.17,0:59:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我已经说了无数次了
Dialogue: 4,0:58:59.17,0:59:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If I said it once, I said it a thousand times,
Dialogue: 5,0:59:01.37,0:59:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不在乎他们是不是爱尔兰人
Dialogue: 4,0:59:01.37,0:59:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't care they're Irish.
Dialogue: 5,0:59:03.60,0:59:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不在乎他们是不是天主教徒
Dialogue: 4,0:59:03.60,0:59:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't care they're Catholic.
Dialogue: 5,0:59:05.15,0:59:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如果要说这辈子有谁你不能信
Dialogue: 4,0:59:05.15,0:59:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If there's one person you can't trust in this life,
Dialogue: 5,0:59:08.70,0:59:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那就是百万富翁的孩子
Dialogue: 4,0:59:08.70,0:59:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}it's millionaires' kids.
Dialogue: 5,0:59:10.05,0:59:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你说得对 吉米
Dialogue: 4,0:59:10.05,0:59:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're right, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,0:59:12.19,0:59:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}尤其是那个小杂种
Dialogue: 4,0:59:12.19,0:59:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Especially that little son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 5,0:59:16.90,0:59:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你是说你不记得
Dialogue: 4,0:59:16.90,0:59:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Are you saying you don't remember
Dialogue: 5,0:59:18.42,0:59:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你帮过约翰尼·迪奥吗
Dialogue: 4,0:59:18.42,0:59:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}doing any favors for Johnny Dio,
Dialogue: 5,0:59:20.50,0:59:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗伯特·肯尼迪
Dialogue: 5,0:59:20.56,0:59:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还是说你不记得你们的对话
Dialogue: 4,0:59:20.56,0:59:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}or you don't remember the conversation?
Dialogue: 5,0:59:23.77,0:59:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我是说 我已经尽力回忆了
Dialogue: 4,0:59:23.77,0:59:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm saying, to the best of my recollection,
Dialogue: 5,0:59:27.48,0:59:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}根据我的回忆
Dialogue: 4,0:59:27.48,0:59:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I must recall on my memory,
Dialogue: 5,0:59:30.21,0:59:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我想不起来了
Dialogue: 4,0:59:30.21,0:59:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I cannot remember.
Dialogue: 5,0:59:34.34,0:59:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那这两万块是哪来的
Dialogue: 4,0:59:34.34,0:59:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Then where did this $20,000 come from?
Dialogue: 5,0:59:38.90,0:59:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}个人的
Dialogue: 4,0:59:38.90,0:59:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Individuals.
Dialogue: 5,0:59:41.22,0:59:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}哪些个人 霍法先生
Dialogue: 4,0:59:41.22,0:59:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Which individuals, Mr. Hoffa?
Dialogue: 5,0:59:45.40,0:59:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}未经核查的情况下 这笔我借的钱
Dialogue: 4,0:59:45.40,0:59:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Off hand, that particular amount of money I borrowed,
Dialogue: 5,0:59:50.37,0:59:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我目前也想不起是找谁借的
Dialogue: 4,0:59:50.37,0:59:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't know at this particular moment.
Dialogue: 5,0:59:53.86,0:59:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但是根据我取得的贷款记录
Dialogue: 4,0:59:53.86,0:59:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But the record of my loans, which I requested, I have,
Dialogue: 5,0:59:58.76,1:00:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在这段时间内
Dialogue: 4,0:59:58.76,1:00:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and out of all the moneys I loaned
Dialogue: 5,1:00:01.02,1:00:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我贷款的所有钱 都投资给了这些企业
Dialogue: 4,1:00:01.02,1:00:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}during this period of time I went into these ventures.
Dialogue: 5,1:00:11.00,1:00:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}该死的肯尼迪家族
Dialogue: 4,1:00:11.00,1:00:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Those goddamn Kennedys,
Dialogue: 5,1:00:12.73,1:00:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们总是得偿所愿
Dialogue: 4,1:00:12.73,1:00:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}they get what they want!
Dialogue: 5,1:00:14.17,1:00:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 吉米 孩子们在呢
Dialogue: 4,1:00:14.17,1:00:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy. Jimmy, the kids.
Dialogue: 5,1:00:15.07,1:00:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他已经让我
Dialogue: 4,1:00:15.07,1:00:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Him and all the bullshit problems
Dialogue: 5,1:00:16.93,1:00:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-处处受制 -吉米
Dialogue: 4,1:00:16.93,1:00:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- he put me through already. - Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,1:00:18.79,1:00:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我得走了 别指望我看这个
Dialogue: 4,1:00:18.79,1:00:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I gotta go. You don't expect me to look at this.
Dialogue: 5,1:00:20.91,1:00:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不指望
Dialogue: 4,1:00:20.91,1:00:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, I don't.
Dialogue: 5,1:00:23.55,1:00:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对罗素这样的人来说
Dialogue: 4,1:00:23.55,1:00:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}For guys like Russ,
Dialogue: 5,1:00:24.87,1:00:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那最好不过了
Dialogue: 4,1:00:24.87,1:00:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}it couldn't have been better.
Dialogue: 5,1:00:26.36,1:00:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}支持肯尼迪当总统
Dialogue: 5,1:00:26.57,1:00:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我是说 罗素
Dialogue: 4,1:00:26.57,1:00:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, Russ,
Dialogue: 5,1:00:27.48,1:00:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}支持肯尼迪当总统
Dialogue: 5,1:00:28.03,1:00:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}肯尼迪当选他也有出力
Dialogue: 4,1:00:28.03,1:00:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}oh, yeah, he did his part for getting Kennedy elected,
Dialogue: 5,1:00:30.78,1:00:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}支持肯尼迪当总统
Dialogue: 5,1:00:30.95,1:00:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这点毫无疑问
Dialogue: 4,1:00:30.95,1:00:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}that's for sure.
Dialogue: 5,1:00:32.17,1:00:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你在做什么 我叫你把它...
Dialogue: 4,1:00:32.17,1:00:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What are you doing? I told you to put it...
Dialogue: 5,1:00:33.43,1:00:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我叫你贴到所有杆子上
Dialogue: 4,1:00:33.43,1:00:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I told you to put them on every pole.
Dialogue: 5,1:00:35.23,1:00:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你还在这瞎转
Dialogue: 4,1:00:35.23,1:00:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're still walking around.
Dialogue: 5,1:00:36.33,1:00:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所以约翰·肯尼迪
Dialogue: 4,1:00:36.33,1:00:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So what's the first thing
Dialogue: 5,1:00:37.29,1:00:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}为了感谢芝加哥的帮助做的第一件事是什么
Dialogue: 4,1:00:37.29,1:00:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}that Jack Kennedy does to thank Chicago for all their help?
Dialogue: 5,1:00:41.35,1:00:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他让他的垃圾弟弟上位了
Dialogue: 4,1:00:41.35,1:00:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He puts his shitass brother in there,
Dialogue: 5,1:00:43.49,1:00:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那个预科学校混蛋
Dialogue: 4,1:00:43.49,1:00:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}that little prep school punk,
Dialogue: 5,1:00:44.82,1:00:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他让他成了司法部长
Dialogue: 4,1:00:44.82,1:00:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and he winds up making him attorney general.
Dialogue: 5,1:00:50.38,1:00:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}鲍比上任后做的第一件事是什么
Dialogue: 4,1:00:50.38,1:00:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And what's the first thing Bobby does?
Dialogue: 5,1:00:52.20,1:00:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他不仅对付吉米
Dialogue: 4,1:00:52.20,1:00:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He goes after not just Jimmy,
Dialogue: 5,1:00:54.24,1:00:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}从某种程度上讲 你也能理解
Dialogue: 4,1:00:54.24,1:00:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}which in a way you could understand.
Dialogue: 5,1:00:56.94,1:00:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米无比厌恶肯尼迪家族
Dialogue: 4,1:00:56.94,1:00:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, Jimmy hated the Kennedys so much
Dialogue: 5,1:00:58.53,1:01:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}以至于他从工会拿了五十万给尼克松
Dialogue: 4,1:00:58.53,1:01:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he gave Nixon $500,000 in Teamster cash.
Dialogue: 5,1:01:01.66,1:01:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但鲍比还去对付詹卡纳
Dialogue: 4,1:01:01.66,1:01:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But Bobby also goes after Giancana,
Dialogue: 5,1:01:04.35,1:01:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}马切洛 特拉菲坎特 以及其他所有
Dialogue: 4,1:01:04.35,1:01:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Marcello, Trafficante, and all the other guys
Dialogue: 5,1:01:07.71,1:01:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}当初帮他哥哥入住白宫的人
Dialogue: 4,1:01:07.71,1:01:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}who put his brother in the White House in the first place.
Dialogue: 5,1:01:12.96,1:01:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那是在干什么
Dialogue: 4,1:01:12.96,1:01:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What's that about?
Dialogue: 5,1:01:14.42,1:01:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,1:01:14.42,1:01:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank.
Dialogue: 5,1:01:15.94,1:01:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-谢谢 -圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 4,1:01:15.94,1:01:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Thank you. - Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 5,1:01:17.17,1:01:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我是漏掉了什么吗
Dialogue: 4,1:01:17.17,1:01:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Am I missing something?
Dialogue: 5,1:01:18.97,1:01:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谢谢你 凯丽
Dialogue: 4,1:01:18.97,1:01:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Thank you, Carrie.
Dialogue: 5,1:01:24.45,1:01:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-太漂亮了 -真美
Dialogue: 4,1:01:24.45,1:01:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- That's gorgeous. - Beautiful.
Dialogue: 5,1:01:27.59,1:01:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}戴着它健健康康 我们爱你
Dialogue: 4,1:01:27.59,1:01:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Wear it in the best of health. We love you.
Dialogue: 5,1:01:30.73,1:01:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是给佩琪的
Dialogue: 4,1:01:30.73,1:01:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay, now this one is for Peggy
Dialogue: 5,1:01:33.23,1:01:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素伯伯送的 圣诞快乐 亲爱的
Dialogue: 4,1:01:33.23,1:01:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}from Uncle Russell. Merry Christmas, my love.
Dialogue: 5,1:01:36.79,1:01:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}看呀
Dialogue: 4,1:01:36.79,1:01:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Oh, look at those.
Dialogue: 5,1:01:40.34,1:01:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}太好了
Dialogue: 4,1:01:40.34,1:01:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So nice!
Dialogue: 5,1:01:42.16,1:01:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我听说你喜欢滑冰
Dialogue: 4,1:01:42.16,1:01:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I heard you like to skate.
Dialogue: 5,1:01:45.54,1:01:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你该说什么
Dialogue: 4,1:01:45.54,1:01:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What do you say?
Dialogue: 5,1:01:48.57,1:01:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谢谢
Dialogue: 4,1:01:48.57,1:01:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 5,1:01:49.71,1:01:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}现在我和罗素伯伯可以带你去滑冰了
Dialogue: 4,1:01:49.71,1:01:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Now me and Uncle Russell could take you ice skating.
Dialogue: 5,1:01:52.21,1:01:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我想圣诞老人
Dialogue: 4,1:01:52.21,1:01:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I think Santa Claus left you
Dialogue: 5,1:01:53.72,1:01:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在里面还给你留了点东西
Dialogue: 4,1:01:53.72,1:01:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}a little something extra in there too.
Dialogue: 5,1:02:01.00,1:02:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你该对罗素伯伯说什么
Dialogue: 4,1:02:01.00,1:02:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What do you say to Uncle Russell?
Dialogue: 5,1:02:04.69,1:02:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你该说什么
Dialogue: 4,1:02:04.69,1:02:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What do you say?
Dialogue: 5,1:02:08.53,1:02:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克 没关系
Dialogue: 4,1:02:08.53,1:02:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank, it's all right.
Dialogue: 5,1:02:10.63,1:02:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她已经说了一次谢谢了 这就够了
Dialogue: 4,1:02:10.63,1:02:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}She said thank you once. That's enough.
Dialogue: 5,1:02:16.38,1:02:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为鲍比是司法部长 他们把我们盯得很紧
Dialogue: 4,1:02:16.38,1:02:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}With Bobby as attorney general, I mean, they were all over us.
Dialogue: 5,1:02:19.52,1:02:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们不能在电话里说事
Dialogue: 4,1:02:19.52,1:02:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, we couldn't talk on the phone
Dialogue: 5,1:02:21.16,1:02:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为我们知道有人窃听
Dialogue: 4,1:02:21.16,1:02:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}because we knew it was being bugged.
Dialogue: 5,1:02:23.29,1:02:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你什么都不能做 哪也不能去
Dialogue: 4,1:02:23.29,1:02:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You couldn't do nothing. You couldn't go nowhere.
Dialogue: 5,1:02:25.15,1:02:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}什么都做不了
Dialogue: 4,1:02:25.15,1:02:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You couldn't do anything.
Dialogue: 5,1:02:26.48,1:02:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}总之情况特别糟糕
Dialogue: 4,1:02:26.48,1:02:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It was a bad, bad, bad situation.
Dialogue: 5,1:02:28.47,1:02:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}然后吉米 算了
Dialogue: 4,1:02:28.47,1:02:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And then Jimmy... Forget it.
Dialogue: 5,1:02:30.94,1:02:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}鲍比 现在作为司法部长 他有权力
Dialogue: 4,1:02:30.94,1:02:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Bobby, now as attorney general, he has the power
Dialogue: 5,1:02:33.59,1:02:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}送任何人进监狱 毋庸置疑
Dialogue: 4,1:02:33.59,1:02:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to send anybody to jail, and no question about it.
Dialogue: 5,1:02:35.93,1:02:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米在鲍比的打击对象名单上名列前茅
Dialogue: 4,1:02:35.93,1:02:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And Jimmy was at the top of Bobby's hit list.
Dialogue: 5,1:02:38.39,1:02:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他甚至组建了一只专门的"抓捕霍法小队"
Dialogue: 4,1:02:38.39,1:02:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He even set up a special "Get Hoffa Squad,"
Dialogue: 5,1:02:41.01,1:02:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他找来了联调局
Dialogue: 4,1:02:41.01,1:02:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}where he had his own guys from the FBI,
Dialogue: 5,1:02:42.81,1:02:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还有国税局的人夜以继日地工作
Dialogue: 4,1:02:42.81,1:02:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the IRS working 'round the clock.
Dialogue: 5,1:02:44.73,1:02:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们唯一的工作就是送吉米·霍法进监狱
Dialogue: 4,1:02:44.73,1:02:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Their only job was to put Jimmy Hoffa in jail.
Dialogue: 5,1:02:47.93,1:02:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我是认真的 他们只干了这事
Dialogue: 4,1:02:47.93,1:02:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm serious. That's all they did.
Dialogue: 5,1:02:52.06,1:02:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这房间里全是该死的蠢货
Dialogue: 4,1:02:52.06,1:02:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I am sitting in a room full of fuckin' idiots.
Dialogue: 5,1:02:57.72,1:03:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一群傻逼
Dialogue: 4,1:02:57.72,1:03:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You dumb motherfuckers!
Dialogue: 5,1:03:00.41,1:03:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们知道你们做了什么吗
Dialogue: 4,1:03:00.41,1:03:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know what you did?
Dialogue: 5,1:03:02.00,1:03:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们找来约翰尼·奥鲁克的孩子
Dialogue: 4,1:03:02.00,1:03:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You take Johnny O'Rourke's kid
Dialogue: 5,1:03:04.96,1:03:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们让他
Dialogue: 4,1:03:04.96,1:03:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and you put him on
Dialogue: 5,1:03:06.68,1:03:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}成为总组织者
Dialogue: 4,1:03:06.68,1:03:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}as general organizer,
Dialogue: 5,1:03:09.41,1:03:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}支付了他3.6万
Dialogue: 4,1:03:09.41,1:03:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}pay him 36 fucking grand,
Dialogue: 5,1:03:12.83,1:03:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}与此同时
Dialogue: 4,1:03:12.83,1:03:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}at the same time,
Dialogue: 5,1:03:15.57,1:03:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们让他卖保险给他爸爸的...
Dialogue: 4,1:03:15.57,1:03:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you let him sell insurance to his fucking father's...
Dialogue: 5,1:03:28.32,1:03:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他爸爸的...
Dialogue: 4,1:03:28.32,1:03:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to his fucking father's...
Dialogue: 5,1:03:31.40,1:03:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卖给他爸爸的地方工会
Dialogue: 4,1:03:31.40,1:03:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to his fucking father's locals!
Dialogue: 5,1:03:35.22,1:03:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}该死
Dialogue: 4,1:03:35.22,1:03:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Damn it!
Dialogue: 5,1:03:37.74,1:03:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}怎么能犯这种错
Dialogue: 4,1:03:37.74,1:03:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}How do you do that?
Dialogue: 5,1:03:40.91,1:03:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们是有多蠢
Dialogue: 4,1:03:40.91,1:03:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}How stupid can you be?
Dialogue: 5,1:03:45.38,1:03:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那该死的狗杂种肯尼迪
Dialogue: 4,1:03:45.38,1:03:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That fucking cocksucker Kennedy
Dialogue: 5,1:03:48.02,1:03:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我去哪他都盯着我
Dialogue: 4,1:03:48.02,1:03:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}has got his nose up my ass everywhere I go!
Dialogue: 5,1:03:51.63,1:03:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们不知道他对我紧追不舍吗
Dialogue: 4,1:03:51.63,1:03:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You don't know that they're hounding me?
Dialogue: 5,1:03:53.44,1:03:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们监视我做的每件事
Dialogue: 4,1:03:53.44,1:03:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They're looking at everything I do.
Dialogue: 5,1:03:55.05,1:03:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们却让这发生在大庭广众之下
Dialogue: 4,1:03:55.05,1:03:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And you let this happen in public!
Dialogue: 5,1:03:58.43,1:03:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们成全了他
Dialogue: 4,1:03:58.43,1:03:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're giving it to him!
Dialogue: 5,1:03:59.78,1:04:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我要去坐牢了 懂吗
Dialogue: 4,1:03:59.78,1:04:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm going to jail. You understand?
Dialogue: 5,1:04:02.76,1:04:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}拜你们所赐 我要去坐牢了
Dialogue: 4,1:04:02.76,1:04:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm going to prison because of you,
Dialogue: 5,1:04:05.24,1:04:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一群蠢货
Dialogue: 4,1:04:05.24,1:04:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you dumb motherfuckers.
Dialogue: 5,1:04:07.31,1:04:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是你们想要的 你们想让我进监狱
Dialogue: 4,1:04:07.31,1:04:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is what you wanted. You wanted to put me in jail.
Dialogue: 5,1:04:09.58,1:04:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}告诉我 好让我就地杀了你们
Dialogue: 4,1:04:09.58,1:04:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tell me now so I can kill you right here.
Dialogue: 5,1:04:12.41,1:04:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就地
Dialogue: 4,1:04:12.41,1:04:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Right here!
Dialogue: 5,1:04:18.70,1:04:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你去哪
Dialogue: 4,1:04:18.70,1:04:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Where're you going?
Dialogue: 5,1:04:19.37,1:04:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}什么叫"我去哪"
Dialogue: 4,1:04:19.37,1:04:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What do you mean, where am I going?
Dialogue: 5,1:04:20.12,1:04:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我他妈不干了 这就是我要去的地方
Dialogue: 4,1:04:20.12,1:04:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I fucking quit, that's where I'm going.
Dialogue: 5,1:04:22.01,1:04:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你为什么不干了
Dialogue: 4,1:04:22.01,1:04:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What are you quitting for?
Dialogue: 5,1:04:23.51,1:04:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你叫我蠢货
Dialogue: 4,1:04:23.51,1:04:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You gonna call me a motherfucker?
Dialogue: 5,1:04:25.25,1:04:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你可以这么跟他们说话 但跟我不行
Dialogue: 4,1:04:25.25,1:04:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You can talk to them like that, you can't talk to me like that.
Dialogue: 5,1:04:26.77,1:04:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克 不 我没说你 你...
Dialogue: 4,1:04:26.77,1:04:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank. No! That didn't apply to you. What are you...
Dialogue: 5,1:04:29.71,1:04:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-没说我 -是的
Dialogue: 4,1:04:29.71,1:04:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Didn't apply? - No!
Dialogue: 5,1:04:30.22,1:04:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那你要告诉我你没在说我
Dialogue: 4,1:04:30.22,1:04:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Then you gotta let me know it didn't apply to me.
Dialogue: 5,1:04:31.98,1:04:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我就站在那
Dialogue: 4,1:04:31.98,1:04:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm standing right there.
Dialogue: 5,1:04:33.56,1:04:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我根本没看到你站在那
Dialogue: 4,1:04:33.56,1:04:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I didn't even see you standing there!
Dialogue: 5,1:04:35.19,1:04:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我就站在那 吉米
Dialogue: 4,1:04:35.19,1:04:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I was standing right there, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,1:04:36.65,1:04:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你胡扯什么呢
Dialogue: 4,1:04:36.65,1:04:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 5,1:04:37.65,1:04:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我没在说你 我还能说什么
Dialogue: 4,1:04:37.65,1:04:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But it didn't apply to you! What else can I say?
Dialogue: 5,1:04:42.02,1:04:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你有问题的话 就先把我拉到一边
Dialogue: 4,1:04:42.02,1:04:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You got a problem, you pull me aside.
Dialogue: 5,1:04:44.37,1:04:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你不能辱骂了我然后又说你没在说我
Dialogue: 4,1:04:44.37,1:04:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You don't insult me and then you say it didn't apply to me.
Dialogue: 5,1:04:46.69,1:04:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我要怎么把你拉到一边 我根本没看到你
Dialogue: 4,1:04:46.69,1:04:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}How am I gonna put you aside? I didn't even see you there.
Dialogue: 5,1:04:49.24,1:04:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}拜托 弗兰克 你知道我不是那样的人
Dialogue: 4,1:04:49.24,1:04:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Oh, come on, Frank, you know me better than that.
Dialogue: 5,1:04:51.86,1:04:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道我不是那样的人
Dialogue: 4,1:04:51.86,1:04:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You just know me better than that.
Dialogue: 5,1:04:53.81,1:04:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}拜托
Dialogue: 4,1:04:53.81,1:04:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Please.
Dialogue: 5,1:04:55.10,1:04:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}来吧 不会有事的
Dialogue: 4,1:04:55.10,1:04:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Come on. It's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 5,1:04:57.46,1:04:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不会有事的 来
Dialogue: 4,1:04:57.46,1:04:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's gonna be all right. Come on.
Dialogue: 5,1:04:59.34,1:05:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}来 我为什么要对你说那样的话
Dialogue: 4,1:04:59.34,1:05:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Come on, why would I ever say anything like that to you?
Dialogue: 5,1:05:01.32,1:05:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你得控制这些人
Dialogue: 4,1:05:01.32,1:05:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You gotta control these people.
Dialogue: 5,1:05:02.11,1:05:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一切都在掌控之中 别担心
Dialogue: 4,1:05:02.11,1:05:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm controlling everything. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 5,1:05:04.31,1:05:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但是当然 当然 我...你懂的
Dialogue: 4,1:05:04.31,1:05:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But certainly, certainly, I... you know.
Dialogue: 5,1:05:07.73,1:05:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}来 各位 出去
Dialogue: 4,1:05:07.73,1:05:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Come on. Okay, guys, get out of here now.
Dialogue: 5,1:05:11.30,1:05:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不知道吉米是怎么管理工会的
Dialogue: 4,1:05:11.30,1:05:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, I don't know how Jimmy is running the fucking union.
Dialogue: 5,1:05:13.86,1:05:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}鲍比和联调局总是盯着他
Dialogue: 4,1:05:13.86,1:05:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Between Bobby and the FBI up his ass all the time,
Dialogue: 5,1:05:16.48,1:05:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他都快疯了
Dialogue: 4,1:05:16.48,1:05:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he's going fucking crazy.
Dialogue: 5,1:05:18.68,1:05:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}告诉吉米 我为他的麻烦感到遗憾
Dialogue: 4,1:05:18.68,1:05:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tell Jimmy I'm sorry for his troubles.
Dialogue: 5,1:05:21.30,1:05:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}老一辈认识老肯尼迪 他们会去和他谈
Dialogue: 4,1:05:21.30,1:05:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The old-timers know the Old Man. They'll talk to him.
Dialogue: 5,1:05:23.75,1:05:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们会跟他讲清楚的
Dialogue: 4,1:05:23.75,1:05:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}At some point, they'll straighten it out for him.
Dialogue: 5,1:05:26.02,1:05:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但他无法理解
Dialogue: 4,1:05:26.02,1:05:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, but he can't understand,
Dialogue: 5,1:05:27.20,1:05:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我和你说实话 我也无法理解
Dialogue: 4,1:05:27.20,1:05:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and I gotta be honest with you, I don't understand either,
Dialogue: 5,1:05:29.68,1:05:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们最初怎么就让混蛋肯尼迪兄弟
Dialogue: 4,1:05:29.68,1:05:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}how youse could help get those two fucking Kennedy pricks
Dialogue: 5,1:05:31.83,1:05:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}当选了
Dialogue: 4,1:05:31.83,1:05:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}elected in the first place.
Dialogue: 5,1:05:32.93,1:05:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他肯定没法理解
Dialogue: 4,1:05:32.93,1:05:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It don't make no sense to him, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 5,1:05:34.88,1:05:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他不必事事都理解
Dialogue: 4,1:05:34.88,1:05:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He doesn't have to understand everything.
Dialogue: 5,1:05:37.24,1:05:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你明白我的意思 有时这样更好
Dialogue: 4,1:05:37.24,1:05:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know what I'm talking about. Sometimes it's better.
Dialogue: 5,1:05:39.52,1:05:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这个...
Dialogue: 4,1:05:39.52,1:05:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well...
Dialogue: 5,1:05:40.97,1:05:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}只是我看到他那样 我没法
Dialogue: 4,1:05:40.97,1:05:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's when I see him like that, I don't, you know,
Dialogue: 5,1:05:42.81,1:05:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我想...我感觉不好受
Dialogue: 4,1:05:42.81,1:05:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I... I'm tryin' to... I feel bad.
Dialogue: 5,1:05:44.71,1:05:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我想怎么也得帮帮他
Dialogue: 4,1:05:44.71,1:05:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I wanna help him in some way.
Dialogue: 5,1:05:47.60,1:05:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}听我说 他太情绪化了
Dialogue: 4,1:05:47.60,1:05:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Listen, he's too emotional.
Dialogue: 5,1:05:49.33,1:05:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就像是个到处折腾来
Dialogue: 4,1:05:49.33,1:05:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Like some guy who's always rushing,
Dialogue: 5,1:05:51.05,1:05:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}折腾去 却看不清大局的人
Dialogue: 4,1:05:51.05,1:05:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}rushing all over the place and they miss the big picture.
Dialogue: 5,1:05:54.63,1:05:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}比如古巴
Dialogue: 4,1:05:54.63,1:05:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Like Cuba.
Dialogue: 5,1:05:58.10,1:06:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}让我们重新开赌场
Dialogue: 4,1:05:58.10,1:06:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Getting us back into casinos.
Dialogue: 5,1:06:01.16,1:06:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}让我们重回哈瓦那
Dialogue: 4,1:06:01.16,1:06:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Getting us back into Havana.
Dialogue: 5,1:06:03.51,1:06:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}比如除掉那个混球卡斯特罗
Dialogue: 4,1:06:03.51,1:06:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Like getting rid of that fucking Castro prick.
Dialogue: 5,1:06:10.03,1:06:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}老一辈和老肯尼迪谈过了
Dialogue: 4,1:06:10.03,1:06:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The old-timers spoke to the Old Man.
Dialogue: 5,1:06:12.53,1:06:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}老肯尼迪跟他儿子约翰谈过了 告诉了他
Dialogue: 4,1:06:12.53,1:06:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The Old Man talked to his son Jack, and he told him,
Dialogue: 5,1:06:15.87,1:06:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别忘了是谁帮他上位的
Dialogue: 4,1:06:15.87,1:06:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"Don't forget who the fuck he owes."
Dialogue: 5,1:06:20.52,1:06:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他知道他欠了谁的人情
Dialogue: 4,1:06:20.52,1:06:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He knows who the fuck he owes.
Dialogue: 5,1:06:24.62,1:06:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所以我要你
Dialogue: 4,1:06:24.62,1:06:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So I want you
Dialogue: 5,1:06:26.66,1:06:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}去一个叫里程碑运输的地方
Dialogue: 4,1:06:26.66,1:06:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to go down to a place called Milestone Hauling.
Dialogue: 5,1:06:31.64,1:06:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有个叫菲尔的家伙
Dialogue: 4,1:06:31.64,1:06:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There's a guy named Phil.
Dialogue: 5,1:06:33.93,1:06:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他会给你一辆卡车
Dialogue: 4,1:06:33.93,1:06:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's gonna give you a rig.
Dialogue: 5,1:06:42.91,1:06:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你把卡车开到巴尔的摩的
Dialogue: 4,1:06:42.91,1:06:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You drive the rig down to Baltimore
Dialogue: 5,1:06:45.52,1:06:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一家水泥厂去
Dialogue: 4,1:06:45.52,1:06:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to a concrete plant.
Dialogue: 5,1:06:47.26,1:06:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在东方大道上
Dialogue: 4,1:06:47.26,1:06:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's on Eastern Avenue.
Dialogue: 5,1:06:48.66,1:06:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}整条街上只有它 不会找不到的
Dialogue: 4,1:06:48.66,1:06:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's the only one on the street. You can't miss it.
Dialogue: 5,1:06:55.81,1:06:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那里会有人等着你
Dialogue: 4,1:06:55.81,1:06:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A guy's gonna meet you there.
Dialogue: 5,1:06:57.87,1:06:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一个叫费瑞的娘炮
Dialogue: 4,1:06:57.87,1:06:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A fairy named Ferrie.
Dialogue: 5,1:07:00.85,1:07:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}向前开 然后倒车进来
Dialogue: 4,1:07:00.85,1:07:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Just pull it forward and then back it in.
Dialogue: 5,1:07:14.28,1:07:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}该干活了
Dialogue: 4,1:07:14.28,1:07:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Let's go, let's go.
Dialogue: 5,1:07:24.61,1:07:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你要在那取点东西
Dialogue: 4,1:07:24.61,1:07:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You'll pick up some things.
Dialogue: 5,1:07:27.18,1:07:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他会给你一些文件 以防你被拦下来
Dialogue: 4,1:07:27.18,1:07:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He'll give you some paperwork in case you get stopped.
Dialogue: 5,1:07:40.50,1:07:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你把卡车开到佛州
Dialogue: 4,1:07:40.50,1:07:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You drive the truck down to Florida.
Dialogue: 5,1:07:42.46,1:07:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}佛州海岸灰狗巴士车道
Dialogue: 5,1:07:43.39,1:07:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}杰克逊维尔外面的一条灰狗巴士车道上
Dialogue: 4,1:07:43.39,1:07:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A dog track outside Jacksonville.
Dialogue: 5,1:07:47.59,1:07:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}把车留在那里
Dialogue: 4,1:07:47.59,1:07:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You leave it there.
Dialogue: 5,1:07:49.71,1:07:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一个叫亨特的大耳朵家伙会在那里等你
Dialogue: 4,1:07:49.71,1:07:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A guy with big ears named Hunt will meet you there.
Dialogue: 5,1:07:54.96,1:07:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他会给你一辆车 让你开回费城
Dialogue: 4,1:07:54.96,1:07:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's gonna give you a car to drive back to Philly.
Dialogue: 5,1:08:11.72,1:08:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你看什么呢
Dialogue: 4,1:08:11.72,1:08:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 5,1:08:13.27,1:08:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你在看我的耳朵吗
Dialogue: 4,1:08:13.27,1:08:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You looking at my ears?
Dialogue: 5,1:08:16.42,1:08:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}什么
Dialogue: 4,1:08:16.42,1:08:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Sorry?
Dialogue: 5,1:08:17.58,1:08:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我的耳朵
Dialogue: 4,1:08:17.58,1:08:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}My ears.
Dialogue: 5,1:08:18.99,1:08:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你在看我的耳朵吗 -你的耳朵
Dialogue: 4,1:08:18.99,1:08:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Are you looking at my ears? - Your ears?
Dialogue: 5,1:08:22.14,1:08:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没有
Dialogue: 4,1:08:22.14,1:08:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No.
Dialogue: 5,1:08:24.40,1:08:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我做了手术 所以谁都不需要
Dialogue: 4,1:08:24.40,1:08:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I had an operation, so there's no need for anyone
Dialogue: 5,1:08:27.10,1:08:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}再看我的耳朵了
Dialogue: 4,1:08:27.10,1:08:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}looking at my ears anymore.
Dialogue: 5,1:08:28.81,1:08:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好吧 我也没看你的耳朵
Dialogue: 4,1:08:28.81,1:08:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, well, I ain't looking at your ears.
Dialogue: 5,1:08:31.03,1:08:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}行吧
Dialogue: 4,1:08:31.03,1:08:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Right.
Dialogue: 5,1:08:34.62,1:08:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你走吧 赶紧的
Dialogue: 4,1:08:34.62,1:08:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Get out of here. Go on.
Dialogue: 5,1:08:58.03,1:08:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...在猪湾空降
Dialogue: 4,1:08:58.03,1:08:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...unfolded in the Bay of Pigs.
Dialogue: 5,1:08:59.31,1:09:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}行动极不顺利
Dialogue: 4,1:08:59.31,1:09:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Nothing went as planned.
Dialogue: 5,1:09:00.87,1:09:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}伞兵们无法
Dialogue: 4,1:09:00.87,1:09:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Paratroopers were unable
Dialogue: 5,1:09:02.11,1:09:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}炸毁通往海岸地区的道路
Dialogue: 4,1:09:02.11,1:09:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to blow up roadways leading to the beach area.
Dialogue: 5,1:09:04.70,1:09:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卡斯特罗的军队奔赴前线
Dialogue: 4,1:09:04.70,1:09:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Castro raced toward the scene.
Dialogue: 5,1:09:06.61,1:09:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}地下潜伏人员本能够
Dialogue: 4,1:09:06.61,1:09:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The underground might
Dialogue: 5,1:09:07.43,1:09:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}将路炸毁 但他们一无所知
Dialogue: 4,1:09:07.43,1:09:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}have blown up the roads but it knew nothing.
Dialogue: 5,1:09:09.30,1:09:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}很快 卡斯特罗的军队就将炮火对准了滩头阵地
Dialogue: 4,1:09:09.30,1:09:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Soon, Castro had artillery firing on the beachhead.
Dialogue: 5,1:09:11.99,1:09:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他的飞机摧毁了入侵舰队
Dialogue: 4,1:09:11.99,1:09:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}His planes destroyed invading ships
Dialogue: 5,1:09:13.78,1:09:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}其中包含一个旅的兵力和重要军火
Dialogue: 4,1:09:13.78,1:09:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}carrying a brigade of men and vital ammunition.
Dialogue: 5,1:09:16.37,1:09:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}滩头阵地无法扩大
Dialogue: 4,1:09:16.37,1:09:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The beachhead could not be enlarged
Dialogue: 5,1:09:18.13,1:09:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}伞兵们很快便试图杀回
Dialogue: 4,1:09:18.13,1:09:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and paratroopers were soon trying to fight their way back
Dialogue: 5,1:09:20.54,1:09:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}岸边的小块区域
Dialogue: 4,1:09:20.54,1:09:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to the small section of the shore
Dialogue: 5,1:09:22.04,1:09:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这里的入侵者已经被压制
Dialogue: 4,1:09:22.04,1:09:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}where the invaders were pinned down.
Dialogue: 5,1:09:23.85,1:09:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}1500人被留在岸边 没有空中掩护
Dialogue: 4,1:09:23.85,1:09:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}1,500 men had been dumped on a shore without air cover
Dialogue: 5,1:09:26.76,1:09:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}也没有舰炮掩护
Dialogue: 4,1:09:26.76,1:09:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}or protective fire from ships.
Dialogue: 5,1:09:28.57,1:09:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卡斯特罗只需等到他们弹尽粮绝
Dialogue: 4,1:09:28.57,1:09:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Castro had to wait only until they ran out of ammunition
Dialogue: 5,1:09:31.14,1:09:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就可将他们一举歼灭
Dialogue: 4,1:09:31.14,1:09:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}before mopping them up.
Dialogue: 5,1:09:32.74,1:09:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}稍后 卡斯特罗在入侵区域高调面对记者
Dialogue: 4,1:09:32.74,1:09:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Later, Castro was to strut around the invasion area with newsmen,
Dialogue: 5,1:09:36.02,1:09:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}并阐述了犯下的错误
Dialogue: 4,1:09:36.02,1:09:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and expound on the errors that had been made.
Dialogue: 5,1:09:38.40,1:09:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他的资料充足
Dialogue: 4,1:09:38.40,1:09:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He had ample material.
Dialogue: 5,1:09:40.43,1:09:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}已经备受侮辱的美国
Dialogue: 4,1:09:40.43,1:09:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The United States, already humiliated,
Dialogue: 5,1:09:42.95,1:09:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}仍然受到世界大多数国家的谴责
Dialogue: 4,1:09:42.95,1:09:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}stood condemned by most of the countries of the world.
Dialogue: 5,1:09:45.96,1:09:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}见鬼
Dialogue: 4,1:09:45.96,1:09:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Shit!
Dialogue: 5,1:09:47.26,1:09:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不出我所料 他们搞完了古巴
Dialogue: 4,1:09:47.26,1:09:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Just as I predicted. They fuck up Cuba,
Dialogue: 5,1:09:50.84,1:09:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这个呆子就要冲我和工会来了
Dialogue: 4,1:09:50.84,1:09:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Boobie starts coming after me and the union.
Dialogue: 5,1:09:53.80,1:09:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他在寻求廉价的宣传手段
Dialogue: 4,1:09:53.80,1:09:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's looking for some cheap publicity.
Dialogue: 5,1:09:55.84,1:09:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就是这样 他就是这么做的
Dialogue: 4,1:09:55.84,1:09:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's all it is. That's what he's doing.
Dialogue: 5,1:09:57.61,1:09:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好吧 都会平息的 吉米
Dialogue: 4,1:09:57.61,1:09:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay. Well, it's all gonna blow over, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,1:09:59.22,1:10:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不 不会平息的 怎么平息
Dialogue: 4,1:09:59.22,1:10:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, it's not gonna blow over. How's it gonna blow over?
Dialogue: 5,1:10:02.06,1:10:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们永远都不会忘记
Dialogue: 4,1:10:02.06,1:10:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They're never gonna forget
Dialogue: 5,1:10:03.95,1:10:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我资助过尼克松 -冷静点 吉米 拜托
Dialogue: 4,1:10:03.95,1:10:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- that I gave money to Nixon! - Calm down. Jimmy, please.
Dialogue: 5,1:10:07.19,1:10:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们会处理好的
Dialogue: 4,1:10:07.19,1:10:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We're gonna handle this.
Dialogue: 5,1:10:08.38,1:10:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}老一辈的
Dialogue: 4,1:10:08.38,1:10:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Couple of the old-timers,
Dialogue: 5,1:10:09.28,1:10:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们会去找老肯尼迪
Dialogue: 4,1:10:09.28,1:10:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}they're gonna get to Old Man Kennedy now.
Dialogue: 5,1:10:11.66,1:10:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好吗 他们会去找他的 他是病了 但...
Dialogue: 4,1:10:11.66,1:10:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay? They're gonna get to him. He's a little sick, but...
Dialogue: 5,1:10:13.35,1:10:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-病了 -是 但是...
Dialogue: 4,1:10:13.35,1:10:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Sick? - Yeah. But...
Dialogue: 5,1:10:14.49,1:10:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他那是中风了 不是病了
Dialogue: 4,1:10:14.49,1:10:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He had a fucking stroke. That's not sick.
Dialogue: 5,1:10:17.17,1:10:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那是...那是将死之人了 好吧
Dialogue: 4,1:10:17.17,1:10:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's you're... you're close to the grave, is what.
Dialogue: 5,1:10:19.80,1:10:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他马上就毫无价值了
Dialogue: 4,1:10:19.80,1:10:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's turning into a fucking eggplant.
Dialogue: 5,1:10:21.75,1:10:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好吧 这也不能怪谁啊 这...
Dialogue: 4,1:10:21.75,1:10:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay. Well, you can't blame anybody for that. That's...
Dialogue: 5,1:10:23.80,1:10:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我又没打算怪谁
Dialogue: 4,1:10:23.80,1:10:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm not looking to blame anybody.
Dialogue: 5,1:10:25.28,1:10:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但真要怪谁的话 得怪肯尼迪小子们
Dialogue: 4,1:10:25.28,1:10:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But if there's any blame going around, it's the Kennedys.
Dialogue: 5,1:10:27.84,1:10:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我可以告诉你 是他的儿子害死了他
Dialogue: 4,1:10:27.84,1:10:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}His kids killed him. Let me tell you that.
Dialogue: 5,1:10:29.73,1:10:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他还没死 但他快死了 快死了
Dialogue: 4,1:10:29.73,1:10:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's not dead, but he's going. He's going.
Dialogue: 5,1:10:32.44,1:10:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们害死了他 他们能让任何人犯心脏病
Dialogue: 4,1:10:32.44,1:10:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They killed him. They'd give anybody a heart attack.
Dialogue: 5,1:10:40.48,1:10:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}久病后于1969年去世
Dialogue: 4,1:10:40.48,1:10:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}老约瑟夫·P·肯尼迪
Dialogue: 5,1:11:10.26,1:11:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你要去哪
Dialogue: 4,1:11:10.26,1:11:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 5,1:11:12.30,1:11:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我去工作
Dialogue: 4,1:11:12.30,1:11:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm going to work.
Dialogue: 5,1:11:14.52,1:11:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}回去睡觉吧
Dialogue: 4,1:11:14.52,1:11:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Go back to sleep.
Dialogue: 5,1:11:48.69,1:11:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}杜维尔
Dialogue: 5,1:12:05.09,1:12:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我能说的是 我们不会罢休
Dialogue: 4,1:12:05.09,1:12:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All I can say is that, we will not stop.
Dialogue: 5,1:12:08.11,1:12:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为我们已经坚持了五十年
Dialogue: 4,1:12:08.11,1:12:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Because we've been doing that for 50 years!
Dialogue: 5,1:12:12.03,1:12:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有什么好处
Dialogue: 4,1:12:12.03,1:12:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What good does it do?
Dialogue: 5,1:12:14.01,1:12:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}让律师去开开卡车
Dialogue: 4,1:12:14.01,1:12:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Let the lawyers... Let the lawyers drive a truck.
Dialogue: 5,1:12:16.79,1:12:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们需要纸笔 需要印台
Dialogue: 4,1:12:16.79,1:12:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They need their pencils and papers and their ink pads.
Dialogue: 5,1:12:21.46,1:12:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那完全是另一回事了
Dialogue: 4,1:12:21.46,1:12:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's... That's a whole other story.
Dialogue: 5,1:12:23.86,1:12:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我们会挺过去的
Dialogue: 4,1:12:23.86,1:12:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But we're gonna get through this.
Dialogue: 5,1:12:26.01,1:12:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们用什么法律狗屁打压我们
Dialogue: 4,1:12:26.01,1:12:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We're gonna get through this legal bullshit
Dialogue: 5,1:12:29.26,1:12:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们会挺过去的
Dialogue: 4,1:12:29.26,1:12:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and garbage they're throwing at us.
Dialogue: 5,1:12:31.46,1:12:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们会挺过去的
Dialogue: 4,1:12:31.46,1:12:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We're gonna get through it because
Dialogue: 5,1:12:31.80,1:12:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}新泽西卡车司机
Dialogue: 5,1:12:33.42,1:12:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为呆子肯尼迪想要什么 并不意味着
Dialogue: 4,1:12:33.42,1:12:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"Boobie" Kennedy wants something, that doesn't mean
Dialogue: 5,1:12:36.71,1:12:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这个纨绔子弟就能得手
Dialogue: 4,1:12:36.71,1:12:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the rich boy is gonna get it.
Dialogue: 5,1:12:38.69,1:12:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们明白我的意思吧
Dialogue: 4,1:12:38.69,1:12:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You understand what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 5,1:12:40.93,1:12:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不在乎他要什么 反正他得不到
Dialogue: 4,1:12:40.93,1:12:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't care what he wants. He's not gonna get it!
Dialogue: 5,1:12:45.49,1:12:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他得不到 因为
Dialogue: 4,1:12:45.49,1:12:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's not gonna get it because
Dialogue: 5,1:12:48.70,1:12:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们是这个国家
Dialogue: 4,1:12:48.70,1:12:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}we are the biggest and best,
Dialogue: 5,1:12:52.68,1:12:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}最庞大 最优秀
Dialogue: 4,1:12:52.68,1:12:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and most honest union
Dialogue: 5,1:12:55.14,1:12:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}最诚实的工会
Dialogue: 4,1:12:55.14,1:12:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}in this country!
Dialogue: 5,1:12:57.40,1:12:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对 没错
Dialogue: 4,1:12:57.40,1:12:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 5,1:12:58.28,1:12:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我就等着这个
Dialogue: 4,1:12:58.28,1:12:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I waited for that!
Dialogue: 5,1:13:04.75,1:13:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们知道我今天要讲的关键词是什么
Dialogue: 4,1:13:04.75,1:13:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And you know the operative word I'm talking about here.
Dialogue: 5,1:13:08.04,1:13:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-团结 -对
Dialogue: 4,1:13:08.04,1:13:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Solidarity. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 5,1:13:09.89,1:13:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}团结有效 对我们所有人都有效
Dialogue: 4,1:13:09.89,1:13:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And it works. It works for all of us.
Dialogue: 5,1:13:12.17,1:13:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对我们的朋友弗兰克·菲茨西蒙斯有效
Dialogue: 4,1:13:12.17,1:13:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And it works for our friend here, Frank Fitzsimmons!
Dialogue: 5,1:13:17.22,1:13:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这位是弗兰克·菲茨西蒙斯
Dialogue: 4,1:13:17.22,1:13:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank Fitzsimmons here,
Dialogue: 5,1:13:19.40,1:13:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我的执行副主席
Dialogue: 4,1:13:19.40,1:13:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}my executive vice president.
Dialogue: 5,1:13:21.98,1:13:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如果有谁能胜任这份工作 那就是他
Dialogue: 4,1:13:21.98,1:13:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If there's anyone that can do this job, it's this man here.
Dialogue: 5,1:13:25.34,1:13:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有他为我保驾护航
Dialogue: 4,1:13:25.34,1:13:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And with him at my back,
Dialogue: 5,1:13:27.87,1:13:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们一定会蒸蒸日上
Dialogue: 4,1:13:27.87,1:13:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}where are we gonna go but up!
Dialogue: 5,1:13:31.94,1:13:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对吗 菲茨
Dialogue: 4,1:13:31.94,1:13:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Is that right, Fitz?
Dialogue: 5,1:13:33.86,1:13:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}完全正确 吉米
Dialogue: 4,1:13:33.86,1:13:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All the way, Jimmy!
Dialogue: 5,1:13:34.87,1:13:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}霍法 霍法 霍法
Dialogue: 4,1:13:34.87,1:13:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hoffa! Hoffa! Hoffa!
Dialogue: 5,1:13:49.87,1:13:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一个工会人
Dialogue: 4,1:13:49.87,1:13:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A union man!
Dialogue: 5,1:13:54.04,1:13:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我觉得他们喜欢菲茨
Dialogue: 4,1:13:54.04,1:13:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know, I felt they liked Fitz.
Dialogue: 5,1:13:56.00,1:13:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}毋庸置疑
Dialogue: 4,1:13:56.00,1:13:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No two ways about it.
Dialogue: 5,1:13:57.06,1:13:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是 你提拔了菲茨
Dialogue: 4,1:13:57.06,1:13:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, you gave Fitz some buildup.
Dialogue: 5,1:13:59.57,1:14:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}希望他不会辜负你
Dialogue: 4,1:13:59.57,1:14:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, I hope he deserves it.
Dialogue: 5,1:14:03.14,1:14:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}怎么说 菲茨有什么不妥吗
Dialogue: 4,1:14:03.14,1:14:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Why? What's wrong with Fitz?
Dialogue: 5,1:14:06.49,1:14:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我说不好 我不想批评他
Dialogue: 4,1:14:06.49,1:14:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't know. I don't want to knock the guy,
Dialogue: 5,1:14:08.57,1:14:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我也说不好
Dialogue: 4,1:14:08.57,1:14:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but I... I don't know.
Dialogue: 5,1:14:09.75,1:14:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你不用批评他 告诉我
Dialogue: 4,1:14:09.75,1:14:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, you're not knocking him. Just tell me...
Dialogue: 5,1:14:12.20,1:14:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}告诉我你的感受
Dialogue: 4,1:14:12.20,1:14:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tell me what you feel.
Dialogue: 5,1:14:14.46,1:14:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他很忠诚 这我可以确定
Dialogue: 4,1:14:14.46,1:14:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, he's a loyal guy, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 5,1:14:17.15,1:14:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他是个好人
Dialogue: 4,1:14:17.15,1:14:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's a nice guy,
Dialogue: 5,1:14:18.54,1:14:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但他不够敏锐 不够聪明
Dialogue: 4,1:14:18.54,1:14:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but he ain't that sharp. He ain't that smart.
Dialogue: 5,1:14:20.91,1:14:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他还...
Dialogue: 4,1:14:20.91,1:14:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And he's also like a...
Dialogue: 5,1:14:22.17,1:14:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他总打高尔夫球
Dialogue: 4,1:14:22.17,1:14:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He plays a lot of fucking golf, you know.
Dialogue: 5,1:14:24.47,1:14:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他打高尔夫球
Dialogue: 4,1:14:24.47,1:14:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He plays golf?
Dialogue: 5,1:14:26.12,1:14:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那又如何 二把手就需要这样的
Dialogue: 4,1:14:26.12,1:14:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So what? That's what you want from a number two.
Dialogue: 5,1:14:28.66,1:14:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不需要太聪明的人
Dialogue: 4,1:14:28.66,1:14:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You don't want somebody too smart.
Dialogue: 5,1:14:30.78,1:14:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}需要一个好人 大家喜欢他
Dialogue: 4,1:14:30.78,1:14:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You want a nice guy. People like him, you know.
Dialogue: 5,1:14:33.58,1:14:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不傻 但是个
Dialogue: 4,1:14:33.58,1:14:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Not dumb, but somebody,
Dialogue: 5,1:14:35.65,1:14:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}可以放心让他走在身后
Dialogue: 4,1:14:35.65,1:14:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you know you can have walking behind you
Dialogue: 5,1:14:36.93,1:14:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}而不怕被捅刀子的人
Dialogue: 4,1:14:36.93,1:14:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}without getting knifed.
Dialogue: 5,1:14:39.30,1:14:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-希望你是对的 -我总是对的
Dialogue: 4,1:14:39.30,1:14:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Well, I hope you're right. - I'm always right.
Dialogue: 5,1:14:42.23,1:14:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我可以对菲茨可以放一百个心
Dialogue: 4,1:14:42.23,1:14:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I can sleep like a babe with Fitz.
Dialogue: 5,1:14:46.34,1:14:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我担心的是矮子
Dialogue: 4,1:14:46.34,1:14:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's the Little Guy I have to worry about.
Dialogue: 5,1:14:48.93,1:14:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道我说的是谁
Dialogue: 4,1:14:48.93,1:14:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 5,1:14:50.25,1:14:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-是 -是
Dialogue: 4,1:14:50.25,1:14:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,1:14:51.33,1:14:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}矮子
Dialogue: 4,1:14:51.33,1:14:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The Little Guy.
Dialogue: 5,1:14:52.54,1:14:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我担心的是他 -嗯
Dialogue: 4,1:14:52.54,1:14:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- That's my worry. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,1:14:55.44,1:14:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那个王八蛋
Dialogue: 4,1:14:55.44,1:14:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 5,1:14:58.56,1:14:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}怎么了
Dialogue: 4,1:14:58.56,1:14:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 5,1:14:59.44,1:15:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没事 没事 你是对的
Dialogue: 4,1:14:59.44,1:15:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Nothing. Nothing. You're right.
Dialogue: 5,1:15:01.76,1:15:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我是对的 是的
Dialogue: 4,1:15:01.76,1:15:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,1:15:04.05,1:15:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你不会觉得困惑吧 -完全不会
Dialogue: 4,1:15:04.05,1:15:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- You're not perplexed, are you? - Not at all. Not at all.
Dialogue: 5,1:15:06.01,1:15:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我和你说了我对菲茨的感受 至于普罗 你懂的
Dialogue: 4,1:15:06.01,1:15:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, I told you how I felt about Fitz. Pro. You know.
Dialogue: 5,1:15:09.55,1:15:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好 那就好 因为有时我觉得
Dialogue: 4,1:15:09.55,1:15:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah. Good, because sometimes I feel
Dialogue: 5,1:15:11.47,1:15:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}只有我一个人看穿了那个狗杂种
Dialogue: 4,1:15:11.47,1:15:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm the only one who sees right through that cocksucker.
Dialogue: 5,1:15:14.52,1:15:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 让我们举杯... ♪
Dialogue: 3,1:15:14.52,1:15:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ So let's raise a glass... ♪
Dialogue: 5,1:15:15.22,1:15:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-他是个坏人 -他是个坏人
Dialogue: 4,1:15:15.22,1:15:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- He's a bad guy. - He's a bad guy.
Dialogue: 5,1:15:18.47,1:15:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 敬最伟大的人 ♪
Dialogue: 4,1:15:18.47,1:15:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ To the greatest guy ♪
Dialogue: 5,1:15:22.05,1:15:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 能有他是560号地方工会之幸 ♪
Dialogue: 4,1:15:22.05,1:15:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 560 is lucky enough to ever have ♪
Dialogue: 5,1:15:28.30,1:15:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 你是我们的兄弟 ♪
Dialogue: 4,1:15:28.30,1:15:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ You're our boy ♪
Dialogue: 5,1:15:31.14,1:15:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 托尼·普罗 ♪
Dialogue: 4,1:15:31.14,1:15:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Tony Pro ♪
Dialogue: 5,1:15:34.35,1:15:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 我们都是你的兄弟 ♪
Dialogue: 4,1:15:34.35,1:15:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ We're all yours ♪
Dialogue: 5,1:15:38.90,1:15:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}矮子就是托尼·普罗文扎诺
Dialogue: 3,1:15:38.90,1:15:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The Little Guy was Tony Provenzano.
Dialogue: 5,1:15:41.89,1:15:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}人称托尼·普罗
Dialogue: 4,1:15:41.89,1:15:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They called him Tony Pro.
