Dialogue: 4,1:15:44.22,1:15:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He was a capo in a big Jersey crew
Dialogue: 5,1:15:46.72,1:15:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}并且是新泽西联合市
Dialogue: 4,1:15:46.72,1:15:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and the president of the Local 560
