Dialogue: 4,1:15:49.43,1:15:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}in Union City, New Jersey.
Dialogue: 5,1:16:02.90,1:16:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 他是最伟大的人 ♪
Dialogue: 4,1:16:02.90,1:16:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ He's the greatest guy ♪
Dialogue: 5,1:16:06.47,1:16:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 能有他是560号地方工会之幸 ♪
Dialogue: 4,1:16:06.47,1:16:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 560 is lucky enough to ever have ♪
