Dialogue: 3,1:16:10.80,1:16:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tony! Tony! Tony!
Dialogue: 5,1:16:13.72,1:16:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}托尼 托尼 托尼
Dialogue: 4,1:16:13.72,1:16:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tony! Tony! Tony!
Dialogue: 5,1:16:17.97,1:16:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}普罗和吉米 他们一起发迹
Dialogue: 4,1:16:17.97,1:16:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Pro and Jimmy, they came up together
