Dialogue: 4,1:16:21.05,1:16:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and they were close... for a while.
Dialogue: 5,1:16:23.93,1:16:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们没日没夜地工作
Dialogue: 4,1:16:23.93,1:16:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You turl, you work,
Dialogue: 5,1:16:26.85,1:16:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}而大企业的老板们
Dialogue: 4,1:16:26.85,1:16:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}while the corporation kings
Dialogue: 5,1:16:29.43,1:16:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}行业的骄子们
Dialogue: 4,1:16:29.43,1:16:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and princes of industry,
