Dialogue: 4,1:16:31.55,1:16:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}with their vast expense accounts
Dialogue: 5,1:16:33.60,1:16:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}高昂薪水 以及豪华游艇
Dialogue: 4,1:16:33.60,1:16:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and salary and luxurous yachts,
Dialogue: 5,1:16:36.26,1:16:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}却致力于毁灭我们
Dialogue: 4,1:16:36.26,1:16:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}have dedicated themselves to our destruction.
Dialogue: 5,1:16:39.76,1:16:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}打倒他们
Dialogue: 4,1:16:39.76,1:16:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Down on them!
Dialogue: 5,1:16:42.89,1:16:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我用不着谁来跟我说托尼·普罗的故事
Dialogue: 4,1:16:42.89,1:16:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I didn't need nobody to tell me about Tony Pro.
Dialogue: 5,1:16:45.89,1:16:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我还需要知道些什么 我知道的够多了
Dialogue: 4,1:16:45.89,1:16:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Oh, no. What did I need to know? I knew enough.
Dialogue: 5,1:16:55.22,1:16:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这家伙让萨利·巴格斯
Dialogue: 4,1:16:55.22,1:16:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is a man who had Sally Bugs strangle
Dialogue: 5,1:16:58.30,1:17:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}勒死了"三指"托尼·卡斯特里图
Dialogue: 4,1:16:58.30,1:17:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tony "Three Fingers" Castellito
Dialogue: 5,1:17:00.14,1:17:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就因为三指在工会里的地位越来越高
Dialogue: 4,1:17:00.14,1:17:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}just because Three Fingers was coming up big in the union.
Dialogue: 5,1:17:03.85,1:17:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那还是他自己人 那可是他自己人
Dialogue: 4,1:17:03.85,1:17:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And it was his own guy. It was his own guy.
Dialogue: 5,1:17:11.72,1:17:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}萨尔瓦多·布里古里欧 绰号"小虫萨利"
Dialogue: 4,1:17:11.72,1:17:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}1979年脸中三枪身亡
Dialogue: 5,1:17:23.80,1:17:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}托尼·普罗太担心
Dialogue: 4,1:17:23.80,1:17:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tony Pro was so fucking worried
Dialogue: 5,1:17:25.68,1:17:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这家伙会击败他
Dialogue: 4,1:17:25.68,1:17:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}that this guy was gonna beat him out
Dialogue: 5,1:17:27.22,1:17:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}以至于在让小虫萨利勒死他之后
Dialogue: 4,1:17:27.22,1:17:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}that after he had Sally Bugs strangle the guy,
Dialogue: 5,1:17:29.93,1:17:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还让萨利把他塞进了碎树机
Dialogue: 4,1:17:29.93,1:17:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he had Sally stick him in a fucking tree shredder.
Dialogue: 5,1:17:32.89,1:17:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这样就再也没有竞争了
Dialogue: 4,1:17:32.89,1:17:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That way there'd be no competition,
Dialogue: 5,1:17:34.68,1:17:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}毕竟他已经粉身碎骨了
Dialogue: 4,1:17:34.68,1:17:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}not even from the grave.
Dialogue: 5,1:17:35.89,1:17:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他已经失控了
Dialogue: 4,1:17:35.89,1:17:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's out of control.
Dialogue: 5,1:17:37.97,1:17:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}拿这种人该怎么办
Dialogue: 4,1:17:37.97,1:17:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What are you gonna do with a person like this?
Dialogue: 5,1:17:40.55,1:17:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他想从每个人那都分杯羹
Dialogue: 4,1:17:40.55,1:17:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's got a hand in everybody's pocket.
