Dialogue: 4,1:17:42.60,1:17:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Shaking down the trucking companies.
Dialogue: 5,1:17:44.22,1:17:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你能想象吗
Dialogue: 4,1:17:44.22,1:17:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Can you imagine that?
