Dialogue: 4,1:17:45.51,1:17:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Threatening people.
Dialogue: 5,1:17:46.93,1:17:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}偶尔威胁威胁人
Dialogue: 4,1:17:46.93,1:17:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, you know, threatening people once in a while,
