Dialogue: 4,1:18:10.85,1:18:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't mean that. I don't...
Dialogue: 5,1:18:12.51,1:18:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不是那个意思
Dialogue: 4,1:18:12.51,1:18:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Not... Not that.
Dialogue: 5,1:18:13.97,1:18:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我只是
Dialogue: 4,1:18:13.97,1:18:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, I'm just...
