Dialogue: 4,1:20:54.47,1:20:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What can I say? I mean, I owe it all to Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,1:20:57.60,1:21:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他把我从运肉卡车中解救出来 给了我新的开始
