Dialogue: 4,1:21:21.64,1:21:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You need anything, just get in touch with me. Okay?
Dialogue: 5,1:21:23.85,1:21:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你确定吗 -当然
Dialogue: 4,1:21:23.85,1:21:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- You sure? - Yeah.
