Dialogue: 5,1:22:12.10,1:22:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}法官阁下 法律顾问已经告诉我的委托人
Dialogue: 4,1:22:12.10,1:22:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Your Honor, my client had been advised by counsel
Dialogue: 5,1:22:14.47,1:22:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她妻子作为货运公司所有者之一
Dialogue: 4,1:22:14.47,1:22:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}that it was perfectly legal for his wife
Dialogue: 5,1:22:16.68,1:22:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是完全合法的
Dialogue: 4,1:22:16.68,1:22:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to be part owner of a trucking business.
Dialogue: 5,1:22:19.01,1:22:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}而在麦克莱伦委员会质询其合法性时
Dialogue: 5,1:22:19.01,1:22:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}美国参议院针对工人
Dialogue: 4,1:22:19.01,1:22:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Still, when the McClellan Committee challenged its legality,
Dialogue: 3,1:22:19.01,1:22:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}及管理层不当行为特别委员会
Dialogue: 5,1:22:22.14,1:22:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她第一时间退出了公司
Dialogue: 4,1:22:22.14,1:22:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}she withdrew from the company immediately.
Dialogue: 5,1:22:24.55,1:22:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}事情到此就该告一段落
Dialogue: 4,1:22:24.55,1:22:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That should be the end of the matter.
Dialogue: 5,1:22:27.35,1:22:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在十三次大陪审团调查中
Dialogue: 4,1:22:27.35,1:22:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There had been not one indictment served
Dialogue: 5,1:22:29.55,1:22:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我的委托人没有一次被判有罪
Dialogue: 4,1:22:29.55,1:22:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}against my client in 13 grand jury investigations.
Dialogue: 5,1:22:33.72,1:22:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}法官阁下 这是典型的
Dialogue: 4,1:22:33.72,1:22:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Your Honor, this is an example of
Dialogue: 5,1:22:36.60,1:22:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对我的委托人和他的家人的恶意报复
Dialogue: 4,1:22:36.60,1:22:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}a personal vendetta against my client,
Dialogue: 5,1:22:38.89,1:22:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是令人失望的司法部和司法部长罗伯特·肯尼迪
Dialogue: 4,1:22:38.89,1:22:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}against his family, by a frustrated Justice Department
Dialogue: 5,1:22:42.55,1:22:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在针对我的委托人
Dialogue: 4,1:22:42.55,1:22:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and the attorney general, Robert Kennedy.
Dialogue: 5,1:22:51.55,1:22:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他手上有枪
Dialogue: 4,1:22:51.55,1:22:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's got a gun!
Dialogue: 5,1:22:57.72,1:22:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}把枪先抢下来
Dialogue: 4,1:22:57.72,1:22:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Get that gun out of his hand!
Dialogue: 5,1:23:03.14,1:23:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别激动 小伙子
Dialogue: 4,1:23:03.14,1:23:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Easy, boy.
Dialogue: 5,1:23:09.97,1:23:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那不是真枪吧
Dialogue: 4,1:23:09.97,1:23:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That was not a real gun, was it?
Dialogue: 5,1:23:11.68,1:23:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}枪是怎么进来的
Dialogue: 4,1:23:11.68,1:23:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}How'd that gun get in?
Dialogue: 5,1:23:13.18,1:23:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}怎么进来的
Dialogue: 4,1:23:13.18,1:23:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}How'd it get in here?
Dialogue: 5,1:23:14.26,1:23:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}又不是我的错
Dialogue: 4,1:23:14.26,1:23:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It wasn't my fault!
Dialogue: 5,1:23:15.97,1:23:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我也不知道
Dialogue: 4,1:23:15.97,1:23:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't know!
Dialogue: 5,1:23:17.40,1:23:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我的查奇
Dialogue: 4,1:23:17.40,1:23:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}My Chuckie!
Dialogue: 5,1:23:18.89,1:23:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是我儿子
Dialogue: 4,1:23:18.89,1:23:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hey, it's my son!
Dialogue: 5,1:23:20.80,1:23:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是我的孩子 我把他养大的
Dialogue: 4,1:23:20.80,1:23:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's my kid. I raised this kid.
Dialogue: 5,1:23:22.93,1:23:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们看见了吗 看见他的英勇之举了吗
Dialogue: 4,1:23:22.93,1:23:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You see him? You see what he did?
Dialogue: 5,1:23:27.43,1:23:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我告诉你们
Dialogue: 4,1:23:27.43,1:23:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'll tell you this.
Dialogue: 5,1:23:28.60,1:23:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他冲我开了枪 感觉像是小弹丸似的
Dialogue: 4,1:23:28.60,1:23:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He shot at me, and it was like a pellet or something.
Dialogue: 5,1:23:31.68,1:23:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没什么感觉 就一点点冲击力
Dialogue: 4,1:23:31.68,1:23:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I didn't feel it, I just felt a little impact,
Dialogue: 5,1:23:33.80,1:23:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}甚至还比不上被BB枪打了
Dialogue: 4,1:23:33.80,1:23:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}like I was shot not even with a BB gun.
Dialogue: 5,1:23:36.10,1:23:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}比BB枪更弱
Dialogue: 4,1:23:36.10,1:23:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Something even lighter.
Dialogue: 5,1:23:37.97,1:23:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我冲向了他
Dialogue: 4,1:23:37.97,1:23:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But I charged him.
Dialogue: 5,1:23:39.22,1:23:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我和查奇都冲向了他 如果你们看见了的话
Dialogue: 4,1:23:39.22,1:23:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I charged him and so did Chuckie, if you noticed.
Dialogue: 5,1:23:41.26,1:23:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我把他教得很好
Dialogue: 4,1:23:41.26,1:23:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I taught him well.
Dialogue: 5,1:23:42.51,1:23:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}遇到持枪的永远要冲上去
Dialogue: 4,1:23:42.51,1:23:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You charge a guy, always charge a guy with a gun.
Dialogue: 5,1:23:46.39,1:23:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如果是持刀的跑就行了
Dialogue: 4,1:23:46.39,1:23:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}With a knife, you run away.
Dialogue: 5,1:23:48.10,1:23:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}遇到持刀的就跑 持枪的就冲
Dialogue: 4,1:23:48.10,1:23:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Run away from a knife. So you charge with a gun,
Dialogue: 5,1:23:51.30,1:23:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-持刀的就跑 -没错
Dialogue: 4,1:23:51.30,1:23:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- with a knife, you run. - That's right.
Dialogue: 5,1:23:53.43,1:23:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我还押韵了
Dialogue: 4,1:23:53.43,1:23:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hey! I rhymed!
Dialogue: 5,1:23:56.51,1:23:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道很难让人相信 但我收到了上头的消息
Dialogue: 4,1:23:56.51,1:23:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know it sounds crazy, but I got a message from a higher power
Dialogue: 5,1:23:57.18,1:24:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}田纳西州纳什维尔警局
Dialogue: 5,1:23:58.97,1:24:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}让我杀了吉米·霍法
Dialogue: 4,1:23:58.97,1:24:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}telling me to shoot Jimmy Hoffa.
Dialogue: 5,1:24:00.51,1:24:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}跟我来
Dialogue: 4,1:24:00.51,1:24:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Come with me.
Dialogue: 5,1:24:01.26,1:24:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}纳什维尔有很多疯子 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,1:24:01.26,1:24:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A lot of nuts in Nashville, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,1:24:03.39,1:24:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}快过来 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,1:24:03.39,1:24:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Come on down, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,1:24:05.22,1:24:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}现在我边上就有一个
Dialogue: 4,1:24:05.22,1:24:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, I got one of them with me now, you see.
Dialogue: 5,1:24:07.26,1:24:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}快过来 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,1:24:07.26,1:24:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Get down here, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,1:24:08.43,1:24:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}艾迪·帕丁 巴顿鲁日的那家伙
Dialogue: 4,1:24:08.43,1:24:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Eddie Partin, you know the guy from Baton Rouge,
Dialogue: 5,1:24:10.55,1:24:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他也在这里
Dialogue: 4,1:24:10.55,1:24:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he's here with me.
Dialogue: 5,1:24:11.60,1:24:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好 我马上过去
Dialogue: 4,1:24:11.60,1:24:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah. Yeah, I'll get right down.
Dialogue: 5,1:24:12.93,1:24:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别挡道 伙计们 让让
Dialogue: 4,1:24:12.93,1:24:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Out of my way, boys. Come on.
Dialogue: 5,1:24:16.05,1:24:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}让让
Dialogue: 4,1:24:16.05,1:24:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 5,1:24:22.35,1:24:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}布伦南先生是否先说了
Dialogue: 4,1:24:22.35,1:24:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Did Mr. Brennan first say,
Dialogue: 5,1:24:24.01,1:24:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}或者你是否记得他首先说了
Dialogue: 4,1:24:24.01,1:24:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}or do you remember him first saying
Dialogue: 5,1:24:25.68,1:24:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}像是"我要更改交易条款
Dialogue: 4,1:24:25.68,1:24:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}something about, say, "I had to change the deal.
Dialogue: 5,1:24:28.68,1:24:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我得让霍法也分一杯羹"这样的话
Dialogue: 4,1:24:28.68,1:24:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I have to cut Hoffa in on the new deal"?
Dialogue: 5,1:24:30.80,1:24:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这不就是整件事的源头吗
Dialogue: 4,1:24:30.80,1:24:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Wasn't that like the chronology of the whole thing?
Dialogue: 5,1:24:33.97,1:24:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不知道他变更了交易条款
Dialogue: 4,1:24:33.97,1:24:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't know he changed the deal,
Dialogue: 5,1:24:36.18,1:24:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我在电话这头的理解是
Dialogue: 4,1:24:36.18,1:24:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but it was my understanding over the telephone that Brennan
Dialogue: 5,1:24:39.72,1:24:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}布伦南只代表了他自己
Dialogue: 4,1:24:39.72,1:24:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}was speaking for himself.
Dialogue: 5,1:24:40.97,1:24:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她看上去很愤怒 这一看就很愤怒
Dialogue: 4,1:24:40.97,1:24:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}She's an angry woman. That's an angry woman.
Dialogue: 5,1:24:43.55,1:24:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是啊
Dialogue: 4,1:24:43.55,1:24:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Oh. Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,1:24:44.14,1:24:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我想她曾经是个老师 -没错
Dialogue: 4,1:24:44.14,1:24:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- She was a teacher I think. - Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 5,1:24:46.35,1:24:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们现在研究的是这个
Dialogue: 4,1:24:46.35,1:24:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What we're looking at is this one.
Dialogue: 5,1:24:48.01,1:24:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这个可不好搞定
Dialogue: 4,1:24:48.01,1:24:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This one is not approachable.
Dialogue: 5,1:24:49.30,1:24:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她很难攻破
Dialogue: 4,1:24:49.30,1:24:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, she'd be a tough nut to crack.
Dialogue: 5,1:24:51.01,1:24:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有很多家族财产
Dialogue: 4,1:24:51.01,1:24:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There's a lot of family money there.
Dialogue: 5,1:24:52.60,1:24:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...将会截停搜查
Dialogue: 4,1:24:52.60,1:24:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...will hail, stop, and search
Dialogue: 5,1:24:54.30,1:24:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所有驶往古巴的船只
Dialogue: 4,1:24:54.30,1:24:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}all ships bound for Cuba.
Dialogue: 5,1:24:56.14,1:24:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}若船长不停船
Dialogue: 4,1:24:56.14,1:24:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If the ships' captains do not stop,
Dialogue: 5,1:24:58.14,1:24:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们将采取武力截停
Dialogue: 4,1:24:58.14,1:24:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}force will be used to stop them.
Dialogue: 5,1:25:00.05,1:25:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如果船停下...
Dialogue: 4,1:25:00.05,1:25:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If the ships do stop...
Dialogue: 5,1:25:01.35,1:25:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我觉得可以选这个
Dialogue: 4,1:25:01.35,1:25:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}See, I think there's an in here...
Dialogue: 5,1:25:03.60,1:25:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你是否对大陪审团
Dialogue: 4,1:25:03.60,1:25:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Did you make this statement
Dialogue: 5,1:25:04.35,1:25:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}做出过如下陈述
Dialogue: 4,1:25:04.35,1:25:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to the grand jury? I'll read it for you.
Dialogue: 5,1:25:06.60,1:25:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"布伦南过来跟我说了些
Dialogue: 4,1:25:06.60,1:25:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"Brennan came to me and said words
Dialogue: 5,1:25:08.10,1:25:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}类似于他要继续的话..."
Dialogue: 4,1:25:08.10,1:25:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to the effect he's gonna go ahead..."
Dialogue: 5,1:25:09.80,1:25:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他开了家餐厅
Dialogue: 4,1:25:09.80,1:25:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's got a restaurant.
Dialogue: 5,1:25:11.10,1:25:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你查过违法行为了吗
Dialogue: 4,1:25:11.10,1:25:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Did you look into violations?
Dialogue: 5,1:25:12.35,1:25:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}查了 我更愿意选女人
Dialogue: 4,1:25:12.35,1:25:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah. I'd rather stick with the women.
Dialogue: 5,1:25:14.22,1:25:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-她们更好搞定 -吉米 谢谢
Dialogue: 4,1:25:14.22,1:25:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- They're more approachable. - Jimmy, thank you.
Dialogue: 5,1:25:15.43,1:25:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...已在古巴部署可用的中程导弹
Dialogue: 4,1:25:15.43,1:25:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...in Cuba of operational medium-range missiles.
Dialogue: 5,1:25:19.35,1:25:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他还表示如果导弹发射
Dialogue: 4,1:25:19.35,1:25:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He added that if one of the missiles is launched,
Dialogue: 5,1:25:21.85,1:25:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}可能会携带有核弹头
Dialogue: 4,1:25:21.85,1:25:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}it would probably carry a nuclear warhead.
Dialogue: 5,1:25:24.51,1:25:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}能够打击美国东南部任何地区
Dialogue: 4,1:25:24.51,1:25:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It could hit any spot in the southeast United States,
Dialogue: 5,1:25:27.51,1:25:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}以及华盛顿南部
Dialogue: 4,1:25:27.51,1:25:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}south of Washington.
Dialogue: 5,1:25:28.97,1:25:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}而我们无法拦截
Dialogue: 4,1:25:28.97,1:25:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And that we would have no way of intercepting it
Dialogue: 5,1:25:31.43,1:25:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}也无法提前预警
Dialogue: 4,1:25:31.43,1:25:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}or issuing a warning about it.
Dialogue: 5,1:25:33.60,1:25:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这位嫁给了一个叫普莱切特的州警
Dialogue: 4,1:25:33.60,1:25:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This one's married to a state trooper named Plechette.
Dialogue: 5,1:25:36.80,1:25:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不错
Dialogue: 4,1:25:36.80,1:25:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's good.
Dialogue: 5,1:25:38.72,1:25:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有门路吗
Dialogue: 4,1:25:38.72,1:25:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We know anyone?
Dialogue: 5,1:25:39.68,1:25:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有 地方工会有个当过警察的
Dialogue: 4,1:25:39.68,1:25:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, yeah, we got an ex-cop in the Local.
Dialogue: 5,1:25:43.14,1:25:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}很好
Dialogue: 4,1:25:43.14,1:25:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's good.
Dialogue: 5,1:25:44.22,1:25:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们的所有部队都提高了警戒级别
Dialogue: 4,1:25:44.22,1:25:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All our forces have been put on increased alert.
Dialogue: 5,1:26:08.68,1:26:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}过来跟我聊了几句 大意是
Dialogue: 4,1:26:08.68,1:26:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...came to me and said words to the effect
Dialogue: 5,1:26:10.51,1:26:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他打算开家公司出租卡车
Dialogue: 4,1:26:10.51,1:26:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he's gonna go ahead and set up a company to lease trucks.
Dialogue: 5,1:26:13.47,1:26:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但之后 他又打电话 他的原话是
Dialogue: 4,1:26:13.47,1:26:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But later, he called me on the phone and said quote,
Dialogue: 5,1:26:16.35,1:26:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"我要更改交易条款
Dialogue: 4,1:26:16.35,1:26:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"I gotta change the deal
Dialogue: 5,1:26:17.97,1:26:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为我要让霍法也分一杯羹"
Dialogue: 4,1:26:17.97,1:26:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}'cause I gotta cut Hoffa in on the deal."
Dialogue: 5,1:26:20.72,1:26:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是这样吗 先生
Dialogue: 4,1:26:20.72,1:26:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Is that accurate, sir?
Dialogue: 5,1:26:22.10,1:26:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是另一个可以下手的对象
Dialogue: 4,1:26:22.10,1:26:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This one's another possibility.
Dialogue: 5,1:26:24.10,1:26:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-等等 -她有过情人
Dialogue: 4,1:26:24.10,1:26:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Wait. - Well, she had a boyfriend,
Dialogue: 5,1:26:25.93,1:26:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她婚后还跟别人有一腿
Dialogue: 4,1:26:25.93,1:26:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}she's seeing somebody else while she's married.
Dialogue: 5,1:26:28.22,1:26:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所以可以用这个要挟她
Dialogue: 4,1:26:28.22,1:26:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So it could be... It could grab her,
Dialogue: 5,1:26:30.72,1:26:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-抓着她不放 -对 但是...
Dialogue: 4,1:26:30.72,1:26:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- hold on to her. - Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 5,1:26:31.68,1:26:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但这家伙
Dialogue: 4,1:26:31.68,1:26:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But this guy,
Dialogue: 5,1:26:32.80,1:26:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}开建筑公司的 做过一些违反的事情
Dialogue: 4,1:26:32.80,1:26:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the construction business. He has a couple of violations,
Dialogue: 5,1:26:36.35,1:26:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他的房子有留置权
Dialogue: 4,1:26:36.35,1:26:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}there's a lien on his house.
Dialogue: 5,1:26:38.68,1:26:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}车还没付钱
Dialogue: 4,1:26:38.68,1:26:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}His car is unpaid.
Dialogue: 5,1:26:40.85,1:26:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}很好 继续 别在领先的时候放弃
Dialogue: 4,1:26:40.85,1:26:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's good. Keep going. Don't quit while you're ahead.
Dialogue: 5,1:26:50.85,1:26:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谢谢 回见 大艾迪
Dialogue: 4,1:26:50.85,1:26:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Thank you. See you, Big Eddie.
Dialogue: 5,1:26:53.26,1:26:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你是否向上帝发誓
Dialogue: 4,1:26:53.26,1:26:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Do you swear to tell the truth,
Dialogue: 5,1:26:54.35,1:26:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你所说的全是事实
Dialogue: 4,1:26:54.35,1:26:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the whole truth and nothing but the truth,
Dialogue: 5,1:26:55.93,1:26:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-没有任何隐瞒 -我发誓
Dialogue: 4,1:26:55.93,1:26:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- so help you God? - I do.
Dialogue: 5,1:27:05.85,1:27:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}金先生 你是
Dialogue: 4,1:27:05.85,1:27:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Mr. King, you're a member of
Dialogue: 5,1:27:08.47,1:27:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}国际卡车司机工会的成员 对吗 先生
Dialogue: 4,1:27:08.47,1:27:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the International Brotherhood of Teamsters, is that correct, sir?
Dialogue: 5,1:27:11.85,1:27:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}恕我拒绝回答这个问题
Dialogue: 4,1:27:11.85,1:27:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I respectfully decline to answer that under the
Dialogue: 5,1:27:15.51,1:27:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我要行使第五修正案赋予我的权利
Dialogue: 4,1:27:15.51,1:27:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}protection afforded me by the Fifth Amendment.
Dialogue: 5,1:27:19.35,1:27:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我只是问你是不是卡车司机工会的 先生
Dialogue: 4,1:27:19.35,1:27:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I just asked if you're a Teamster, sir.
Dialogue: 5,1:27:21.10,1:27:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}恕我拒绝回答...
Dialogue: 4,1:27:21.10,1:27:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I respectfully decline to answer...
Dialogue: 5,1:27:22.47,1:27:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好 没问题 行
Dialogue: 4,1:27:22.47,1:27:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay. All right. Fine.
Dialogue: 5,1:27:24.85,1:27:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我要给你看张照片 行吗
Dialogue: 4,1:27:24.85,1:27:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm gonna show you a photograph, all right?
Dialogue: 5,1:27:26.76,1:27:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-恕我拒绝回答.... -等等
Dialogue: 4,1:27:26.76,1:27:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I respectfully decline to answer... - Wait. Wait. Wait. Wait...
Dialogue: 5,1:27:29.14,1:27:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我要行使...
Dialogue: 4,1:27:29.14,1:27:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...under the protection...
Dialogue: 5,1:27:30.39,1:27:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}田纳西州警
Dialogue: 5,1:27:30.97,1:27:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你还没看这张照片
Dialogue: 4,1:27:30.97,1:27:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You haven't even seen the photograph yet.
Dialogue: 5,1:27:32.64,1:27:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}看着这张照片 好好看看
Dialogue: 4,1:27:32.64,1:27:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Look at the photograph, wait a smidge,
Dialogue: 5,1:27:34.68,1:27:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-然后你可以... -根据我的理解
Dialogue: 4,1:27:34.68,1:27:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- and then you can... - I want to avail myself
Dialogue: 5,1:27:37.80,1:27:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我想援引宪法赋予我的权利
Dialogue: 4,1:27:37.80,1:27:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}of my right under the constitution, as I understand it.
Dialogue: 5,1:27:40.89,1:27:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}威廉·E·米勒法官阁下
Dialogue: 5,1:27:41.85,1:27:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-吉米 让他援引自己的权利 -好吧
Dialogue: 4,1:27:41.85,1:27:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Jim, let him avail himself. - Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 5,1:27:48.85,1:27:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}希尔德布兰特糖果冰淇淋店
Dialogue: 5,1:27:52.68,1:27:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是啊
Dialogue: 4,1:27:52.68,1:27:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 5,1:27:54.18,1:27:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}金是最棒的
Dialogue: 4,1:27:54.18,1:27:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That King's the best.
Dialogue: 5,1:27:56.26,1:27:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他是最棒的 他是个好人
Dialogue: 4,1:27:56.26,1:27:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's the best. He's a good guy.
Dialogue: 5,1:27:58.64,1:28:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你看到他是怎样对付那个混蛋的吗
Dialogue: 4,1:27:58.64,1:28:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You see him stand up to that jerk?
Dialogue: 5,1:28:00.18,1:28:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}看到了 看到了 我知道 他很棒
Dialogue: 4,1:28:00.18,1:28:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, yeah, I know. He was great.
Dialogue: 5,1:28:02.14,1:28:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我就喜欢他这么干
Dialogue: 4,1:28:02.14,1:28:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I love what he did.
Dialogue: 5,1:28:03.26,1:28:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们想让他开口 他们尽了全力
Dialogue: 4,1:28:03.26,1:28:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They tried to get him, they tried their best.
Dialogue: 5,1:28:06.18,1:28:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我们需要更多他这样的人 -天啊
Dialogue: 4,1:28:06.18,1:28:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- We need more like him. - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 5,1:28:09.39,1:28:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们刚刚收到更多详细信息
Dialogue: 4,1:28:09.39,1:28:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}More details just arrived.
Dialogue: 5,1:28:12.80,1:28:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这些详细信息是最新的
Dialogue: 4,1:28:12.80,1:28:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}These details are not the same as previously.
Dialogue: 5,1:28:15.51,1:28:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}肯尼迪总统在车队
Dialogue: 4,1:28:15.51,1:28:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}President Kennedy, shot today,
Dialogue: 5,1:28:17.10,1:28:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}离开达拉斯市区时遇刺
Dialogue: 4,1:28:17.10,1:28:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}just as his motorcade left downtown Dallas.
Dialogue: 5,1:28:19.89,1:28:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}肯尼迪夫人上前
Dialogue: 4,1:28:19.89,1:28:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Mrs. Kennedy jumped up
Dialogue: 5,1:28:21.10,1:28:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}抱住肯尼迪先生 大喊"不"
Dialogue: 4,1:28:21.10,1:28:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and grabbed Mr. Kennedy. She called, "Oh, no!"
Dialogue: 5,1:28:24.14,1:28:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}车队加速驶离
Dialogue: 4,1:28:24.14,1:28:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The motorcade sped on.
Dialogue: 5,1:28:26.76,1:28:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}合众社报道称肯尼迪总统受的
Dialogue: 4,1:28:26.76,1:28:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}United Press says that the wounds of President Kennedy
Dialogue: 5,1:28:29.93,1:28:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}可能是致命伤
Dialogue: 4,1:28:29.93,1:28:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}perhaps could be fatal.
Dialogue: 5,1:28:32.89,1:28:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}正在重播哥伦比亚广播公司新闻发出的简报
Dialogue: 4,1:28:32.89,1:28:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Repeating a bulletin from CBS News.
Dialogue: 5,1:28:35.93,1:28:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}肯尼迪总统在得克萨斯州的达拉斯市
Dialogue: 4,1:28:35.93,1:28:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}President Kennedy has been shot
Dialogue: 5,1:28:38.14,1:28:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}被一名嫌疑刺客开枪击中
Dialogue: 4,1:28:38.14,1:28:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}by a would-be assassin in Dallas, Texas.
Dialogue: 5,1:28:41.47,1:28:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}请继续关注哥伦比亚广播公司新闻
Dialogue: 4,1:28:41.47,1:28:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Stay tuned to CBS News for
Dialogue: 5,1:28:43.57,1:28:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}了解更多详细信息
Dialogue: 4,1:28:43.57,1:28:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}further details.
Dialogue: 5,1:28:45.05,1:28:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}什么
Dialogue: 4,1:28:45.05,1:28:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What?
Dialogue: 5,1:28:48.85,1:28:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}要做出一杯真正的咖啡
Dialogue: 4,1:28:48.85,1:28:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It takes more than an instant
Dialogue: 5,1:28:50.93,1:28:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一瞬间可不够
Dialogue: 4,1:28:50.93,1:28:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to make a real cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 5,1:28:53.22,1:28:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因此雀巢咖啡研制出了一种新产品
Dialogue: 4,1:28:53.22,1:28:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's why Nescafé has come up with a new kind of coffee.
Dialogue: 5,1:28:57.05,1:29:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这不只是一种即溶咖啡 而是新的雀巢分钟煮咖啡
Dialogue: 4,1:28:57.05,1:29:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's more than an instant. It's new Minute Brew Nescafé.
Dialogue: 5,1:29:01.76,1:29:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}人人都能做出...
Dialogue: 4,1:29:01.76,1:29:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Anybody can make a...
Dialogue: 5,1:29:02.85,1:29:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这显然是一则官方简报
Dialogue: 4,1:29:02.85,1:29:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The flash, apparently official,
Dialogue: 5,1:29:05.10,1:29:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}肯尼迪总统于中部标准时间下午一点
Dialogue: 4,1:29:05.10,1:29:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}President Kennedy died at 1:00 p.m. Central standard time,
Dialogue: 5,1:29:10.76,1:29:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}东部标准时间下午两点去世
Dialogue: 4,1:29:10.76,1:29:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}two o'clock, eastern standard time,
Dialogue: 5,1:29:13.60,1:29:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}大约38分钟前
Dialogue: 4,1:29:13.60,1:29:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}some 38 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 5,1:29:21.22,1:29:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}副总统约翰逊已离开位于达拉斯的医院
Dialogue: 4,1:29:21.22,1:29:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Vice President Johnson has left the hospital in Dallas,
Dialogue: 5,1:29:25.55,1:29:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我们不知道他将前往哪里
Dialogue: 4,1:29:25.55,1:29:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but we do not know, uh, to where he has proceeded.
Dialogue: 5,1:29:29.35,1:29:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}预计他很快将宣誓就职
Dialogue: 4,1:29:29.35,1:29:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Presumably, he will be taking the oath of office shortly
Dialogue: 5,1:29:33.14,1:29:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}成为第36届美国总统
Dialogue: 4,1:29:33.14,1:29:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and become the 36th President of the United States.
Dialogue: 5,1:29:42.93,1:29:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}国际卡车司机工会
Dialogue: 5,1:29:44.18,1:29:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}霍法先生 你会参加
Dialogue: 4,1:29:44.18,1:29:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Mr. Hoffa, will you be attending
Dialogue: 5,1:29:45.55,1:29:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}总统的葬礼吗
Dialogue: 4,1:29:45.55,1:29:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the President's funeral?
Dialogue: 5,1:29:47.22,1:29:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我没有受邀
Dialogue: 4,1:29:47.22,1:29:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I wasn't invited.
Dialogue: 5,1:29:48.30,1:29:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不一定要受邀 上百万的美国人都会参加
Dialogue: 4,1:29:48.30,1:29:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You don't have to be invited. A million Americans will be there.
Dialogue: 5,1:29:51.14,1:29:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那...
Dialogue: 4,1:29:51.14,1:29:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well...
Dialogue: 5,1:29:52.55,1:29:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我想我得查查我的日程
Dialogue: 4,1:29:52.55,1:29:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I guess I'll have to check my schedule.
Dialogue: 5,1:29:54.30,1:29:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如果你去参加并被请求发言 你会说什么
Dialogue: 4,1:29:54.30,1:29:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If you were to go and asked to speak, what would you say?
Dialogue: 5,1:29:57.22,1:29:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我会说
Dialogue: 4,1:29:57.22,1:29:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'd say, uh,
Dialogue: 5,1:29:58.97,1:30:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}鲍比·肯尼迪现在只是个普通律师了
Dialogue: 4,1:29:58.97,1:30:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Bobby Kennedy is just another lawyer now.
Dialogue: 5,1:30:06.89,1:30:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}混蛋
Dialogue: 4,1:30:06.89,1:30:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 5,1:30:08.22,1:30:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}国际卡车司机工会
Dialogue: 5,1:30:23.30,1:30:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}很好 埃里克 非常感谢
Dialogue: 4,1:30:23.30,1:30:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Good, Eric. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 5,1:30:35.01,1:30:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米说得对
Dialogue: 4,1:30:35.01,1:30:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy was right.
Dialogue: 5,1:30:38.05,1:30:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}几乎是对的
Dialogue: 4,1:30:38.05,1:30:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Almost.
Dialogue: 5,1:30:40.80,1:30:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}鲍比的刁难到此为止了
Dialogue: 4,1:30:40.80,1:30:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That was the end of it with Bobby.
Dialogue: 5,1:30:43.72,1:30:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他卸任司法部长了 事情了结了
Dialogue: 4,1:30:43.72,1:30:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So much for him being the attorney general. That was done.
Dialogue: 5,1:30:50.10,1:30:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}鲍比跟我们的宿怨结束了
Dialogue: 4,1:30:50.10,1:30:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Bobby's vendetta was over, with us.
Dialogue: 5,1:30:58.93,1:30:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}霍法先生
Dialogue: 4,1:30:58.93,1:30:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Mr. Hoffa,
Dialogue: 5,1:31:01.01,1:31:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你因损害了这个国家的灵魂
Dialogue: 4,1:31:01.01,1:31:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you stand here convicted of having tampered
Dialogue: 5,1:31:03.01,1:31:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}被判有罪
Dialogue: 4,1:31:03.01,1:31:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}with the very soul of this nation.
Dialogue: 5,1:31:05.93,1:31:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但纳什维尔那个陪审团的事情还没完
Dialogue: 4,1:31:05.93,1:31:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But there was still that jury thing in Nashville.
Dialogue: 5,1:31:09.18,1:31:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}先生 这个国家的灵魂在于
Dialogue: 4,1:31:09.18,1:31:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The soul of this nation, sir,
Dialogue: 5,1:31:11.47,1:31:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}它神圣的司法程序
Dialogue: 4,1:31:11.47,1:31:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}lies in its sacred processes of justice.
Dialogue: 5,1:31:14.72,1:31:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}正义必须得到伸张
Dialogue: 4,1:31:14.72,1:31:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Justice must be done.
Dialogue: 5,1:31:16.68,1:31:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你因为曾邪恶地企图破坏这套程序
Dialogue: 4,1:31:16.68,1:31:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And for your wicked attempts to corrupt these processes,
Dialogue: 5,1:31:21.26,1:31:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}将会受到法律的制裁
Dialogue: 4,1:31:21.26,1:31:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}justice will be done on you.
Dialogue: 5,1:31:24.35,1:31:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们终于抓到他了
Dialogue: 4,1:31:24.35,1:31:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We got him now.
Dialogue: 5,1:31:26.05,1:31:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们抓到他了
Dialogue: 4,1:31:26.05,1:31:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We got him.
Dialogue: 5,1:31:27.14,1:31:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}女士们先生们 我们做到了
Dialogue: 4,1:31:27.14,1:31:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Ladies and gentlemen, we did it!
Dialogue: 5,1:31:32.35,1:31:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}囚车不作鸣枪警示
Dialogue: 5,1:31:47.64,1:31:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但是吉米把一切都安排妥当了
Dialogue: 4,1:31:47.64,1:31:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But Jimmy, you know, he had it all set up.
Dialogue: 5,1:31:50.64,1:31:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}虽然表面看起来是
Dialogue: 4,1:31:50.64,1:31:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Although you knew it was supposed to look like Fitz
Dialogue: 5,1:31:53.85,1:31:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}菲茨在管事
Dialogue: 4,1:31:53.85,1:31:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}was the one in charge.
Dialogue: 5,1:31:55.76,1:31:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但他通过比尔·巴法利诺和
Dialogue: 4,1:31:55.76,1:31:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He gave Fitz his orders through
Dialogue: 5,1:31:57.30,1:32:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}詹姆斯·R·霍法
Dialogue: 5,1:31:57.37,1:31:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}艾伦·多夫曼给菲茨下指令
Dialogue: 4,1:31:57.37,1:31:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Bill Bufalino and Allen Dorfman,
Dialogue: 5,1:31:59.10,1:32:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们还替吉米放贷
Dialogue: 4,1:31:59.10,1:32:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and they ran Jimmy's loans.
Dialogue: 5,1:32:00.89,1:32:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在里面待得还好吗 一切都...
Dialogue: 4,1:32:00.89,1:32:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But things are good in here? Everything is...
Dialogue: 5,1:32:03.06,1:32:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一切都糟透了
Dialogue: 4,1:32:03.06,1:32:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Everything's terrible.
Dialogue: 5,1:32:03.89,1:32:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}夜不能寐 因为担心
Dialogue: 4,1:32:03.89,1:32:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You don't sleep at night 'cause you're afraid
Dialogue: 5,1:32:05.80,1:32:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有人会拿刀捅你
Dialogue: 4,1:32:05.80,1:32:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}someone's gonna knife you.
Dialogue: 5,1:32:07.89,1:32:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但你看上去不错 还不错
Dialogue: 4,1:32:07.89,1:32:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}'Cause you look okay. You look okay.
Dialogue: 5,1:32:09.30,1:32:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}菲茨在哪 他迟到了
Dialogue: 4,1:32:09.30,1:32:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Where's Fitz? He's late.
Dialogue: 5,1:32:12.22,1:32:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们本来要在正门等他的 他...
Dialogue: 4,1:32:12.22,1:32:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah. Well, we were gonna meet him in the front. He...
Dialogue: 5,1:32:14.80,1:32:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在正门等他吗
Dialogue: 4,1:32:14.80,1:32:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Meet him in the front?
Dialogue: 5,1:32:15.93,1:32:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他来了 他来了
Dialogue: 4,1:32:15.93,1:32:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Here he is, here he is.
Dialogue: 5,1:32:16.89,1:32:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你到底去哪了 你来这干什么
Dialogue: 4,1:32:16.89,1:32:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Where the hell have you been? What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 5,1:32:19.47,1:32:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你到底来干什么 菲茨
Dialogue: 4,1:32:19.47,1:32:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Why did you even come at all, Fitz?
Dialogue: 5,1:32:21.76,1:32:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道自己迟到了吗
Dialogue: 4,1:32:21.76,1:32:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know, are you aware you're late?
Dialogue: 5,1:32:23.01,1:32:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我就想知道这个 你知道自己迟到了吗
Dialogue: 4,1:32:23.01,1:32:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's all I want to know. Do you know you're late?
Dialogue: 5,1:32:24.60,1:32:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对不起我迟到了 吉米
Dialogue: 4,1:32:24.60,1:32:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm sorry I'm late, Jimmy,
Dialogue: 5,1:32:25.35,1:32:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我们有很多事要做
Dialogue: 4,1:32:25.35,1:32:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but we got a lot going on.
Dialogue: 5,1:32:26.97,1:32:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们有很多事要做
Dialogue: 4,1:32:26.97,1:32:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We got a lot going on.
Dialogue: 5,1:32:27.93,1:32:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不想听这种话 我想听点具体的
Dialogue: 4,1:32:27.93,1:32:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't wanna hear that. I wanna hear something concrete,
Dialogue: 5,1:32:30.64,1:32:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我想听你直入正题
Dialogue: 4,1:32:30.64,1:32:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I wanna hear something straight on.
Dialogue: 5,1:32:33.26,1:32:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我只想请你耐心一点
Dialogue: 4,1:32:33.26,1:32:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm just gonna ask you to be a little more patient.
Dialogue: 5,1:32:35.47,1:32:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我觉得我们会...
Dialogue: 4,1:32:35.47,1:32:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I think we're gonna have...
Dialogue: 5,1:32:36.26,1:32:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我在坐牢 不会太耐心
Dialogue: 4,1:32:36.26,1:32:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm inside here. I'm not gonna be too patient.
Dialogue: 5,1:32:38.93,1:32:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}尽管吉米对菲茨很不爽
Dialogue: 4,1:32:38.93,1:32:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}As much as Jimmy was getting pissed off at Fitz,
Dialogue: 5,1:32:42.18,1:32:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}其他人还是喜欢他 因为
Dialogue: 4,1:32:42.18,1:32:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}everybody else liked him because
Dialogue: 5,1:32:43.80,1:32:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们可以从他那里得到想要的一切
Dialogue: 4,1:32:43.80,1:32:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}they could get anything out of him that they wanted.
Dialogue: 5,1:32:46.18,1:32:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是他们不能从吉米那得到的
Dialogue: 4,1:32:46.18,1:32:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They couldn't do that with Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,1:32:49.51,1:32:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如果进了监狱 难免会发生这种事情
Dialogue: 4,1:32:49.51,1:32:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's what happens when you go away to college.
Dialogue: 5,1:32:52.60,1:32:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}打得怎么样
Dialogue: 4,1:32:52.60,1:32:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}How's that?
Dialogue: 5,1:32:55.72,1:32:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米生菲茨的气
Dialogue: 4,1:32:55.72,1:32:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy's pissed off with Fitz.
Dialogue: 5,1:32:58.30,1:33:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}菲茨还不错 我们喜欢他
Dialogue: 4,1:32:58.30,1:33:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Fitz is okay. We like Fitz.
Dialogue: 5,1:33:01.30,1:33:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我告诉你问题出在哪
Dialogue: 4,1:33:01.30,1:33:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'll tell you what the problem is.
Dialogue: 5,1:33:03.01,1:33:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米让那个难缠的多夫曼
Dialogue: 4,1:33:03.01,1:33:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy's got that ballbusting Dorfman
Dialogue: 5,1:33:05.02,1:33:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}拖延菲茨已经同意的贷款
Dialogue: 4,1:33:05.02,1:33:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}holding up loans that Fitz already okayed.
Dialogue: 5,1:33:09.85,1:33:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我讨厌那个多夫曼
Dialogue: 4,1:33:09.85,1:33:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I hate that Dorfman.
Dialogue: 5,1:33:10.93,1:33:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他是个令人头疼的犹太人
Dialogue: 4,1:33:10.93,1:33:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's such a pain-in-the-ass fucking Jew.
Dialogue: 5,1:33:17.01,1:33:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你想让我怎么办
Dialogue: 4,1:33:17.01,1:33:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 5,1:33:19.01,1:33:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不 先别那样 先别那样
Dialogue: 4,1:33:19.01,1:33:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, not that. Not that.
Dialogue: 5,1:33:22.68,1:33:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你要做的就是
Dialogue: 4,1:33:22.68,1:33:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What you gotta do is, you know,
Dialogue: 5,1:33:23.93,1:33:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}警告一下多夫曼
Dialogue: 4,1:33:23.93,1:33:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}put a firecracker up Dorfman's ass.
Dialogue: 5,1:33:27.10,1:33:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}菲茨会明白的
Dialogue: 4,1:33:27.10,1:33:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Fitz'll get the message.
Dialogue: 5,1:33:29.47,1:33:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他会明白的
Dialogue: 4,1:33:29.47,1:33:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He'll get the message.
Dialogue: 5,1:33:31.26,1:33:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你不能对菲茨下手 因为如果...
Dialogue: 4,1:33:31.26,1:33:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, you can't do it to Fitz because if...
Dialogue: 5,1:33:34.01,1:33:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如果你对那个酒鬼下手
Dialogue: 4,1:33:34.01,1:33:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}if you do it to that lush,
Dialogue: 5,1:33:35.01,1:33:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他会直接去找联调局 搞砸一切
Dialogue: 4,1:33:35.01,1:33:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he'll run right to the feds and screw up everything.
Dialogue: 5,1:33:38.18,1:33:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但多夫曼
Dialogue: 4,1:33:38.18,1:33:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But Dorfman...
Dialogue: 5,1:33:39.93,1:33:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你要对多夫曼下手
Dialogue: 4,1:33:39.93,1:33:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You gotta do it to Dorfman.
