Dialogue: 5,1:34:19.85,1:34:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}菲茨 菲茨明白我们的意思了
Dialogue: 4,1:34:19.85,1:34:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Fitz... Fitz got the message.
Dialogue: 5,1:34:25.39,1:34:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}从此以后 任何人想从养老基金里
Dialogue: 4,1:34:25.39,1:34:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}After that, anybody who wanted anything
Dialogue: 5,1:34:27.47,1:34:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}捞一笔 都能得偿所愿
Dialogue: 4,1:34:27.47,1:34:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}from the pension fund, they got it.
Dialogue: 5,1:34:34.39,1:34:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}老是翻到这张牌
Dialogue: 4,1:34:34.39,1:34:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The thing keeps comin' around. Keeps comin' around.
Dialogue: 5,1:34:36.77,1:34:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}怎么回事
Dialogue: 4,1:34:36.77,1:34:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What's goin' on?
Dialogue: 5,1:34:38.68,1:34:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-搞什么 -这家伙是谁
Dialogue: 4,1:34:38.68,1:34:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Fuck is this? - Who's this guy?
Dialogue: 5,1:34:40.47,1:34:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谁让你进来的
Dialogue: 4,1:34:40.47,1:34:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Who let you in?
Dialogue: 5,1:34:43.68,1:34:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}普罗文扎诺先生
Dialogue: 4,1:34:43.68,1:34:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Mr. Provenzano.
Dialogue: 5,1:34:45.23,1:34:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我是联调局的迪格雷奥里奥探员
Dialogue: 4,1:34:45.23,1:34:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm Agent DiGregorio of the FBI.
Dialogue: 5,1:34:46.51,1:34:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我有你的逮捕令 请站起来
Dialogue: 4,1:34:46.51,1:34:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I have a warrant for your arrest. Please stand.
Dialogue: 5,1:34:48.31,1:34:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我能把手里的牌打完吗
Dialogue: 4,1:34:48.31,1:34:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Can I finish my hand?
Dialogue: 5,1:34:49.32,1:34:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不行 先生 请站起来
Dialogue: 4,1:34:49.32,1:34:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, sir. Please stand.
Dialogue: 5,1:34:50.64,1:34:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}反正我手气烂透了
Dialogue: 4,1:34:50.64,1:34:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I had a bad fucking hand anyway.
Dialogue: 5,1:34:51.85,1:34:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}安东尼·加卡罗内 人称"托尼·杰克"
Dialogue: 3,1:34:51.85,1:34:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}人缘很好 于2001年2月23日寿终正寝
Dialogue: 5,1:34:52.72,1:34:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}牌才打到一半
Dialogue: 4,1:34:52.72,1:34:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Middle of the game.
Dialogue: 5,1:34:54.39,1:34:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}让他一起打吧
Dialogue: 4,1:34:54.39,1:34:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Join the club. Deal him in.
Dialogue: 5,1:34:56.18,1:34:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}请伸另一只手
Dialogue: 4,1:34:56.18,1:34:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Other arm, please.
Dialogue: 5,1:34:57.10,1:34:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我能拿我的包吗 -不行 先生
Dialogue: 4,1:34:57.10,1:34:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Can I get my bags? - No, sir.
Dialogue: 5,1:34:58.93,1:35:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我口袋里什么都没有 我穿着短裤呢
Dialogue: 4,1:34:58.93,1:35:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I got nothing in my pocket. I got fucking shorts on here.
Dialogue: 5,1:35:01.68,1:35:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}看看那边那只企鹅
Dialogue: 4,1:35:01.68,1:35:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Look at this penguin over there, huh?
Dialogue: 5,1:35:04.10,1:35:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}托尼 你能帮我拿下包吗
Dialogue: 4,1:35:04.10,1:35:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hey, Tony, will you get my bags?
Dialogue: 5,1:35:05.39,1:35:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}行 我会帮你拿包
Dialogue: 4,1:35:05.39,1:35:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, I'll get your bags.
Dialogue: 5,1:35:06.89,1:35:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这就像在看电视
Dialogue: 4,1:35:06.89,1:35:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is like watchin' TV.
Dialogue: 5,1:35:10.01,1:35:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}普罗因为敲诈被抓 判了七年
Dialogue: 4,1:35:10.01,1:35:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They got Pro for extortion and gave him seven years.
Dialogue: 5,1:35:13.80,1:35:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}把他送去了路易斯堡监狱
Dialogue: 4,1:35:13.80,1:35:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And they sent him to Lewisburg prison.
Dialogue: 5,1:35:16.55,1:35:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他和谁落在一起了
Dialogue: 4,1:35:16.55,1:35:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So who does he end up with?
Dialogue: 5,1:35:18.68,1:35:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米
Dialogue: 4,1:35:18.68,1:35:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,1:35:28.68,1:35:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}瞧瞧这个
Dialogue: 4,1:35:28.68,1:35:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Look at that.
Dialogue: 5,1:35:30.22,1:35:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}简直是艺术品
Dialogue: 4,1:35:30.22,1:35:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A work of art.
Dialogue: 5,1:35:32.35,1:35:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谢谢 皮特
Dialogue: 4,1:35:32.35,1:35:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Thank you, Pete.
Dialogue: 5,1:35:41.76,1:35:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我要跟你谈谈养老金的问题
Dialogue: 4,1:35:41.76,1:35:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I gotta talk to you about a problem I got with my pension.
Dialogue: 5,1:35:48.01,1:35:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道
Dialogue: 4,1:35:48.01,1:35:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know.
Dialogue: 5,1:35:50.22,1:35:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道
Dialogue: 4,1:35:50.22,1:35:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know?
Dialogue: 5,1:35:52.30,1:35:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道什么
Dialogue: 4,1:35:52.30,1:35:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What do you know?
Dialogue: 5,1:35:54.51,1:35:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道
Dialogue: 4,1:35:54.51,1:35:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know
Dialogue: 5,1:35:56.01,1:35:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你有120万
Dialogue: 4,1:35:56.01,1:35:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you got a million two
Dialogue: 5,1:35:57.72,1:36:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}而且出了问题
Dialogue: 4,1:35:57.72,1:36:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and, uh, there's a problem with it.
Dialogue: 5,1:36:02.39,1:36:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那你会帮我查查吗
Dialogue: 4,1:36:02.39,1:36:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So you'll look into it for me?
Dialogue: 5,1:36:04.76,1:36:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我要怎么查 我能查什么
Dialogue: 4,1:36:04.76,1:36:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}How am I going to look into it? What am I gonna look into?
Dialogue: 5,1:36:07.89,1:36:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就这么回事
Dialogue: 4,1:36:07.89,1:36:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It is what it is.
Dialogue: 5,1:36:09.85,1:36:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}怎么回事
Dialogue: 4,1:36:09.85,1:36:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, what is it?
Dialogue: 5,1:36:11.55,1:36:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这笔钱没了
Dialogue: 4,1:36:11.55,1:36:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You lost it.
Dialogue: 5,1:36:13.30,1:36:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你进来时它就被没收了 就是这样
Dialogue: 4,1:36:13.30,1:36:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You forfeited it when you came in here. That's it.
Dialogue: 5,1:36:18.39,1:36:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所以你的也被没收了吗
Dialogue: 4,1:36:18.39,1:36:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So is yours forfeited too?
Dialogue: 5,1:36:20.30,1:36:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没有
Dialogue: 4,1:36:20.30,1:36:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No.
Dialogue: 5,1:36:23.72,1:36:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们先理清楚 你的钱还在
Dialogue: 4,1:36:23.72,1:36:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Ok, let me get this straight. So yours is still there,
Dialogue: 5,1:36:27.35,1:36:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你的150万什么的
Dialogue: 4,1:36:27.35,1:36:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}your million five, whatever it is,
Dialogue: 5,1:36:29.51,1:36:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我的钱没了
Dialogue: 4,1:36:29.51,1:36:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but mine's gone?
Dialogue: 5,1:36:31.85,1:36:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对 我的钱还在
Dialogue: 4,1:36:31.85,1:36:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah. Mine's still there.
Dialogue: 5,1:36:36.89,1:36:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我俩现在都在牢里
Dialogue: 4,1:36:36.89,1:36:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But we're both sitting here.
Dialogue: 5,1:36:38.64,1:36:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我俩都在牢里 没错
Dialogue: 4,1:36:38.64,1:36:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We're both sitting here. That's right.
Dialogue: 5,1:36:40.97,1:36:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不过我俩坐牢的原因不同
Dialogue: 4,1:36:40.97,1:36:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Only we're sitting here for different things.
Dialogue: 5,1:36:44.18,1:36:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你是因为敲诈
Dialogue: 4,1:36:44.18,1:36:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're sitting here for extortion.
Dialogue: 5,1:36:46.51,1:36:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我是因为欺诈
Dialogue: 4,1:36:46.51,1:36:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm sitting here for fraud.
Dialogue: 5,1:36:49.22,1:36:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-那又怎样 -怎样 是有差别的
Dialogue: 4,1:36:49.22,1:36:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- So? - So? So there's a difference.
Dialogue: 5,1:36:52.55,1:36:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}什么差别
Dialogue: 4,1:36:52.55,1:36:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What's the difference?
Dialogue: 5,1:36:56.85,1:36:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我没威胁任何人 但你威胁了
Dialogue: 4,1:36:56.85,1:36:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I didn't threaten anybody, you did.
Dialogue: 5,1:36:59.72,1:37:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那又怎样 根本说不通
Dialogue: 4,1:36:59.72,1:37:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So what? That makes no sense.
Dialogue: 5,1:37:01.47,1:37:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}当然说得通
Dialogue: 4,1:37:01.47,1:37:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What do you mean? It does.
Dialogue: 5,1:37:02.68,1:37:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不 我不想跟你辩论
Dialogue: 4,1:37:02.68,1:37:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, it doesn't. I don't want a debate.
Dialogue: 5,1:37:04.55,1:37:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-想想看 -我在想了 吉米
Dialogue: 4,1:37:04.55,1:37:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Think about it. - I'm thinking about it, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,1:37:07.01,1:37:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别唬我 吉米
Dialogue: 4,1:37:07.01,1:37:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, don't fuck with me, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,1:37:08.55,1:37:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}做点什么
Dialogue: 4,1:37:08.55,1:37:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Just do something about it.
Dialogue: 5,1:37:14.97,1:37:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"做点什么"是什么意思
Dialogue: 4,1:37:14.97,1:37:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What do you mean, "do something about it"?
Dialogue: 5,1:37:16.85,1:37:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我能做什么
Dialogue: 4,1:37:16.85,1:37:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 5,1:37:17.72,1:37:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}拜托 你总有办法
Dialogue: 4,1:37:17.72,1:37:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Come on, there's always something you can do.
Dialogue: 5,1:37:19.26,1:37:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不 联邦法律我没办法
Dialogue: 4,1:37:19.26,1:37:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No. It's federal law.
Dialogue: 5,1:37:20.93,1:37:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我不管 -你不管
Dialogue: 4,1:37:20.93,1:37:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I don't care. - You don't care?
Dialogue: 5,1:37:22.47,1:37:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你还是能做点什么
Dialogue: 4,1:37:22.47,1:37:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, you can still do something about it.
Dialogue: 5,1:37:25.05,1:37:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我无能为力 我能做什么
Dialogue: 4,1:37:25.05,1:37:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There's nothing I can do. What can I do?
Dialogue: 5,1:37:26.89,1:37:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}把我的钱拿回来
Dialogue: 4,1:37:26.89,1:37:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You can get my fucking money.
Dialogue: 5,1:37:28.26,1:37:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}怎么拿
Dialogue: 4,1:37:28.26,1:37:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}How?
Dialogue: 5,1:37:28.97,1:37:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-找个办法 -什么办法
Dialogue: 4,1:37:28.97,1:37:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Some other way. - What way?
Dialogue: 5,1:37:30.35,1:37:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你怎么拿回你的钱 你就怎么帮我
Dialogue: 4,1:37:30.35,1:37:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The same way you got your money.
Dialogue: 5,1:37:31.89,1:37:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}小点声
Dialogue: 4,1:37:31.89,1:37:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Lower your fucking voice.
