Dialogue: 5,1:41:50.03,1:41:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所有人都是我的讽刺对象
Dialogue: 4,1:41:50.03,1:41:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I work everyone.
Dialogue: 5,1:41:51.26,1:41:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我开黑人玩笑 我开犹太人玩笑
Dialogue: 4,1:41:51.26,1:41:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I make fun of blacks, I make fun of Jews.
Dialogue: 5,1:41:53.51,1:41:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉普赛人 意大利人
Dialogue: 4,1:41:53.51,1:41:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I work Gypsies, I work Italians.
Dialogue: 5,1:41:55.87,1:41:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那些意大利人可不行
Dialogue: 4,1:41:55.87,1:41:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, not those Italians.
Dialogue: 5,1:41:58.28,1:41:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不不不
Dialogue: 4,1:41:58.28,1:41:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 5,1:41:59.80,1:42:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没事的 乔伊 我有钱 别开枪
Dialogue: 4,1:41:59.80,1:42:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's okay, Joey. I got the money. Don't shoot.
Dialogue: 5,1:42:04.03,1:42:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们今天告诉我
Dialogue: 4,1:42:04.03,1:42:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I was told today,
Dialogue: 5,1:42:05.37,1:42:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"说话千万小心"
Dialogue: 4,1:42:05.37,1:42:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"Be very careful about what you say."
Dialogue: 5,1:42:07.85,1:42:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但抛开那些玩笑 生日快乐 乔伊
Dialogue: 4,1:42:07.85,1:42:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But, uh, all kidding aside, happy birthday, Joey.
Dialogue: 5,1:42:22.28,1:42:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素
Dialogue: 4,1:42:22.28,1:42:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Russ.
Dialogue: 5,1:42:26.26,1:42:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你戴那个干什么
Dialogue: 4,1:42:26.26,1:42:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What are you doing with that?
Dialogue: 5,1:42:28.58,1:42:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}意大利裔美国人人权联盟
Dialogue: 5,1:42:30.26,1:42:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你真相信那个狗屁联盟
Dialogue: 4,1:42:30.26,1:42:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You really believe in that bullshit league?
Dialogue: 5,1:42:33.76,1:42:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不是因为那个
Dialogue: 4,1:42:33.76,1:42:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, it's not that.
Dialogue: 5,1:42:35.66,1:42:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是意大利裔
Dialogue: 4,1:42:35.66,1:42:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's Italian.
Dialogue: 5,1:42:36.62,1:42:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}乔伊 乔伊
Dialogue: 4,1:42:36.62,1:42:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Joey. Joey.
Dialogue: 5,1:42:37.54,1:42:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我说什么了 -不不不
Dialogue: 4,1:42:37.54,1:42:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- What did I say? - Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 5,1:42:38.98,1:42:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我说什么了 -乔伊 乔伊
Dialogue: 4,1:42:38.98,1:42:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- What did I say? - Joey, Joey. Joey. Joey.
Dialogue: 5,1:42:41.62,1:42:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}听我说
Dialogue: 4,1:42:41.62,1:42:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Now, listen.
Dialogue: 5,1:42:43.82,1:42:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你不能在这儿说那种话 明白吗 不行
Dialogue: 4,1:42:43.82,1:42:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You can't say that stuff like that here. Okay? You can't do that.
Dialogue: 5,1:42:46.32,1:42:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}为什么 只有瑞克斯能开玩笑吗
Dialogue: 4,1:42:46.32,1:42:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Why not? Rickles is the only one who can make jokes?
Dialogue: 5,1:42:48.27,1:42:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他是老大
Dialogue: 4,1:42:48.27,1:42:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The man's a boss.
Dialogue: 5,1:42:49.47,1:42:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我也是老大 他是老大
Dialogue: 4,1:42:49.47,1:42:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So I'm a boss. He's a boss.
Dialogue: 5,1:42:51.03,1:42:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那我们应该是兄弟 对吧
Dialogue: 4,1:42:51.03,1:42:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We're all supposed to be brothers, right?
Dialogue: 5,1:42:52.13,1:42:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道你是老大
Dialogue: 4,1:42:52.13,1:42:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know you're a boss.
Dialogue: 5,1:42:53.01,1:42:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道 但我们现在不想吵 对吧
Dialogue: 4,1:42:53.01,1:42:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know, but we don't wanna have a beef now. Okay?
Dialogue: 5,1:42:54.92,1:42:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我们是兄弟 对吧 -没错 兄弟
Dialogue: 4,1:42:54.92,1:42:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- We're brothers, right? - That's right, brothers.
Dialogue: 5,1:42:56.96,1:42:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我们是兄弟吧 -你们是兄弟
Dialogue: 4,1:42:56.96,1:42:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- We're brothers? - You're brothers.
Dialogue: 5,1:42:58.82,1:43:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我们是兄弟 -我不跟你争
Dialogue: 4,1:42:58.82,1:43:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- We're brothers. - I'm not arguing with you.
Dialogue: 5,1:43:00.42,1:43:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}大家都是兄弟
Dialogue: 4,1:43:00.42,1:43:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Everybody's a brother.
Dialogue: 5,1:43:01.43,1:43:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没错 你是兄弟 你是他兄弟
Dialogue: 4,1:43:01.43,1:43:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's right, you're a brother. You're his brother.
Dialogue: 5,1:43:03.47,1:43:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不是 但你们是
Dialogue: 4,1:43:03.47,1:43:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm not, but you guys are.
Dialogue: 5,1:43:04.75,1:43:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所以如果你能给点面子就好了
Dialogue: 4,1:43:04.75,1:43:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So that's why I would like it if you just...
Dialogue: 5,1:43:07.08,1:43:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-好 -好吗
Dialogue: 4,1:43:07.08,1:43:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- All right. - Okay?
Dialogue: 5,1:43:08.00,1:43:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我们是兄弟 -对
Dialogue: 4,1:43:08.00,1:43:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- We're brothers? - You're brothers.
Dialogue: 5,1:43:09.21,1:43:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对 今天我过生日
Dialogue: 4,1:43:09.21,1:43:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah. It's my birthday.
Dialogue: 5,1:43:11.44,1:43:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}生日快乐
Dialogue: 4,1:43:11.44,1:43:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 5,1:43:12.28,1:43:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}生日快乐
Dialogue: 4,1:43:12.28,1:43:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 5,1:43:16.06,1:43:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}赶紧滚吧
Dialogue: 4,1:43:16.06,1:43:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Get the fuck out of here.
Dialogue: 5,1:43:39.61,1:43:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}要做这种活儿
Dialogue: 4,1:43:39.61,1:43:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Now, for something like this,
Dialogue: 5,1:43:41.47,1:43:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你需要两把枪
Dialogue: 4,1:43:41.47,1:43:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you're gonna need two guns.
Dialogue: 5,1:43:43.24,1:43:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一把是用的 一把是后备
Dialogue: 4,1:43:43.24,1:43:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The one you're gonna use and a backup.
Dialogue: 5,1:43:46.93,1:43:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}要比点22口径的更有威慑力
Dialogue: 4,1:43:46.93,1:43:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You want something with more stopping power than a .22.
Dialogue: 5,1:43:55.82,1:43:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}绝对不用消音器
Dialogue: 4,1:43:55.82,1:43:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You definitely don't want a silencer.
Dialogue: 5,1:43:57.89,1:44:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}要弄出很大响声 吓得目击者逃走
Dialogue: 4,1:43:57.89,1:44:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You want to make a lot of noise to make the witnesses run away
Dialogue: 5,1:44:00.79,1:44:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这样他们就不会看你了
Dialogue: 4,1:44:00.79,1:44:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}so they ain't gonna be looking at you.
Dialogue: 5,1:44:05.60,1:44:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但点45口径的响声可不行
Dialogue: 4,1:44:05.60,1:44:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But not the noise a .45 makes
Dialogue: 5,1:44:07.61,1:44:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那样动静就太大了
Dialogue: 4,1:44:07.61,1:44:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}'cause that makes too much noise,
Dialogue: 5,1:44:09.16,1:44:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}几个街区外的巡逻警车都能听到
Dialogue: 4,1:44:09.16,1:44:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and a patrol car can hear it a few blocks away at least.
Dialogue: 5,1:44:15.93,1:44:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}警察管点32口径的叫女士枪 因为它比较好控制
Dialogue: 4,1:44:15.93,1:44:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The cops call a .32 a woman's gun because it's easier to handle
Dialogue: 5,1:44:19.77,1:44:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没有点38口径的破坏力
Dialogue: 4,1:44:19.77,1:44:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and don't do the damage a .38 does,
Dialogue: 5,1:44:21.84,1:44:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但是足够了
Dialogue: 4,1:44:21.84,1:44:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but, you know, it does enough.
Dialogue: 5,1:44:29.98,1:44:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}安贝特蛤蜊餐厅
Dialogue: 5,1:44:31.78,1:44:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}到时候是深夜 爱达荷州的游客不会在那儿
Dialogue: 4,1:44:31.78,1:44:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It would be late, so the tourists from Idaho
Dialogue: 5,1:44:36.14,1:44:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们已经睡觉了
Dialogue: 4,1:44:36.14,1:44:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}wouldn't be there. They'd be in bed.
Dialogue: 5,1:44:38.23,1:44:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他在小意大利区
Dialogue: 4,1:44:38.23,1:44:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And him being down there in Little Italy,
Dialogue: 5,1:44:40.45,1:44:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}也许会更自在 更放松
Dialogue: 4,1:44:40.45,1:44:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}maybe he'd be more comfortable, more relaxed.
Dialogue: 5,1:44:44.73,1:44:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那天是他生日 所以他会带着老婆孩子一起去
Dialogue: 4,1:44:44.73,1:44:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It was his birthday so he'd be there with his wife
Dialogue: 5,1:44:47.79,1:44:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这样正好
Dialogue: 4,1:44:47.79,1:44:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and his kid which, in this case,
Dialogue: 5,1:44:50.19,1:44:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为这正是我们的目的
Dialogue: 4,1:44:50.19,1:44:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}that's good because that's the point.
Dialogue: 5,1:44:52.51,1:44:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}应该让他们亲眼见识
Dialogue: 4,1:44:52.51,1:44:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They should have to see what it's like.
Dialogue: 5,1:44:56.38,1:44:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他已经喝了不少酒
Dialogue: 4,1:44:56.38,1:44:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He'd already been drinking,
Dialogue: 5,1:44:58.35,1:45:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这样他会迟缓很多
Dialogue: 4,1:44:58.35,1:45:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}which would have slowed him down a lot.
Dialogue: 5,1:45:01.54,1:45:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他的保镖会跟着他
Dialogue: 4,1:45:01.54,1:45:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}His bodyguard would be with him
Dialogue: 5,1:45:02.81,1:45:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}乔伊自己也应该是带着枪的
Dialogue: 4,1:45:02.81,1:45:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and Joey himself could be carrying, too,
Dialogue: 5,1:45:04.78,1:45:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但他的枪可能在他老婆的包里
Dialogue: 4,1:45:04.78,1:45:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but then the piece would be in his wife's purse probably.
Dialogue: 5,1:45:14.19,1:45:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}从来不会事先对你透露多少
Dialogue: 4,1:45:14.19,1:45:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You never got a lot of advance notice.
Dialogue: 5,1:45:17.54,1:45:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你只知道你到时候要做什么
Dialogue: 4,1:45:17.54,1:45:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All you knew was your part of it.
Dialogue: 5,1:45:21.71,1:45:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}红发约翰只知道
Dialogue: 4,1:45:21.71,1:45:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}John the Redhead knew only one thing:
Dialogue: 5,1:45:24.76,1:45:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他要开车送我过去
Dialogue: 4,1:45:24.76,1:45:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he was gonna drop me off,
Dialogue: 5,1:45:26.70,1:45:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}绕着街区转 然后再接我
Dialogue: 4,1:45:26.70,1:45:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}circle the block and pick me up.
Dialogue: 5,1:45:31.42,1:45:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}安贝特蛤蜊餐厅
Dialogue: 5,1:45:37.85,1:45:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你得先解决掉保镖
Dialogue: 4,1:45:37.85,1:45:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You wanna take out the bodyguard first.
Dialogue: 5,1:45:40.40,1:45:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不是杀他 别杀他 让他失去行动能力就好
Dialogue: 4,1:45:40.40,1:45:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Not kill him. Don't kill him, just disable him.
Dialogue: 5,1:45:43.97,1:45:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你跟他无冤无仇
Dialogue: 4,1:45:43.97,1:45:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You got no argument with him,
Dialogue: 5,1:45:45.41,1:45:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所以别照着脸或者胸膛来一枪
Dialogue: 4,1:45:45.41,1:45:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}so, not in the face or the chest.
Dialogue: 5,1:45:49.49,1:45:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有时 干这种活儿
Dialogue: 4,1:45:49.49,1:45:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Sometimes, with something like this,
Dialogue: 5,1:45:52.23,1:45:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你可能想先去趟厕所
Dialogue: 4,1:45:52.23,1:45:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you might want to go to the bathroom first.
Dialogue: 5,1:45:55.38,1:45:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好确定没人跟踪你进来
Dialogue: 4,1:45:55.38,1:45:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It gives you a chance to make sure nobody followed you in.
Dialogue: 5,1:45:58.39,1:45:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}也能让你确定
Dialogue: 4,1:45:58.39,1:45:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It also gives you a chance to make sure
Dialogue: 5,1:45:59.80,1:46:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}无需担心厕所里的人
Dialogue: 4,1:45:59.80,1:46:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}nobody is in the bathroom you have to worry about.
Dialogue: 5,1:46:03.00,1:46:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}也给你机会上趟厕所
Dialogue: 4,1:46:03.00,1:46:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It also gives you a chance to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 5,1:46:05.32,1:46:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}干活的时候你不想不舒服
Dialogue: 4,1:46:05.32,1:46:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You don't want to be uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 5,1:46:07.76,1:46:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我之前去过 深夜在这么个小餐厅
Dialogue: 4,1:46:07.76,1:46:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But I went before, and in a place this small, this late,
Dialogue: 5,1:46:11.08,1:46:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}直接干活就行了
Dialogue: 4,1:46:11.08,1:46:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you might as well just get to work.
Dialogue: 5,1:46:13.21,1:46:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}再来点红酒
Dialogue: 4,1:46:13.21,1:46:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We need more wine, all right?
Dialogue: 5,1:46:14.87,1:46:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}汤米 再来点红酒
Dialogue: 4,1:46:14.87,1:46:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tommy, some more wine.
Dialogue: 5,1:46:16.85,1:46:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}之后呢
Dialogue: 4,1:46:16.85,1:46:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So how about after?
Dialogue: 5,1:46:17.74,1:46:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-蛋糕 蛋糕 蛋糕 -现在还不行
Dialogue: 4,1:46:17.74,1:46:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Cake, cake, cake! - Not yet.
Dialogue: 5,1:46:19.99,1:46:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你还没吃完饭呢
Dialogue: 4,1:46:19.99,1:46:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're not even done eating the meal yet.
Dialogue: 5,1:46:21.37,1:46:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你要蛋糕 得了吧 不能这样
Dialogue: 4,1:46:21.37,1:46:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You want the cake? Come on, you can't do that.
Dialogue: 5,1:46:26.96,1:46:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}靠
Dialogue: 4,1:46:26.96,1:46:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Shit!
Dialogue: 5,1:46:28.04,1:46:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}操 操
Dialogue: 4,1:46:28.04,1:46:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Fuck! Fuck!
Dialogue: 5,1:47:04.48,1:47:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}此事发生在纽约的小意大利区
Dialogue: 4,1:47:04.48,1:47:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It happened in New York's Little Italy,
Dialogue: 5,1:47:06.49,1:47:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}传言这里是黑帮的中立地带
Dialogue: 4,1:47:06.49,1:47:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}an area rumored to be neutral territory among mobsters.
Dialogue: 5,1:47:07.80,1:47:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}安贝特蛤蜊餐厅
Dialogue: 5,1:47:09.81,1:47:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}凶杀之后
Dialogue: 4,1:47:09.81,1:47:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}After the killing,
Dialogue: 5,1:47:10.56,1:47:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}警方找到了几把枪以及一些指纹
Dialogue: 4,1:47:10.56,1:47:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}police found several guns and some fingerprints
Dialogue: 5,1:47:13.29,1:47:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}今日正在追查
Dialogue: 4,1:47:13.29,1:47:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}which they were tracing today.
Dialogue: 5,1:47:15.19,1:47:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"疯子乔"乔瑟夫·加洛
Dialogue: 4,1:47:15.19,1:47:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Joseph "Crazy Joe" Gallo
Dialogue: 5,1:47:16.57,1:47:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}晚间来到这家温馨的海鲜餐厅
Dialogue: 4,1:47:16.57,1:47:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}had come to the intimate seafood restaurant to cap an evening of celebration
Dialogue: 5,1:47:20.94,1:47:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}与他结婚不满一个月的妻子
Dialogue: 4,1:47:20.94,1:47:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}with his new bride of less than a month,
Dialogue: 5,1:47:22.70,1:47:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}以及与前妻所生的十一岁女儿一起庆祝
Dialogue: 4,1:47:22.70,1:47:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and his 11-year-old daughter by a previous marriage.
Dialogue: 5,1:47:25.54,1:47:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们在庆祝乔的47岁生日
Dialogue: 4,1:47:25.54,1:47:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They were, uh, celebrating Joe's 47th birthday.
Dialogue: 5,1:47:29.57,1:47:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那晚他们先去了一家夜店
Dialogue: 4,1:47:29.57,1:47:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They had been to a nightclub early in the evening.
Dialogue: 5,1:47:32.45,1:47:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们坐在餐厅后面的一桌 总共六个人
Dialogue: 4,1:47:32.45,1:47:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They were sitting at a rear table, this group of six people,
Dialogue: 5,1:47:37.14,1:47:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}然后
Dialogue: 4,1:47:37.14,1:47:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}when a, uh...
Dialogue: 5,1:47:39.28,1:47:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一个男人从后门进来
Dialogue: 4,1:47:39.28,1:47:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}a man walked in from the back door,
Dialogue: 5,1:47:41.83,1:47:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}直接走到
Dialogue: 4,1:47:41.83,1:47:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and he walked up, uh,
Dialogue: 5,1:47:44.33,1:47:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}走到桌子边上 开了三枪
Dialogue: 4,1:47:44.33,1:47:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to the side of the table. He fired three shots.
Dialogue: 5,1:47:47.71,1:47:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他打了乔两枪
Dialogue: 4,1:47:47.71,1:47:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He hit Joe twice
Dialogue: 5,1:47:49.39,1:47:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-还打了他的保镖 -佩琪 走吧
Dialogue: 4,1:47:49.39,1:47:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- and he hit his bodyguard... - Peggy, let's go.
Dialogue: 5,1:47:51.39,1:47:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}希腊人皮特一枪
Dialogue: 4,1:47:51.39,1:47:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...Pete the Greek, one time.
Dialogue: 5,1:47:53.60,1:47:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一共开了十四枪
Dialogue: 4,1:47:53.60,1:47:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There was a total of 14 shots fired.
Dialogue: 5,1:47:56.21,1:47:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}佩琪 走吧
Dialogue: 4,1:47:56.21,1:47:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Peggy, come on.
Dialogue: 5,1:47:57.85,1:47:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}乔伊·加洛的地盘总统街上
Dialogue: 4,1:47:57.85,1:47:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's quiet here on President Street,
Dialogue: 5,1:47:59.88,1:48:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}非常安静
Dialogue: 4,1:47:59.88,1:48:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Joey Gallo's turf.
Dialogue: 5,1:48:02.08,1:48:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}甚至有些太安静了
Dialogue: 4,1:48:02.08,1:48:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}In fact, it's too quiet.
Dialogue: 5,1:48:04.09,1:48:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在布鲁克林
Dialogue: 4,1:48:04.09,1:48:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Out here in Brooklyn,
Dialogue: 5,1:48:05.20,1:48:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}乔伊·加洛是个英雄
Dialogue: 4,1:48:05.20,1:48:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Joey Gallo was a hero.
Dialogue: 5,1:48:06.65,1:48:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}据猜测 他的死亡或将引发一场帮派战争
Dialogue: 4,1:48:06.65,1:48:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Speculation has it that his death may start a gang war,
Dialogue: 5,1:48:10.43,1:48:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}可能已经悄然开始
Dialogue: 4,1:48:10.43,1:48:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}if it hasn't already begun.
Dialogue: 5,1:48:12.91,1:48:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}普通汽油
Dialogue: 5,1:48:17.79,1:48:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}电话亭
Dialogue: 5,1:48:46.37,1:48:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你好好的 吉米 -你也是 麦奇
Dialogue: 4,1:48:46.37,1:48:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Take it easy, Jimmy. - You too, Mikey.
Dialogue: 5,1:48:48.67,1:48:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}保重了 吉米
Dialogue: 4,1:48:48.67,1:48:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Take good care, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,1:48:50.28,1:48:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}以防再也不见 问个好
Dialogue: 4,1:48:50.28,1:48:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If I don't see you again, hello.
Dialogue: 5,1:48:51.70,1:48:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}四年后 花了五十万美元
Dialogue: 4,1:48:51.70,1:48:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Four years later and $500,000 under the table
Dialogue: 5,1:48:55.15,1:48:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}贿赂尼克松的连任委员会
Dialogue: 4,1:48:55.15,1:48:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to Nixon's re-election committee,
Dialogue: 5,1:48:57.11,1:48:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米终于得偿所愿
Dialogue: 4,1:48:57.11,1:48:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy finally got what he wanted.
Dialogue: 5,1:48:59.17,1:49:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}抱歉 不过我不会再回来了
Dialogue: 4,1:48:59.17,1:49:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Sorry, but I won't be back.
Dialogue: 5,1:49:00.76,1:49:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}总统特赦以及假释
Dialogue: 4,1:49:00.76,1:49:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A presidential pardon and his parole.
Dialogue: 5,1:49:03.87,1:49:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米
Dialogue: 4,1:49:03.87,1:49:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy!
Dialogue: 5,1:49:05.82,1:49:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你现在打算做什么 吉米
Dialogue: 4,1:49:05.82,1:49:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What are you gonna do now, Jimmy?
Dialogue: 5,1:49:07.31,1:49:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我要做的第一件事就是
Dialogue: 4,1:49:07.31,1:49:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, the first thing I'm gonna do is register
Dialogue: 5,1:49:10.33,1:49:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}去联邦缓刑办公室登记
Dialogue: 4,1:49:10.33,1:49:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}with the Federal Probation Office,
Dialogue: 5,1:49:12.12,1:49:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}然后就和我妻子一起去佛州晒太阳
Dialogue: 4,1:49:12.12,1:49:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and then I'm going down to Florida with my wife to get some sun.
Dialogue: 5,1:49:16.44,1:49:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那之后有什么计划吗
Dialogue: 4,1:49:16.44,1:49:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Any plans after that?
Dialogue: 5,1:49:17.71,1:49:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我要夺回我工会的控制权
Dialogue: 4,1:49:17.71,1:49:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, I'm gonna take back control of my union.
Dialogue: 5,1:49:20.46,1:49:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你要怎么做 吉米
Dialogue: 4,1:49:20.46,1:49:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}How're you gonna do that, Jimmy?
Dialogue: 5,1:49:23.47,1:49:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}菲茨也要竞选 你感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 4,1:49:23.47,1:49:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}How do you like Fitz running against you?
Dialogue: 5,1:49:25.30,1:49:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}感觉不好
Dialogue: 4,1:49:25.30,1:49:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't.
Dialogue: 5,1:49:25.93,1:49:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 被关这么久是什么感觉
Dialogue: 4,1:49:25.93,1:49:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy, what was it like being locked up all that time?
Dialogue: 5,1:49:28.19,1:49:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}非常好 我很开心
Dialogue: 4,1:49:28.19,1:49:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It was wonderful. Had a great time.
Dialogue: 5,1:49:29.57,1:49:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卢姆餐厅
Dialogue: 5,1:49:31.44,1:49:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我做的第一件事就是
Dialogue: 4,1:49:31.44,1:49:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The first thing I did was,
Dialogue: 5,1:49:32.65,1:49:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}去卢姆餐厅买了几个辣味热狗
Dialogue: 4,1:49:32.65,1:49:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I picked up some chili dogs from Lum's,
Dialogue: 5,1:49:34.63,1:49:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米爱热狗就像爱冰激淋
Dialogue: 4,1:49:34.63,1:49:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}which Jimmy loved almost as much as ice cream.
Dialogue: 5,1:49:37.01,1:49:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}理查德·尼克松总统
Dialogue: 4,1:49:37.01,1:49:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A consultant to President
Dialogue: 5,1:49:38.33,1:49:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}连任竞选委员会的一名顾问
Dialogue: 4,1:49:38.33,1:49:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Richard Nixon's re-election campaign committee...
Dialogue: 5,1:49:41.28,1:49:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们的秘诀就是用啤酒蒸香肠
Dialogue: 4,1:49:41.28,1:49:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The secret is they steam them in beer.
Dialogue: 5,1:49:43.60,1:49:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是全美最好吃的热狗
Dialogue: 4,1:49:43.60,1:49:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There ain't a better hot dog in America.
Dialogue: 5,1:49:45.70,1:49:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}警方称麦考德和他的同谋
Dialogue: 4,1:49:45.70,1:49:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Police say McCord and his accomplices
Dialogue: 5,1:49:47.85,1:49:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}随身带了电子监听设备
Dialogue: 4,1:49:47.85,1:49:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}brought electronic listening devices with them
Dialogue: 5,1:49:50.27,1:49:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还卸下了两块天花板
Dialogue: 4,1:49:50.27,1:49:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and had removed two ceiling panels...
Dialogue: 5,1:49:51.89,1:49:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卢姆餐厅
Dialogue: 5,1:49:53.05,1:49:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}以便在民主党全国委员会
Dialogue: 4,1:49:53.05,1:49:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...while installing eavesdropping equipment
Dialogue: 5,1:49:55.27,1:49:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}安装窃听设备
Dialogue: 4,1:49:55.27,1:49:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}at the Democratic National Committee.
Dialogue: 5,1:49:57.41,1:50:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卡车司机工会
Dialogue: 5,1:49:58.00,1:50:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你看看 他还真有胆子竞选工会主席
Dialogue: 4,1:49:58.00,1:50:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Look at this. He's got the balls to run for President of the Teamsters.
Dialogue: 5,1:50:01.03,1:50:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你看看 托尼·普罗还给他颁奖了
Dialogue: 4,1:50:01.03,1:50:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Look at this. And Tony Pro giving him an award.
Dialogue: 5,1:50:03.73,1:50:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这混蛋 你信吗
Dialogue: 4,1:50:03.73,1:50:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This fuck... Do you believe it?
Dialogue: 5,1:50:04.43,1:50:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卡车司机工会
Dialogue: 5,1:50:05.33,1:50:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}菲茨很受特定人群的欢迎
Dialogue: 4,1:50:05.33,1:50:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Look, Fitz is very popular with certain people.
Dialogue: 5,1:50:08.11,1:50:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卡车司机工会
Dialogue: 5,1:50:08.26,1:50:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他当然受欢迎 能不受欢迎吗
Dialogue: 4,1:50:08.26,1:50:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Of course he's popular. Who wouldn't be popular?
Dialogue: 5,1:50:10.10,1:50:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}哪个弟兄问他借钱他都给
Dialogue: 4,1:50:10.10,1:50:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He loans money to every goombah who asks.
Dialogue: 5,1:50:12.81,1:50:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所以托尼支持他 他把选票都给菲茨了
Dialogue: 4,1:50:12.81,1:50:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's why Tony's behind him. He's given Fitz all his votes.
Dialogue: 5,1:50:15.95,1:50:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你受工会大多数人的支持
Dialogue: 4,1:50:15.95,1:50:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You got great support from most of the union.
Dialogue: 5,1:50:18.16,1:50:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你只需要托尼·普罗
Dialogue: 4,1:50:18.16,1:50:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All you need is Tony Pro's
Dialogue: 5,1:50:19.61,1:50:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在东北部的选民 你就能赢
Dialogue: 4,1:50:19.61,1:50:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}voters in the Northeast, and you can win.
Dialogue: 5,1:50:21.46,1:50:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你真不要吃一个吗 -不了 谢谢
Dialogue: 4,1:50:21.46,1:50:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- You sure you don't want one of these? - No, thank you.
Dialogue: 5,1:50:23.58,1:50:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我就是不敢相信我要去找托尼·普罗要选票
Dialogue: 4,1:50:23.58,1:50:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I just can't believe I gotta go to Tony Pro to get votes.
Dialogue: 5,1:50:27.65,1:50:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这都什么跟什么
Dialogue: 4,1:50:27.65,1:50:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What is that?
Dialogue: 5,1:50:30.73,1:50:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}托尼牢牢控制着菲茨 吉米
Dialogue: 4,1:50:30.73,1:50:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tony has Fitz in his pocket, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,1:50:33.01,1:50:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}工会不受黑帮控制
Dialogue: 4,1:50:33.01,1:50:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Wise guys don't run the union.
Dialogue: 5,1:50:34.57,1:50:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有菲茨就行
Dialogue: 4,1:50:34.57,1:50:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}With Fitz, they do.
Dialogue: 5,1:50:37.00,1:50:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 等你重新当上主席
Dialogue: 4,1:50:37.00,1:50:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy, listen, as soon as you're back as president,
Dialogue: 5,1:50:39.47,1:50:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你想做什么就做什么
Dialogue: 4,1:50:39.47,1:50:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you can do anything you want to.
Dialogue: 5,1:50:40.59,1:50:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你想解雇谁就解雇谁
Dialogue: 4,1:50:40.59,1:50:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You can fire anybody you want to.
Dialogue: 5,1:50:42.44,1:50:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你把托尼·普罗解雇了都行
Dialogue: 4,1:50:42.44,1:50:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You can even fire Tony Pro.
Dialogue: 5,1:50:46.15,1:50:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你可以盯着他 让他清空桌子
Dialogue: 4,1:50:46.15,1:50:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You could stand over him, watch him clear out his desk.
Dialogue: 5,1:50:48.79,1:50:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还可以让他脱光 搜他的身
Dialogue: 4,1:50:48.79,1:50:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You could strip-search the guy.
Dialogue: 5,1:50:51.39,1:50:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}确保他走的时候连个回形针都带不走
Dialogue: 4,1:50:51.39,1:50:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Make sure he doesn't walk off with a paper clip.
Dialogue: 5,1:50:53.77,1:50:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对 听见没 你听见没
Dialogue: 4,1:50:53.77,1:50:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yes. See that? Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 5,1:50:57.26,1:50:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所有人都以为乔是白脸
Dialogue: 4,1:50:57.26,1:50:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}See, everybody thinks Jo's the nice one
Dialogue: 5,1:50:59.03,1:51:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我是黑脸
Dialogue: 4,1:50:59.03,1:51:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and I'm the bad guy.
Dialogue: 5,1:51:00.60,1:51:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但其实是反过来
Dialogue: 4,1:51:00.60,1:51:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But it's opposite.
Dialogue: 5,1:51:02.78,1:51:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她是大灰狼 我是小绵羊
Dialogue: 4,1:51:02.78,1:51:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}She's the killer and I'm the sweetheart.
Dialogue: 5,1:51:06.88,1:51:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}现在我要去和狗杂种讲和了
Dialogue: 4,1:51:06.88,1:51:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Now I gotta make peace with the cocksucker.
Dialogue: 5,1:51:10.66,1:51:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我想和你重归于好
Dialogue: 4,1:51:10.66,1:51:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I want to make up with you.
Dialogue: 5,1:51:12.79,1:51:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我需要你支持我 拜托了 托尼
Dialogue: 4,1:51:12.79,1:51:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I need you to endorse me. Please, Tony.
Dialogue: 5,1:51:15.91,1:51:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}求你了
Dialogue: 4,1:51:15.91,1:51:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Please.
Dialogue: 5,1:51:17.29,1:51:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}该死
Dialogue: 4,1:51:17.29,1:51:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Fucking...
Dialogue: 5,1:51:19.59,1:51:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这事我做不来
Dialogue: 4,1:51:19.59,1:51:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm not gonna get through this.
Dialogue: 5,1:51:20.77,1:51:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你跟他谈谈就可以了
Dialogue: 4,1:51:20.77,1:51:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You gotta talk to him, that's all. Just...
Dialogue: 5,1:51:23.16,1:51:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你得处理好
Dialogue: 4,1:51:23.16,1:51:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You gotta deal with it, that's all.
Dialogue: 5,1:51:24.05,1:51:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}顺其自然吧
Dialogue: 3,1:51:24.05,1:51:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Let the chips fall where they may.
Dialogue: 5,1:51:25.19,1:51:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不过他真是个狗杂种
Dialogue: 4,1:51:25.19,1:51:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He is a cocksucker, though.
Dialogue: 5,1:51:28.08,1:51:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}要是我坐下和他谈 你一起来吗
Dialogue: 4,1:51:28.08,1:51:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If I sat down with him, would you come along?
Dialogue: 5,1:51:30.20,1:51:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你说什么呢 当然了
Dialogue: 4,1:51:30.20,1:51:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What are you talking about? Of course.
Dialogue: 5,1:51:31.81,1:51:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我怎么会不跟你去
Dialogue: 4,1:51:31.81,1:51:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}How am I not gonna go with you?
Dialogue: 5,1:51:42.75,1:51:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}妈的 走吧
Dialogue: 4,1:51:42.75,1:51:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Fuck it. Let's go.
Dialogue: 5,1:51:43.79,1:51:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 吉米 给个机会
Dialogue: 4,1:51:43.79,1:51:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy, Jimmy. Give it a chance.
Dialogue: 5,1:51:45.68,1:51:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}给个机会 再等几分钟
Dialogue: 4,1:51:45.68,1:51:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Give it a chance. Give it a few more minutes.
Dialogue: 5,1:51:49.78,1:51:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-就 -这样不行
Dialogue: 4,1:51:49.78,1:51:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Just... - This isn't right.
Dialogue: 5,1:51:51.11,1:51:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这样不行 怎么能这样
Dialogue: 4,1:51:51.11,1:51:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This isn't right. You don't do this.
Dialogue: 5,1:51:53.21,1:51:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}怎么能让人干等
Dialogue: 4,1:51:53.21,1:51:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You don't keep a man waiting.
Dialogue: 5,1:51:55.23,1:51:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道 我知道
Dialogue: 4,1:51:55.23,1:51:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know. I know.
Dialogue: 5,1:51:57.70,1:51:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}真要让人等
Dialogue: 4,1:51:57.70,1:51:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The only time you do
Dialogue: 5,1:51:59.69,1:52:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就代表你有话要说
Dialogue: 4,1:51:59.69,1:52:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}is when you want to say something.
Dialogue: 5,1:52:03.00,1:52:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我知道 -你想说"去死"
Dialogue: 4,1:52:03.00,1:52:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I know. - When you want to say "Fuck you."
Dialogue: 5,1:52:05.57,1:52:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}只有这种解释
Dialogue: 4,1:52:05.57,1:52:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's the only time.
Dialogue: 5,1:52:08.24,1:52:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}来了
Dialogue: 4,1:52:08.24,1:52:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Here they are.
Dialogue: 5,1:52:10.91,1:52:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你能相信这天气吗 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,1:52:10.91,1:52:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Can you believe this weather, Frank? Huh?
Dialogue: 5,1:52:13.28,1:52:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}外面快三十度了 真好
Dialogue: 4,1:52:13.28,1:52:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's 85 degrees outside. Perfect.
Dialogue: 5,1:52:16.74,1:52:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我是托尼·杰克
Dialogue: 4,1:52:16.74,1:52:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tony Jack.
Dialogue: 5,1:52:18.49,1:52:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我是吉米
Dialogue: 4,1:52:18.49,1:52:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,1:52:19.23,1:52:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}纽约的人都要冻死了 看看我们
Dialogue: 4,1:52:19.23,1:52:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}People freezing to death in New York and look at us, huh?
Dialogue: 5,1:52:22.96,1:52:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我就想知道 我们干嘛不一直住在这里
Dialogue: 4,1:52:22.96,1:52:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Why we don't live here all year round is what I wanna know.
Dialogue: 5,1:52:25.88,1:52:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}太棒了
Dialogue: 4,1:52:25.88,1:52:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 5,1:52:27.31,1:52:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-这是夏天 -什么
Dialogue: 4,1:52:27.31,1:52:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- It's summer. - What?
Dialogue: 5,1:52:30.12,1:52:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是夏天
Dialogue: 4,1:52:30.12,1:52:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's summer.
Dialogue: 5,1:52:32.33,1:52:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}纽约的人没要冻死
Dialogue: 4,1:52:32.33,1:52:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}People aren't freezing to death in New York.
Dialogue: 5,1:52:35.77,1:52:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}现在是夏天
Dialogue: 4,1:52:35.77,1:52:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's summer.
Dialogue: 5,1:52:39.56,1:52:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在我心里 纽约一直零下十三度
Dialogue: 4,1:52:39.56,1:52:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}In my mind, it's always eight degrees in New York.
Dialogue: 5,1:52:41.54,1:52:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我就想表个态
Dialogue: 4,1:52:41.54,1:52:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm making a point.
Dialogue: 5,1:52:43.34,1:52:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你想表个态
Dialogue: 4,1:52:43.34,1:52:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're making a point.
Dialogue: 5,1:52:45.16,1:52:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}穿成这样表态
Dialogue: 4,1:52:45.16,1:52:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Making a point dressing like that?
Dialogue: 5,1:52:47.51,1:52:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你开会就穿成这样吗
Dialogue: 4,1:52:47.51,1:52:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Is that how you dress for a meeting?
Dialogue: 5,1:52:50.56,1:52:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你在佛州就穿成这样吗 穿西装
Dialogue: 4,1:52:50.56,1:52:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is how you dress in Florida? In a suit?
Dialogue: 5,1:52:53.96,1:52:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}去开会吗
Dialogue: 4,1:52:53.96,1:52:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}For a meeting?
Dialogue: 5,1:52:56.00,1:52:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别说佛州 不管在什么鬼地方
Dialogue: 4,1:52:56.00,1:52:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Anywhere. Florida, Timbuktu, I dress in a suit.
Dialogue: 5,1:52:59.60,1:53:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我开会都穿西装
Dialogue: 4,1:52:59.60,1:53:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}For a meetin'.
Dialogue: 5,1:53:01.59,1:53:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-而且你迟到了 -什么
Dialogue: 4,1:53:01.59,1:53:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- And you're late. - What?
Dialogue: 5,1:53:04.33,1:53:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你迟到了
Dialogue: 4,1:53:04.33,1:53:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're late.
Dialogue: 5,1:53:07.50,1:53:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}嗯 路上堵车
Dialogue: 4,1:53:07.50,1:53:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, there was traffic.
Dialogue: 5,1:53:08.85,1:53:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是啊 堵车
Dialogue: 4,1:53:08.85,1:53:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yes, traffic.
Dialogue: 5,1:53:10.81,1:53:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是不是堵车了
Dialogue: 4,1:53:10.81,1:53:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Wasn't there traffic?
Dialogue: 5,1:53:11.69,1:53:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-来堵车这一套 -的确堵车
Dialogue: 4,1:53:11.69,1:53:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- You give me traffic? - There was traffic.
Dialogue: 5,1:53:13.33,1:53:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你想要我们怎么办
Dialogue: 4,1:53:13.33,1:53:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What do you want from us?
Dialogue: 5,1:53:14.84,1:53:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}保险杠都抵着保险杠了
Dialogue: 4,1:53:14.84,1:53:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It was bumper to fuckin' bumper.
Dialogue: 5,1:53:15.69,1:53:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是啊 堵车确实严重
Dialogue: 4,1:53:15.69,1:53:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, yeah. No, it's bad, you know?
Dialogue: 5,1:53:17.77,1:53:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}堵车
Dialogue: 4,1:53:17.77,1:53:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Traffic.
Dialogue: 5,1:53:19.67,1:53:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我这辈子从来没有
Dialogue: 4,1:53:19.67,1:53:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I never waited for anyone who was late
Dialogue: 5,1:53:23.36,1:53:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}等人超过十分钟
Dialogue: 4,1:53:23.36,1:53:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}more than ten minutes in my life.
Dialogue: 5,1:53:26.35,1:53:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}十五分钟吧 比较合适
Dialogue: 4,1:53:26.35,1:53:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'd say fifteen. Fifteen's right.
Dialogue: 5,1:53:28.35,1:53:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不 十分钟
Dialogue: 4,1:53:28.35,1:53:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, ten.
Dialogue: 5,1:53:30.69,1:53:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我觉得不行 十分钟不够
Dialogue: 4,1:53:30.69,1:53:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't think so, ten's not enough.
Dialogue: 5,1:53:32.60,1:53:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你得算上堵车的时间
Dialogue: 4,1:53:32.60,1:53:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You have to take traffic into account.
Dialogue: 5,1:53:34.12,1:53:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我算了 堵车的时间算进去了
Dialogue: 4,1:53:34.12,1:53:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's what I'm doing. I'm taking traffic into account.
Dialogue: 5,1:53:37.94,1:53:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所以给了十分钟
Dialogue: 4,1:53:37.94,1:53:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's why it's ten.
Dialogue: 5,1:53:39.11,1:53:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我还是坚持十五分钟 -十分钟
Dialogue: 4,1:53:39.11,1:53:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I still say 15. - No, ten.
Dialogue: 5,1:53:42.07,1:53:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}行吧 这点我们保留意见
Dialogue: 4,1:53:42.07,1:53:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Fine. We disagree on that.
Dialogue: 5,1:53:44.20,1:53:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}要不就十二分半
Dialogue: 4,1:53:44.20,1:53:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}How about twelve and a half minutes?
Dialogue: 5,1:53:46.08,1:53:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这就对了 十二分半
Dialogue: 4,1:53:46.08,1:53:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There we go, 12.5.
Dialogue: 5,1:53:47.29,1:53:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}中间值 正中间 太好了
Dialogue: 4,1:53:47.29,1:53:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The middle. Right in the middle. Beautiful.
Dialogue: 5,1:53:49.81,1:53:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}超过十分钟
Dialogue: 4,1:53:49.81,1:53:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}More than ten...
Dialogue: 5,1:53:52.23,1:53:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你就是有话要说了
Dialogue: 4,1:53:52.23,1:53:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you're saying something.
Dialogue: 5,1:53:54.76,1:53:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你有话要对我说吗 -我来了
Dialogue: 4,1:53:54.76,1:53:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- You saying something to me? - I'm here.
Dialogue: 5,1:53:58.10,1:53:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就这个意思
Dialogue: 4,1:53:58.10,1:53:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It says what it says.
Dialogue: 5,1:54:00.92,1:54:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那就这样吧
Dialogue: 4,1:54:00.92,1:54:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So there it is.
Dialogue: 5,1:54:04.14,1:54:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}接下来怎么谈
Dialogue: 4,1:54:04.14,1:54:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Where do we go from here?
Dialogue: 5,1:54:08.15,1:54:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我能为你做什么
Dialogue: 4,1:54:08.15,1:54:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, what can I do for you?
Dialogue: 5,1:54:12.91,1:54:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我希望你
Dialogue: 4,1:54:12.91,1:54:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I want you...
Dialogue: 5,1:54:16.34,1:54:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我
Dialogue: 4,1:54:16.34,1:54:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I...
Dialogue: 5,1:54:18.55,1:54:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我希望你支持我
Dialogue: 4,1:54:18.55,1:54:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I want you to endorse me...
Dialogue: 5,1:54:22.25,1:54:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}支持什么你也清楚
Dialogue: 4,1:54:22.25,1:54:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}for you know what.
Dialogue: 5,1:54:24.99,1:54:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在我们谈那个之前 先把另一件事讲清楚
Dialogue: 4,1:54:24.99,1:54:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Before we get to that, let's straighten that other thing up.
Dialogue: 5,1:54:27.83,1:54:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不 另一件事与我无关
Dialogue: 4,1:54:27.83,1:54:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No. The other thing is none of my business.
Dialogue: 5,1:54:30.06,1:54:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你的养老金我做不了主
Dialogue: 4,1:54:30.06,1:54:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I can't do anything about your pension.
Dialogue: 5,1:54:32.46,1:54:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不行 菲茨在就不行 菲茨是主席
Dialogue: 4,1:54:32.46,1:54:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I can't. Not with Fitz in there. Fitz is in there, you know.
Dialogue: 5,1:54:36.04,1:54:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你去找菲茨 -找了
Dialogue: 4,1:54:36.04,1:54:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- You go to Fitz. - I did.
Dialogue: 5,1:54:37.43,1:54:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-他会帮你 -我找了
Dialogue: 4,1:54:37.43,1:54:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- He'll help you out. - I did.
Dialogue: 5,1:54:38.56,1:54:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他说会帮我解决 没问题
Dialogue: 4,1:54:38.56,1:54:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He said he'll take care of it, no questions asked.
Dialogue: 5,1:54:41.05,1:54:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你不愿意 但是他愿意
Dialogue: 4,1:54:41.05,1:54:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You wouldn't do that but he will.
Dialogue: 5,1:54:43.71,1:54:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我是说另一件事
Dialogue: 4,1:54:43.71,1:54:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I meant the other thing.
Dialogue: 5,1:54:47.15,1:54:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}哪件事
Dialogue: 4,1:54:47.15,1:54:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What other thing?
Dialogue: 5,1:54:48.52,1:54:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你很清楚
Dialogue: 4,1:54:48.52,1:54:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know.
Dialogue: 5,1:54:49.65,1:54:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不清楚
Dialogue: 4,1:54:49.65,1:54:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 5,1:54:51.08,1:54:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你要道歉
Dialogue: 4,1:54:51.08,1:54:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Your apology.
Dialogue: 5,1:54:54.51,1:54:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我要道歉
Dialogue: 4,1:54:54.51,1:54:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}My apology?
Dialogue: 5,1:54:57.29,1:54:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我道什么歉
Dialogue: 4,1:54:57.29,1:54:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}My apology for what?
Dialogue: 5,1:54:58.67,1:55:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就是那时你像个国王一样
Dialogue: 4,1:54:58.67,1:55:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}For what you said when you were sitting there
Dialogue: 5,1:55:00.34,1:55:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吃着冰激淋说出的话
Dialogue: 4,1:55:00.34,1:55:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}eating your ice cream like some fucking king.
Dialogue: 5,1:55:03.81,1:55:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那可是种族污蔑 "你们这些人"
Dialogue: 4,1:55:03.81,1:55:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That was an ethnic slur. "You people."
Dialogue: 5,1:55:07.07,1:55:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你知道他说了什么吗 -不 我听说
Dialogue: 4,1:55:07.07,1:55:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Did you know what he said? - Nah, I mean, I heard...
Dialogue: 5,1:55:09.10,1:55:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我听说你们在牢里吵了一架 但我不清楚
Dialogue: 4,1:55:09.10,1:55:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I heard you had an altercation in the can, but I don't know.
Dialogue: 5,1:55:11.49,1:55:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对 "你们这些人"
Dialogue: 4,1:55:11.49,1:55:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, "You people."
Dialogue: 5,1:55:14.43,1:55:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你就这么说的 对吧 吉米
Dialogue: 4,1:55:14.43,1:55:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's what you said. Right, Jim?
Dialogue: 5,1:55:17.76,1:55:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"你们这些人" 我是不如你吗
Dialogue: 4,1:55:17.76,1:55:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"You people." Am I beneath you?
Dialogue: 5,1:55:22.04,1:55:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一点没错
Dialogue: 4,1:55:22.04,1:55:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Definitely.
Dialogue: 5,1:55:23.41,1:55:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-吉米 别这样 -吉米 你干嘛
Dialogue: 4,1:55:23.41,1:55:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Jimmy, come on. - Jimmy, what're you doing?
Dialogue: 5,1:55:25.02,1:55:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别忘了 你今天的地位全靠"我们这些人"
Dialogue: 4,1:55:25.02,1:55:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Don't forget, "You people" got you where you are.
Dialogue: 5,1:55:27.54,1:55:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别 别跟我说这种话 你个狗东...
Dialogue: 4,1:55:27.54,1:55:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Don't...don't tell me that, you fucking...
Dialogue: 5,1:55:29.79,1:55:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那就是你的问题所在 吉米
Dialogue: 4,1:55:29.79,1:55:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's your problem, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,1:55:30.59,1:55:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你的问题在于你是个人渣
Dialogue: 4,1:55:30.59,1:55:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Your problem is you're a piece of shit.
Dialogue: 5,1:55:32.79,1:55:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 拜托
Dialogue: 4,1:55:32.79,1:55:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy, come on.
Dialogue: 5,1:55:33.74,1:55:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-吉米 你在干什么 -天呐 吉米 别这样
Dialogue: 4,1:55:33.74,1:55:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Jimmy, what are you doin'? - Jesus, Jimmy, come on.
Dialogue: 5,1:55:35.84,1:55:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我叫你支持我 你却跟我说这么多废话
Dialogue: 4,1:55:35.84,1:55:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I asked for your endorsement and you're giving me all this crap.
Dialogue: 5,1:55:37.99,1:55:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我叫你向我道歉
Dialogue: 4,1:55:37.99,1:55:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I asked for your apology.
Dialogue: 5,1:55:39.32,1:55:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你他妈算老几 我为什么要向你道歉
Dialogue: 4,1:55:39.32,1:55:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Who the fuck are you to apologize to?
Dialogue: 5,1:55:42.18,1:55:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米
Dialogue: 4,1:55:42.18,1:55:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy...
Dialogue: 5,1:55:42.87,1:55:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你他妈算老几啊
Dialogue: 4,1:55:42.87,1:55:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Who the fuck are you?
Dialogue: 5,1:55:44.82,1:55:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}和气点
Dialogue: 4,1:55:44.82,1:55:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Be gentle.
Dialogue: 5,1:55:45.32,1:55:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我不需要跟你谈 -坐下吧 托尼
Dialogue: 4,1:55:45.32,1:55:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I don't need this. - Let's just sit down. Tony.
Dialogue: 5,1:55:47.23,1:55:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我就需要吗 难道我需要你
Dialogue: 4,1:55:47.23,1:55:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I need this? I need you?
Dialogue: 5,1:55:49.29,1:55:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-没错 你需要我 -得了吧
Dialogue: 4,1:55:49.29,1:55:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Yeah, you need me. - Oh, please.
Dialogue: 5,1:55:50.80,1:55:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 拜托 你对他有所求
Dialogue: 4,1:55:50.80,1:55:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy, come on. You're asking him for something.
Dialogue: 5,1:55:52.69,1:55:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这家伙让我紧张 他总是说些让我生气的话
Dialogue: 4,1:55:52.69,1:55:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The guy gets me nervous. He talks about things that get me upset.
Dialogue: 5,1:55:54.79,1:55:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-冷静点 -既然大家都来了
Dialogue: 4,1:55:54.79,1:55:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Take it easy. - Everybody's here.
Dialogue: 5,1:55:56.48,1:55:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们就赶紧开会吧 来吧
Dialogue: 4,1:55:56.48,1:55:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Let's have the fucking meeting. Come on.
Dialogue: 5,1:55:59.19,1:56:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我们好好谈谈 -仅此而已
Dialogue: 4,1:55:59.19,1:56:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Let's talk. - That's all.
Dialogue: 5,1:56:00.93,1:56:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他人来了
Dialogue: 4,1:56:00.93,1:56:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's here.
Dialogue: 5,1:56:06.46,1:56:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们在牢里吵的就是这个吗
Dialogue: 4,1:56:06.46,1:56:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Was this the altercation youse had in the can?
Dialogue: 5,1:56:08.51,1:56:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}嗯 跟这差不多吧
Dialogue: 4,1:56:08.51,1:56:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, it was something like this.
Dialogue: 5,1:56:09.66,1:56:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们 我们最后打了起来
Dialogue: 4,1:56:09.66,1:56:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We... We got to arm wrestling.
Dialogue: 5,1:56:12.73,1:56:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他输了
Dialogue: 4,1:56:12.73,1:56:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He lost.
Dialogue: 5,1:56:13.77,1:56:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有脸说我输了 你该瞧瞧他的肋骨
Dialogue: 4,1:56:13.77,1:56:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I lost. You should see his ribs.
Dialogue: 5,1:56:16.38,1:56:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们还是谈正事吧 别扯其他的
Dialogue: 4,1:56:16.38,1:56:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Why don't you just talk about what you need to talk about.
Dialogue: 5,1:56:18.33,1:56:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-没错 -就是啊
Dialogue: 4,1:56:18.33,1:56:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- That's right. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,1:56:20.22,1:56:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你希望我怎么做
Dialogue: 4,1:56:20.22,1:56:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 5,1:56:22.18,1:56:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我的确说了"你们这些人"
Dialogue: 4,1:56:22.18,1:56:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I said, "You people."
Dialogue: 5,1:56:23.06,1:56:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你希望我怎么做 为此道歉吗
Dialogue: 4,1:56:23.06,1:56:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What do you want me to do, apologize for it?
Dialogue: 5,1:56:24.97,1:56:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那正是我想要的 吉米 一句道歉
Dialogue: 4,1:56:24.97,1:56:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's exactly what I want, Jimmy. An apology.
Dialogue: 5,1:56:27.68,1:56:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那我就为此道歉
Dialogue: 4,1:56:27.68,1:56:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'll apologize for it.
Dialogue: 5,1:56:29.64,1:56:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我也别无他求
Dialogue: 4,1:56:29.64,1:56:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's all I want.
Dialogue: 5,1:56:32.41,1:56:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}前提是你先为这次迟到道歉
Dialogue: 4,1:56:32.41,1:56:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}After you apologize for being late,
Dialogue: 5,1:56:36.67,1:56:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你个狗娘养的外国佬
Dialogue: 4,1:56:36.67,1:56:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you motherfucking wop cocksucker.
Dialogue: 5,1:56:40.34,1:56:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 你他妈是疯了吗
Dialogue: 4,1:56:40.34,1:56:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy, are you out of your fucking mind?
Dialogue: 5,1:56:42.18,1:56:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我可以为迟到道歉
Dialogue: 4,1:56:42.18,1:56:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'll apologize for being late
Dialogue: 5,1:56:44.28,1:56:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我会先绑架你孙女 把她的内脏挖出来
Dialogue: 4,1:56:44.28,1:56:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}after I kidnap your granddaughter, rip her guts out,
Dialogue: 5,1:56:46.93,1:56:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}然后装在信封里寄给你
Dialogue: 4,1:56:46.93,1:56:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and send them to you in a fucking envelope!
Dialogue: 5,1:56:52.89,1:56:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}把他拉开 快
Dialogue: 4,1:56:52.89,1:56:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Get him off! Come on!
Dialogue: 5,1:56:55.11,1:56:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我要杀了他
Dialogue: 4,1:56:55.11,1:56:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'll fucking kill him!
Dialogue: 5,1:56:55.73,1:56:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-别打了 托尼 -天呐
Dialogue: 4,1:56:55.73,1:56:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Come on, Tony! - Jesus!
Dialogue: 5,1:57:03.05,1:57:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你觉得罗素...
Dialogue: 4,1:57:03.05,1:57:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You think Russ would...
Dialogue: 5,1:57:04.79,1:57:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}会不会解决掉那家伙
Dialogue: 4,1:57:04.79,1:57:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}would do something about this guy?
Dialogue: 5,1:57:07.68,1:57:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那很复杂
Dialogue: 4,1:57:07.68,1:57:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's complicated.
Dialogue: 5,1:57:10.16,1:57:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是啊 的确很复杂
Dialogue: 4,1:57:10.16,1:57:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah. It's complicated.
Dialogue: 5,1:57:11.48,1:57:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我倒是想亲手宰了那个狗东西
Dialogue: 4,1:57:11.48,1:57:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'd like to clip the motherfucker myself, you know,
Dialogue: 5,1:57:13.80,1:57:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-获得他们的同意 但是... -我懂
Dialogue: 4,1:57:13.80,1:57:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Get the okay from them. But... - I know.
Dialogue: 5,1:57:16.42,1:57:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}必须除掉这家伙
Dialogue: 4,1:57:16.42,1:57:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This guy's gotta go.
Dialogue: 5,1:57:18.44,1:57:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}必须除掉他 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,1:57:18.44,1:57:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's gotta go, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,1:57:20.16,1:57:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们不可能同意我这么做的
Dialogue: 4,1:57:20.16,1:57:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm not gonna get the okay to do that.
Dialogue: 5,1:57:23.62,1:57:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克 跟那家伙谈谈
Dialogue: 4,1:57:23.62,1:57:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank, just talk to the guy.
Dialogue: 5,1:57:25.96,1:57:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好吗 找他好好谈谈
Dialogue: 4,1:57:25.96,1:57:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay? Just talk to him.
Dialogue: 5,1:57:29.26,1:57:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}纽约 东哈莱姆区
Dialogue: 4,1:57:29.26,1:57:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}第115大街
Dialogue: 5,1:57:36.24,1:57:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}泽西的那些家伙不停给我打电话
Dialogue: 4,1:57:36.24,1:57:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}These guys from Jersey keep fucking calling me
Dialogue: 5,1:57:38.31,1:57:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}跟我说这两人之间的矛盾
Dialogue: 4,1:57:38.31,1:57:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}about this bullshit between these two guys.
Dialogue: 5,1:57:40.38,1:57:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我把我对他们说的话再跟你们说一遍
Dialogue: 4,1:57:40.38,1:57:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm gonna tell you the same thing I told them.
Dialogue: 5,1:57:43.27,1:57:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不认同普罗针对吉米说的那些话
Dialogue: 4,1:57:43.27,1:57:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't approve of what Pro said about Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,1:57:45.59,1:57:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是啊
Dialogue: 4,1:57:45.59,1:57:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No.
Dialogue: 5,1:57:46.22,1:57:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谁会那样去威胁别人的孙辈啊
Dialogue: 4,1:57:46.22,1:57:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, who talks like that about a person's grandchildren?
Dialogue: 5,1:57:49.37,1:57:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-那是不对的 -是啊
Dialogue: 4,1:57:49.37,1:57:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- It's not fucking right. - No.
Dialogue: 5,1:57:51.13,1:57:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}托尼·萨雷诺 绰号"胖子托尼"
Dialogue: 4,1:57:51.13,1:57:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}被判一百年徒刑
Dialogue: 3,1:57:51.13,1:57:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}1992年死于狱中 享年80岁
Dialogue: 5,1:57:56.27,1:57:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但普罗也不是无名小卒
Dialogue: 2,1:57:56.27,1:57:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But Pro isn't nobody.
Dialogue: 5,1:57:58.87,1:57:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米应该明白这点的
Dialogue: 4,1:57:58.87,1:57:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy should know that.
Dialogue: 5,1:58:00.65,1:58:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我能怎么办
Dialogue: 4,1:58:00.65,1:58:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What am I gonna go?
Dialogue: 5,1:58:01.60,1:58:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我又没办法告诫那家伙能说什么 不能说什么
Dialogue: 4,1:58:01.60,1:58:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm not gonna tell this guy what he can or can't fucking say,
Dialogue: 5,1:58:04.41,1:58:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}把他当小孩管教
Dialogue: 4,1:58:04.41,1:58:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}like he's a child.
Dialogue: 5,1:58:05.86,1:58:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}听着
Dialogue: 4,1:58:05.86,1:58:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, listen.
Dialogue: 5,1:58:07.04,1:58:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米其实没什么恶意 他只是很生气
Dialogue: 4,1:58:07.04,1:58:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy don't mean nothing. He just gets upset.
Dialogue: 5,1:58:09.15,1:58:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素 拜托 我们都知道他暴躁易怒
Dialogue: 4,1:58:09.15,1:58:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Russ, come on, we all know he's a fucking hothead.
Dialogue: 5,1:58:11.10,1:58:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们都曾有过暴躁易怒的时候
Dialogue: 4,1:58:11.10,1:58:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We're all hotheads once in a while.
Dialogue: 5,1:58:12.45,1:58:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是没错 但吉米有时会说些不该说的话
Dialogue: 4,1:58:12.45,1:58:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, but Jimmy says things he shouldn't say sometimes.
Dialogue: 5,1:58:14.62,1:58:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是 我们有时也都会那样
Dialogue: 4,1:58:14.62,1:58:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah. We all do that too.
Dialogue: 5,1:58:16.30,1:58:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}该有人让他冷静下来
Dialogue: 4,1:58:16.30,1:58:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, somebody should just calm him down.
Dialogue: 5,1:58:23.10,1:58:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好吧 我会...
Dialogue: 4,1:58:23.10,1:58:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, well, that... I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 5,1:58:24.68,1:58:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我会让他冷静下来的 他很不好搞 但...
Dialogue: 4,1:58:24.68,1:58:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm gonna calm him down. He's difficult, but...
Dialogue: 5,1:58:26.92,1:58:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}或许这能帮他冷静下来
Dialogue: 4,1:58:26.92,1:58:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Maybe this could help him calm down.
Dialogue: 5,1:58:28.62,1:58:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你可以告诉他 我向来都很喜欢他
Dialogue: 4,1:58:28.62,1:58:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You could tell him that I always liked him.
Dialogue: 5,1:58:32.66,1:58:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}并且我不会阻拦他夺回他的职位
Dialogue: 4,1:58:32.66,1:58:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And I won't stand in his way of him trying to get his job back.
Dialogue: 5,1:58:35.89,1:58:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我会的 我会告诉他这点的 托尼
Dialogue: 4,1:58:35.89,1:58:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I will. I will tell him that, Tony.
Dialogue: 5,1:58:36.92,1:58:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-好吗 -好的
Dialogue: 4,1:58:36.92,1:58:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Okay? - Yes.
Dialogue: 5,1:58:38.35,1:58:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那可无法让我冷静下来
Dialogue: 4,1:58:38.35,1:58:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's not making me calm down.
Dialogue: 5,1:58:40.62,1:58:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}站我这边
Dialogue: 4,1:58:40.62,1:58:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Standing by me.
Dialogue: 5,1:58:42.50,1:58:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那他妈是什么意思
Dialogue: 4,1:58:42.50,1:58:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What the fuck does that mean?
Dialogue: 5,1:58:44.54,1:58:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}站我这边跟采取措施
Dialogue: 4,1:58:44.54,1:58:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Standing by me ain't the same thing as doing something
Dialogue: 5,1:58:48.07,1:58:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}处理一个失控的疯子 可不是一回事
Dialogue: 4,1:58:48.07,1:58:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}about some out-of-control fucking psycho!
Dialogue: 5,1:58:52.15,1:58:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 矮子可不是无名小卒
Dialogue: 4,1:58:52.15,1:58:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy, the Little Guy ain't a nobody.
Dialogue: 5,1:58:54.16,1:58:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你必须明白这点
Dialogue: 4,1:58:54.16,1:58:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You gotta understand that.
Dialogue: 5,1:58:55.36,1:58:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-他可不是无名小卒 -他是个龟孙
Dialogue: 4,1:58:55.36,1:58:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- He ain't a nobody. - He's a cocksucker.
Dialogue: 5,1:58:56.89,1:58:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}菲茨也是个龟孙
Dialogue: 4,1:58:56.89,1:58:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Fitz is a cocksucker.
Dialogue: 5,1:58:59.62,1:59:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我要把这些龟孙全都解决掉
Dialogue: 4,1:58:59.62,1:59:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm gonna deal with both these cocksuckers...
Dialogue: 5,1:59:02.10,1:59:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我亲自动手
Dialogue: 4,1:59:02.10,1:59:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}myself!
Dialogue: 5,1:59:04.08,1:59:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这里以前是我的办公室
Dialogue: 4,1:59:04.08,1:59:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This used to be my office.
Dialogue: 5,1:59:06.25,1:59:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}进去找弗兰克·菲茨西蒙斯吧 你们是找不到他的
Dialogue: 4,1:59:06.25,1:59:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Go look for Frank Fitzsimmons there. You're not gonna find him.
Dialogue: 5,1:59:07.72,1:59:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}国际卡车司机工会
Dialogue: 5,1:59:09.62,1:59:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为他在全国各地旅游
Dialogue: 4,1:59:09.62,1:59:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's because he travels all over the country
Dialogue: 5,1:59:12.17,1:59:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}寻找好的高尔夫球场 他就只会干这个
Dialogue: 4,1:59:12.17,1:59:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}looking for goddamn golf courses because that's what he does.
Dialogue: 5,1:59:15.51,1:59:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他喜欢打高尔夫
Dialogue: 4,1:59:15.51,1:59:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He plays golf.
Dialogue: 5,1:59:16.84,1:59:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他算老几 能跟在尼克松身边
Dialogue: 4,1:59:16.84,1:59:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Who is he to run around with Nixon,
Dialogue: 5,1:59:18.74,1:59:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}跟在司法部长身边
Dialogue: 4,1:59:18.74,1:59:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}run around with the attorney general?
Dialogue: 5,1:59:20.57,1:59:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他整天就知道打高尔夫 还能领全额薪水
Dialogue: 4,1:59:20.57,1:59:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He does this and collects full-time salary while he's doing it.
Dialogue: 5,1:59:24.98,1:59:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那是怎么做到的
Dialogue: 4,1:59:24.98,1:59:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Now, how do you do that?
Dialogue: 5,1:59:26.30,1:59:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这份工作 一天24小时都不够忙活的
Dialogue: 4,1:59:26.30,1:59:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There's not enough hours in a day to do this job.
Dialogue: 5,1:59:29.34,1:59:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我因为欺诈罪被判刑入狱
Dialogue: 4,1:59:29.34,1:59:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I was sent to prison for fraud.
Dialogue: 5,1:59:32.35,1:59:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他的所为 才叫欺诈呢
Dialogue: 4,1:59:32.35,1:59:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is fraud, what he's doing.
Dialogue: 5,1:59:35.91,1:59:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那么菲茨对吉米的回应是怎样的呢
Dialogue: 4,1:59:35.91,1:59:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So what's Fitz's answer to Jimmy?
Dialogue: 5,1:59:38.27,1:59:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他给吉米的老朋友
Dialogue: 4,1:59:38.27,1:59:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He does it by sending a message
Dialogue: 5,1:59:39.89,1:59:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}戴夫·约翰逊传达了一条信息
Dialogue: 4,1:59:39.89,1:59:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to Jimmy's old friend, Dave Johnson.
Dialogue: 5,1:59:42.48,1:59:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}戴夫·约翰逊 他是299号地方工会的主席
Dialogue: 4,1:59:42.48,1:59:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Now, Dave Johnson, he ran Local 299.
Dialogue: 5,1:59:47.46,1:59:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}信息是这样的
Dialogue: 4,1:59:47.46,1:59:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This was the message.
Dialogue: 5,1:59:53.36,1:59:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}菲茨就是以这种方式表明
Dialogue: 4,1:59:53.36,1:59:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So this is how Fitz says
Dialogue: 5,1:59:54.77,1:59:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他希望我的老朋友戴夫·约翰逊退位
Dialogue: 4,1:59:54.77,1:59:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he wants my old pal Dave Johnson to step down
Dialogue: 5,1:59:58.08,2:00:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好让他的儿子接管299号地方工会
Dialogue: 4,1:59:58.08,2:00:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}so he can have his son take over Local 299.
Dialogue: 5,2:00:03.13,2:00:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那么我打算用接下来的方式拒绝他儿子小菲茨
Dialogue: 4,2:00:03.13,2:00:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is how I'm gonna say no to his son, little fucking Fitz.
Dialogue: 5,2:00:08.69,2:00:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她长得很像你妈
Dialogue: 4,2:00:08.69,2:00:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}She looked a lot like your mother.
Dialogue: 5,2:00:09.94,2:00:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}体型都差不多
Dialogue: 4,2:00:09.94,2:00:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}About the same size.
Dialogue: 5,2:00:10.96,2:00:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}爸 拜托 你都说了上千遍了
Dialogue: 4,2:00:10.96,2:00:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Pops, come on, you told me like a thousand times.
Dialogue: 5,2:00:11.81,2:00:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}长得漂亮 她长得很漂亮
Dialogue: 4,2:00:11.81,2:00:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Good-looking girl. She was a good-looking girl.
Dialogue: 5,2:00:14.24,2:00:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我当时真不知道那不是你妈
Dialogue: 4,2:00:14.24,2:00:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But I had no idea that it wasn't your mother.
Dialogue: 5,2:00:16.97,2:00:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}当时那里很暗...
Dialogue: 4,2:00:16.97,2:00:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It was dark and...
Dialogue: 5,2:00:21.97,2:00:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}霍法
Dialogue: 5,2:00:23.25,2:00:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}约·霍法
Dialogue: 4,2:00:23.25,2:00:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}运输部 女助理
Dialogue: 5,2:00:26.86,2:00:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}接下来菲茨用这种方式表明他不喜欢
Dialogue: 4,2:00:26.86,2:00:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is how Fitz says he doesn't like
Dialogue: 5,2:00:29.36,2:00:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我选定的299号工会负责人
Dialogue: 4,2:00:29.36,2:00:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}who I say runs the 299.
Dialogue: 5,2:00:32.43,2:00:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他开除了我老婆
Dialogue: 4,2:00:32.43,2:00:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}By firing my wife
Dialogue: 5,2:00:33.67,2:00:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}让她失去了年薪4.8万美元的工会工作
Dialogue: 4,2:00:33.67,2:00:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}from her forty-eight-fucking-thousand- dollar-a-year union job!
Dialogue: 5,2:00:38.67,2:00:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卡车司机299号地方工会
Dialogue: 5,2:01:20.54,2:01:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}狗娘养的 他去死吧
Dialogue: 4,2:01:20.54,2:01:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Son of a bitch. Fuck him!
Dialogue: 5,2:01:23.13,2:01:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他事先在水门大厦
Dialogue: 4,2:01:23.13,2:01:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He had previously taped the locks
Dialogue: 5,2:01:25.59,2:01:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}大门的锁上贴了个胶带
Dialogue: 4,2:01:25.59,2:01:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}on the entry door of the basement of the Watergate...
Dialogue: 5,2:01:28.39,2:01:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你在看什么 -就...
Dialogue: 4,2:01:28.39,2:01:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- What are you looking at? - Uh, it's...
Dialogue: 5,2:01:31.08,2:01:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是大耳朵
Dialogue: 4,2:01:31.08,2:01:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's Big Ears.
Dialogue: 5,2:01:32.61,2:01:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}小埃弗雷特·霍华德·亨特
Dialogue: 4,2:01:32.61,2:01:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}前中情局探员
Dialogue: 5,2:01:32.68,2:01:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他注意到那个胶带被人撕掉了
Dialogue: 3,2:01:32.68,2:01:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He had noticed that the tape had been removed,
Dialogue: 5,2:01:36.47,2:01:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}于是他又重新贴了胶带
Dialogue: 3,2:01:36.47,2:01:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and he re-taped the door.
Dialogue: 5,2:01:39.68,2:01:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}大耳朵
Dialogue: 3,2:01:39.68,2:01:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Big Ears?
Dialogue: 5,2:01:41.12,2:01:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那是...
Dialogue: 4,2:01:41.12,2:01:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's, uh...
Dialogue: 5,2:01:42.26,2:01:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我很多年前认识的一个人
Dialogue: 4,2:01:42.26,2:01:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Somebody I met a long time ago. Just...
Dialogue: 5,2:01:46.54,2:01:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他的耳朵也没那么大啊
Dialogue: 4,2:01:46.54,2:01:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}His ears ain't so big.
Dialogue: 5,2:01:47.65,2:01:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那个时候 我就说 "收工吧"
Dialogue: 4,2:01:47.65,2:01:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...at that point, I said "Let us junk it,"
Dialogue: 5,2:01:50.82,2:01:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}也就是放弃行动
Dialogue: 4,2:01:50.82,2:01:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}meaning let us scrap the operation.
Dialogue: 5,2:01:52.85,2:01:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}利迪先生和麦考德先生私下谈了谈
Dialogue: 4,2:01:52.85,2:01:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Mr. Liddy and Mr. McCord talked between themselves
Dialogue: 5,2:01:56.74,2:01:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就做出了决定 继续行动
Dialogue: 4,2:01:56.74,2:01:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and the decision was made to go.
Dialogue: 5,2:01:59.80,2:02:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我当时觉得这很鲁莽...
Dialogue: 4,2:01:59.80,2:02:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I thought it was very foolhardy...
Dialogue: 5,2:02:01.18,2:02:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那么 在你看来 弗兰克·菲茨西蒙斯
Dialogue: 4,2:02:01.18,2:02:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So, Frank Fitzsimmons, in your opinion,
Dialogue: 5,2:02:02.90,2:02:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}媒体见面会 直播
Dialogue: 5,2:02:02.96,2:02:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}应该继续担任卡车司机工会的主席吗
Dialogue: 4,2:02:02.96,2:02:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}should he remain president of the Teamsters?
Dialogue: 5,2:02:05.45,2:02:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}绝对不能
Dialogue: 4,2:02:05.45,2:02:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 5,2:02:06.33,2:02:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}詹姆斯·霍法
Dialogue: 5,2:02:06.66,2:02:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克·菲茨西蒙斯已经将他的工会
Dialogue: 4,2:02:06.66,2:02:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank Fitzsimmons has sold his union out
Dialogue: 5,2:02:09.47,2:02:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卖给了他的黑社会朋友
Dialogue: 4,2:02:09.47,2:02:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to his underworld pals.
Dialogue: 5,2:02:11.45,2:02:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}黑帮控制着他
Dialogue: 4,2:02:11.45,2:02:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The mob controls him,
Dialogue: 5,2:02:13.18,2:02:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那意味着他们也控制着我们的养老金
Dialogue: 4,2:02:13.18,2:02:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}which means it controls our pension fund.
Dialogue: 5,2:02:15.67,2:02:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我说的是上十亿美元的低息或无息贷款
Dialogue: 4,2:02:15.67,2:02:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm talking about a billion dollars in low or no-interest loans
Dialogue: 5,2:02:19.59,2:02:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}都被他借给了已知的黑帮分子
Dialogue: 4,2:02:19.59,2:02:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}this man has given to known racketeers
Dialogue: 5,2:02:22.34,2:02:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}用到他们非法勾当中
Dialogue: 4,2:02:22.34,2:02:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}for their illegal enterprises.
Dialogue: 5,2:02:24.08,2:02:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}再也不可能了
Dialogue: 4,2:02:24.08,2:02:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 5,2:02:25.29,2:02:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}船将沉 老鼠该弃船而逃了
Dialogue: 4,2:02:25.29,2:02:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's time for the rats to abandon ship.
Dialogue: 5,2:02:28.80,2:02:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他是认真的吗
Dialogue: 4,2:02:28.80,2:02:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Is he serious?
Dialogue: 5,2:02:30.41,2:02:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米才不是认真的 这都是宣传手段
Dialogue: 4,2:02:30.41,2:02:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Not Jimmy. This is all publicity.
Dialogue: 5,2:02:32.58,2:02:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他在竞选公职 只是做做样子罢了
Dialogue: 4,2:02:32.58,2:02:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's running for office. He's putting on a show.
Dialogue: 5,2:02:34.68,2:02:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是啊 都是空口号 没有实质
Dialogue: 4,2:02:34.68,2:02:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, it's all puff. It's got no substance, nothing.
Dialogue: 5,2:02:37.44,2:02:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}或许他就是认真的
Dialogue: 4,2:02:37.44,2:02:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Maybe he means what he says.
Dialogue: 5,2:02:39.58,2:02:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-托尼 他在竞选 -罗素
Dialogue: 4,2:02:39.58,2:02:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Tony, he's campaigning. - Russ.
Dialogue: 5,2:02:42.08,2:02:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他可以信口开河
Dialogue: 4,2:02:42.08,2:02:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's liable to say any fucking thing.
Dialogue: 5,2:02:43.76,2:02:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我才不管他是不是在竞选
Dialogue: 4,2:02:43.76,2:02:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't care if he's campaigning.
Dialogue: 5,2:02:45.55,2:02:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他不能说这种话
Dialogue: 4,2:02:45.55,2:02:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He can't talk like that.
Dialogue: 5,2:02:47.02,2:02:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那可不好
Dialogue: 4,2:02:47.02,2:02:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's no fucking good.
Dialogue: 5,2:02:48.39,2:02:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我明白你的意思
Dialogue: 4,2:02:48.39,2:02:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I understand what you're saying.
Dialogue: 5,2:02:49.45,2:02:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道他该做什么吗 罗素
Dialogue: 4,2:02:49.45,2:02:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know what he should do, Russ?
Dialogue: 5,2:02:51.54,2:02:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他应该将他那一大笔养老金提现
Dialogue: 4,2:02:51.54,2:02:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He should cash in that big pension of his.
Dialogue: 5,2:02:53.89,2:02:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}多陪陪他的孙辈们
Dialogue: 4,2:02:53.89,2:02:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Spend more time with his grandchildren.
Dialogue: 5,2:02:56.86,2:02:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他有幸福美满的家庭 不是吗
Dialogue: 4,2:02:56.86,2:02:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He got a beautiful family, no?
Dialogue: 5,2:02:59.36,2:03:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是啊 是啊 没错
Dialogue: 4,2:02:59.36,2:03:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah. Yeah, yeah, right.
Dialogue: 5,2:03:00.63,2:03:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}或许他应该放轻松
Dialogue: 4,2:03:00.63,2:03:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Maybe he should relax.
Dialogue: 5,2:03:04.05,2:03:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}该让人给他传个话
Dialogue: 4,2:03:04.05,2:03:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Word should get back to him.
Dialogue: 5,2:03:10.27,2:03:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我 我只想说
Dialogue: 4,2:03:10.27,2:03:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I... I just wanna say...
Dialogue: 5,2:03:11.75,2:03:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不希望你误会我接下来的话
Dialogue: 4,2:03:11.75,2:03:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't want you to take this the wrong way.
Dialogue: 5,2:03:14.59,2:03:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我之前跟一些人在一起
Dialogue: 4,2:03:14.59,2:03:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But there I was with some people
Dialogue: 5,2:03:15.86,2:03:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你也知道是哪些人 他们说...
Dialogue: 4,2:03:15.86,2:03:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and they were saying, and you know who they are...
Dialogue: 5,2:03:17.80,2:03:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们说...
Dialogue: 4,2:03:17.80,2:03:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They were saying...
Dialogue: 5,2:03:20.49,2:03:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"请转告吉米我们爱他
Dialogue: 4,2:03:20.49,2:03:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"Please tell Jimmy we love the guy.
Dialogue: 5,2:03:23.48,2:03:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们并不想惹麻烦
Dialogue: 4,2:03:23.48,2:03:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We don't want any problem.
Dialogue: 5,2:03:26.10,2:03:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们只是认为他应该...
Dialogue: 4,2:03:26.10,2:03:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We just think that he should...
Dialogue: 5,2:03:28.90,2:03:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}享受陪伴孙辈的日子
Dialogue: 4,2:03:28.90,2:03:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}maybe enjoy his grandchildren,
Dialogue: 5,2:03:30.83,2:03:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}享受养老金 享受目前的生活"
Dialogue: 4,2:03:30.83,2:03:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}enjoy his pension, enjoy his life as is."
Dialogue: 5,2:03:33.29,2:03:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不用再说了 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,2:03:33.29,2:03:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Go no further, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,2:03:36.92,2:03:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是谁说的
Dialogue: 4,2:03:36.92,2:03:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Who said it?
Dialogue: 5,2:03:39.28,2:03:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-是谁说的并不重要 -当然重要
Dialogue: 4,2:03:39.28,2:03:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- It don't matter who said it. - Oh, it matters.
Dialogue: 5,2:03:42.02,2:03:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-是罗素吗 -不是
Dialogue: 4,2:03:42.02,2:03:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Was it Russell? - No.
Dialogue: 5,2:03:43.88,2:03:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}当然不是罗素
Dialogue: 4,2:03:43.88,2:03:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Of course it's not Russell.
Dialogue: 5,2:03:45.22,2:03:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是迈阿密那事儿的那个龟孙吗
Dialogue: 4,2:03:45.22,2:03:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's that little cocksucker from the Miami fiasco?
Dialogue: 5,2:03:48.79,2:03:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-不是吗 -不是
Dialogue: 4,2:03:48.79,2:03:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- No? - No.
Dialogue: 5,2:03:49.96,2:03:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不是他吗 真不是吗
Dialogue: 4,2:03:49.96,2:03:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Not him. No?
Dialogue: 5,2:03:51.80,2:03:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那是谁
Dialogue: 4,2:03:51.80,2:03:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Then who?
Dialogue: 5,2:03:55.40,2:03:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我还是告诉你吧
Dialogue: 4,2:03:55.40,2:03:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm gonna tell you.
Dialogue: 5,2:03:56.88,2:03:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是托尼
Dialogue: 4,2:03:56.88,2:03:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tony.
Dialogue: 5,2:03:58.60,2:03:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}托尼
Dialogue: 4,2:03:58.60,2:03:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tony?
Dialogue: 5,2:03:59.79,2:04:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}哪个托尼
Dialogue: 4,2:03:59.79,2:04:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Which Tony?
Dialogue: 5,2:04:01.12,2:04:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那么多人叫托尼
Dialogue: 4,2:04:01.12,2:04:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They're all named Tony.
Dialogue: 5,2:04:03.18,2:04:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}意大利人是怎么回事
Dialogue: 4,2:04:03.18,2:04:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, what's the matter with Italians?
Dialogue: 5,2:04:05.52,2:04:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们难道没别的名字取了吗
Dialogue: 4,2:04:05.52,2:04:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They can only think of one name.
Dialogue: 5,2:04:08.62,2:04:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}另一个托尼
Dialogue: 4,2:04:08.62,2:04:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The other Tony.
Dialogue: 5,2:04:11.61,2:04:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}哪个
Dialogue: 4,2:04:11.61,2:04:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What Tony?
Dialogue: 5,2:04:15.55,2:04:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}萨雷诺
Dialogue: 4,2:04:15.55,2:04:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Salerno.
Dialogue: 5,2:04:25.39,2:04:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我能说什么呢
Dialogue: 4,2:04:25.39,2:04:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, what can I say?
Dialogue: 5,2:04:29.02,2:04:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 我这是在帮你
Dialogue: 4,2:04:29.02,2:04:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy, I'm trying to help you.
Dialogue: 5,2:04:30.28,2:04:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-让你明白一些事 -我知道
Dialogue: 4,2:04:30.28,2:04:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I'm trying to tell you something. - I know you are.
Dialogue: 5,2:04:32.94,2:04:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克 想都别想
Dialogue: 4,2:04:32.94,2:04:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank, don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 5,2:04:35.83,2:04:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我向来是有话直说
Dialogue: 4,2:04:35.83,2:04:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't keep my mouth shut...
Dialogue: 5,2:04:37.41,2:04:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我知道 -对谁都是如此
Dialogue: 4,2:04:37.41,2:04:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I know that. - ...for anyone.
Dialogue: 5,2:04:38.87,2:04:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知你知 但他们不知道
Dialogue: 4,2:04:38.87,2:04:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know that, you know that, they don't know that.
Dialogue: 5,2:04:44.10,2:04:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这就是我的为人本性 我也不会做出任何改变
Dialogue: 4,2:04:44.10,2:04:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's who I am, that's what I am and that's what I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 5,2:04:49.27,2:04:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}可以找人转告他了
Dialogue: 4,2:04:49.27,2:04:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Somebody can tell him that.
Dialogue: 5,2:04:50.89,2:04:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他这么说了
Dialogue: 4,2:04:50.89,2:04:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He said that?
Dialogue: 5,2:04:53.00,2:04:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我只说了个大概 你懂的
Dialogue: 4,2:04:53.00,2:04:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}In so many words, you know.
Dialogue: 5,2:04:54.67,2:04:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那他在口出狂言之前
Dialogue: 4,2:04:54.67,2:04:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, before he says something like that,
Dialogue: 5,2:04:56.34,2:04:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就应该想到乔·加洛
Dialogue: 4,2:04:56.34,2:04:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he should remember that Joe Gallo liked to make
Dialogue: 5,2:04:58.10,2:04:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}也是老管不住自己的嘴巴
Dialogue: 4,2:04:58.10,2:04:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}a lot of fucking noise, too.
Dialogue: 5,2:04:59.81,2:05:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}找个人转告他吧
Dialogue: 4,2:04:59.81,2:05:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Somebody should tell him that.
Dialogue: 5,2:05:01.44,2:05:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}又是谁说的
Dialogue: 4,2:05:01.44,2:05:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Who said?
Dialogue: 5,2:05:04.23,2:05:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-托尼 -他说的
Dialogue: 4,2:05:04.23,2:05:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Tony. - He said that?
Dialogue: 5,2:05:06.31,2:05:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}行了 我决定了
Dialogue: 4,2:05:06.31,2:05:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's it. That does it.
Dialogue: 5,2:05:09.56,2:05:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我到死都不会退休
Dialogue: 4,2:05:09.56,2:05:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm never gonna retire now.
Dialogue: 5,2:05:12.56,2:05:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}找个人转告他吧
Dialogue: 4,2:05:12.56,2:05:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Somebody can tell him that.
Dialogue: 5,2:05:13.77,2:05:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 我跟他说了 说了不知道多少遍
Dialogue: 4,2:05:13.77,2:05:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy, I did tell him. I told him over and over.
Dialogue: 5,2:05:16.02,2:05:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那这样 你跟他说别再传来传去了
Dialogue: 4,2:05:16.02,2:05:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All right, you told him. Let's stop this, then.
Dialogue: 5,2:05:17.93,2:05:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}算了吧 不谈了
Dialogue: 4,2:05:17.93,2:05:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Forget it. Enough.
Dialogue: 5,2:05:20.48,2:05:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}让我好好享用我的冰淇淋
Dialogue: 4,2:05:20.48,2:05:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Let me enjoy my ice cream here.
Dialogue: 5,2:05:27.81,2:05:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}怎么了
Dialogue: 4,2:05:27.81,2:05:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 5,2:05:29.44,2:05:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没事
Dialogue: 4,2:05:29.44,2:05:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Nothing.
Dialogue: 5,2:05:31.10,2:05:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}说啊
Dialogue: 4,2:05:31.10,2:05:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What?
Dialogue: 5,2:05:31.77,2:05:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-真没事 -怎么可能没事
Dialogue: 4,2:05:31.77,2:05:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Nothing. - What do you mean, nothing?
Dialogue: 5,2:05:33.02,2:05:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你想说什么 告诉我
Dialogue: 4,2:05:33.02,2:05:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Come on, you're thinking something. What?
Dialogue: 5,2:05:35.31,2:05:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我只是...
Dialogue: 4,2:05:35.31,2:05:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I just...
Dialogue: 5,2:05:38.31,2:05:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}怎么了 说啊 别扭扭捏捏的
Dialogue: 4,2:05:38.31,2:05:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What? Come on. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 5,2:05:39.69,2:05:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-现在说不太合适 -你什么意思
Dialogue: 4,2:05:39.69,2:05:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- It ain't the right time. - What do you mean it ain't the right time?
Dialogue: 5,2:05:42.15,2:05:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}现在就很合适 什么时候说都合适
Dialogue: 4,2:05:42.15,2:05:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It is the right time. What isn't the right time?
Dialogue: 5,2:05:43.90,2:05:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}快说
Dialogue: 4,2:05:43.90,2:05:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Say it.
