Dialogue: 4,2:05:49.02,2:05:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}a testimonial dinner for me and...
Dialogue: 5,2:05:51.27,2:05:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}给你的答谢晚宴 那很好啊
Dialogue: 4,2:05:51.27,2:05:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A testimonial dinner for you, that's good.
Dialogue: 5,2:05:53.40,2:05:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是的 不过之后有...
Dialogue: 4,2:05:53.40,2:05:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah. But later... Later, when...
Dialogue: 5,2:05:56.27,2:05:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你想说什么
Dialogue: 4,2:05:56.27,2:05:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 5,2:06:01.90,2:06:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我打算问你愿不愿意
Dialogue: 4,2:06:01.90,2:06:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I was gonna ask you if you would...
Dialogue: 5,2:06:04.23,2:06:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}为我颁奖
Dialogue: 4,2:06:04.23,2:06:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}present the award to me.
Dialogue: 5,2:06:07.35,2:06:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这个嘛
Dialogue: 4,2:06:07.35,2:06:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well...
Dialogue: 5,2:06:09.19,2:06:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有心了 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,2:06:09.19,2:06:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's nice of you, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,2:06:10.85,2:06:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}真的 你能想起我真好
Dialogue: 4,2:06:10.85,2:06:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Really. That's nice of you. And, you know...
Dialogue: 5,2:06:13.65,2:06:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还有谁会参加
Dialogue: 4,2:06:13.65,2:06:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Who's gonna be there?
Dialogue: 5,2:06:15.98,2:06:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}都会来
