Dialogue: 5,2:06:17.01,2:06:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是一大群叫托尼的吗
Dialogue: 4,2:06:17.01,2:06:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tony, Tony, Tony, Tony, and Tony, huh?
