Dialogue: 4,2:06:23.15,2:06:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Everybody from Downtown.
Dialogue: 5,2:06:25.69,2:06:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}算了 还是不太好 到时候所有人都会来
Dialogue: 4,2:06:25.69,2:06:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Nah. Nah, it ain't a good idea. Everybody's gonna be there.
Dialogue: 5,2:06:28.06,2:06:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你会不自在的
Dialogue: 4,2:06:28.06,2:06:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}People... You're gonna be uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 5,2:06:30.69,2:06:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我才不管谁去谁不去
Dialogue: 4,2:06:30.69,2:06:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't give a fuck who's there.
Dialogue: 5,2:06:34.19,2:06:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}难道那群狗杂种在
Dialogue: 4,2:06:34.19,2:06:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We gonna let those cocksuckers
Dialogue: 5,2:06:35.48,2:06:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我就不能出席你的重大晚宴了吗 休想
Dialogue: 4,2:06:35.48,2:06:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}keep me from your big night? There's no way.
Dialogue: 5,2:06:39.02,2:06:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不可能
Dialogue: 4,2:06:39.02,2:06:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No.
Dialogue: 5,2:06:40.31,2:06:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我会去的 而且是我荣幸之至
Dialogue: 4,2:06:40.31,2:06:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm gonna be there. And I'll be honored to be there.
Dialogue: 5,2:06:43.90,2:06:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你当之无愧
Dialogue: 4,2:06:43.90,2:06:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You deserve this.
Dialogue: 5,2:06:45.27,2:06:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-谢谢你 吉米 -没事
Dialogue: 4,2:06:45.27,2:06:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Thank you, Jimmy. Thank you. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,2:06:50.43,2:06:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-看那个内奸迪恩 -是啊
Dialogue: 4,2:06:50.43,2:06:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- That mole Dean. - Yeah.
