Dialogue: 5,2:07:32.15,2:07:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}屋顶工工会主席
Dialogue: 3,2:07:32.15,2:07:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}约翰·麦卡洛
Dialogue: 2,2:07:32.15,2:07:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}1980年在自家厨房头中六枪身亡
Dialogue: 5,2:07:32.19,2:07:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}代理商 地方工会主席
Dialogue: 4,2:07:32.19,2:07:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}business agents, local presidents,
Dialogue: 5,2:07:35.06,2:07:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}联合委员会主席 以及区域受托人等等
Dialogue: 4,2:07:35.06,2:07:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}joint committee chairmen, and regional trustees,
Dialogue: 5,2:07:38.85,2:07:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}今晚到场的都是弗兰克的好友
Dialogue: 4,2:07:38.85,2:07:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}we are all friends of Frank's tonight.
Dialogue: 5,2:07:43.15,2:07:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克的好友
Dialogue: 4,2:07:43.15,2:07:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Friends of Frank.
Dialogue: 5,2:07:46.56,2:07:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}比如全国有色人种协进会主席塞西尔·摩尔
Dialogue: 4,2:07:46.56,2:07:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Like NAACP president Cecil Moore.
Dialogue: 5,2:07:50.73,2:07:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}地方检察官艾米特·菲茨帕特里克
Dialogue: 4,2:07:50.73,2:07:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}District Attorney Emmett Fitzpatrick.
Dialogue: 5,2:07:54.23,2:07:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}费城市长弗兰克·里佐
Dialogue: 4,2:07:54.23,2:07:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Philadelphia mayor Frank Rizzo.
Dialogue: 5,2:07:58.60,2:08:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们都喜欢你呢 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,2:07:58.60,2:08:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hey, they like you, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,2:08:00.48,2:08:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}当然 还有我们的特邀发言人
Dialogue: 4,2:08:00.48,2:08:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And, of course, our featured speaker,
Dialogue: 5,2:08:02.85,2:08:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}詹姆斯·里德尔·霍法
Dialogue: 4,2:08:02.85,2:08:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}James Riddell Hoffa.
Dialogue: 5,2:08:12.02,2:08:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}同时呢 在外面的树上
Dialogue: 4,2:08:12.02,2:08:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And meanwhile, outside in the trees,
Dialogue: 5,2:08:14.69,2:08:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还藏着联调局的人
Dialogue: 4,2:08:14.69,2:08:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}we got the FBI.
Dialogue: 5,2:08:17.81,2:08:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有谁要去看看吗
Dialogue: 4,2:08:17.81,2:08:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Somebody wanna check on them?
Dialogue: 5,2:08:20.94,2:08:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我来分享一下我第一次见到弗兰克时的场景吧
Dialogue: 4,2:08:20.94,2:08:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Now, let me tell you about the first time I met Frank.
Dialogue: 5,2:08:23.10,2:08:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他带我去吃牛排晚餐
Dialogue: 4,2:08:23.10,2:08:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He took me out to a steak dinner,
Dialogue: 5,2:08:25.23,2:08:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他问我说 "你的牛排要几分熟"
Dialogue: 4,2:08:25.23,2:08:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and he asked me, he said, "How do you like your steak?"
Dialogue: 5,2:08:27.31,2:08:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我说"我喜欢一分熟" 他说"我也是"
Dialogue: 4,2:08:27.31,2:08:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I said, "I like it rare." He said, "Me too."
Dialogue: 5,2:08:29.06,2:08:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}然后就开始上牛排了 我的是一分熟
Dialogue: 4,2:08:29.06,2:08:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, they bring out the steaks. Mine's rare.
Dialogue: 5,2:08:31.60,2:08:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克的那份正从厨房里走出来
Dialogue: 4,2:08:31.60,2:08:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank's was still walking from the kitchen.
Dialogue: 5,2:08:35.56,2:08:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他转身对我说 "其实吧
Dialogue: 4,2:08:35.56,2:08:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He turns to me, he said, "Well, you know,
Dialogue: 5,2:08:37.48,2:08:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我喜欢动物 我不想杀生"
Dialogue: 4,2:08:37.48,2:08:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm an animal lover. I don't wanna hurt it."
Dialogue: 5,2:08:41.65,2:08:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他居然喜欢动物
Dialogue: 4,2:08:41.65,2:08:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's an animal lover.
Dialogue: 5,2:09:07.06,2:09:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这家伙连主席都没当上
Dialogue: 4,2:09:07.06,2:09:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This guy is not even the goddamn president
Dialogue: 5,2:09:09.15,2:09:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就在拖延别人的贷款了
Dialogue: 4,2:09:09.15,2:09:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and he's holding up people's loans.
Dialogue: 5,2:09:11.98,2:09:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你确定吗 -我确定
Dialogue: 4,2:09:11.98,2:09:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Are you sure? - I'm sure.
Dialogue: 5,2:09:14.35,2:09:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他是怎么办到的
Dialogue: 4,2:09:14.35,2:09:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And how's he supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 5,2:09:15.35,2:09:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为他的手下拖延了
Dialogue: 4,2:09:15.35,2:09:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Because his guys are holding 'em back loans
Dialogue: 5,2:09:16.94,2:09:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卡洛斯在新奥尔良建新酒店的钱
Dialogue: 4,2:09:16.94,2:09:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}on Carlos's new hotel in New Orleans,
Dialogue: 5,2:09:18.98,2:09:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们在凯撒酒店扩建的钱
Dialogue: 4,2:09:18.98,2:09:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the add-on that we're doing at Caesars.
Dialogue: 5,2:09:25.65,2:09:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-菲茨都在做些什么 -菲茨吗
Dialogue: 4,2:09:25.65,2:09:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- And what's Fitz doing all this time? - Fitz?
Dialogue: 5,2:09:27.98,2:09:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是啊 这事应该他管的
Dialogue: 4,2:09:27.98,2:09:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, he's supposed to help with this shit.
Dialogue: 5,2:09:29.94,2:09:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}钱是养老基金的受托人出的
Dialogue: 4,2:09:29.94,2:09:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The money comes from the Pension Fund trustees.
Dialogue: 5,2:09:32.31,2:09:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们应该要签字同意
Dialogue: 4,2:09:32.31,2:09:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They gotta sign off on it.
Dialogue: 5,2:09:33.65,2:09:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们本应该听菲茨的安排开绿灯
Dialogue: 4,2:09:33.65,2:09:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They're supposed to be rubber-stamping what Fitz says.
Dialogue: 5,2:09:35.90,2:09:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-没错 -只是吉米
Dialogue: 4,2:09:35.90,2:09:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Right, right. Yeah. - Except Jimmy
Dialogue: 5,2:09:38.19,2:09:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}让其中几位拒绝开绿灯了
Dialogue: 4,2:09:38.19,2:09:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}has a couple of them to stop rubber-stamping.
Dialogue: 5,2:09:42.65,2:09:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这个王八蛋
Dialogue: 4,2:09:42.65,2:09:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 5,2:09:44.73,2:09:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我以为已经处理好了
Dialogue: 4,2:09:44.73,2:09:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I thought we took care of that.
Dialogue: 5,2:09:47.52,2:09:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道他怎么跟人说的吗
Dialogue: 4,2:09:47.52,2:09:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know what he told somebody?
Dialogue: 5,2:09:48.85,2:09:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他说一旦菲茨下位 他成功上台
Dialogue: 4,2:09:48.85,2:09:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He goes, once Fitz is out and he's in,
Dialogue: 5,2:09:50.85,2:09:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他就要收回以前的债款
Dialogue: 4,2:09:50.85,2:09:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he's gonna call in the old loans.
Dialogue: 5,2:09:53.23,2:09:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}酒店 赌场 房地产之类的
Dialogue: 4,2:09:53.23,2:09:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hotels, casinos, real estate, no matter what it is.
Dialogue: 5,2:09:56.77,2:09:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}而且你要是没有马上连本带利还钱给他
Dialogue: 4,2:09:56.77,2:09:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And if you don't have his money and interest in two seconds,
Dialogue: 5,2:09:59.19,2:10:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他就要全部接管
Dialogue: 4,2:09:59.19,2:10:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he's taking 'em over.
Dialogue: 5,2:10:01.02,2:10:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不能让他得逞
Dialogue: 4,2:10:01.02,2:10:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We can't have that.
Dialogue: 5,2:10:04.69,2:10:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-这是他说的 -是他说的
Dialogue: 4,2:10:04.69,2:10:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- He said that? - He said that.
Dialogue: 5,2:10:06.77,2:10:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你确定这是他的原话吗 托尼
Dialogue: 4,2:10:06.77,2:10:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You sure he said that, Tony?
Dialogue: 5,2:10:08.35,2:10:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是他的原话
Dialogue: 4,2:10:08.35,2:10:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He said that.
Dialogue: 5,2:10:09.81,2:10:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我跟你说的这些全都是他的原话
Dialogue: 4,2:10:09.81,2:10:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Everything I'm telling you, yeah, he said.
Dialogue: 5,2:10:11.90,2:10:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他以为他是谁啊 卡斯特罗吗
Dialogue: 4,2:10:11.90,2:10:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, who does he think he is? Castro?
Dialogue: 5,2:10:17.52,2:10:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 就是现在 ♪
Dialogue: 4,2:10:17.52,2:10:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ The time is now ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:10:19.90,2:10:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 一同起立欢呼 ♪
Dialogue: 4,2:10:19.90,2:10:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ The time to stand and cheer ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:10:22.31,2:10:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 因为留下的都是美好时光 ♪
Dialogue: 4,2:10:22.31,2:10:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 'Cause better times are here to stay ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:10:26.27,2:10:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 昨日已远去 ♪
Dialogue: 4,2:10:26.27,2:10:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Oh, yesterday is over ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:10:28.98,2:10:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 明日要到来 ♪
Dialogue: 4,2:10:28.98,2:10:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Tomorrow's on its way ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:10:31.19,2:10:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 但快来看看今天有什么在等待着你 ♪
Dialogue: 4,2:10:31.19,2:10:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ But look what's new and made for you today ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:10:36.23,2:10:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 今天 ♪
Dialogue: 4,2:10:36.23,2:10:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Today ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:10:39.35,2:10:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你要的不是钱吧
Dialogue: 4,2:10:39.35,2:10:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You don't need money, do you?
Dialogue: 5,2:10:40.77,2:10:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}与钱无关
Dialogue: 4,2:10:40.77,2:10:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's not about money.
Dialogue: 5,2:10:42.77,2:10:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如果不是为了钱
Dialogue: 4,2:10:42.77,2:10:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If it's not about money,
Dialogue: 5,2:10:43.81,2:10:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那我就真的有点搞不懂了
Dialogue: 4,2:10:43.81,2:10:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}then I'm really having trouble understanding,
Dialogue: 5,2:10:45.77,2:10:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们谈了那么久到底是为了什么
Dialogue: 4,2:10:45.77,2:10:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}because I don't know what all the talk is about.
Dialogue: 5,2:10:48.48,2:10:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是我的工会
Dialogue: 4,2:10:48.48,2:10:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's my union.
Dialogue: 5,2:10:50.90,2:10:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-这很难理解吗 -不是
Dialogue: 4,2:10:50.90,2:10:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Is that hard to understand? - No, no.
Dialogue: 5,2:10:52.85,2:10:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是你的工会 没问题 永远都是你的工会
Dialogue: 4,2:10:52.85,2:10:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's your union, that's right. It'll always be your union.
Dialogue: 5,2:10:55.40,2:10:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你完全可以下台在幕后管理
Dialogue: 4,2:10:55.40,2:10:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You could step down and still run it.
Dialogue: 5,2:10:56.98,2:10:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我才不会下台 -你这话什么意思
Dialogue: 4,2:10:56.98,2:10:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- No, you don't step down. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 5,2:10:59.19,2:11:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素 下台是管不了工会的
Dialogue: 4,2:10:59.19,2:11:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Russ, you don't step down to run a union.
Dialogue: 5,2:11:01.23,2:11:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}下台是直接进坟墓
Dialogue: 4,2:11:01.23,2:11:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You step down to go to your grave.
Dialogue: 5,2:11:03.27,2:11:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}听好了
Dialogue: 4,2:11:03.27,2:11:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, listen.
Dialogue: 5,2:11:05.40,2:11:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我还是在想...不好意思
Dialogue: 4,2:11:05.40,2:11:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I still think... I can't help but think, I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 5,2:11:08.15,2:11:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你这么迫切是出于什么其他理由吗
Dialogue: 4,2:11:08.15,2:11:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but is there another reason or something?
Dialogue: 5,2:11:10.48,2:11:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是我的工会 "其他理由"又是什么意思
Dialogue: 4,2:11:10.48,2:11:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is my union! What do you mean, "another reason"?
Dialogue: 5,2:11:14.65,2:11:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是我的工会
Dialogue: 4,2:11:14.65,2:11:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is my union.
Dialogue: 5,2:11:16.23,2:11:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好吗 你先明确好这一点
Dialogue: 4,2:11:16.23,2:11:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All right? Let's start with that
Dialogue: 5,2:11:17.94,2:11:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}再去弄清楚别的事情
Dialogue: 4,2:11:17.94,2:11:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and then try to understand things.
Dialogue: 5,2:11:19.85,2:11:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}听我说 有人
Dialogue: 4,2:11:19.85,2:11:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Listen, some people,
Dialogue: 5,2:11:22.35,2:11:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不是我 但有人
Dialogue: 4,2:11:22.35,2:11:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}not me, but some people,
Dialogue: 5,2:11:25.85,2:11:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们有点顾虑
Dialogue: 4,2:11:25.85,2:11:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}they're a little concerned.
Dialogue: 5,2:11:28.02,2:11:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有人 不是我 他们觉得你可能...
Dialogue: 4,2:11:28.02,2:11:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Some people, not me, they think that you might...
Dialogue: 5,2:11:31.81,2:11:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我可能什么
Dialogue: 4,2:11:31.81,2:11:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I might...
Dialogue: 5,2:11:32.77,2:11:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你可能没有表达出应有的感激之举
Dialogue: 4,2:11:32.77,2:11:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You might be demonstrating a failure to show appreciation.
Dialogue: 5,2:11:39.44,2:11:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我没有表现出感激
Dialogue: 4,2:11:39.44,2:11:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm not showing appreciation?
Dialogue: 5,2:11:41.81,2:11:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有人是这么说的
Dialogue: 4,2:11:41.81,2:11:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}According to, you know, some people.
Dialogue: 5,2:11:43.90,2:11:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我蹲了五年牢房
Dialogue: 4,2:11:43.90,2:11:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I went to school for five fucking years.
Dialogue: 5,2:11:46.98,2:11:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我知道 -整整五年
Dialogue: 4,2:11:46.98,2:11:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Yes, you did. - Five fucking years.
Dialogue: 5,2:11:50.94,2:11:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我没有供出任何一个人
Dialogue: 4,2:11:50.94,2:11:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I didn't name one fucking name.
Dialogue: 5,2:11:52.85,2:11:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你做得对 -我做得对
Dialogue: 4,2:11:52.85,2:11:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- You did the right thing. - I did the right thing.
Dialogue: 5,2:11:54.65,2:11:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你做得很对
Dialogue: 4,2:11:54.65,2:11:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You did the right thing.
Dialogue: 5,2:11:55.73,2:11:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我每天都要跟那个
Dialogue: 4,2:11:55.73,2:11:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I sat there every day with that
Dialogue: 5,2:11:57.65,2:12:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}爱发牢骚的新泽西狗杂种坐在一起
Dialogue: 4,2:11:57.65,2:12:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}whining cocksucker from New Jersey,
Dialogue: 5,2:12:01.10,2:12:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}听他说有他多么不幸 有多困难
Dialogue: 4,2:12:01.10,2:12:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}talking to me about his woes, his problems,
Dialogue: 5,2:12:05.31,2:12:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}而我只是想安安静静地吃个冰淇淋
Dialogue: 4,2:12:05.31,2:12:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and all I wanted to do was finish my ice cream in peace.
Dialogue: 5,2:12:09.52,2:12:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这个狗杂种开会迟到了十五分钟
Dialogue: 4,2:12:09.52,2:12:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This cocksucker shows up at a meeting 15 minutes late,
Dialogue: 5,2:12:14.77,2:12:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还穿着他妈的短裤
Dialogue: 4,2:12:14.77,2:12:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}wearing fucking shorts!
Dialogue: 5,2:12:17.48,2:12:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-谁会穿短裤去开会 -谁都不会
Dialogue: 4,2:12:17.48,2:12:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Who wears shorts to a meeting? - Nobody.
Dialogue: 5,2:12:20.02,2:12:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-没错 -没人会这么做
Dialogue: 4,2:12:20.02,2:12:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- That's right. - Nobody.
Dialogue: 5,2:12:22.44,2:12:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还说我没有表示感激
Dialogue: 4,2:12:22.44,2:12:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm not showing appreciation?
Dialogue: 5,2:12:24.19,2:12:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不是我说的
Dialogue: 4,2:12:24.19,2:12:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's not me.
Dialogue: 5,2:12:25.73,2:12:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是有人这么说
Dialogue: 4,2:12:25.73,2:12:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}According to some people...
Dialogue: 5,2:12:26.81,2:12:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道不是你 是另有他人
Dialogue: 4,2:12:26.81,2:12:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, I know it's not you. Some people...
Dialogue: 5,2:12:29.60,2:12:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}另有他人说我没有表示感激
Dialogue: 4,2:12:29.60,2:12:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Some people say I'm not showing appreciation?
Dialogue: 5,2:12:32.02,2:12:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那就去他们的吧
Dialogue: 4,2:12:32.02,2:12:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, then fuck them.
Dialogue: 5,2:12:34.23,2:12:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我这是在帮你 吉米
Dialogue: 4,2:12:34.23,2:12:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm trying to help you, Jim.
Dialogue: 5,2:12:35.77,2:12:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道
Dialogue: 4,2:12:35.77,2:12:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know you are.
Dialogue: 5,2:12:37.56,2:12:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但是谁都别想威胁霍法
Dialogue: 4,2:12:37.56,2:12:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But nobody threatens Hoffa.
Dialogue: 5,2:12:39.35,2:12:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 就是现在 ♪
Dialogue: 4,2:12:39.35,2:12:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ The time is now ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:12:41.69,2:12:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 就是当下 ♪
Dialogue: 4,2:12:41.69,2:12:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ The time is now ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:12:44.06,2:12:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 就是此刻 ♪
Dialogue: 4,2:12:44.06,2:12:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ The time is now ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:13:01.65,2:13:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他当过司机
Dialogue: 4,2:13:01.65,2:13:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He has done it as a driver,
Dialogue: 5,2:13:03.65,2:13:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}当过工会组织者
Dialogue: 4,2:13:03.65,2:13:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he has done it as an organizer,
Dialogue: 5,2:13:06.10,2:13:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还有可能在场的大多数来宾都不知道
Dialogue: 4,2:13:06.10,2:13:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and I don't think many of you here know this,
Dialogue: 5,2:13:08.94,2:13:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克手握一项记录
Dialogue: 4,2:13:08.94,2:13:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but Frank holds a record.
Dialogue: 5,2:13:12.40,2:13:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在罢工纠察线上被逮捕次数最多的人
Dialogue: 4,2:13:12.40,2:13:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's most arrests on the picket line.
Dialogue: 5,2:13:17.69,2:13:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一天内26次
Dialogue: 4,2:13:17.69,2:13:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Twenty-six times in 24 hours,
Dialogue: 5,2:13:22.14,2:13:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}打破了我的记录
Dialogue: 4,2:13:22.14,2:13:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}beating my record.
Dialogue: 5,2:13:26.35,2:13:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没错 女士们先生们 我没有夸大其词
Dialogue: 4,2:13:26.35,2:13:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There it is, ladies and gentlemen. There's no exaggeration.
Dialogue: 5,2:13:30.98,2:13:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他是彻头彻尾的工会人
Dialogue: 4,2:13:30.98,2:13:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He is a union man to his bones.
Dialogue: 5,2:13:35.56,2:13:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们选择站在哪一边
Dialogue: 4,2:13:35.56,2:13:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Which side are you on?
Dialogue: 5,2:13:37.35,2:13:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你这边
Dialogue: 4,2:13:37.35,2:13:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Your side!
Dialogue: 5,2:13:38.73,2:13:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}哪一边
Dialogue: 4,2:13:38.73,2:13:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Whose side?
Dialogue: 5,2:13:39.81,2:13:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你这边
Dialogue: 4,2:13:39.81,2:13:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Your side!
Dialogue: 5,2:13:41.02,2:13:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我这边
Dialogue: 4,2:13:41.02,2:13:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}My side.
Dialogue: 5,2:13:41.85,2:13:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你这边
Dialogue: 4,2:13:41.85,2:13:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Your side.
Dialogue: 5,2:13:42.98,2:13:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-他那边 -没错
Dialogue: 4,2:13:42.98,2:13:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- His side. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 5,2:13:45.10,2:13:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就是这样
Dialogue: 4,2:13:45.10,2:13:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There it is.
Dialogue: 5,2:13:46.77,2:13:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所以今晚我很荣幸在这里
Dialogue: 4,2:13:46.77,2:13:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And so, it is an honor for me to be here tonight
Dialogue: 5,2:13:50.77,2:13:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}将这份奖
Dialogue: 4,2:13:50.77,2:13:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to present this award
Dialogue: 5,2:13:52.44,2:13:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}颁给我亲爱的朋友 弗兰克·希兰先生
Dialogue: 4,2:13:52.44,2:13:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to my dear friend, Mr. Frank Sheeran!
Dialogue: 5,2:14:06.23,2:14:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谢谢你 吉米 非常感谢
Dialogue: 4,2:14:06.23,2:14:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Thank you, Jimmy, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 5,2:14:09.40,2:14:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}也谢谢我亲爱的妻子琳妮
Dialogue: 4,2:14:09.40,2:14:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And thank you to my lovely wife Reenie
Dialogue: 5,2:14:12.40,2:14:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}陪我来这里
Dialogue: 4,2:14:12.40,2:14:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}for being here with me.
Dialogue: 5,2:14:14.69,2:14:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}感谢我甜美可爱的女儿们
Dialogue: 4,2:14:14.69,2:14:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}My lovely, sweet, adorable daughters,
Dialogue: 5,2:14:17.31,2:14:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}玛丽安 多洛莉丝 康妮 佩琪
Dialogue: 4,2:14:17.31,2:14:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Maryanne, Dolores, Connie, Peggy,
Dialogue: 5,2:14:21.52,2:14:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这么多年一直容忍我
Dialogue: 4,2:14:21.52,2:14:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}for putting up with me for all these years.
Dialogue: 5,2:14:25.90,2:14:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还有吉米 我无法表达你给我颁发这份荣誉
Dialogue: 4,2:14:25.90,2:14:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And, Jimmy, I can't tell you what this means to me
Dialogue: 5,2:14:28.60,2:14:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对我意义多么重大
Dialogue: 4,2:14:28.60,2:14:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to get this honor from you.
Dialogue: 5,2:14:31.02,2:14:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我人生最重要的时刻 非常非常感谢你
Dialogue: 4,2:14:31.02,2:14:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's the highlight of my life. Thank you very, very much.
Dialogue: 5,2:14:34.56,2:14:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这个人 詹姆斯·里德尔·霍法
Dialogue: 4,2:14:34.56,2:14:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And this man, James Riddell Hoffa,
Dialogue: 5,2:14:38.19,2:14:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是最能成事的人
Dialogue: 4,2:14:38.19,2:14:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}is the guy that gets the job done.
Dialogue: 5,2:14:43.10,2:14:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我就在你身后 吉米
Dialogue: 4,2:14:43.10,2:14:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm behind you, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,2:14:44.77,2:14:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一路随行
Dialogue: 4,2:14:44.77,2:14:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All the way.
Dialogue: 5,2:14:47.81,2:14:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}总之
Dialogue: 4,2:14:47.81,2:14:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}In any case,
Dialogue: 5,2:14:48.85,2:14:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我衷心感谢你们所有人
Dialogue: 4,2:14:48.85,2:14:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}from the deepest part of my heart, I thank you all.
Dialogue: 5,2:14:51.40,2:14:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我并不该获得这一切
Dialogue: 4,2:14:51.40,2:14:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}'Cause I don't really deserve all this.
Dialogue: 5,2:14:54.27,2:14:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我得了滑囊炎 我也不该得那个
Dialogue: 4,2:14:54.27,2:14:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But I have bursitis and I don't deserve that either.
Dialogue: 5,2:14:58.77,2:15:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}今晚感谢你们所有人 感谢前来
Dialogue: 4,2:14:58.77,2:15:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Thank you all tonight and thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 5,2:15:01.44,2:15:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}晚安
Dialogue: 4,2:15:01.44,2:15:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Good night.
Dialogue: 5,2:15:13.65,2:15:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}怎么不喊"说茄子"
Dialogue: 4,2:15:13.65,2:15:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What happened to "Say cheese"?
Dialogue: 5,2:15:15.98,2:15:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}茄子
Dialogue: 4,2:15:15.98,2:15:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Cheese!
Dialogue: 5,2:15:21.40,2:15:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 让我的爱盈满你的心 ♪
Dialogue: 4,2:15:21.40,2:15:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Bringing you all the love your heart can hold ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:15:30.27,2:15:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 请说"我愿意" ♪
Dialogue: 4,2:15:30.27,2:15:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Please say "sí, sí" ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:15:39.31,2:15:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 说你及你那西班牙眼眸会为我等待 ♪
Dialogue: 4,2:15:39.31,2:15:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Say you and your Spanish eyes will wait for me ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:15:49.77,2:15:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 蓝色的西班牙眼眸 ♪
Dialogue: 4,2:15:49.77,2:15:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Blue Spanish eyes ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:15:59.35,2:16:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 墨西哥最美的双眼 ♪
Dialogue: 4,2:15:59.35,2:16:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Prettiest eyes in all of Mexico ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:16:08.90,2:16:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 真诚的西班牙眼眸 ♪
Dialogue: 4,2:16:08.90,2:16:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ True Spanish eyes ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:16:18.40,2:16:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 请在我离开前再为我展开笑颜 ♪
Dialogue: 4,2:16:18.40,2:16:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Please smile for me once more before I go... ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:16:32.56,2:16:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}世上只有三个人有这个
Dialogue: 4,2:16:32.56,2:16:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Only three people in the world have one of these.
Dialogue: 5,2:16:35.48,2:16:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}其中只有一人是爱尔兰人
Dialogue: 4,2:16:35.48,2:16:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And only one of them is Irish.
Dialogue: 5,2:16:37.90,2:16:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我有一枚
Dialogue: 4,2:16:37.90,2:16:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I have one.
Dialogue: 5,2:16:39.31,2:16:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}安吉洛有一枚
Dialogue: 4,2:16:39.31,2:16:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Angelo has one.
Dialogue: 5,2:16:43.27,2:16:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}现在你也有了
Dialogue: 4,2:16:43.27,2:16:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Now you have one.
Dialogue: 5,2:16:49.19,2:16:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}真漂亮
Dialogue: 4,2:16:49.19,2:16:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is beautiful.
Dialogue: 5,2:16:54.40,2:16:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不知道该说什么 罗素 这...
Dialogue: 4,2:16:54.40,2:16:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I... I don't... I don't know what to say, Russ. It's...
Dialogue: 5,2:16:58.10,2:17:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}快戴上 看看怎么样
Dialogue: 4,2:16:58.10,2:17:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Slip it on. See how it looks.
Dialogue: 5,2:17:04.35,2:17:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-感觉好吗 -好
Dialogue: 4,2:17:04.35,2:17:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Feel good? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,2:17:07.98,2:17:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道我让你变得多强吗 知道多强吗
Dialogue: 4,2:17:07.98,2:17:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know how strong I made you? You know how strong?
Dialogue: 5,2:17:12.65,2:17:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你是我的小子
Dialogue: 4,2:17:12.65,2:17:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're my kid.
Dialogue: 5,2:17:14.98,2:17:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没人...没人能搞你
Dialogue: 4,2:17:14.98,2:17:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Nobody... Nobody can fuck with you.
Dialogue: 5,2:17:17.52,2:17:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没人
Dialogue: 4,2:17:17.52,2:17:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Nobody.
Dialogue: 5,2:17:44.77,2:17:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}听着 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,2:17:44.77,2:17:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Listen, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,2:17:46.81,2:17:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们的朋友又失控了
Dialogue: 4,2:17:46.81,2:17:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Things have gotten out of hand with our friend again.
Dialogue: 5,2:17:50.85,2:17:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有些人对他意见很大
Dialogue: 4,2:17:50.85,2:17:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And some people are having serious problems with him.
Dialogue: 5,2:17:54.94,2:17:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}到现在这个地步
Dialogue: 4,2:17:54.94,2:17:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And it's at a point where
Dialogue: 5,2:17:57.90,2:18:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你必须找他谈谈 告诉他
Dialogue: 4,2:17:57.90,2:18:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you're gonna have to talk to him and tell him
Dialogue: 5,2:18:01.31,2:18:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}到此为止了
Dialogue: 4,2:18:01.31,2:18:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}it's what it is.
Dialogue: 5,2:18:05.48,2:18:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}到此为止
Dialogue: 4,2:18:05.48,2:18:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What it is?
Dialogue: 5,2:18:06.69,2:18:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是的 这是他们的意愿
Dialogue: 4,2:18:06.69,2:18:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yes. It's what they want.
Dialogue: 5,2:18:09.19,2:18:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}已经到这步了
Dialogue: 4,2:18:09.19,2:18:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's where it's gotten.
Dialogue: 5,2:18:12.19,2:18:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你和他亲近 或许他会听你的
Dialogue: 4,2:18:12.19,2:18:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're close to him. Maybe he'll listen to you.
Dialogue: 5,2:18:14.90,2:18:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道我和他谈过
Dialogue: 4,2:18:14.90,2:18:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know I talked to him.
Dialogue: 5,2:18:16.31,2:18:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他这人很固执 你了解他的
Dialogue: 4,2:18:16.31,2:18:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's a tough guy to talk to. You know him.
Dialogue: 5,2:18:18.31,2:18:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他没得选
Dialogue: 4,2:18:18.31,2:18:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He has no choice.
Dialogue: 5,2:18:20.15,2:18:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他没得选
Dialogue: 4,2:18:20.15,2:18:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He has no choice.
Dialogue: 5,2:18:22.35,2:18:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这些是大人物
Dialogue: 4,2:18:22.35,2:18:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}These are the higher-ups.
Dialogue: 5,2:18:25.81,2:18:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他也是个大人物 不是吗
Dialogue: 4,2:18:25.81,2:18:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, he's a higher-up too. I mean... No?
Dialogue: 5,2:18:29.15,2:18:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}和他们不同 你知道的
Dialogue: 4,2:18:29.15,2:18:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Not like this. You know that.
Dialogue: 5,2:18:31.40,2:18:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}拜托 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,2:18:31.40,2:18:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Come on now, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,2:18:35.77,2:18:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如果他们能干掉一个总统
Dialogue: 4,2:18:35.77,2:18:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If they can whack a president,
Dialogue: 5,2:18:37.90,2:18:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们就能干掉一个工会主席
Dialogue: 4,2:18:37.90,2:18:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}they can whack a president of the union.
Dialogue: 5,2:18:41.77,2:18:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道 我也知道
Dialogue: 4,2:18:41.77,2:18:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know it and I know it.
Dialogue: 5,2:18:54.65,2:18:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我和他谈过一次又一次
Dialogue: 4,2:18:54.65,2:18:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I talk to this guy, I talk to him, I talk to him,
Dialogue: 5,2:18:56.56,2:18:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他就是不听
Dialogue: 4,2:18:56.56,2:18:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I talk to him, he don't listen.
Dialogue: 5,2:18:57.94,2:19:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但他现在必须听 我得让他听进去
Dialogue: 4,2:18:57.94,2:19:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But he's gotta listen now. I gotta make him listen.
Dialogue: 5,2:19:02.77,2:19:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这样不对 他就是个傻瓜
Dialogue: 4,2:19:02.77,2:19:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That ain't right. He's... he's a fucking knucklehead.
Dialogue: 5,2:19:17.06,2:19:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 我和罗素谈了
Dialogue: 4,2:19:17.06,2:19:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy. I talked to Russ.
Dialogue: 5,2:19:19.77,2:19:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他和托尼谈过
Dialogue: 4,2:19:19.77,2:19:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He talked to Tony.
Dialogue: 5,2:19:21.06,2:19:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他说的话是认真的
Dialogue: 4,2:19:21.06,2:19:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He means what he's saying.
Dialogue: 5,2:19:23.27,2:19:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-谁 罗素吗 -不 托尼
Dialogue: 4,2:19:23.27,2:19:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Who? Russ? - No, Tony.
Dialogue: 5,2:19:25.48,2:19:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-托尼 -是的
Dialogue: 4,2:19:25.48,2:19:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Tony? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,2:19:27.27,2:19:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我说的话也是认真的
Dialogue: 4,2:19:27.27,2:19:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, I mean what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 5,2:19:29.69,2:19:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他那该死的西西里肥脑袋似乎就是不明白
Dialogue: 4,2:19:29.69,2:19:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He can't seem to get that through his fat, fucking Sicilian head.
Dialogue: 5,2:19:33.52,2:19:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对不对 别担心
Dialogue: 4,2:19:33.52,2:19:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Can he? Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 5,2:19:35.48,2:19:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你怎么了
Dialogue: 4,2:19:35.48,2:19:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 5,2:19:36.73,2:19:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你看起来...
Dialogue: 4,2:19:36.73,2:19:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You... you look...
Dialogue: 5,2:19:37.94,2:19:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我很担心 -我知道
Dialogue: 4,2:19:37.94,2:19:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I'm concerned. - Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 5,2:19:39.10,2:19:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你看起来就在担心 你担心什么
Dialogue: 4,2:19:39.10,2:19:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You look concerned. What are you concerned about?
Dialogue: 5,2:19:41.65,2:19:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我...
Dialogue: 4,2:19:41.65,2:19:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm... I'm...
Dialogue: 5,2:19:42.27,2:19:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}该担心的是他们
Dialogue: 4,2:19:42.27,2:19:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They should be concerned.
Dialogue: 5,2:19:43.85,2:19:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-他们确实担心 -那就让他们担心去
Dialogue: 4,2:19:43.85,2:19:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- They are. They are. - Well, let them be.
Dialogue: 5,2:19:45.19,2:19:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们不止有一点点担心
Dialogue: 4,2:19:45.19,2:19:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They're more than a little concerned.
Dialogue: 5,2:19:46.77,2:19:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们担心颇多
Dialogue: 4,2:19:46.77,2:19:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There's widespread concern.
Dialogue: 5,2:19:48.19,2:19:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是个大问题
Dialogue: 4,2:19:48.19,2:19:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's a big problem.
Dialogue: 5,2:19:51.23,2:19:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}托尼让老爷子叫我告诉你...
Dialogue: 4,2:19:51.23,2:19:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tony told the old man to tell me to tell you...
Dialogue: 5,2:19:55.60,2:19:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"到此为止了"
Dialogue: 4,2:19:55.60,2:19:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"It's what it is."
Dialogue: 5,2:20:01.06,2:20:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}到此为止
Dialogue: 4,2:20:01.06,2:20:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What it is?
Dialogue: 5,2:20:01.94,2:20:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}到此为止了
Dialogue: 4,2:20:01.94,2:20:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's what it is.
Dialogue: 5,2:20:07.15,2:20:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}拜托 听我说
Dialogue: 4,2:20:07.15,2:20:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Please, listen to me.
Dialogue: 5,2:20:10.60,2:20:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们不敢
Dialogue: 4,2:20:10.60,2:20:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They wouldn't dare.
Dialogue: 5,2:20:12.52,2:20:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-别... -他们不敢
Dialogue: 4,2:20:12.52,2:20:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Don't... - They wouldn't dare.
Dialogue: 5,2:20:14.35,2:20:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-吉米 -得了吧 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,2:20:14.35,2:20:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Jimmy... - Please, Frank, come on.
Dialogue: 5,2:20:16.19,2:20:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-别说他们不敢 -不
Dialogue: 4,2:20:16.19,2:20:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Don't say they wouldn't dare. - No.
Dialogue: 5,2:20:17.98,2:20:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别跟我说这种话...都是胡扯
Dialogue: 4,2:20:17.98,2:20:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Don't... don't tell me that kinda... That's fairy tales.
Dialogue: 5,2:20:21.02,2:20:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别说他们不敢
Dialogue: 4,2:20:21.02,2:20:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, don't say they wouldn't dare.
Dialogue: 5,2:20:23.60,2:20:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如果我出了什么事
Dialogue: 4,2:20:23.60,2:20:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If something funny happens to me...
Dialogue: 5,2:20:28.19,2:20:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们就完了
Dialogue: 4,2:20:28.19,2:20:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}they're done.
Dialogue: 5,2:20:29.06,2:20:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你明白吗 他们也清楚这点
Dialogue: 4,2:20:29.06,2:20:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You understand that? And they know it.
Dialogue: 5,2:20:31.19,2:20:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为我有文件 我有证据
Dialogue: 4,2:20:31.19,2:20:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Because I got files. I got proof.
Dialogue: 5,2:20:33.90,2:20:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我有记录 我有录音带
Dialogue: 4,2:20:33.90,2:20:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I got records. I got tapes.
Dialogue: 5,2:20:35.65,2:20:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}只要我想 他们随时会完蛋
Dialogue: 4,2:20:35.65,2:20:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Any time I want, they'll be gone.
Dialogue: 5,2:20:38.10,2:20:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这些几内亚混蛋
Dialogue: 4,2:20:38.10,2:20:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}These Guinea motherfuckers
Dialogue: 5,2:20:39.73,2:20:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}余生都会在监狱度过
Dialogue: 4,2:20:39.73,2:20:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}will spend the rest of their lives in jail,
Dialogue: 5,2:20:41.90,2:20:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们清楚
Dialogue: 4,2:20:41.90,2:20:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and they know it.
Dialogue: 5,2:20:44.35,2:20:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们清楚
Dialogue: 4,2:20:44.35,2:20:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They know it.
Dialogue: 5,2:20:44.94,2:20:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但你现在说的正是他们担心的
Dialogue: 4,2:20:44.94,2:20:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But what you're saying is what they're concerned about.
Dialogue: 5,2:20:47.31,2:20:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我在说的是我知道他们的事
Dialogue: 4,2:20:47.31,2:20:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What I'm saying is I know things.
Dialogue: 5,2:20:49.02,2:20:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道他们不知道我知道的事
Dialogue: 4,2:20:49.02,2:20:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know things they don't know I know.
Dialogue: 5,2:20:52.81,2:20:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-拜托 -你真的要冒那个险吗
Dialogue: 4,2:20:52.81,2:20:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Please... - Are you gonna take that chance?
Dialogue: 5,2:20:55.10,2:20:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我冒什么...我为什么要冒险
Dialogue: 4,2:20:55.10,2:20:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What chance am I... Why should I be taking a chance?
Dialogue: 5,2:20:57.10,2:20:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们说到此为止了
Dialogue: 4,2:20:57.10,2:20:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They're saying this is it.
Dialogue: 5,2:20:59.44,2:21:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们说到此为止 那就到此为止吗
Dialogue: 4,2:20:59.44,2:21:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They're saying this is it, and then it's it?
Dialogue: 5,2:21:01.44,2:21:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-胡说 胡说 弗兰克 -别这样
Dialogue: 4,2:21:01.44,2:21:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Bullshit. Bullshit, Frank. - Come on.
Dialogue: 5,2:21:03.56,2:21:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 我是想告诉你
Dialogue: 4,2:21:03.56,2:21:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy, I'm trying to tell you something.
Dialogue: 5,2:21:05.10,2:21:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道你是 你在告诉我他们威胁我
Dialogue: 4,2:21:05.10,2:21:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know you are. You're telling me that they're threatening me
Dialogue: 5,2:21:07.35,2:21:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我必须照他们说的做
Dialogue: 4,2:21:07.35,2:21:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and I gotta do what they say.
Dialogue: 5,2:21:08.98,2:21:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那不只是威胁 那是底线
Dialogue: 4,2:21:08.98,2:21:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's more than a threat. It's the bottom line.
Dialogue: 5,2:21:11.81,2:21:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}底线
Dialogue: 4,2:21:11.81,2:21:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The bottom line.
Dialogue: 5,2:21:13.65,2:21:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}到此为止了
Dialogue: 4,2:21:13.65,2:21:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's what it is.
Dialogue: 5,2:21:15.02,2:21:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们搞我 我就搞他们
Dialogue: 4,2:21:15.02,2:21:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They do something to me, I do something to them.
Dialogue: 5,2:21:18.56,2:21:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我就知道这个 别的我不知道 你知道吗
Dialogue: 4,2:21:18.56,2:21:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's all I know. I don't know anything else. Do you?
Dialogue: 5,2:21:23.44,2:21:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那我要怎么做 我该怎么跟麦基说
Dialogue: 4,2:21:23.44,2:21:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So what am I gonna do? What am I gonna tell McGee?
Dialogue: 5,2:21:26.44,2:21:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}说你不肯听吗
Dialogue: 4,2:21:26.44,2:21:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That you're not gonna listen?
Dialogue: 5,2:21:28.15,2:21:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他不习惯有人不听他的
Dialogue: 4,2:21:28.15,2:21:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He ain't used to people not listening to him.
Dialogue: 5,2:21:29.48,2:21:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我也是
Dialogue: 4,2:21:29.48,2:21:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, neither am I.
Dialogue: 5,2:21:31.98,2:21:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-什么 -我也是
Dialogue: 4,2:21:31.98,2:21:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- What? - Neither am I.
Dialogue: 5,2:21:34.85,2:21:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那我不知道该怎么办了
Dialogue: 4,2:21:34.85,2:21:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Then I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 5,2:21:35.77,2:21:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}或许你该找些保镖
Dialogue: 4,2:21:35.77,2:21:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, maybe you should get some bodies around you
Dialogue: 5,2:21:37.52,2:21:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-保护你 -得了吧
Dialogue: 4,2:21:37.52,2:21:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- for protection. - Come on. Please.
Dialogue: 5,2:21:39.44,2:21:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不会选那条路
Dialogue: 4,2:21:39.44,2:21:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm not gonna go that route.
Dialogue: 5,2:21:41.15,2:21:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别这么对我 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,2:21:41.15,2:21:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Don't do this to me, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,2:21:42.81,2:21:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你说"找些保镖"是什么意思 我不需要
Dialogue: 4,2:21:42.81,2:21:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What do you mean, "bodies around me"? I don't need...
Dialogue: 5,2:21:45.23,2:21:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你找保镖 他们就会找上你的家人
Dialogue: 4,2:21:45.23,2:21:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You put bodies around you, then they go after your family.
Dialogue: 5,2:21:47.81,2:21:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-这不重要 你担心吗 -我担心
Dialogue: 4,2:21:47.81,2:21:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- It doesn't matter. You worried? - I'm worried.
Dialogue: 5,2:21:50.06,2:21:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你去找些保镖吧 我告诉你为什么
Dialogue: 4,2:21:50.06,2:21:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Get some bodies around you. I'll tell you why.
Dialogue: 5,2:21:53.65,2:21:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这事可能落到你身上
Dialogue: 4,2:21:53.65,2:21:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This could happen to you.
Dialogue: 5,2:21:55.23,2:21:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们可能找上你
Dialogue: 4,2:21:55.23,2:21:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They could come after you
Dialogue: 5,2:21:57.52,2:21:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为你支持我
Dialogue: 4,2:21:57.52,2:21:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}since you're with me.
Dialogue: 5,2:21:59.35,2:22:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不是吗
Dialogue: 4,2:21:59.35,2:22:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No?
Dialogue: 5,2:22:02.73,2:22:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我很担心
Dialogue: 4,2:22:02.73,2:22:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm worried.
Dialogue: 5,2:22:04.06,2:22:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}告诉罗素我对他只有尊重
Dialogue: 4,2:22:04.06,2:22:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tell Russ I got nothing but respect for him.
Dialogue: 5,2:22:06.77,2:22:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我和他有点小摩擦
Dialogue: 4,2:22:06.77,2:22:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I got a little trouble with him.
Dialogue: 5,2:22:09.31,2:22:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们之前谈的时候 我有点失控
Dialogue: 4,2:22:09.31,2:22:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We were talking before and I just got a little crazy.
Dialogue: 5,2:22:11.60,2:22:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你知道我什么样 有时会发脾气 -是的
Dialogue: 4,2:22:11.60,2:22:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- You know how I am. I just blow. Sometimes. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,2:22:14.69,2:22:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}气得扭头就走
Dialogue: 4,2:22:14.69,2:22:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I just walked away like that.
Dialogue: 5,2:22:16.10,2:22:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我就是这样的人
Dialogue: 4,2:22:16.10,2:22:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But I get that way. I get abrupt.
Dialogue: 5,2:22:18.10,2:22:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}或许你能告诉他我多么尊重他
Dialogue: 4,2:22:18.10,2:22:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Maybe you could tell him how much I respect him.
Dialogue: 5,2:22:21.52,2:22:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我对他只有尊重
Dialogue: 4,2:22:21.52,2:22:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I have nothing but respect for this guy.
Dialogue: 5,2:22:23.98,2:22:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我永远不会伤害他
Dialogue: 4,2:22:23.98,2:22:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I would never hurt him,
Dialogue: 5,2:22:25.69,2:22:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不管我手上有什么文件 不管我做什么
Dialogue: 4,2:22:25.69,2:22:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}no matter what I do with files, or whatever I do with anything.
Dialogue: 5,2:22:28.94,2:22:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你应该亲自告诉他
Dialogue: 4,2:22:28.94,2:22:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But you should tell him. Yourself.
Dialogue: 5,2:22:31.06,2:22:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不 我不要亲自告诉他
Dialogue: 4,2:22:31.06,2:22:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, I'm not gonna tell him myself.
Dialogue: 5,2:22:32.31,2:22:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-拜托 -算了吧
Dialogue: 4,2:22:32.31,2:22:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Please. - Come on.
Dialogue: 5,2:22:33.35,2:22:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-亲口说更有意义 -他是你的导师
Dialogue: 4,2:22:33.35,2:22:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- It would go a long way. - He's your rabbi.
Dialogue: 5,2:22:36.31,2:22:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你有今天全靠他
Dialogue: 4,2:22:36.31,2:22:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Because of him, you're here.
Dialogue: 5,2:22:38.23,2:22:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你告诉他
Dialogue: 4,2:22:38.23,2:22:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You tell him.
Dialogue: 5,2:22:40.10,2:22:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}听我说
Dialogue: 4,2:22:40.10,2:22:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 5,2:22:41.02,2:22:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}最终只有一件事是真的
Dialogue: 4,2:22:41.02,2:22:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}At the end, there's only one thing that's real.
Dialogue: 5,2:22:44.65,2:22:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是我的工会
Dialogue: 4,2:22:44.65,2:22:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is my union.
Dialogue: 5,2:22:48.35,2:22:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是我的工会 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,2:22:48.35,2:22:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is my union, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,2:22:53.60,2:22:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}明确这一点 其他就简单了
Dialogue: 4,2:22:53.60,2:22:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Very simple when you say it that way.
Dialogue: 5,2:23:01.06,2:23:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}佩琪
Dialogue: 4,2:23:01.06,2:23:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Peggy!
Dialogue: 5,2:23:02.27,2:23:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们跳舞吧
Dialogue: 4,2:23:02.27,2:23:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Shall we dance?
Dialogue: 5,2:23:04.19,2:23:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}失陪
Dialogue: 4,2:23:04.19,2:23:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Excuse us.
Dialogue: 5,2:23:37.10,2:23:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}距离底特律几小时车程
Dialogue: 4,2:23:37.10,2:23:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A couple of hours outside Detroit,
Dialogue: 5,2:23:39.31,2:23:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们决定住一晚
Dialogue: 4,2:23:39.31,2:23:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}we figured we'd spend the night,
Dialogue: 5,2:23:41.77,2:23:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}早上再赶路
Dialogue: 4,2:23:41.77,2:23:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}drive up in the morning.
Dialogue: 5,2:23:43.69,2:23:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们要去参加婚礼
Dialogue: 4,2:23:43.69,2:23:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, the wedding, that was the thing.
Dialogue: 5,2:23:46.15,2:23:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}比尔·巴法利诺要把女儿嫁给一个好男人
Dialogue: 4,2:23:46.15,2:23:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Bill Bufalino, you know, was giving his daughter away to a hell of a guy.
Dialogue: 5,2:23:50.15,2:23:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}比之前那个无赖好
Dialogue: 4,2:23:50.15,2:23:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Better than the bum she was with before.
Dialogue: 5,2:23:52.65,2:23:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是件好事
Dialogue: 4,2:23:52.65,2:23:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And that was all well and good.
Dialogue: 5,2:23:55.06,2:23:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但婚礼实际是求和任务
Dialogue: 4,2:23:55.06,2:23:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But the wedding was really a peace mission.
Dialogue: 5,2:23:59.48,2:24:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那才是我们参加的目的
Dialogue: 4,2:23:59.48,2:24:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And that's what we were there for.
Dialogue: 5,2:23:59.77,2:24:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}哥伦布
Dialogue: 3,2:23:59.77,2:24:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}代顿
Dialogue: 2,2:23:59.77,2:24:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}底特律
Dialogue: 5,2:24:00.69,2:24:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}大家差不多都知道
Dialogue: 4,2:24:00.69,2:24:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And everybody kinda knew that,
Dialogue: 5,2:24:02.69,2:24:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们是去理清这件事的
Dialogue: 4,2:24:02.69,2:24:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and we were there to straighten it all out.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:05.23,2:24:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-吉米 -是我
Dialogue: 4,2:24:05.23,2:24:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Jimmy? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:06.60,2:24:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我和老爷子在一起 我们开车过去
Dialogue: 4,2:24:06.60,2:24:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm with the old man, we're driving up.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:08.40,2:24:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他希望我们能把整件事理清楚
Dialogue: 4,2:24:08.40,2:24:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He hopes we can straighten this whole thing out.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:11.02,2:24:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他说了什么
Dialogue: 4,2:24:11.02,2:24:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What did he say?
Dialogue: 5,2:24:11.98,2:24:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他说希望我们能理清这事
Dialogue: 4,2:24:11.98,2:24:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He said he hopes we can straighten it out.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:13.44,2:24:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}婚礼之后 我们坐下谈谈
Dialogue: 4,2:24:13.44,2:24:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}After the wedding, we sit down, we talk,
Dialogue: 5,2:24:15.31,2:24:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}理清这事
Dialogue: 4,2:24:15.31,2:24:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}we straighten it out.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:16.27,2:24:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}婚礼啊
Dialogue: 4,2:24:16.27,2:24:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Right, the wedding.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:17.23,2:24:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不准备参加婚礼
Dialogue: 4,2:24:17.23,2:24:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm not going to the wedding.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:18.81,2:24:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}太多我不喜欢的人会到场
Dialogue: 4,2:24:18.81,2:24:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Too many people I don't like are gonna be there,
Dialogue: 5,2:24:20.60,2:24:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所以我不准备去
Dialogue: 4,2:24:20.60,2:24:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}so I'm not going to the wedding.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:22.52,2:24:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你不去参加婚礼吗
Dialogue: 4,2:24:22.52,2:24:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're not going to the wedding?
Dialogue: 5,2:24:23.90,2:24:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不会去
Dialogue: 4,2:24:23.90,2:24:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm not gonna be there.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:27.48,2:24:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那我们可以...
Dialogue: 4,2:24:27.48,2:24:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, then we could...
Dialogue: 5,2:24:28.98,2:24:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 你想在哪里谈都可以
Dialogue: 4,2:24:28.98,2:24:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy, then we could do it anywhere you want.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:30.40,2:24:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}可以在你家
Dialogue: 4,2:24:30.40,2:24:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We can do it at your house.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:32.44,2:24:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你想在哪里都行
Dialogue: 4,2:24:32.44,2:24:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We can do it anywhere you want.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:33.90,2:24:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}地点任你选择
Dialogue: 4,2:24:33.90,2:24:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Wherever you're comfortable.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:36.23,2:24:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}湖边怎么样
Dialogue: 4,2:24:36.23,2:24:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The lake?
Dialogue: 5,2:24:37.31,2:24:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好 湖边 你想在那里谈吗
Dialogue: 4,2:24:37.31,2:24:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, the lake. You wanna do it at the lake?
Dialogue: 5,2:24:40.69,2:24:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我一开始就想把这事谈妥
Dialogue: 4,2:24:40.69,2:24:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}From day one, I wanted to work this out.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:43.44,2:24:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我知道 我知道 -从他妈的一开始
Dialogue: 4,2:24:43.44,2:24:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I know. I know. - From day fucking one.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:46.65,2:24:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我明白 我比任何人都清楚 我知道
Dialogue: 4,2:24:46.65,2:24:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know. Nobody knows better than me. I know that.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:49.44,2:24:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好 就你们俩来吧
Dialogue: 4,2:24:49.44,2:24:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All right, uh... Just you two, right?
Dialogue: 5,2:24:52.60,2:24:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别带上那个矮子
Dialogue: 4,2:24:52.60,2:24:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, not the Little Guy.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:54.56,2:24:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-不 他当然得去 -不行
Dialogue: 4,2:24:54.56,2:24:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- No, of course, the Little Guy. - No.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:56.65,2:24:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不要跟他谈
Dialogue: 4,2:24:56.65,2:24:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm not doing it with him.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:58.19,2:24:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 只有我们三个人谈没有用
Dialogue: 4,2:24:58.19,2:24:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy, there's no point just the three of us.
Dialogue: 5,2:24:59.85,2:25:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不 不 不
Dialogue: 4,2:24:59.85,2:25:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, no. No, no.
Dialogue: 5,2:25:00.98,2:25:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就我们三个人谈 就这样...
Dialogue: 4,2:25:00.98,2:25:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Just the three of us. That's the way it's...
Dialogue: 5,2:25:03.31,2:25:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}只有我们三个人谈没有用
Dialogue: 4,2:25:03.31,2:25:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There's no point just the three of us.
Dialogue: 5,2:25:04.81,2:25:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}矮子必须得在场
Dialogue: 4,2:25:04.81,2:25:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's gotta be the Little Guy with us.
Dialogue: 5,2:25:06.10,2:25:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不 我不要再跟那个小龟孙谈了
Dialogue: 4,2:25:06.10,2:25:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, I'm not sitting down with that little cocksucker again!
Dialogue: 5,2:25:08.73,2:25:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你明白吗 我做不到 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,2:25:08.73,2:25:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Do you understand? I can't do it, Frank!
Dialogue: 5,2:25:11.27,2:25:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你必须跟他谈
Dialogue: 4,2:25:11.27,2:25:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You have to.
Dialogue: 5,2:25:11.81,2:25:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不 吉米 你得跟他谈谈
Dialogue: 4,2:25:11.81,2:25:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, Jimmy, you gotta sit down with him.
Dialogue: 5,2:25:13.31,2:25:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-什么都不必做 -大家都说...
Dialogue: 4,2:25:13.31,2:25:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- We don't gotta do anything. - Everybody says...
Dialogue: 5,2:25:14.56,2:25:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我这是出于对他们的礼貌
Dialogue: 4,2:25:14.56,2:25:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is a courtesy with these people.
Dialogue: 5,2:25:16.77,2:25:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}完全是给他们面子
Dialogue: 4,2:25:16.77,2:25:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A complete courtesy.
Dialogue: 5,2:25:17.98,2:25:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你懂的 -我明白
Dialogue: 4,2:25:17.98,2:25:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- You know that. - I understand.
Dialogue: 5,2:25:19.23,2:25:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但你得试着让这事过去
Dialogue: 4,2:25:19.23,2:25:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But you gotta try and move past that.
Dialogue: 5,2:25:21.06,2:25:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我已经让这事过去了
Dialogue: 4,2:25:21.06,2:25:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Get past it? I am past it!
Dialogue: 5,2:25:22.69,2:25:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我再也不会见那个混蛋了
Dialogue: 4,2:25:22.69,2:25:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm never seeing that motherfucker again.
Dialogue: 5,2:25:24.97,2:25:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-这就是... -吉米 你得坐下来好好谈
Dialogue: 4,2:25:24.97,2:25:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- You see that's... - Jimmy, you gotta sit down.
Dialogue: 5,2:25:26.27,2:25:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}大家都这么说
Dialogue: 4,2:25:26.27,2:25:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Everybody says so.
Dialogue: 5,2:25:27.31,2:25:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但这没有意义 只有一点
Dialogue: 4,2:25:27.31,2:25:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But there's no point. There's only one point,
Dialogue: 5,2:25:29.77,2:25:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不想这么做 我也不会这么做
Dialogue: 4,2:25:29.77,2:25:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't wanna do it and I'm not gonna do it.
Dialogue: 5,2:25:31.90,2:25:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克 我要挂你电话了
Dialogue: 4,2:25:31.90,2:25:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank, I'm gonna hang up on you now.
Dialogue: 5,2:25:33.56,2:25:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}拜托 理解一下 好吗
Dialogue: 4,2:25:33.56,2:25:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Please. Understand this. Okay?
Dialogue: 5,2:25:49.35,2:25:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-他怎么说 -他在考虑
Dialogue: 4,2:25:49.35,2:25:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- What did he say? - Uh, he's thinking about it.
Dialogue: 5,2:25:52.56,2:25:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-考虑 -对
Dialogue: 4,2:25:52.56,2:25:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Thinking about it? - Yeah.
