Dialogue: 5,2:26:01.65,2:26:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}给你的
Dialogue: 4,2:26:01.65,2:26:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's for you.
Dialogue: 5,2:26:10.73,2:26:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}很好 好的
Dialogue: 4,2:26:10.73,2:26:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, that's good. Okay.
Dialogue: 5,2:26:25.48,2:26:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}几点了 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,2:26:25.48,2:26:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What time you got, Frank?
Dialogue: 5,2:26:28.15,2:26:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}大概五点
Dialogue: 4,2:26:28.15,2:26:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}About five.
Dialogue: 5,2:26:29.31,2:26:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}五点吗
Dialogue: 4,2:26:29.31,2:26:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Five, huh?
Dialogue: 5,2:26:32.94,2:26:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}也许你该给吉米打个电话
Dialogue: 4,2:26:32.94,2:26:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Maybe you should give Jimmy a call.
Dialogue: 5,2:26:34.60,2:26:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他说他会考虑的 对吗
Dialogue: 4,2:26:34.60,2:26:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, he said he was gonna think about it, right?
Dialogue: 5,2:26:43.02,2:26:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好
Dialogue: 4,2:26:43.02,2:26:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay.
Dialogue: 5,2:26:55.19,2:26:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们什么时候来
Dialogue: 4,2:26:55.19,2:26:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So when are you getting in?
Dialogue: 5,2:26:56.73,2:26:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}明天早上
Dialogue: 4,2:26:56.73,2:26:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 5,2:26:58.06,2:27:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那挺好 挺好 因为...
Dialogue: 4,2:26:58.06,2:27:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's good. That's good, 'cause, uh...
Dialogue: 5,2:27:00.40,2:27:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}另外那件事我改变主意了
Dialogue: 4,2:27:00.40,2:27:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I changed my mind about the other thing.
Dialogue: 5,2:27:04.35,2:27:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-是吗 -嗯
Dialogue: 4,2:27:04.35,2:27:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- You did? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,2:27:06.10,2:27:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我明天下午会跟矮子见面
Dialogue: 4,2:27:06.10,2:27:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, I'm gonna meet, uh, with the Little Guy tomorrow afternoon.
Dialogue: 5,2:27:10.44,2:27:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}跟矮...
Dialogue: 4,2:27:10.44,2:27:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}With the lit...
Dialogue: 5,2:27:11.65,2:27:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-跟矮子见面吗 -嗯
Dialogue: 4,2:27:11.65,2:27:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- With the Little Guy? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,2:27:13.52,2:27:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}托尼·杰克安排好了 我喜欢杰克
Dialogue: 4,2:27:13.52,2:27:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tony Jack set it up. I like Jack.
Dialogue: 5,2:27:15.85,2:27:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他很不错
Dialogue: 4,2:27:15.85,2:27:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jack's good.
Dialogue: 5,2:27:16.45,2:27:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}迈阿密那事儿之后 我见过他几次
Dialogue: 4,2:27:16.45,2:27:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I met with him a few times after that, you know, Miami fiasco.
Dialogue: 5,2:27:20.15,2:27:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在哪里和矮子见面
Dialogue: 4,2:27:20.15,2:27:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}With the Little Guy. Where?
Dialogue: 5,2:27:22.65,2:27:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}老地方 你知道在哪里
Dialogue: 4,2:27:22.65,2:27:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Same place as before. You know where it is.
Dialogue: 5,2:27:26.06,2:27:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在公共场合
Dialogue: 4,2:27:26.06,2:27:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}In public.
Dialogue: 5,2:27:28.77,2:27:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道托尼·杰克是普罗的表亲吧
Dialogue: 4,2:27:28.77,2:27:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know Tony Jack is Pro's cousin?
Dialogue: 5,2:27:31.35,2:27:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}嗯 那又怎样
Dialogue: 4,2:27:31.35,2:27:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah. So?
Dialogue: 5,2:27:32.77,2:27:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们全都是亲戚 你能怎么办
Dialogue: 4,2:27:32.77,2:27:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They're all fucking cousins. What're you gonna do?
Dialogue: 5,2:27:35.31,2:27:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 我觉得我应该过去
Dialogue: 4,2:27:35.31,2:27:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy, I think I should be there.
Dialogue: 5,2:27:37.35,2:27:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好 我想让你在场
Dialogue: 4,2:27:37.35,2:27:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, I want you there.
Dialogue: 5,2:27:38.60,2:27:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所以我问了你什么时候过来
Dialogue: 4,2:27:38.60,2:27:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's why I asked when you're coming in.
Dialogue: 5,2:27:40.73,2:27:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们几点见面
Dialogue: 4,2:27:40.73,2:27:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What time's the meeting?
Dialogue: 5,2:27:42.31,2:27:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}两点半
Dialogue: 4,2:27:42.31,2:27:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Two-thirty.
Dialogue: 5,2:27:43.23,2:27:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那个龟孙可千万别迟到
Dialogue: 4,2:27:43.23,2:27:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And he better not be late, that cocksucker,
Dialogue: 5,2:27:45.81,2:27:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}或是穿着该死的短裤
Dialogue: 4,2:27:45.81,2:27:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}or wearing those fucking shorts.
Dialogue: 5,2:27:48.02,2:27:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我两点到那里
Dialogue: 4,2:27:48.02,2:27:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Listen, I'm gonna get there at 2:00,
Dialogue: 5,2:27:49.40,2:27:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你也应该两点到
Dialogue: 4,2:27:49.40,2:27:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}so you should get there at 2:00.
Dialogue: 5,2:27:51.35,2:27:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-好吗 -我会两点到
Dialogue: 4,2:27:51.35,2:27:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Okay? - I'll be there at 2:00.
Dialogue: 5,2:27:52.69,2:27:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好 很好 好的
Dialogue: 4,2:27:52.69,2:27:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Oh, good. Good. Okay.
Dialogue: 5,2:27:54.98,2:27:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}两点见
Dialogue: 4,2:27:54.98,2:27:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'll see you at 2:00.
Dialogue: 5,2:27:56.27,2:27:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-谢谢 弗兰克 -好 吉米
Dialogue: 4,2:27:56.27,2:27:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Thanks, Frank. - Okay, Jimmy.
