Dialogue: 4,2:28:08.40,2:28:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's gonna meet with Pro.
Dialogue: 5,2:28:12.02,2:28:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}托尼·杰克安排好了
Dialogue: 4,2:28:12.02,2:28:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tony Jack set it up.
Dialogue: 5,2:28:14.19,2:28:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}很好
Dialogue: 4,2:28:14.19,2:28:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Very good.
