Dialogue: 4,2:28:48.02,2:28:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Great Italian olive oil we got from that other mooch was not bad either.
Dialogue: 5,2:28:53.85,2:28:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卡塔尼亚的橄榄油最棒了
Dialogue: 4,2:28:53.85,2:28:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Catania olives, what better.
Dialogue: 5,2:28:56.35,2:28:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}顶级的
Dialogue: 4,2:28:56.35,2:28:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The best.
Dialogue: 5,2:29:02.15,2:29:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}计划有变
Dialogue: 4,2:29:02.15,2:29:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There's been a change.
Dialogue: 5,2:29:04.44,2:29:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}明天早上别那么早出发
Dialogue: 4,2:29:04.44,2:29:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Instead of, uh, going up early,
Dialogue: 5,2:29:08.18,2:29:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们先待一会儿 然后再开车过去
Dialogue: 4,2:29:08.18,2:29:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}we're gonna hang around tomorrow morning and then go drive up.
Dialogue: 5,2:29:11.98,2:29:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我跟吉米说了 我们一早就出发
Dialogue: 4,2:29:11.98,2:29:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But... But I told Jimmy that we were gonna be up in the morning.
Dialogue: 5,2:29:17.31,2:29:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我跟吉米说了...
Dialogue: 4,2:29:17.31,2:29:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I told Jimmy...
Dialogue: 5,2:29:18.31,2:29:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我跟吉米说了我们一早就出发
Dialogue: 4,2:29:18.31,2:29:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I told Jimmy we're gonna be up in the morning.
Dialogue: 5,2:29:20.44,2:29:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道 我知道
Dialogue: 4,2:29:20.44,2:29:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know. I know.
Dialogue: 5,2:29:24.19,2:29:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我说我会陪他去见普罗
Dialogue: 4,2:29:24.19,2:29:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That I would be there for that... meeting with Pro.
Dialogue: 5,2:29:28.02,2:29:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-什么 -我会...
Dialogue: 4,2:29:28.02,2:29:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- What? - That I'd be...
Dialogue: 5,2:29:29.31,2:29:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}陪他去见普罗
Dialogue: 4,2:29:29.31,2:29:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}be there for that meeting with Pro.
Dialogue: 5,2:29:31.44,2:29:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}嗯 我知道 我知道
Dialogue: 4,2:29:31.44,2:29:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Oh, yeah. I know. I know.
Dialogue: 5,2:29:37.10,2:29:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那我要怎么做
Dialogue: 4,2:29:37.10,2:29:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But what I... What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 5,2:29:40.40,2:29:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们得过去 我得过去
Dialogue: 4,2:29:40.40,2:29:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We gotta go there. I mean, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 5,2:29:43.23,2:29:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我跟他说了我会去
Dialogue: 4,2:29:43.23,2:29:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I told him I'd be there.
Dialogue: 5,2:29:48.48,2:29:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,2:29:48.48,2:29:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank...
Dialogue: 5,2:29:50.35,2:29:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们对他仁至义尽了
Dialogue: 4,2:29:50.35,2:29:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}we did all we could for the man.
Dialogue: 5,2:30:04.03,2:30:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别打给他
Dialogue: 4,2:30:04.03,2:30:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Don't call him.
Dialogue: 5,2:30:42.19,2:30:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-早上好 -早上好
Dialogue: 4,2:30:42.19,2:30:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Hey. Good morning. - Hey. Morning.
Dialogue: 5,2:30:46.82,2:30:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}要咖啡吗
Dialogue: 4,2:30:46.82,2:30:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Want some coffee?
Dialogue: 5,2:30:48.46,2:30:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不用 我有了
Dialogue: 4,2:30:48.46,2:30:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, I got it here.
Dialogue: 5,2:30:51.38,2:30:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-睡得怎么样 -挺好 你呢
Dialogue: 4,2:30:51.38,2:30:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- How'd ya sleep? - Good. You?
Dialogue: 5,2:30:55.31,2:30:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还行吧
Dialogue: 4,2:30:55.31,2:30:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All right.
Dialogue: 5,2:31:00.35,2:31:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}要全麦片还是玉米片
Dialogue: 4,2:31:00.35,2:31:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Want some Total or Corn Flakes?
Dialogue: 5,2:31:02.98,2:31:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}全麦片吧
Dialogue: 4,2:31:02.98,2:31:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Maybe Total.
Dialogue: 5,2:31:12.58,2:31:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}够了 谢谢
Dialogue: 4,2:31:12.58,2:31:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's good, thanks.
Dialogue: 5,2:31:20.75,2:31:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们今天要去一趟克林顿港
Dialogue: 4,2:31:20.75,2:31:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We're gonna take a ride up to Port Clinton today.
Dialogue: 5,2:31:28.87,2:31:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我以为我们要待在这里
Dialogue: 4,2:31:28.87,2:31:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I thought we were staying here.
Dialogue: 5,2:31:31.57,2:31:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不 夫人们待在这里
Dialogue: 4,2:31:31.57,2:31:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, the girls are gonna stay here.
Dialogue: 5,2:31:34.17,2:31:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们俩去
Dialogue: 4,2:31:34.17,2:31:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You and me, we're going up and, uh...
Dialogue: 5,2:31:37.60,2:31:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}最多三个小时就会回来
Dialogue: 4,2:31:37.60,2:31:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}we'll be back three hours tops.
Dialogue: 5,2:31:43.18,2:31:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}去克林顿港干什么
Dialogue: 4,2:31:43.18,2:31:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But... But what's in Port Clinton?
Dialogue: 5,2:31:46.32,2:31:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}坐飞机
Dialogue: 4,2:31:46.32,2:31:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A plane.
Dialogue: 5,2:31:50.96,2:31:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}坐飞机 去哪里
Dialogue: 4,2:31:50.96,2:31:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A plane? To where?
Dialogue: 5,2:31:53.26,2:31:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}底特律
Dialogue: 4,2:31:53.26,2:31:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Detroit.
Dialogue: 5,2:32:01.98,2:32:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们现在要去底特律吗
Dialogue: 4,2:32:01.98,2:32:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We're going to Detroit now?
Dialogue: 5,2:32:04.15,2:32:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不 你要去底特律
Dialogue: 4,2:32:04.15,2:32:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, you're gonna go to Detroit.
Dialogue: 5,2:32:09.15,2:32:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你回来之后
Dialogue: 4,2:32:09.15,2:32:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And when you come back,
Dialogue: 5,2:32:11.05,2:32:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们带上夫人们
Dialogue: 4,2:32:11.05,2:32:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}me and you, we get together with the girls,
Dialogue: 5,2:32:13.92,2:32:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}优哉游哉地上路
Dialogue: 4,2:32:13.92,2:32:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}we take a nice slow drive up.
Dialogue: 5,2:32:16.78,2:32:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}时不时停下来抽根烟
Dialogue: 4,2:32:16.78,2:32:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}With cigarette breaks, you know.
Dialogue: 5,2:32:30.15,2:32:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,2:32:30.15,2:32:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank.
Dialogue: 5,2:32:31.95,2:32:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我必须让你去做这件事
Dialogue: 4,2:32:31.95,2:32:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I had to put you into this thing,
Dialogue: 5,2:32:34.82,2:32:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}否则你绝不会袖手旁观
Dialogue: 4,2:32:34.82,2:32:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}or you would never let it happen.
Dialogue: 5,2:32:37.83,2:32:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道你不会
Dialogue: 4,2:32:37.83,2:32:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And I know you wouldn't.
Dialogue: 5,2:32:44.86,2:32:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但事已至此
Dialogue: 4,2:32:44.86,2:32:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But it's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 5,2:32:48.97,2:32:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不管怎样 都得解决他
Dialogue: 4,2:32:48.97,2:32:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Either way, he's going.
Dialogue: 5,2:32:58.06,2:33:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我明白你的感受 弗兰克 相信我
Dialogue: 4,2:32:58.06,2:33:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know how you feel, Frank. Trust me.
Dialogue: 5,2:33:00.71,2:33:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我明白你的感受
Dialogue: 4,2:33:00.71,2:33:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 5,2:33:03.96,2:33:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我之前跟你说过 我们已经尽力帮他了
Dialogue: 4,2:33:03.96,2:33:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I told you before, we tried everything to help him.
Dialogue: 5,2:33:06.68,2:33:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道的
Dialogue: 4,2:33:06.68,2:33:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know that.
Dialogue: 5,2:33:07.83,2:33:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你尽力了
Dialogue: 4,2:33:07.83,2:33:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You tried.
Dialogue: 5,2:33:11.81,2:33:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是他自找的
Dialogue: 4,2:33:11.81,2:33:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He brought this on himself.
Dialogue: 5,2:33:15.72,2:33:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还牵扯到了我们
Dialogue: 4,2:33:15.72,2:33:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And it's landing on us.
Dialogue: 5,2:33:21.45,2:33:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们同意这样安排
Dialogue: 4,2:33:21.45,2:33:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The only reason they agreed to this
Dialogue: 5,2:33:24.32,2:33:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是出于对我的尊重
Dialogue: 4,2:33:24.32,2:33:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}was out of respect to me.
Dialogue: 5,2:33:28.88,2:33:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你和琳妮不会有事的
Dialogue: 4,2:33:28.88,2:33:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But you and Reenie will be okay,
Dialogue: 5,2:33:31.46,2:33:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为你是我的人
Dialogue: 4,2:33:31.46,2:33:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}'cause you're with me.
Dialogue: 5,2:33:37.92,2:33:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你是我的人
Dialogue: 4,2:33:37.92,2:33:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're with me.
Dialogue: 5,2:34:18.40,2:34:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}把你的眼镜给我
Dialogue: 4,2:34:18.40,2:34:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Give me your glasses.
Dialogue: 5,2:36:20.16,2:36:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}凯撒路83号
Dialogue: 5,2:36:40.70,2:36:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}红狐餐厅
Dialogue: 5,2:37:24.48,2:37:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}凯撒路83号
Dialogue: 5,2:38:47.13,2:38:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,2:38:47.13,2:38:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hey, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,2:38:49.03,2:38:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}小萨
Dialogue: 4,2:38:49.03,2:38:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hey, Sal.
Dialogue: 5,2:38:52.54,2:38:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}查奇迟到了
Dialogue: 4,2:38:52.54,2:38:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Chuckie's late.
Dialogue: 5,2:39:47.76,2:39:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是他吗
Dialogue: 4,2:39:47.76,2:39:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That him?
Dialogue: 5,2:39:53.51,2:39:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}嗯
Dialogue: 4,2:39:53.51,2:39:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,2:39:56.88,2:39:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}天呐
Dialogue: 4,2:39:56.88,2:39:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jesus.
Dialogue: 5,2:40:02.62,2:40:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我是萨利
Dialogue: 4,2:40:02.62,2:40:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm Sally.
Dialogue: 5,2:40:04.25,2:40:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你好
Dialogue: 4,2:40:04.25,2:40:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hi.
Dialogue: 5,2:40:07.22,2:40:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-小查 -弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,2:40:07.22,2:40:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Chuck. - Frank.
Dialogue: 5,2:40:08.92,2:40:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}快走 我不想你爸因为迟到对我大吼大叫
Dialogue: 4,2:40:08.92,2:40:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Let's go. I don't want your father yelling at me for being late.
Dialogue: 5,2:40:10.99,2:40:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克 你坐前面
Dialogue: 4,2:40:10.99,2:40:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank, you take the front.
Dialogue: 5,2:40:13.72,2:40:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-这他妈怎么回事 -怎么了
Dialogue: 4,2:40:13.72,2:40:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- What the fuck is this? - What?
Dialogue: 5,2:40:16.14,2:40:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}湿漉漉的
Dialogue: 4,2:40:16.14,2:40:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's wet.
Dialogue: 5,2:40:17.58,2:40:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我刚给朋友送了一条冻鱼
Dialogue: 4,2:40:17.58,2:40:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, I had a frozen fish I had to deliver for a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 5,2:40:22.61,2:40:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一条鱼
Dialogue: 4,2:40:22.61,2:40:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A fish?
Dialogue: 5,2:40:24.08,2:40:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}座位是被鱼给弄湿了吗
Dialogue: 4,2:40:24.08,2:40:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The seat is wet from a fish?
Dialogue: 5,2:40:25.17,2:40:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对 你现在想让我怎么办
Dialogue: 4,2:40:25.17,2:40:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, I know. What do you want me to do about it now?
Dialogue: 5,2:40:26.79,2:40:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-老天啊 -我坐后面吧
Dialogue: 4,2:40:26.79,2:40:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Jesus Christ. - I'll sit back there.
Dialogue: 5,2:40:28.03,2:40:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不不不 没关系 你坐前面
Dialogue: 4,2:40:28.03,2:40:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, no, no, it's all right. You sit in the front.
Dialogue: 5,2:40:29.36,2:40:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我坐后面
Dialogue: 4,2:40:29.36,2:40:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'll sit there.
Dialogue: 5,2:40:31.15,2:40:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我坐后面 你坐前面
Dialogue: 4,2:40:31.15,2:40:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'll sit here, you take the front.
Dialogue: 5,2:40:32.51,2:40:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不 不
Dialogue: 4,2:40:32.51,2:40:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, no.
Dialogue: 5,2:40:33.67,2:40:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我坐后面
Dialogue: 4,2:40:33.67,2:40:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'll sit there.
Dialogue: 5,2:40:38.10,2:40:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我不要坐前面 -你怎么就不...
Dialogue: 4,2:40:38.10,2:40:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I'm not sitting there. - Why don't you...
Dialogue: 5,2:40:39.06,2:40:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我要坐后面
Dialogue: 4,2:40:39.06,2:40:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm sitting there.
Dialogue: 5,2:40:42.68,2:40:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好 随你便
Dialogue: 4,2:40:42.68,2:40:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All right, sit where you want.
Dialogue: 5,2:40:46.27,2:40:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}要给你拿张报纸吗 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,2:40:46.27,2:40:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You want me to get you a newspaper, Frank?
Dialogue: 5,2:40:47.99,2:40:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不用了 走吧 我们得快点
Dialogue: 4,2:40:47.99,2:40:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's okay. Let's go. We gotta hurry.
Dialogue: 5,2:41:03.88,2:41:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是什么鱼
Dialogue: 4,2:41:03.88,2:41:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What kind of fish?
Dialogue: 5,2:41:07.24,2:41:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}什么
Dialogue: 4,2:41:07.24,2:41:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What?
Dialogue: 5,2:41:10.56,2:41:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你送的是什么鱼
Dialogue: 4,2:41:10.56,2:41:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What kind of fish?
Dialogue: 5,2:41:13.89,2:41:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不知道 就是可以吃的鱼
Dialogue: 4,2:41:13.89,2:41:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't know. The kind you eat. A fish.
Dialogue: 5,2:41:17.92,2:41:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你不知道是哪种鱼吗
Dialogue: 4,2:41:17.92,2:41:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You don't know what kind?
Dialogue: 5,2:41:21.22,2:41:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不知道
Dialogue: 4,2:41:21.22,2:41:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No. I don't.
Dialogue: 5,2:41:23.80,2:41:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你从哪弄来的
Dialogue: 4,2:41:23.80,2:41:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Where did you get it?
Dialogue: 5,2:41:26.12,2:41:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你说呢 卖鱼的地方
Dialogue: 4,2:41:26.12,2:41:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What the fuck. At a fish place.
Dialogue: 5,2:41:30.29,2:41:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你就直接过去说"给我条鱼"吗
Dialogue: 4,2:41:30.29,2:41:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What, you just go in there and say, "Gimme a fish"?
Dialogue: 5,2:41:34.83,2:41:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}差不多吧
Dialogue: 4,2:41:34.83,2:41:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Pretty much. Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,2:41:37.79,2:41:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你没说你要鲑鱼
Dialogue: 4,2:41:37.79,2:41:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You didn't say you want a salmon,
Dialogue: 5,2:41:39.36,2:41:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还是黑线鳕
Dialogue: 4,2:41:39.36,2:41:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you want a... haddock,
Dialogue: 5,2:41:41.23,2:41:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还是鳕鱼吗
Dialogue: 4,2:41:41.23,2:41:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you want a... a fucking cod?
Dialogue: 5,2:41:43.54,2:41:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是哪种鱼有什么关系吗
Dialogue: 4,2:41:43.54,2:41:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What the fuck does it matter what kind of fish it was?
Dialogue: 5,2:41:47.06,2:41:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你为什么那么关心那条鱼
Dialogue: 4,2:41:47.06,2:41:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Why are you so concerned about this fish?
Dialogue: 5,2:41:48.55,2:41:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我只是想搞清楚...
Dialogue: 4,2:41:48.55,2:41:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm just trying to understand how...
Dialogue: 5,2:41:50.03,2:41:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这...
Dialogue: 4,2:41:50.03,2:41:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Does it...
Dialogue: 5,2:41:53.33,2:41:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}怎么能买到一条鱼 却不知道是什么鱼
Dialogue: 4,2:41:53.33,2:41:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...how a person can buy a fish and not know what kind it was.
Dialogue: 5,2:41:58.41,2:42:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那条鱼就在那里等着我
Dialogue: 4,2:41:58.41,2:42:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There was a fish waiting for me there.
Dialogue: 5,2:42:04.07,2:42:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我没问那是什么鱼 抱歉
Dialogue: 4,2:42:04.07,2:42:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I didn't ask what kind of fish it was. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 5,2:42:10.90,2:42:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-就是说你朋友已经把鱼订好了 -对
Dialogue: 4,2:42:10.90,2:42:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- So your friend had already ordered this fish. - Right.
Dialogue: 5,2:42:20.04,2:42:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}要是有人问起 我得能解释明白
Dialogue: 4,2:42:20.04,2:42:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}'Cause I wanna be able to explain this if somebody asks me.
Dialogue: 5,2:42:27.49,2:42:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}红狐餐厅
Dialogue: 5,2:42:30.18,2:42:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好 没问题
Dialogue: 4,2:42:30.18,2:42:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah. Absolutely.
Dialogue: 5,2:42:44.40,2:42:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}爸
Dialogue: 4,2:42:44.40,2:42:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Dad.
Dialogue: 5,2:42:47.11,2:42:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}查奇
Dialogue: 4,2:42:47.11,2:42:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Chuckie.
Dialogue: 5,2:42:48.14,2:42:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-抱歉我迟到了 我得去送... -迟到
Dialogue: 4,2:42:48.14,2:42:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Yeah, sorry I'm late. I had to drop off... - Late?
Dialogue: 5,2:42:50.77,2:42:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你来这里干什么
Dialogue: 4,2:42:50.77,2:42:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What the fuck are you even doing here?
Dialogue: 5,2:42:52.56,2:42:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-谁让你来的 -吉米
Dialogue: 4,2:42:52.56,2:42:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Who invited you? - Hey, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,2:42:57.16,2:42:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你是谁
Dialogue: 4,2:42:57.16,2:42:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Who the fuck are you?
Dialogue: 5,2:42:58.87,2:43:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我是普罗的人
Dialogue: 4,2:42:58.87,2:43:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm with Pro.
Dialogue: 5,2:43:00.34,2:43:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你是普罗的人
Dialogue: 4,2:43:00.34,2:43:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're with Pro?
Dialogue: 5,2:43:01.87,2:43:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你是那个放我鸽子的龟孙的人
Dialogue: 4,2:43:01.87,2:43:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Are you with the cocksucker who just stood me up?
Dialogue: 5,2:43:04.30,2:43:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不会等人超过十分钟
Dialogue: 4,2:43:04.30,2:43:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't wait for anybody more than ten minutes.
Dialogue: 5,2:43:06.46,2:43:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他在房子里
Dialogue: 4,2:43:06.46,2:43:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's at the house.
Dialogue: 5,2:43:08.40,2:43:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}什么房子
Dialogue: 4,2:43:08.40,2:43:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What house?
Dialogue: 5,2:43:09.44,2:43:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}和罗素在一起
Dialogue: 4,2:43:09.44,2:43:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}With Russ.
Dialogue: 5,2:43:11.62,2:43:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-罗素 搞什么 -看看谁在后面
Dialogue: 4,2:43:11.62,2:43:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Russ? What the fuck is... - Hey, look who's here.
Dialogue: 5,2:43:14.54,2:43:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-弗兰克 -吉米
Dialogue: 4,2:43:14.54,2:43:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Frank. - Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,2:43:16.19,2:43:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}到底怎么回事
Dialogue: 4,2:43:16.19,2:43:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What the fuck is going on?
Dialogue: 5,2:43:18.61,2:43:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我一直在等你 我两点就到了
Dialogue: 4,2:43:18.61,2:43:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I was waiting for you. I was there at two o'clock.
Dialogue: 5,2:43:20.81,2:43:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你应该到场的 出什么事了
Dialogue: 4,2:43:20.81,2:43:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You were supposed to show. What happened?
Dialogue: 5,2:43:21.85,2:43:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}抱歉 但麦基来了 他决定过来
Dialogue: 4,2:43:21.85,2:43:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm sorry. But McGee's here, he decided to come.
Dialogue: 5,2:43:24.99,2:43:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但他不喜欢这里 他不想来这里
Dialogue: 4,2:43:24.99,2:43:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But he ain't comfortable here. He don't wanna come here.
Dialogue: 5,2:43:27.43,2:43:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他在房子里
Dialogue: 4,2:43:27.43,2:43:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's at the house.
Dialogue: 5,2:43:28.25,2:43:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-麦基来底特律了 -对 他来了
Dialogue: 4,2:43:28.25,2:43:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- McGee's in Detroit? - Yeah, he's here.
Dialogue: 5,2:43:30.91,2:43:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他决定过来
Dialogue: 4,2:43:30.91,2:43:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He decided to come.
Dialogue: 5,2:43:34.59,2:43:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他是来帮忙理清这件事的
Dialogue: 4,2:43:34.59,2:43:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, he came to help straighten this all out.
Dialogue: 5,2:43:38.13,2:43:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}房子
Dialogue: 4,2:43:38.13,2:43:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The house?
Dialogue: 5,2:43:44.98,2:43:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}事后我们会带你来取车的
Dialogue: 4,2:43:44.98,2:43:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We'll bring you back after to get your car.
Dialogue: 5,2:43:52.91,2:43:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没错
Dialogue: 4,2:43:52.91,2:43:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,2:43:55.60,2:43:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好吧
Dialogue: 4,2:43:55.60,2:43:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay.
Dialogue: 5,2:44:01.63,2:44:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-好 -嗯
Dialogue: 4,2:44:01.63,2:44:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,2:44:08.98,2:44:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}红狐餐厅
Dialogue: 5,2:44:13.17,2:44:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}之前车里放了条鱼
Dialogue: 4,2:44:13.17,2:44:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There was a fish in here,
Dialogue: 5,2:44:14.07,2:44:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我们已经清理干净了
Dialogue: 4,2:44:14.07,2:44:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but we cleaned it up.
Dialogue: 5,2:44:16.76,2:44:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}鱼
Dialogue: 4,2:44:16.76,2:44:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A fish?
Dialogue: 5,2:44:19.08,2:44:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}查奇在车里放了条鱼
Dialogue: 4,2:44:19.08,2:44:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Chuckie had a fucking fish in here.
Dialogue: 5,2:44:20.88,2:44:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他连是什么鱼都不知道
Dialogue: 4,2:44:20.88,2:44:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Didn't even know what kind.
Dialogue: 5,2:44:21.84,2:44:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但现在没事了 我擦干净了
Dialogue: 4,2:44:21.84,2:44:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But it's okay now. I wiped it up.
Dialogue: 5,2:44:23.92,2:44:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我在座位上垫了块手帕 -我闻出来了
Dialogue: 4,2:44:23.92,2:44:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- I got the handkerchief here. - Yeah, I can smell it.
Dialogue: 5,2:44:27.20,2:44:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}查奇
Dialogue: 4,2:44:27.20,2:44:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hey, Chuckie.
Dialogue: 5,2:44:27.70,2:44:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你在车里放了条鱼吗
Dialogue: 4,2:44:27.70,2:44:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You had a fish in here in your car?
Dialogue: 5,2:44:29.79,2:44:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}给鲍比·霍姆斯的
Dialogue: 4,2:44:29.79,2:44:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}For Bobby Holmes.
Dialogue: 5,2:44:31.38,2:44:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道的 鲍比喜欢吃鱼
Dialogue: 4,2:44:31.38,2:44:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know, Bobby likes fish.
Dialogue: 5,2:44:33.21,2:44:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们清理干净了 吉米 没关系
Dialogue: 4,2:44:33.21,2:44:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We cleaned it up, Jimmy. It's all right.
Dialogue: 5,2:44:34.95,2:44:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你清理干净了
Dialogue: 4,2:44:34.95,2:44:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You cleaned it up?
Dialogue: 5,2:44:36.52,2:44:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你清理干净了 -是的
Dialogue: 4,2:44:36.52,2:44:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- You cleaned it up? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,2:44:38.30,2:44:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你他妈了解鱼吗
Dialogue: 4,2:44:38.30,2:44:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What the fuck you know about fish?
Dialogue: 5,2:44:40.38,2:44:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你这辈子有抓过鱼吗
Dialogue: 4,2:44:40.38,2:44:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You ever caught a fucking fish in your life?
Dialogue: 5,2:44:43.38,2:44:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没有
Dialogue: 4,2:44:43.38,2:44:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No.
Dialogue: 5,2:44:44.21,2:44:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那你就不了解 对吧
Dialogue: 4,2:44:44.21,2:44:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, then you don't know. See?
Dialogue: 5,2:44:46.59,2:44:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}小查
Dialogue: 4,2:44:46.59,2:44:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Chuck.
Dialogue: 5,2:44:47.15,2:44:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}听我说 永远不要在车里放鱼
Dialogue: 4,2:44:47.15,2:44:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Listen to me. Never put a fish in your car.
Dialogue: 5,2:44:50.12,2:44:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}味道是散不掉的
Dialogue: 4,2:44:50.12,2:44:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You never get the smell out.
Dialogue: 5,2:44:51.84,2:44:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-嗯... -除非包装得很好
Dialogue: 4,2:44:51.84,2:44:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- No... - Unless you pack it tight, you know.
Dialogue: 5,2:44:53.66,2:44:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}嗯 我知道
Dialogue: 4,2:44:53.66,2:44:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, I... I know.
Dialogue: 5,2:44:55.10,2:44:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你知道吗 记住了 -对
Dialogue: 4,2:44:55.10,2:44:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- You know? Remember that. - Right.
Dialogue: 5,2:44:57.08,2:44:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道
Dialogue: 4,2:44:57.08,2:44:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know.
Dialogue: 5,2:44:57.89,2:44:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你会受益匪浅的
Dialogue: 4,2:44:57.89,2:44:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It'll help you in life.
Dialogue: 5,2:45:04.58,2:45:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克 你就不能两点来找我 告诉我这事吗
Dialogue: 4,2:45:04.58,2:45:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank, you couldn't come by at 2:00 and tell me this?
Dialogue: 5,2:45:07.55,2:45:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我傻傻地在那等了你四十分钟
Dialogue: 4,2:45:07.55,2:45:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I was waiting there 40 minutes like a fuckin' moron.
Dialogue: 5,2:45:10.54,2:45:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米 抱歉 我刚到就赶过来了
Dialogue: 4,2:45:10.54,2:45:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy, I'm sorry. I came as soon as I got here.
Dialogue: 5,2:45:13.08,2:45:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你今天早上到的 -不是
Dialogue: 4,2:45:13.08,2:45:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- You got in this morning. - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 5,2:45:14.99,2:45:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我今天下午才到的
Dialogue: 4,2:45:14.99,2:45:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I got here this afternoon.
Dialogue: 5,2:45:16.19,2:45:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素在克林顿港办事 我得等他
Dialogue: 4,2:45:16.19,2:45:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Russell had business in Port Clinton. I had to wait for him.
Dialogue: 5,2:45:19.08,2:45:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他提醒了我 我忘记了
Dialogue: 4,2:45:19.08,2:45:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He reminded me. I forgot.
Dialogue: 5,2:45:20.70,2:45:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所以我们马上赶来 我刚到
Dialogue: 4,2:45:20.70,2:45:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So, we had to come and as soon as we got here,
Dialogue: 5,2:45:22.85,2:45:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就直接过来找你了
Dialogue: 4,2:45:22.85,2:45:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I came right here to see you.
Dialogue: 5,2:45:24.48,2:45:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没有对罗素不敬的意思
Dialogue: 4,2:45:24.48,2:45:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All due respect to Russ, you know,
Dialogue: 5,2:45:27.71,2:45:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但应该让人提前告诉我的
Dialogue: 4,2:45:27.71,2:45:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but somebody should have come tell me, you know.
Dialogue: 5,2:45:30.63,2:45:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}最起码应该来告诉我时间推迟了
Dialogue: 4,2:45:30.63,2:45:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Just come tell me it's 2:30, 2:40, at the very least.
Dialogue: 5,2:45:34.05,2:45:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你说得对 我是说...
Dialogue: 4,2:45:34.05,2:45:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're not incorrect. I mean...
Dialogue: 5,2:45:35.71,2:45:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}普罗算哪根葱 还派个狗腿子过来
Dialogue: 4,2:45:35.71,2:45:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Who the fuck is Pro? He sends a fucking errand boy here.
Dialogue: 5,2:45:39.83,2:45:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他不会待太久
Dialogue: 4,2:45:39.83,2:45:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He ain't stayin'.
Dialogue: 5,2:45:40.96,2:45:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道他不会待太久
Dialogue: 4,2:45:40.96,2:45:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know he ain't staying.
Dialogue: 5,2:45:42.09,2:45:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}关键不在于他待多久
Dialogue: 4,2:45:42.09,2:45:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's not the point, he's staying or not staying.
Dialogue: 5,2:45:44.19,2:45:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}关键在于普罗派他过来
Dialogue: 4,2:45:44.19,2:45:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The point is Pro sent him.
Dialogue: 5,2:45:46.03,2:45:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}知道吗
Dialogue: 4,2:45:46.03,2:45:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know?
Dialogue: 5,2:45:46.87,2:45:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}关键是他应该亲自来接我
Dialogue: 4,2:45:46.87,2:45:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Point is, he should've come picked me up himself.
Dialogue: 5,2:45:48.65,2:45:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这才是问题的关键
Dialogue: 4,2:45:48.65,2:45:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's the point I'm makin'.
Dialogue: 5,2:45:53.46,2:45:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你戴着这副眼镜能看得清吗
Dialogue: 4,2:45:53.46,2:45:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Can you even see out of those glasses?
Dialogue: 5,2:45:56.66,2:45:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我什么都看不清
Dialogue: 4,2:45:56.66,2:45:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I can't see a fucking thing.
Dialogue: 5,2:45:58.55,2:46:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}很好 幸好不是你开车
Dialogue: 4,2:45:58.55,2:46:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's good. I'm glad you're not driving, then.
Dialogue: 5,2:46:09.71,2:46:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就在这...这边
Dialogue: 4,2:46:09.71,2:46:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, it's right... It's right up...
Dialogue: 5,2:46:11.79,2:46:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就在这边 这边
Dialogue: 4,2:46:11.79,2:46:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's right up here. Right... Right up...
Dialogue: 5,2:46:13.83,2:46:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有楼梯的那房子
Dialogue: 4,2:46:13.83,2:46:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That building with the staircase.
Dialogue: 5,2:46:17.32,2:46:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你带家伙了吗
Dialogue: 4,2:46:17.32,2:46:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You got your friend with you?
Dialogue: 5,2:46:18.97,2:46:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-带了 -很好
Dialogue: 4,2:46:18.97,2:46:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Right here. - Good.
Dialogue: 5,2:46:21.33,2:46:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谁知道这个龟孙会做出什么事
Dialogue: 4,2:46:21.33,2:46:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You never know with this cocksucker,
Dialogue: 5,2:46:23.28,2:46:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不管罗素在不在场
Dialogue: 4,2:46:23.28,2:46:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}with or without Russ there.
Dialogue: 5,2:47:04.50,2:47:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}快走 弗兰克 快
Dialogue: 4,2:47:04.50,2:47:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Let's get outta here, Frank. Come on.
Dialogue: 5,2:48:29.82,2:48:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Before the light ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:48:29.82,2:48:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}In The Still Of The Night - The Five Satins
Dialogue: 5,2:48:35.93,2:48:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Hold me again ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:48:38.97,2:48:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ With all of your might ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:48:41.08,2:48:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ In the still of the night ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:48:44.95,2:48:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ In the still of the night ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:49:22.27,2:49:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ So before the light ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:49:28.73,2:49:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Hold me again ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:49:31.85,2:49:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ With all of your might ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:49:33.91,2:49:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ In the still of the night ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:49:36.92,2:49:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ In the still of the night ♪
Dialogue: 5,2:49:41.96,2:49:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卡车司机工会前主席詹姆斯·霍法
Dialogue: 4,2:49:41.96,2:49:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}James Hoffa, former president of the Teamsters Union,
Dialogue: 5,2:49:44.56,2:49:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}于周三失踪
Dialogue: 4,2:49:44.56,2:49:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}disappeared on Wednesday.
Dialogue: 5,2:49:45.91,2:49:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}截至今晚 尚未发现他的踪迹
Dialogue: 4,2:49:45.91,2:49:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And as of tonight, no trace of him has been found.
Dialogue: 5,2:49:49.22,2:49:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}霍法在监狱服刑四年 他坦承
Dialogue: 4,2:49:49.22,2:49:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hoffa spent four years in prison and made no bones
Dialogue: 5,2:49:52.00,2:49:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-自己打算... -弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,2:49:52.00,2:49:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- about his intention... - Frank.
Dialogue: 5,2:49:53.43,2:49:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}从他的继任弗兰克·菲茨西蒙斯手上
Dialogue: 4,2:49:53.43,2:49:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...to get the presidency back from his successor,
Dialogue: 5,2:49:55.65,2:49:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}夺回主席之位
Dialogue: 4,2:49:55.65,2:49:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank Fitzsimmons.
Dialogue: 5,2:49:56.91,2:49:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}菲茨西蒙斯的儿子是副主席...
Dialogue: 4,2:49:56.91,2:49:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Fitzsimmons' son is the vice president of...
Dialogue: 5,2:49:58.95,2:50:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还没消息吗
Dialogue: 4,2:49:58.95,2:50:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Still nothing?
Dialogue: 5,2:50:01.38,2:50:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}小菲茨西蒙斯的车被炸了 他当时不在车内
Dialogue: 4,2:50:01.38,2:50:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...young Fitzsimmons' car was bombed. He was not in it.
Dialogue: 5,2:50:04.39,2:50:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但底特律地方工会内确有不和
Dialogue: 4,2:50:04.39,2:50:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But there is bad blood in the Detroit Local.
Dialogue: 5,2:50:07.79,2:50:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}霍法于周三下午失踪
Dialogue: 4,2:50:07.79,2:50:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hoffa disappeared Wednesday afternoon.
Dialogue: 5,2:50:10.74,2:50:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}目前已过去48个小时 仍然不清楚
Dialogue: 4,2:50:10.74,2:50:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Now, more than 48 hours later, with no word yet
Dialogue: 5,2:50:14.07,2:50:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}霍法出了什么事 警方对此极为关切
Dialogue: 4,2:50:14.07,2:50:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}on what happened to Hoffa, police are extremely concerned.
Dialogue: 5,2:50:18.07,2:50:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}当局急于弄清楚
Dialogue: 4,2:50:18.07,2:50:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Authorities are most anxious to find whom
Dialogue: 5,2:50:20.37,2:50:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}霍法在红狐餐厅外见的是谁
Dialogue: 4,2:50:20.37,2:50:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hoffa was supposed to meet outside the Red Fox restaurant
Dialogue: 5,2:50:23.61,2:50:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那是最后有人看到他的地方
Dialogue: 4,2:50:23.61,2:50:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}where he was last seen.
Dialogue: 5,2:50:25.83,2:50:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}警方认为可能是安东尼·加卡罗内
Dialogue: 4,2:50:25.83,2:50:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Police think it could have been a man named Anthony Giacalone,
Dialogue: 5,2:50:29.43,2:50:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他被称为底特律黑手党的大佬
Dialogue: 4,2:50:29.43,2:50:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}described as a big man in the Detroit Mafia.
Dialogue: 5,2:50:32.09,2:50:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}霍法的儿子詹姆斯今天试图联系加卡罗内
Dialogue: 4,2:50:32.09,2:50:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hoffa's son, James, tried to contact Giacalone today,
Dialogue: 5,2:50:35.47,2:50:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但没能联系上
Dialogue: 4,2:50:35.47,2:50:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but didn't succeed.
Dialogue: 5,2:50:36.80,2:50:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}霍法的亲朋好友今天留在
Dialogue: 4,2:50:36.80,2:50:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hoffa's family and friends stayed
Dialogue: 5,2:50:38.94,2:50:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}位于湖口镇的家中
Dialogue: 4,2:50:38.94,2:50:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}in the family home in Lake Orion today...
Dialogue: 5,2:50:40.98,2:50:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我应该打给约
Dialogue: 4,2:50:40.98,2:50:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I should call Jo.
Dialogue: 5,2:50:44.50,2:50:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你还没有打给约吗
Dialogue: 4,2:50:44.50,2:50:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You haven't called Jo yet?
Dialogue: 5,2:50:53.22,2:50:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}为什么
Dialogue: 4,2:50:53.22,2:50:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Why?
Dialogue: 5,2:50:54.71,2:50:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}什么
Dialogue: 4,2:50:54.71,2:50:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What?
Dialogue: 5,2:50:56.80,2:50:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}为什么
Dialogue: 4,2:50:56.80,2:50:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Why?
Dialogue: 5,2:50:59.35,2:51:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}什么为什么
Dialogue: 4,2:50:59.35,2:51:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Why what?
Dialogue: 5,2:51:02.42,2:51:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你为什么还没有打给约
Dialogue: 4,2:51:02.42,2:51:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Why haven't you called Jo?
Dialogue: 5,2:51:04.57,2:51:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有人索要赎金之类的吗
Dialogue: 4,2:51:04.57,2:51:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Has anybody come forward with a ransom demand or anything like that?
Dialogue: 5,2:51:08.05,2:51:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}目前还没有
Dialogue: 4,2:51:08.05,2:51:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Not as of yet.
Dialogue: 5,2:51:09.33,2:51:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你认为这起绑架是为了索要赎金吗
Dialogue: 4,2:51:09.33,2:51:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Do you think the abduction was for ransom?
Dialogue: 5,2:51:12.44,2:51:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我现在打给她
Dialogue: 4,2:51:12.44,2:51:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm gonna call her now.
Dialogue: 5,2:51:15.36,2:51:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你认为这起绑架
Dialogue: 4,2:51:15.36,2:51:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Do you think the abduction
Dialogue: 5,2:51:16.36,2:51:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}和他所在的299号地方工会
Dialogue: 4,2:51:16.36,2:51:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}had anything to do with the recent conflicts
Dialogue: 5,2:51:19.52,2:51:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}最近的内部冲突有关吗
Dialogue: 4,2:51:19.52,2:51:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}within Local 299, his own Local?
Dialogue: 5,2:51:21.48,2:51:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我认为工会政治
Dialogue: 4,2:51:21.48,2:51:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I think the union politics
Dialogue: 5,2:51:23.95,2:51:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}当然是需要进行调查的
Dialogue: 4,2:51:23.95,2:51:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}is certainly something that has to be investigated.
Dialogue: 5,2:51:25.87,2:51:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}国际卡车司机工会的一位高层人士
Dialogue: 4,2:51:25.87,2:51:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}One high official of the Teamsters International
Dialogue: 5,2:51:28.41,2:51:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}声称他担心发生了最坏的事
Dialogue: 4,2:51:28.41,2:51:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}says he fears the worst,
Dialogue: 5,2:51:30.20,2:51:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}即霍法可能已经被杀
Dialogue: 4,2:51:30.20,2:51:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}that Hoffa may have been killed.
Dialogue: 5,2:51:33.04,2:51:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}全国广播公司新闻频道的罗伯特·哈格
Dialogue: 4,2:51:33.04,2:51:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Robert Hager, NBC News,
Dialogue: 5,2:51:34.84,2:51:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在密歇根州布隆菲尔德为您报道
Dialogue: 4,2:51:34.84,2:51:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Bloomfield, Michigan.
Dialogue: 5,2:51:37.79,2:51:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}底特律外的一处卡车休息站
Dialogue: 4,2:51:37.79,2:51:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}At a truck stop outside Detroit,
Dialogue: 5,2:51:39.72,2:51:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}霍法在这升任卡车司机工会主席
Dialogue: 4,2:51:39.72,2:51:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}where Hoffa rose to the top in the Teamsters Union,
Dialogue: 5,2:51:42.75,2:51:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}站内的卡车司机们众说纷纭
Dialogue: 4,2:51:42.75,2:51:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}truck drivers had a variety of theories...
Dialogue: 5,2:51:45.08,2:51:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她自那天后就没和我说过话
Dialogue: 4,2:51:45.08,2:51:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}She stopped talking to me that day.
Dialogue: 5,2:51:47.87,2:51:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}1975年8月3日
Dialogue: 4,2:51:47.87,2:51:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}August 3rd, 1975.
Dialogue: 5,2:51:52.37,2:51:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她现在有份好工作 住在费城外
Dialogue: 4,2:51:52.37,2:51:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}She's got a good job now and lives just outside Philly.
Dialogue: 5,2:51:57.68,2:51:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我的女儿
Dialogue: 4,2:51:57.68,2:51:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But my daughter...
Dialogue: 5,2:52:00.17,2:52:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}佩琪
Dialogue: 4,2:52:00.17,2:52:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Peggy...
Dialogue: 5,2:52:02.13,2:52:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}自那天后
Dialogue: 4,2:52:02.13,2:52:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}disappeared...
Dialogue: 5,2:52:04.68,2:52:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就从我的生命中消失了
Dialogue: 4,2:52:04.68,2:52:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}from my life that day.
Dialogue: 5,2:52:10.24,2:52:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}喂
Dialogue: 4,2:52:10.24,2:52:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hello.
Dialogue: 5,2:52:13.42,2:52:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-喂 -喂
Dialogue: 4,2:52:13.42,2:52:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Hello. - Hello?
Dialogue: 5,2:52:15.18,2:52:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}约
Dialogue: 4,2:52:15.18,2:52:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jo.
Dialogue: 5,2:52:16.15,2:52:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}约
Dialogue: 4,2:52:16.15,2:52:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jo?
Dialogue: 5,2:52:18.14,2:52:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是关于...
Dialogue: 4,2:52:18.14,2:52:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's... It's...
Dialogue: 5,2:52:19.66,2:52:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-弗兰克 是你吗 -是我
Dialogue: 4,2:52:19.66,2:52:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Frank. Frank? - Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,2:52:23.03,2:52:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-嗯 -我不...
Dialogue: 4,2:52:23.03,2:52:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Yeah... - I don't...
Dialogue: 5,2:52:25.81,2:52:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-听着 我... -弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,2:52:25.81,2:52:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Look, I... - Frank...
Dialogue: 5,2:52:28.74,2:52:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你觉得他还活着吗
Dialogue: 4,2:52:28.74,2:52:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Do you think... Do you think he's alive?
Dialogue: 5,2:52:33.97,2:52:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他肯定还活着
Dialogue: 4,2:52:33.97,2:52:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's gotta be.
Dialogue: 5,2:52:36.56,2:52:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你得乐观一点
Dialogue: 4,2:52:36.56,2:52:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know, you gotta think positively.
Dialogue: 5,2:52:38.41,2:52:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还没过很久...
Dialogue: 4,2:52:38.41,2:52:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's just, you know, it ain't that long. It's just...
Dialogue: 5,2:52:40.63,2:52:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但你...
Dialogue: 4,2:52:40.63,2:52:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But do you...
Dialogue: 5,2:52:42.33,2:52:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道他现在还好吗
Dialogue: 4,2:52:42.33,2:52:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Do you know he's okay?
Dialogue: 5,2:52:43.79,2:52:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不不不 你了解我的 我...
Dialogue: 4,2:52:43.79,2:52:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, no, no, I mean, you know me, I...
Dialogue: 5,2:52:46.50,2:52:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他可能干了"香蕉乔"那样的事
Dialogue: 4,2:52:46.50,2:52:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He maybe did something like the Joe Bananas thing,
Dialogue: 5,2:52:46.52,2:52:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}美国黑手党"第一教父"
Dialogue: 3,2:52:46.52,2:52:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}约瑟夫·博南诺的外号
Dialogue: 5,2:52:49.29,2:52:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}把自己绑架了
Dialogue: 4,2:52:49.29,2:52:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}where, you know, he had himself kidnapped
Dialogue: 5,2:52:52.57,2:52:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}然后毫发无损地回来了
Dialogue: 4,2:52:52.57,2:52:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and then came back, but he wasn't hurt, nothing happened.
Dialogue: 5,2:52:55.79,2:52:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}也许他
Dialogue: 4,2:52:55.79,2:52:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Maybe he...
Dialogue: 5,2:52:57.93,2:52:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}也许他只是想
Dialogue: 4,2:52:57.93,2:52:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Maybe he just felt, you know,
Dialogue: 5,2:52:59.01,2:53:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}清理一下自己的思绪
Dialogue: 4,2:52:59.01,2:53:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he wanted to clear his head a bit.
Dialogue: 5,2:53:00.87,2:53:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但你得相信...
Dialogue: 4,2:53:00.87,2:53:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But you gotta just think that it's gonna be...
Dialogue: 5,2:53:03.81,2:53:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不会有事的
Dialogue: 4,2:53:03.81,2:53:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 5,2:53:06.04,2:53:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不会有事的
Dialogue: 4,2:53:06.04,2:53:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 5,2:53:09.24,2:53:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他不会...
Dialogue: 4,2:53:09.24,2:53:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's gonna be...
Dialogue: 5,2:53:12.28,2:53:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你有什么需要的话尽管找我
Dialogue: 4,2:53:12.28,2:53:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If you need anything, I'm here for you.
Dialogue: 5,2:53:14.72,2:53:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}任何事都行
Dialogue: 4,2:53:14.72,2:53:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Anything. Anything.
Dialogue: 5,2:53:17.99,2:53:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你可以...可以再打给我吗
Dialogue: 4,2:53:17.99,2:53:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Can you just... Can you call me again?
Dialogue: 5,2:53:19.90,2:53:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好 我会...会打给你的
Dialogue: 4,2:53:19.90,2:53:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, I'll call... I'll call you.
Dialogue: 5,2:53:23.60,2:53:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好 我会打给你的
Dialogue: 4,2:53:23.60,2:53:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, I'll... I'll call you.
Dialogue: 5,2:53:26.34,2:53:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我明早打给你
Dialogue: 4,2:53:26.34,2:53:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'll check in with you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 5,2:53:28.32,2:53:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好 明天打给我
Dialogue: 4,2:53:28.32,2:53:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yes, call me tomorrow.
Dialogue: 5,2:53:30.06,2:53:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好 我明早打给你 好吗
Dialogue: 4,2:53:30.06,2:53:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay. I'll call you in the morning, okay?
Dialogue: 5,2:53:32.49,2:53:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你保证吗
Dialogue: 4,2:53:32.49,2:53:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Promise?
Dialogue: 5,2:53:33.51,2:53:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别担心 坚强点
Dialogue: 4,2:53:33.51,2:53:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Don't worry. Be strong.
Dialogue: 5,2:53:35.42,2:53:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}乐观点 好吗
Dialogue: 4,2:53:35.42,2:53:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Be positive, huh?
Dialogue: 5,2:53:37.69,2:53:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好了 约 好了
Dialogue: 4,2:53:37.69,2:53:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay, Jo, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 5,2:53:40.99,2:53:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好了
Dialogue: 4,2:53:40.99,2:53:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay.
Dialogue: 5,2:53:42.31,2:53:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-好 -我晚点再打给你 再见
Dialogue: 4,2:53:42.31,2:53:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Okay. - Talk to ya a little later. Bye.
Dialogue: 5,2:53:44.16,2:53:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-再见 -再见 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,2:53:44.16,2:53:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Bye. - Goodbye, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,2:54:45.19,2:54:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就是这么简单
Dialogue: 4,2:54:45.19,2:54:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It was no more complicated than that.
Dialogue: 5,2:54:49.96,2:54:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}希兰先生
Dialogue: 4,2:54:49.96,2:54:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Mr. Sheeran,
Dialogue: 5,2:54:51.82,2:54:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道是否有人 是什么人
Dialogue: 4,2:54:51.82,2:54:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}do you know who, if anyone,
Dialogue: 5,2:54:54.14,2:54:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}绑架了詹姆斯·霍法吗
Dialogue: 4,2:54:54.14,2:54:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}was behind the disappearance of James Hoffa?
Dialogue: 5,2:54:56.93,2:55:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}跟吉米有关系的人
Dialogue: 4,2:54:56.93,2:55:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Everybody who ever had anything to do with Jimmy
Dialogue: 5,2:55:00.52,2:55:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}都被传唤进行问询
Dialogue: 4,2:55:00.52,2:55:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}was hauled in and questioned.
Dialogue: 5,2:55:02.40,2:55:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}根据律师的建议
Dialogue: 4,2:55:02.40,2:55:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}On the advice of counsel,
Dialogue: 5,2:55:03.35,2:55:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}恕我拒绝回答这个问题
Dialogue: 4,2:55:03.35,2:55:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I respectfully decline to answer that question
Dialogue: 5,2:55:05.51,2:55:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为这可能会使我负罪
Dialogue: 4,2:55:05.51,2:55:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}on the grounds that it might tend to incriminate me.
Dialogue: 5,2:55:07.89,2:55:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好吧 我换个问题
Dialogue: 4,2:55:07.89,2:55:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay, let me ask you this:
Dialogue: 5,2:55:10.18,2:55:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我的笔是什么颜色
Dialogue: 4,2:55:10.18,2:55:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}what color is my pen?
Dialogue: 5,2:55:14.05,2:55:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所有人都行使第五修正案拒绝回答
Dialogue: 4,2:55:14.05,2:55:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And everybody took the Fifth.
Dialogue: 5,2:55:15.26,2:55:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在那种情况下 只能这么做
Dialogue: 4,2:55:15.26,2:55:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, in that situation, that's what you do.
Dialogue: 5,2:55:18.47,2:55:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不然还能怎么做呢
Dialogue: 4,2:55:18.47,2:55:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What else are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 5,2:55:19.85,2:55:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}然而所有人都因某件事被控告和定罪
Dialogue: 4,2:55:19.85,2:55:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Still, everybody got indicted or convicted on one thing or another,
Dialogue: 5,2:55:24.43,2:55:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但不是因为那件事
Dialogue: 4,2:55:24.43,2:55:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but not that.
Dialogue: 5,2:55:25.72,2:55:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不是因为吉米
Dialogue: 4,2:55:25.72,2:55:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Not about Jimmy.
Dialogue: 5,2:55:27.14,2:55:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如你所知 没有人因为这件事入狱
Dialogue: 4,2:55:27.14,2:55:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Nobody, as you know, even went to jail for that.
Dialogue: 5,2:55:30.10,2:55:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}也没有人松口 这不常见
Dialogue: 4,2:55:30.10,2:55:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And nobody talked, which is unusual,
Dialogue: 5,2:55:32.18,2:55:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为通常来说 三个人守不住秘密
Dialogue: 4,2:55:32.18,2:55:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}'cause usually, three people can keep a secret
Dialogue: 5,2:55:34.85,2:55:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}除非另外两人不在人世
Dialogue: 4,2:55:34.85,2:55:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}only when two of them are dead.
Dialogue: 5,2:55:38.72,2:55:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}布鲁诺·邓赞塔和马尔科·罗西
Dialogue: 4,2:55:38.72,2:55:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Bruno Denzetta and Marco Rossi,
Dialogue: 5,2:55:41.30,2:55:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们因敲诈一家货运公司而分别被判刑二十年
Dialogue: 4,2:55:41.30,2:55:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}they got 20 years each for shaking down a trucking company.
Dialogue: 5,2:55:45.89,2:55:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}普罗和他们一起被判刑
Dialogue: 4,2:55:45.89,2:55:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Pro was convicted with them,
Dialogue: 5,2:55:47.47,2:55:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但他早就因为
Dialogue: 4,2:55:47.47,2:55:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but he was already back in school
Dialogue: 5,2:55:49.14,2:55:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我之前说过的另一件事进了监狱
Dialogue: 4,2:55:49.14,2:55:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}for that other matter I talked about before.
Dialogue: 5,2:55:51.72,2:55:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还记得可怜的工会财务
Dialogue: 4,2:55:51.72,2:55:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, you remember that poor union treasurer,
Dialogue: 5,2:55:53.55,2:55:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"三指"托尼吗 就是比普罗获得更多选票的那个
Dialogue: 4,2:55:53.55,2:55:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tony "Three Fingers," who got more votes than Pro?
Dialogue: 5,2:55:56.51,2:55:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们因此把他做掉了
Dialogue: 4,2:55:56.51,2:55:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They got him on that.
Dialogue: 5,2:55:58.01,2:56:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}小虫萨利动的手
Dialogue: 4,2:55:58.01,2:56:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Sally Bugs, you know, he did that one.
Dialogue: 5,2:56:07.26,2:56:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有一天 有人看见小虫走进了政府大楼
Dialogue: 4,2:56:07.26,2:56:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}One day, Bugs was seen walking into the Federal building.
Dialogue: 5,2:56:12.10,2:56:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他做的事不是犯罪
Dialogue: 4,2:56:12.10,2:56:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What he did itself ain't no crime.
Dialogue: 5,2:56:14.30,2:56:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}很多人都因为做了某事而被传唤
Dialogue: 4,2:56:14.30,2:56:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, a lot of people get called in for things.
Dialogue: 5,2:56:17.35,2:56:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但萨利明白事理
Dialogue: 4,2:56:17.35,2:56:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But Sally knows better.
Dialogue: 5,2:56:19.51,2:56:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他怎么会什么都没告诉别人呢
Dialogue: 4,2:56:19.51,2:56:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}How come he didn't say anything to anybody?
Dialogue: 5,2:56:23.05,2:56:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他一句话都没跟别人说
Dialogue: 4,2:56:23.05,2:56:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He didn't tell anybody one word.
Dialogue: 5,2:56:25.51,2:56:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一句话都没有
Dialogue: 4,2:56:25.51,2:56:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Not one word.
Dialogue: 5,2:56:27.93,2:56:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}可以肯定的是
Dialogue: 4,2:56:27.93,2:56:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And one thing for sure,
Dialogue: 5,2:56:30.68,2:56:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他去那里不是为了吃午餐的
Dialogue: 4,2:56:30.68,2:56:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he didn't go there for fucking lunch.
Dialogue: 5,2:56:45.93,2:56:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}萨利
Dialogue: 4,2:56:45.93,2:56:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Sally.
Dialogue: 5,2:56:47.72,2:56:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你好吗 -你好啊 爱尔兰人
Dialogue: 4,2:56:47.72,2:56:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- What's good? - Hey, Irish.
Dialogue: 5,2:57:01.93,2:57:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}后来才知道萨利确实跟别人说了
Dialogue: 4,2:57:01.93,2:57:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Turns out Sally did tell somebody
Dialogue: 5,2:57:03.72,2:57:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他要去那里办事
Dialogue: 4,2:57:03.72,2:57:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he had to go in there for something.
Dialogue: 5,2:57:05.51,2:57:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}只不过对方忘了告诉别人
Dialogue: 4,2:57:05.51,2:57:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They just forgot to tell somebody else.
Dialogue: 5,2:57:07.10,2:57:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们杀错人了
Dialogue: 4,2:57:07.10,2:57:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So it was a bad hit.
Dialogue: 5,2:57:12.22,2:57:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米的儿子查奇 他的养子
Dialogue: 4,2:57:12.22,2:57:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy's son, Chuckie, you know, his foster son,
Dialogue: 5,2:57:14.43,2:57:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}也参与了这件事
Dialogue: 4,2:57:14.43,2:57:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}was in the thing, too,
Dialogue: 5,2:57:15.93,2:57:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但他并不知情
Dialogue: 4,2:57:15.93,2:57:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but he didn't know it.
Dialogue: 5,2:57:18.39,2:57:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}查奇只知道他要接
Dialogue: 4,2:57:18.39,2:57:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All Chuckie knew was he was pickin' up
Dialogue: 5,2:57:20.51,2:57:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我和一个普罗的人
Dialogue: 4,2:57:20.51,2:57:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}one of Pro's guys and me,
Dialogue: 5,2:57:22.26,2:57:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}然后我们要一起到红狐餐厅
Dialogue: 4,2:57:22.26,2:57:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and we was all gonna pick up his dad
Dialogue: 5,2:57:24.39,2:57:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}接他爸去开会
Dialogue: 4,2:57:24.39,2:57:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}at the Red Fox for a meeting.
Dialogue: 5,2:57:27.01,2:57:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他参与了这件事 没错
Dialogue: 4,2:57:27.01,2:57:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, I mean, he was in it, yeah,
Dialogue: 5,2:57:28.47,2:57:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}可以这么说 但他是糊里糊涂的
Dialogue: 4,2:57:28.47,2:57:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you could say that, but stupidly.
Dialogue: 5,2:57:31.47,2:57:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我一直对查奇心怀愧疚
Dialogue: 4,2:57:31.47,2:57:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I... I always felt sorry for Chuckie in this whole thing.
Dialogue: 5,2:57:34.30,2:57:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我现在仍然很愧疚
Dialogue: 4,2:57:34.30,2:57:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And I... I still do.
Dialogue: 5,2:57:36.10,2:57:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}联调局因为一台车的破事
Dialogue: 4,2:57:36.10,2:57:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And the Feds gave him ten months
Dialogue: 5,2:57:37.76,2:57:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}让他被判刑十个月 事情大概就是这样
Dialogue: 4,2:57:37.76,2:57:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}for some bullshit thing about a car, and that's about it.
Dialogue: 5,2:57:40.43,2:57:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谁知道是在搞什么
Dialogue: 4,2:57:40.43,2:57:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Who knows what the fuck...
Dialogue: 5,2:57:43.80,2:57:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}胖子托尼·萨雷诺因为所得税的事情被抓
Dialogue: 4,2:57:43.80,2:57:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Fat Tony Salerno, they got on an income tax thing.
Dialogue: 5,2:57:48.01,2:57:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不久之后
Dialogue: 4,2:57:48.01,2:57:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A little while after,
Dialogue: 5,2:57:48.97,2:57:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他被查出患有前列腺癌
Dialogue: 4,2:57:48.97,2:57:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}he was diagnosed with prostate cancer.
Dialogue: 5,2:57:55.39,2:57:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}北加州有一家
Dialogue: 4,2:57:55.39,2:57:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There's a... a pork store up in...
Dialogue: 5,2:58:00.60,2:58:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}猪肉店
Dialogue: 4,2:58:00.60,2:58:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}northern California.
Dialogue: 5,2:58:03.85,2:58:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就在
Dialogue: 4,2:58:03.85,2:58:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Right around...
Dialogue: 5,2:58:06.30,2:58:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}核桃溪市边上
Dialogue: 4,2:58:06.30,2:58:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Walnut Creek.
Dialogue: 5,2:58:07.22,2:58:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你是从那里来的 对吧
Dialogue: 4,2:58:07.22,2:58:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're from up there, ain't you?
Dialogue: 5,2:58:09.18,2:58:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-对 -嗯
Dialogue: 4,2:58:09.18,2:58:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,2:58:10.72,2:58:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你可能还认识店主
Dialogue: 4,2:58:10.72,2:58:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And you might even know the guy that runs it.
Dialogue: 5,2:58:13.55,2:58:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}其实 我想让你帮个忙
Dialogue: 4,2:58:13.55,2:58:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Actually, I'm looking for a little favor...
Dialogue: 5,2:58:16.22,2:58:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}帮他 不是帮我
Dialogue: 4,2:58:16.22,2:58:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}for him, not for me.
Dialogue: 5,2:58:19.01,2:58:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你能不能帮他弄张机票 比如去澳大利亚的
Dialogue: 4,2:58:19.01,2:58:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But if you can get him a ticket, like, to Australia...
Dialogue: 5,2:58:24.30,2:58:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你懂我的意思
Dialogue: 4,2:58:24.30,2:58:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 5,2:58:28.14,2:58:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好
Dialogue: 4,2:58:28.14,2:58:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,2:58:30.72,2:58:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你愿意帮他出国吗
Dialogue: 4,2:58:30.72,2:58:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You want to help him get down there?
Dialogue: 5,2:58:38.30,2:58:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}愿意
Dialogue: 4,2:58:38.30,2:58:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Ye... Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,2:58:39.51,2:58:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素被抓了
Dialogue: 4,2:58:39.51,2:58:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Now, Russell, he got pinched
Dialogue: 5,2:58:41.30,2:58:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为杰克·拿波里从他那赊账
Dialogue: 4,2:58:41.30,2:58:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}for telling Jimmy the Weasel to strangle Jack Napoli
Dialogue: 5,2:58:43.93,2:58:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}拿走了价值两万五的珠宝却没还钱
Dialogue: 4,2:58:43.93,2:58:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}over some beef about 25 grand of jewelry
Dialogue: 5,2:58:46.72,2:58:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}于是他让黄鼠狼吉米
Dialogue: 4,2:58:46.72,2:58:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}that Jack took on credit from Russell
Dialogue: 5,2:58:49.26,2:58:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}去把杰克勒死
Dialogue: 4,2:58:49.26,2:58:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and then he never paid for.
Dialogue: 5,2:58:51.43,2:58:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你不能对罗素做这样的事
Dialogue: 4,2:58:51.43,2:58:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Now, with Russ, you don't do that.
Dialogue: 5,2:58:54.85,2:58:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}问题在于 黄鼠狼叛变了
Dialogue: 4,2:58:54.85,2:58:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}So, only thing is, the Weasel, he flipped.
Dialogue: 5,2:58:58.14,2:58:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他身上带了窃听器
Dialogue: 4,2:58:58.14,2:58:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He had a wire on him.
Dialogue: 5,2:59:00.01,2:59:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们声称他"密谋杀害目击者"
Dialogue: 4,2:59:00.01,2:59:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They called it "conspiracy to kill a witness."
Dialogue: 5,2:59:02.64,2:59:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}显而易见的是
Dialogue: 4,2:59:02.64,2:59:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It was obvious to everybody else
Dialogue: 5,2:59:03.93,2:59:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}拿波里做得不对
Dialogue: 4,2:59:03.93,2:59:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}that Napoli was clearly in the wrong.
Dialogue: 5,2:59:05.76,2:59:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这难道不明显吗
Dialogue: 4,2:59:05.76,2:59:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, how could you not see that?
Dialogue: 5,2:59:07.97,2:59:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他陷害了他 这是诱捕
Dialogue: 4,2:59:07.97,2:59:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He set him up. It was entrapment.
Dialogue: 5,2:59:09.85,2:59:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}难道不是吗
Dialogue: 4,2:59:09.85,2:59:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What else could you call it?
Dialogue: 5,2:59:11.43,2:59:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但这件事我现在也不想细说
Dialogue: 4,2:59:11.43,2:59:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But that's another thing I don't wanna get into now.
Dialogue: 5,2:59:15.72,2:59:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}举起右手
Dialogue: 4,2:59:15.72,2:59:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Raise your right hand.
Dialogue: 5,2:59:16.51,2:59:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们把我送上法庭 指控我行贿和工会诈骗
Dialogue: 4,2:59:16.51,2:59:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They brought me up on bribery and labor racketeering charges
Dialogue: 5,2:59:19.89,2:59:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还有其他一些我不知道的破事
Dialogue: 4,2:59:19.89,2:59:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and some other bullshit things I don't know.
Dialogue: 5,2:59:21.68,2:59:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谋杀 谋杀未遂 恐吓 挪用公款 纵火
Dialogue: 5,2:59:22.35,2:59:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你是否向上帝发誓 你所说的全是事实
Dialogue: 4,2:59:22.35,2:59:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the whole truth and nothing but the truth,
Dialogue: 5,2:59:24.18,2:59:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-没有任何隐瞒 -我发誓
Dialogue: 4,2:59:24.18,2:59:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- so help you God? - I do.
Dialogue: 5,2:59:25.76,2:59:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你是否还告诉他们巴法先生
Dialogue: 4,2:59:25.76,2:59:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Did you also tell them that Mr. Boffa
Dialogue: 5,2:59:27.89,2:59:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}送了你和你妻子豪车
Dialogue: 4,2:59:27.89,2:59:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}had given you and your wife luxury vehicles?
Dialogue: 5,2:59:30.01,2:59:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}科尔先生 我工作了44年
Dialogue: 4,2:59:30.01,2:59:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Mr. Cole, I worked for 44 years,
Dialogue: 5,2:59:33.26,2:59:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我没收过巴法或者别人的任何不法之财
Dialogue: 4,2:59:33.26,2:59:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I never took one dime illegal off Boffa or nobody else.
Dialogue: 5,2:59:37.72,2:59:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你怎么想是你的事 跟我没关系
Dialogue: 4,2:59:37.72,2:59:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You can think whatever you wanna think. Don't matter to me.
Dialogue: 5,2:59:40.18,2:59:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但他们能落实的罪名 只有我炸了一家吊车公司
Dialogue: 4,2:59:40.18,2:59:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But all they got me for was blowing up a crane company
Dialogue: 5,2:59:43.26,2:59:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那家公司开除了我的两个工会谈判代表
Dialogue: 4,2:59:43.26,2:59:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}that fired two of my shop stewards
Dialogue: 5,2:59:45.35,2:59:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}却没有正当的理由
Dialogue: 4,2:59:45.35,2:59:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}for no good reason.
Dialogue: 5,2:59:49.01,2:59:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还有我的林肯汽车
Dialogue: 4,2:59:49.01,2:59:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And... And my Lincoln.
Dialogue: 5,2:59:51.47,2:59:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我从尤金·巴法手里买下来的
Dialogue: 4,2:59:51.47,2:59:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, I bought that car from Eugene Boffa.
Dialogue: 5,2:59:54.97,2:59:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他向货运公司出租卡车司机
Dialogue: 4,2:59:54.97,2:59:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He leased truck drivers to freight companies,
Dialogue: 5,2:59:57.55,3:00:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}然后付给他们低于正常标准的工资
Dialogue: 4,2:59:57.55,3:00:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and then he paid them substandard wages.
Dialogue: 5,3:00:02.35,3:00:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们说我买这辆车花的钱
Dialogue: 4,3:00:02.35,3:00:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They said I paid a lot less for the car
Dialogue: 5,3:00:04.60,3:00:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}远低于其价值
Dialogue: 4,3:00:04.60,3:00:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}than what it was worth.
Dialogue: 5,3:00:06.68,3:00:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们说这辆车是贿赂
Dialogue: 4,3:00:06.68,3:00:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They said the car was a bribe.
Dialogue: 5,3:00:14.80,3:00:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我爱这辆车
Dialogue: 4,3:00:14.80,3:00:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I... I... I loved that car.
Dialogue: 5,3:00:17.47,3:00:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但它不值得我为它坐十八年牢
Dialogue: 4,3:00:17.47,3:00:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But it wasn't worth the 18 years they gave me for it.
Dialogue: 5,3:00:21.47,3:00:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是肯定的
Dialogue: 4,3:00:21.47,3:00:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's for sure.
Dialogue: 5,3:00:27.39,3:00:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素中风了
Dialogue: 4,3:00:27.39,3:00:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Russell, he had a stroke.
Dialogue: 5,3:00:29.80,3:00:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}胖托尼尿失禁了
Dialogue: 4,3:00:29.80,3:00:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Fat Tony, he couldn't control his urine no more.
Dialogue: 5,3:00:33.39,3:00:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我在安齐奥的散兵坑里得上的关节炎
Dialogue: 4,3:00:33.39,3:00:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And my arthritis that started in the foxholes of Anzio
Dialogue: 5,3:00:38.01,3:00:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不断折磨着我的腰
Dialogue: 4,3:00:38.01,3:00:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}was eatin' away at my lower back now,
Dialogue: 5,3:00:40.64,3:00:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我的脚已经没什么知觉了
Dialogue: 4,3:00:40.64,3:00:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and I couldn't feel much in my feet no more.
Dialogue: 5,3:00:43.68,3:00:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我需要拄拐杖
Dialogue: 4,3:00:43.68,3:00:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I needed a cane.
Dialogue: 5,3:00:44.80,3:00:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但他们不会在牢里给你配拐杖
Dialogue: 4,3:00:44.80,3:00:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But, you know, they're not gonna give you a cane in the can
Dialogue: 5,3:00:47.76,3:00:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为他们怕你把它当作武器
Dialogue: 4,3:00:47.76,3:00:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}because they say you're gonna use it as a weapon.
Dialogue: 5,3:00:50.68,3:00:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有一种叫诺立汀的药
Dialogue: 4,3:00:50.68,3:00:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There was this medicine, Neurontin,
Dialogue: 5,3:00:52.43,3:00:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对我有点帮助
Dialogue: 4,3:00:52.43,3:00:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}it helped me a little bit,
Dialogue: 5,3:00:53.60,3:00:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但也会使你神经错乱
Dialogue: 4,3:00:53.60,3:00:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}but it also made you loopy.
Dialogue: 5,3:00:55.72,3:00:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他要打中了
Dialogue: 4,3:00:55.72,3:00:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's got it!
Dialogue: 5,3:00:57.30,3:00:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他要打中了
Dialogue: 4,3:00:57.30,3:00:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's got it!
Dialogue: 5,3:00:59.89,3:01:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们在严寒中
Dialogue: 4,3:00:59.89,3:01:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We were all falling apart right there
Dialogue: 5,3:01:01.22,3:01:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}都要崩溃了
Dialogue: 4,3:01:01.22,3:01:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}in the freezing fucking cold.
Dialogue: 5,3:01:02.89,3:01:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我在这里就能看到 你现在怕了吗
Dialogue: 4,3:01:02.89,3:01:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I can see it from here. You getting scared now?
Dialogue: 5,3:01:04.76,3:01:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你再练个十年
Dialogue: 4,3:01:04.76,3:01:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, you stay here another fucking ten years,
Dialogue: 5,3:01:06.68,3:01:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}才有可能赢我
Dialogue: 4,3:01:06.68,3:01:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you'll beat me.
Dialogue: 5,3:01:17.01,3:01:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是好喝的葡萄汁吗
Dialogue: 4,3:01:17.01,3:01:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Is this the good grape juice?
Dialogue: 5,3:01:31.64,3:01:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我吃不了这个
Dialogue: 4,3:01:31.64,3:01:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I can't eat it.
Dialogue: 5,3:01:33.51,3:01:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-吃一口 -我没牙 吃不了
Dialogue: 4,3:01:33.51,3:01:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Take a bite. - I got no teeth. I can't.
Dialogue: 5,3:01:35.22,3:01:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}给我一小块
Dialogue: 4,3:01:35.22,3:01:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Put a little piece.
Dialogue: 5,3:01:37.01,3:01:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一小块就好 谢谢
Dialogue: 4,3:01:37.01,3:01:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Just a little piece, thank you.
Dialogue: 5,3:01:38.43,3:01:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还要吗
Dialogue: 4,3:01:38.43,3:01:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's it?
Dialogue: 5,3:01:52.97,3:01:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-好吃吧 -好吃
Dialogue: 4,3:01:52.97,3:01:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- E buono, no? - Buono.
Dialogue: 5,3:01:55.30,3:01:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好吃
Dialogue: 4,3:01:55.30,3:01:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Buono.
Dialogue: 5,3:02:01.10,3:02:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吉米是个好人
Dialogue: 4,3:02:01.10,3:02:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy was a good man.
Dialogue: 5,3:02:03.30,3:02:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他还有美满的家庭 不是吗
Dialogue: 4,3:02:03.30,3:02:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know? He had a nice family too, huh?
Dialogue: 5,3:02:08.68,3:02:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是的 我知道
Dialogue: 4,3:02:08.68,3:02:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah. Yeah. I know.
Dialogue: 5,3:02:12.14,3:02:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我从没想过要把事情做这么绝
Dialogue: 4,3:02:12.14,3:02:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I never wanted it to go that far.
Dialogue: 5,3:02:23.76,3:02:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我为了我们的利益而放弃了他
Dialogue: 4,3:02:23.76,3:02:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I picked us over him.
Dialogue: 5,3:02:27.43,3:02:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}去他们的
Dialogue: 4,3:02:27.43,3:02:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Fuck 'em.
Dialogue: 5,3:02:29.64,3:02:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}去他们的
Dialogue: 4,3:02:29.64,3:02:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Fuck 'em.
Dialogue: 5,3:02:32.64,3:02:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}去他们的
Dialogue: 4,3:02:32.64,3:02:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Fuck 'em.
Dialogue: 5,3:02:39.60,3:02:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}吃吧 小子 吃吧
Dialogue: 4,3:02:39.60,3:02:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Mangia che cresci... figlio mio, mangia.
Dialogue: 5,3:02:58.43,3:02:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素
Dialogue: 4,3:02:58.43,3:02:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hey, Russ.
Dialogue: 5,3:02:59.72,3:03:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,3:02:59.72,3:03:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hey, Frankie.
Dialogue: 5,3:03:01.01,3:03:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你要去哪 -什么
Dialogue: 4,3:03:01.01,3:03:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Where you goin'? - What?
Dialogue: 5,3:03:02.85,3:03:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-你要去哪 -我要去教堂
Dialogue: 4,3:03:02.85,3:03:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Where you goin'? - I'm going to church.
Dialogue: 5,3:03:05.89,3:03:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}教堂
Dialogue: 4,3:03:05.89,3:03:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Church?
Dialogue: 5,3:03:07.30,3:03:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别笑 到时你就知道了
Dialogue: 4,3:03:07.30,3:03:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Don't laugh, you'll see.
Dialogue: 5,3:03:09.01,3:03:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别笑
Dialogue: 4,3:03:09.01,3:03:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Don't laugh.
Dialogue: 5,3:03:10.72,3:03:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}到时你就知道了
Dialogue: 4,3:03:10.72,3:03:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You'll see.
Dialogue: 5,3:03:19.80,3:03:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素去了教堂
Dialogue: 4,3:03:19.80,3:03:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Russell went to church.
Dialogue: 5,3:03:23.72,3:03:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}后来他去了监狱的医院
Dialogue: 4,3:03:23.72,3:03:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Then he went to the prison hospital.
Dialogue: 5,3:03:29.14,3:03:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}再后来他进了坟墓
Dialogue: 4,3:03:29.14,3:03:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And... And then he went to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 5,3:03:35.30,3:03:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}主耶稣基督
Dialogue: 4,3:03:35.30,3:03:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Lord Jesus Christ...
Dialogue: 5,3:03:38.43,3:03:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我在那年的十月出狱了
Dialogue: 4,3:03:38.43,3:03:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I got out that October.
Dialogue: 5,3:03:40.35,3:03:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}琳妮在十二月去世了
Dialogue: 4,3:03:40.35,3:03:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Reenie died in December.
Dialogue: 5,3:03:42.80,3:03:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}准确地说是12月23日
Dialogue: 4,3:03:42.80,3:03:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}On December 23rd, to be exact.
Dialogue: 5,3:03:45.93,3:03:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}肺癌
Dialogue: 4,3:03:45.93,3:03:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Lung cancer.
Dialogue: 5,3:03:47.60,3:03:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一点也不意外
Dialogue: 4,3:03:47.60,3:03:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No surprise.
Dialogue: 5,3:03:49.76,3:03:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}即使夺去了我们必死的身躯
Dialogue: 4,3:03:49.76,3:03:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...even as it claims our mortal bodies.
Dialogue: 5,3:03:52.93,3:03:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}让我们的姐妹在此安眠
Dialogue: 4,3:03:52.93,3:03:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Grant that our sister may sleep here in peace,
Dialogue: 5,3:03:55.80,3:03:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}直至您用荣光将她唤醒
Dialogue: 4,3:03:55.80,3:03:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}until you awaken her to glory.
Dialogue: 5,3:03:58.80,3:04:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为您就是复苏和生命
Dialogue: 4,3:03:58.80,3:04:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}For you are the resurrection and the life.
Dialogue: 5,3:04:01.55,3:04:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}然后她将与您面对面
Dialogue: 4,3:04:01.55,3:04:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And then she will see you face to face,
Dialogue: 5,3:04:04.18,3:04:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在您的光明中看见光明
Dialogue: 4,3:04:04.18,3:04:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and in your light will see light,
Dialogue: 5,3:04:06.68,3:04:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}感受上帝的光辉 直到永远
Dialogue: 4,3:04:06.68,3:04:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and know the splendor of God for ever and ever.
Dialogue: 5,3:04:11.26,3:04:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}阿门
Dialogue: 4,3:04:11.26,3:04:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Amen.
Dialogue: 5,3:04:45.26,3:04:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这个赛季他的击打率比生涯平均的29.6%
Dialogue: 4,3:04:45.26,3:04:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...six points shy of his career average of .296
Dialogue: 5,3:04:50.26,3:04:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}低了六个百分点
Dialogue: 4,3:04:50.26,3:04:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}coming into this season.
Dialogue: 5,3:04:51.89,3:04:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}费城队阵容里前四位击球员
Dialogue: 4,3:04:51.89,3:04:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Top four batters in this lineup for Philadelphia
Dialogue: 5,3:04:54.68,3:04:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}都是左右手都能打的
Dialogue: 4,3:04:54.68,3:04:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}today are all switch hitters.
Dialogue: 5,3:05:50.76,3:05:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}使一些政策制定者失望的是
Dialogue: 4,3:05:50.76,3:05:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Much to the frustration of some policy makers,
Dialogue: 5,3:05:53.39,3:05:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}北约军事领导人不会冒险
Dialogue: 4,3:05:53.39,3:05:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}NATO military leaders will not risk
Dialogue: 5,3:05:56.22,3:05:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对科索沃的塞尔维亚军队发动低空袭击
Dialogue: 4,3:05:56.22,3:05:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}low flying attacks on Serb troops in Kosovo.
Dialogue: 5,3:06:01.05,3:06:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}还需要进行多日的系统轰炸
Dialogue: 4,3:06:01.05,3:06:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It could take days more of systematic bombing,
Dialogue: 5,3:06:04.35,3:06:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}尤其是因为塞尔维亚人
Dialogue: 4,3:06:04.35,3:06:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}especially since the Serbs
Dialogue: 5,3:06:05.68,3:06:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}将很多防空导弹藏了起来
Dialogue: 4,3:06:05.68,3:06:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}have hidden so many of their anti-aircraft missiles,
Dialogue: 5,3:06:08.85,3:06:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}想引诱北约军队进行低空空袭
Dialogue: 4,3:06:08.85,3:06:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}in essence, daring NATO to fly low.
Dialogue: 5,3:06:34.72,3:06:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你去吧 去吧
Dialogue: 4,3:06:34.72,3:06:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You go... you go there. Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 5,3:06:37.47,3:06:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}去吧
Dialogue: 4,3:06:37.47,3:06:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 5,3:06:45.05,3:06:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}暂停营业
Dialogue: 4,3:06:45.05,3:06:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}请到隔壁柜台
Dialogue: 5,3:06:47.89,3:06:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}佩琪
Dialogue: 3,3:06:47.89,3:06:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Peggy.
Dialogue: 5,3:06:48.97,3:06:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}佩琪 我只是想和你聊聊
Dialogue: 4,3:06:48.97,3:06:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Peggy. I just want to talk.
Dialogue: 5,3:07:13.35,3:07:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我只是 我...
Dialogue: 4,3:07:13.35,3:07:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I just, you know... I...
Dialogue: 5,3:07:15.30,3:07:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她走开了
Dialogue: 4,3:07:15.30,3:07:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}She walked away.
Dialogue: 5,3:07:17.85,3:07:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道她生我的气 但我想...
Dialogue: 4,3:07:17.85,3:07:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know she's mad at me and all, but I... I want...
Dialogue: 5,3:07:20.55,3:07:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}打给她 打给她 我只是想和她聊聊
Dialogue: 4,3:07:20.55,3:07:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Call her. Call her. I just want to talk to her.
Dialogue: 5,3:07:24.76,3:07:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}和她聊什么呢
Dialogue: 4,3:07:24.76,3:07:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Talk to her and tell her what?
Dialogue: 5,3:07:26.93,3:07:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}什么
Dialogue: 4,3:07:26.93,3:07:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What...
Dialogue: 5,3:07:28.39,3:07:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我只是想跟她道个歉 仅此而已
Dialogue: 4,3:07:28.39,3:07:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I just want to say I'm sorry. That's all.
Dialogue: 5,3:07:32.05,3:07:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}为什么道歉
Dialogue: 4,3:07:32.05,3:07:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}For?
Dialogue: 5,3:07:35.55,3:07:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}听着
Dialogue: 4,3:07:35.55,3:07:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Look...
Dialogue: 5,3:07:37.76,3:07:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道我不是个好父亲 我知道
Dialogue: 4,3:07:37.76,3:07:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know I wasn't a... a good dad. I know that.
Dialogue: 5,3:07:40.89,3:07:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道 我只是想保护她
Dialogue: 4,3:07:40.89,3:07:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know that. I was just trying to protect her.
Dialogue: 5,3:07:43.60,3:07:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}保护你们每个人不受伤害
Dialogue: 4,3:07:43.60,3:07:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Protect all of youse.
Dialogue: 5,3:07:44.72,3:07:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那就是我做的事
Dialogue: 4,3:07:44.72,3:07:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, that's what I was doing. That's...
Dialogue: 5,3:07:48.26,3:07:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}受什么伤害
Dialogue: 4,3:07:48.26,3:07:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}From what?
Dialogue: 5,3:07:50.51,3:07:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一切事情
Dialogue: 4,3:07:50.51,3:07:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, everything.
Dialogue: 5,3:07:52.10,3:07:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我是说
Dialogue: 4,3:07:52.10,3:07:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean...
Dialogue: 5,3:07:53.47,3:07:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}某种程度上 你们以前过着受保护的生活
Dialogue: 4,3:07:53.47,3:07:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You... Youse had a sheltered life, in a way,
Dialogue: 5,3:07:57.14,3:07:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为你们没见过我所见过的事
Dialogue: 4,3:07:57.14,3:07:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}because you didn't see what I see
Dialogue: 5,3:07:59.01,3:08:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没经历过我所经历的事
Dialogue: 4,3:07:59.01,3:08:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and what I've been through.
Dialogue: 5,3:08:02.18,3:08:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}外面有很多坏人
Dialogue: 4,3:08:02.18,3:08:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There's a lot of bad people out there.
Dialogue: 5,3:08:05.14,3:08:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我还能做什么
Dialogue: 4,3:08:05.14,3:08:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What else am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 5,3:08:07.43,3:08:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}爸 你根本不知道我们以前的感受
Dialogue: 4,3:08:07.43,3:08:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Daddy, you have no idea what it was like for us.
Dialogue: 5,3:08:11.60,3:08:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们出了问题没法找你
Dialogue: 4,3:08:11.60,3:08:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, we couldn't go to you with a problem
Dialogue: 5,3:08:13.26,3:08:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}怕你会做不好的事
Dialogue: 4,3:08:13.26,3:08:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}'cause of what you would do.
Dialogue: 5,3:08:14.85,3:08:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们没法向你寻求保护
Dialogue: 4,3:08:14.85,3:08:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know, we couldn't come to you for protection
Dialogue: 5,3:08:17.26,3:08:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为你会做可怕的事
Dialogue: 4,3:08:17.26,3:08:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}because of the terrible things that you would do.
Dialogue: 5,3:08:22.47,3:08:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我只是 只是
Dialogue: 4,3:08:22.47,3:08:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I was just... I was...
Dialogue: 5,3:08:23.47,3:08:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不想看你们受到伤害 仅此而已
Dialogue: 4,3:08:23.47,3:08:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I didn't want to see youse get hurt, that's all.
Dialogue: 5,3:08:31.10,3:08:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道你们读到过 听说过很多我的事情
Dialogue: 4,3:08:31.10,3:08:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know you read a lot of things about me, heard about me.
Dialogue: 5,3:08:34.18,3:08:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对不起
Dialogue: 4,3:08:34.18,3:08:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 5,3:08:35.76,3:08:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我...
Dialogue: 4,3:08:35.76,3:08:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I...
Dialogue: 5,3:08:38.85,3:08:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我现在能做些什么来补偿你们吗
Dialogue: 4,3:08:38.85,3:08:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Can I do anything now to make it up to you?
Dialogue: 5,3:08:53.76,3:08:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如果你想要奢华一点的
Dialogue: 4,3:08:53.76,3:08:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If you're looking for something with a little bit more luxury,
Dialogue: 5,3:08:56.18,3:08:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们有这两款
Dialogue: 4,3:08:56.18,3:08:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}we have these two models over here.
Dialogue: 5,3:08:58.39,3:09:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}它们就像棺材界的凯迪拉克
Dialogue: 4,3:08:58.39,3:09:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They're like the Cadillacs of caskets.
Dialogue: 5,3:09:01.05,3:09:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如果你要火化的话
Dialogue: 4,3:09:01.05,3:09:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Now, if we puttin' you in the fuckin' oven,
Dialogue: 5,3:09:02.68,3:09:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}用什么棺材其实都无所谓
Dialogue: 4,3:09:02.68,3:09:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}it really doesn't matter what you go in.
Dialogue: 5,3:09:04.97,3:09:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}越便宜越好
Dialogue: 4,3:09:04.97,3:09:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The cheapest shit possible.
Dialogue: 5,3:09:06.55,3:09:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}复合板就够了
Dialogue: 4,3:09:06.55,3:09:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Particle board, that's it.
Dialogue: 5,3:09:08.51,3:09:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}后事打算怎么办 火葬吗
Dialogue: 4,3:09:08.51,3:09:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What are we doin' today? Are we doin' a cremation?
Dialogue: 5,3:09:11.68,3:09:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-土葬 -土葬
Dialogue: 4,3:09:11.68,3:09:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- A burial. - Burial?
Dialogue: 5,3:09:14.35,3:09:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是男人还是女人
Dialogue: 4,3:09:14.35,3:09:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Is it for a man or for a woman?
Dialogue: 5,3:09:16.01,3:09:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是我
Dialogue: 4,3:09:16.01,3:09:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Me.
Dialogue: 5,3:09:18.05,3:09:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}靠
Dialogue: 4,3:09:18.05,3:09:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Shit.
Dialogue: 5,3:09:23.55,3:09:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有喜欢的吗
Dialogue: 4,3:09:23.55,3:09:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You see anything you like?
Dialogue: 5,3:09:36.26,3:09:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-那个绿色的 -那个很漂亮
Dialogue: 4,3:09:36.26,3:09:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- That green one. - That's a beauty.
Dialogue: 5,3:09:38.39,3:09:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如果你今天就买的话
Dialogue: 4,3:09:38.39,3:09:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That one'll set you back about $7,500
Dialogue: 5,3:09:40.64,3:09:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}大概要七千五百块
Dialogue: 4,3:09:40.64,3:09:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}if you take it home today.
Dialogue: 5,3:09:42.97,3:09:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你觉得呢
Dialogue: 4,3:09:42.97,3:09:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What do you think?
Dialogue: 5,3:09:45.47,3:09:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}能便宜点吗
Dialogue: 4,3:09:45.47,3:09:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Can you do any better?
Dialogue: 5,3:09:47.55,3:09:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}伙计 你想在这棺材里长眠是吧
Dialogue: 4,3:09:47.55,3:09:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, buddy, this is what you want to go home in, no?
Dialogue: 5,3:09:53.85,3:09:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那就算你六千吧 怎么样
Dialogue: 4,3:09:53.85,3:09:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I think we could go six on that for you. How about that?
Dialogue: 5,3:09:57.05,3:09:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-六千现金 行吗 -可以
Dialogue: 4,3:09:57.05,3:09:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Six flat cash work for you? - That's good.
Dialogue: 5,3:10:00.55,3:10:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}可以
Dialogue: 4,3:10:00.55,3:10:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Good for me.
Dialogue: 5,3:10:21.55,3:10:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}迟早
Dialogue: 4,3:10:21.55,3:10:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Sooner or later,
Dialogue: 5,3:10:23.30,3:10:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这世上每一个人都有离开的那天
Dialogue: 4,3:10:23.30,3:10:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}everybody put here has a date when he's gonna go.
Dialogue: 5,3:10:26.39,3:10:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}人生就是如此
Dialogue: 4,3:10:26.39,3:10:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's just the way it is.
Dialogue: 5,3:10:29.14,3:10:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我认为离开的时候肯定会发生什么
Dialogue: 4,3:10:29.14,3:10:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And I think there's gotta be something when you go
Dialogue: 5,3:10:33.76,3:10:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不然 这一切到底是怎么开始的
Dialogue: 4,3:10:33.76,3:10:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}'cause, I mean, how the hell did this whole thing start?
Dialogue: 5,3:10:42.10,3:10:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}比我聪明的人都没搞清楚
Dialogue: 4,3:10:42.10,3:10:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}People smarter than me can't figure it out.
Dialogue: 5,3:10:44.60,3:10:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所以我绝对不会选择火葬
Dialogue: 4,3:10:44.60,3:10:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's why I would never go for cremation
Dialogue: 5,3:10:46.43,3:10:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为那就真的结束了
Dialogue: 4,3:10:46.43,3:10:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}because it's so... it's so final.
Dialogue: 5,3:10:50.68,3:10:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这个
Dialogue: 4,3:10:50.68,3:10:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This... This one.
Dialogue: 5,3:10:53.60,3:10:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}1948号
Dialogue: 4,3:10:53.60,3:10:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}1948.
Dialogue: 5,3:10:56.18,3:10:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对埋葬你的人来说最难接受的
Dialogue: 4,3:10:56.18,3:10:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's the hardest part of anybody when they bury youse,
Dialogue: 5,3:10:59.22,3:11:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就是入土的时候
Dialogue: 4,3:10:59.22,3:11:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}is when they go into the ground
Dialogue: 5,3:11:01.10,3:11:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为那就真的结束了
Dialogue: 4,3:11:01.10,3:11:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}because it's... it's so final.
Dialogue: 5,3:11:04.72,3:11:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}如果你要埋在房子里 房子还在
Dialogue: 4,3:11:04.72,3:11:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}If you go into a building, the building's there.
Dialogue: 5,3:11:07.18,3:11:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}墓还在
Dialogue: 4,3:11:07.18,3:11:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The crypt is there.
Dialogue: 5,3:11:08.68,3:11:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一定要用金属棺材
Dialogue: 4,3:11:08.68,3:11:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It has to be a metal casket,
Dialogue: 5,3:11:10.30,3:11:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们把你放在房间里
Dialogue: 4,3:11:10.30,3:11:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and they have you in the room.
Dialogue: 5,3:11:12.51,3:11:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}都放好
Dialogue: 4,3:11:12.51,3:11:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And all that there.
Dialogue: 5,3:11:13.97,3:11:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就不算完全结束了
Dialogue: 4,3:11:13.97,3:11:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's just not as final.
Dialogue: 5,3:11:15.26,3:11:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你死了 但还没结束
Dialogue: 4,3:11:15.26,3:11:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're dead, but it ain't that final.
Dialogue: 5,3:11:21.39,3:11:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}抱歉 如果你们想谈霍法先生的事
Dialogue: 4,3:11:21.39,3:11:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm sorry, but I gotta direct youse to my attorney,
Dialogue: 5,3:11:25.64,3:11:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我就得
Dialogue: 4,3:11:25.64,3:11:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Mr. Ragano...
Dialogue: 5,3:11:28.72,3:11:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}请你们去找我的律师
Dialogue: 4,3:11:28.72,3:11:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}if youse want to talk about Mr. Hoffa or...
Dialogue: 5,3:11:31.85,3:11:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}雷加诺先生
Dialogue: 4,3:11:31.85,3:11:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}or any matter, for that matter.
Dialogue: 5,3:11:33.93,3:11:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我没有别的可说的
Dialogue: 4,3:11:33.93,3:11:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I got noth... nothing new to say.
Dialogue: 5,3:11:36.89,3:11:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他死了
Dialogue: 4,3:11:36.89,3:11:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's dead.
Dialogue: 5,3:11:38.89,3:11:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谁死了
Dialogue: 4,3:11:38.89,3:11:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Who's dead?
Dialogue: 5,3:11:40.55,3:11:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你的律师 雷加诺先生
Dialogue: 4,3:11:40.55,3:11:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Your attorney, Mr. Ragano.
Dialogue: 5,3:11:42.10,3:11:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-他死了 -是的
Dialogue: 4,3:11:42.10,3:11:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- He's dead? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,3:11:42.97,3:11:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}谁干的
Dialogue: 4,3:11:42.97,3:11:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Who did it?
Dialogue: 5,3:11:45.89,3:11:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}癌症
Dialogue: 4,3:11:45.89,3:11:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Cancer.
Dialogue: 5,3:11:49.68,3:11:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所有人都死了 希兰先生
Dialogue: 4,3:11:49.68,3:11:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Everybody's dead, Mr. Sheeran.
Dialogue: 5,3:11:53.39,3:11:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}结束了
Dialogue: 4,3:11:53.39,3:11:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's over.
Dialogue: 5,3:11:55.05,3:11:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们都死了
Dialogue: 4,3:11:55.05,3:11:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They're all gone.
Dialogue: 5,3:11:56.47,3:11:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罗素 安吉洛 萨雷诺
Dialogue: 4,3:11:56.47,3:11:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Russell, Angelo, Salerno,
Dialogue: 5,3:11:58.80,3:12:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}普罗 多夫曼 小虫萨利
Dialogue: 4,3:11:58.80,3:12:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Pro, Dorfman, Sally Bugs.
Dialogue: 5,3:12:01.14,3:12:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们都死了
Dialogue: 4,3:12:01.14,3:12:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They're gone.
Dialogue: 5,3:12:03.93,3:12:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你在保护谁
Dialogue: 4,3:12:03.93,3:12:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Who are you protecting?
Dialogue: 5,3:12:07.39,3:12:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你知道谁没死吗
Dialogue: 4,3:12:07.39,3:12:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You know who's not gone?
Dialogue: 5,3:12:10.30,3:12:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}霍法先生的家人 他的孩子们
Dialogue: 4,3:12:10.30,3:12:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Mr. Hoffa's family. His children.
Dialogue: 5,3:12:13.18,3:12:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他们还活着 他们一辈子都得不到真相
Dialogue: 4,3:12:13.18,3:12:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They're here. And they gotta live not knowing.
Dialogue: 5,3:12:17.64,3:12:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}那很难熬
Dialogue: 4,3:12:17.64,3:12:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's hard to do.
Dialogue: 5,3:12:21.76,3:12:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你也有孩子 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,3:12:21.76,3:12:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I mean, you got kids, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,3:12:24.05,3:12:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你能想象吗
Dialogue: 4,3:12:24.05,3:12:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Can you imagine?
Dialogue: 5,3:12:30.80,3:12:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克 是时候了 该说出真相了
Dialogue: 4,3:12:30.80,3:12:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank, it's time. It's time you say what happened.
Dialogue: 5,3:12:40.80,3:12:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你们看起来人不错
Dialogue: 4,3:12:40.80,3:12:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You seem like nice fellas.
Dialogue: 5,3:12:43.68,3:12:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}感谢你们亲自来找我
Dialogue: 4,3:12:43.68,3:12:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I appreciate youse coming to see me.
Dialogue: 5,3:12:46.55,3:12:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但我帮不了你们
Dialogue: 4,3:12:46.55,3:12:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But I... I can't help you.
Dialogue: 5,3:12:52.18,3:12:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就这样吗
Dialogue: 4,3:12:52.18,3:12:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's it?
Dialogue: 5,3:12:53.05,3:12:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就这样
Dialogue: 4,3:12:53.05,3:12:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's it.
Dialogue: 5,3:13:00.97,3:13:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}圣母玛利亚
Dialogue: 4,3:13:00.97,3:13:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Holy Mary, Mother of God...
Dialogue: 5,3:13:03.60,3:13:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}圣母玛利亚
Dialogue: 4,3:13:03.60,3:13:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Holy Mary, Mother of God...
Dialogue: 5,3:13:04.93,3:13:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-请为我们这些罪人祈祷 -请为我们这些罪人祈祷
Dialogue: 4,3:13:04.93,3:13:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Pray for us sinners... - Pray for us sinners...
Dialogue: 5,3:13:07.55,3:13:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-现在和我们临终时 -现在和我们临终时
Dialogue: 4,3:13:07.55,3:13:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Now and at the hour of our death. - Now and at the hour of our death.
Dialogue: 5,3:13:11.22,3:13:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-阿门 -阿门
Dialogue: 4,3:13:11.22,3:13:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Amen. - Amen.
Dialogue: 5,3:13:15.64,3:13:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这...
Dialogue: 4,3:13:15.64,3:13:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That was...
Dialogue: 5,3:13:17.35,3:13:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这还不错
Dialogue: 4,3:13:17.35,3:13:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That wasn't too bad.
Dialogue: 5,3:13:19.18,3:13:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}很久没祷告过了
Dialogue: 4,3:13:19.18,3:13:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's been a while.
Dialogue: 5,3:13:21.01,3:13:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}真的很不错
Dialogue: 4,3:13:21.01,3:13:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Not bad at all.
Dialogue: 5,3:13:22.10,3:13:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}真心实意的 发自内心
Dialogue: 4,3:13:22.10,3:13:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And the intention was there. The intention.
Dialogue: 5,3:13:24.51,3:13:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道
Dialogue: 4,3:13:24.51,3:13:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know.
Dialogue: 5,3:13:26.30,3:13:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我知道你是发自内心的
Dialogue: 4,3:13:26.30,3:13:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I know the intention is there.
Dialogue: 5,3:13:28.26,3:13:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是真的 神父
Dialogue: 4,3:13:28.26,3:13:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It was there, Father.
Dialogue: 5,3:13:31.30,3:13:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你对自己做过的事
Dialogue: 4,3:13:31.30,3:13:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Do you feel anything for...
Dialogue: 5,3:13:33.43,3:13:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}有任何感觉吗
Dialogue: 4,3:13:33.43,3:13:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}for what you've done?
Dialogue: 5,3:13:39.18,3:13:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没有 不过也许...
Dialogue: 4,3:13:39.18,3:13:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I, I don't. I mean, maybe that...
Dialogue: 5,3:13:43.55,3:13:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我现在坐在这里跟你说话
Dialogue: 4,3:13:43.55,3:13:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Because I'm here now talking to you,
Dialogue: 5,3:13:45.47,3:13:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}也许这本身就是
Dialogue: 4,3:13:45.47,3:13:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}that in itself is,
Dialogue: 5,3:13:47.51,3:13:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一种尝试...
Dialogue: 4,3:13:47.51,3:13:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you know, an attempt to...
Dialogue: 5,3:13:54.47,3:13:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但你真的一点感觉都没有吗
Dialogue: 4,3:13:54.47,3:13:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But you don't feel anything at all?
Dialogue: 5,3:13:59.39,3:14:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没有
Dialogue: 4,3:13:59.39,3:14:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No.
Dialogue: 5,3:14:02.97,3:14:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}都是过去的事了
Dialogue: 4,3:14:02.97,3:14:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Water under the dam.
Dialogue: 5,3:14:09.10,3:14:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对他的家人有没有愧疚呢
Dialogue: 4,3:14:09.10,3:14:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Any... Any remorse for the families?
Dialogue: 5,3:14:13.43,3:14:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不认识他的家人
Dialogue: 4,3:14:13.43,3:14:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I... I didn't know the families.
Dialogue: 5,3:14:18.85,3:14:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不认识他们 只认识一个
Dialogue: 4,3:14:18.85,3:14:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I didn't know 'em. Except one I knew.
Dialogue: 5,3:14:26.68,3:14:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我认为我们可以悔过
Dialogue: 4,3:14:26.68,3:14:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I think we can... we can be sorry...
Dialogue: 5,3:14:29.72,3:14:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们可以悔过 即使我们不觉得难过
Dialogue: 4,3:14:29.72,3:14:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We can be sorry even when we don't feel sorry.
Dialogue: 5,3:14:33.30,3:14:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们可以做出意志上的决定
Dialogue: 4,3:14:33.30,3:14:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, for us to say, to make a decision of the will...
Dialogue: 5,3:14:36.30,3:14:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"上帝啊
Dialogue: 4,3:14:36.30,3:14:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"God...
Dialogue: 5,3:14:37.97,3:14:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我很抱歉 上帝
Dialogue: 4,3:14:37.97,3:14:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I am sorry, God.
Dialogue: 5,3:14:41.35,3:14:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}原谅我"
Dialogue: 4,3:14:41.35,3:14:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Forgive me."
Dialogue: 5,3:14:43.51,3:14:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这就是意志上的决定
Dialogue: 4,3:14:43.51,3:14:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And that... that's a decision of the will.
Dialogue: 5,3:14:54.10,3:14:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}什么样的人
Dialogue: 4,3:14:54.10,3:14:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What kind of man
