Dialogue: 4,3:14:57.30,3:15:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}makes a... a phone call like that?
Dialogue: 5,3:15:05.60,3:15:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}什么意思 什么电话
Dialogue: 4,3:15:05.60,3:15:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What do you mean? What phone call?
Dialogue: 5,3:15:07.85,3:15:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不能告诉你
Dialogue: 4,3:15:07.85,3:15:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 5,3:15:12.51,3:15:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我不能 我得...
Dialogue: 4,3:15:12.51,3:15:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I can't. I got...
Dialogue: 5,3:15:14.97,3:15:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}没关系
Dialogue: 4,3:15:14.97,3:15:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's okay.
Dialogue: 5,3:15:19.60,3:15:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}弗兰克 你想再和我祷告一次吗
Dialogue: 4,3:15:19.60,3:15:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Frank, do you wanna pray with me again?
Dialogue: 5,3:15:21.51,3:15:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好的
Dialogue: 4,3:15:21.51,3:15:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,3:15:23.43,3:15:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这次我们用自己的话来说 好吗
Dialogue: 4,3:15:23.43,3:15:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This time, we'll do it in our own words. Okay?
Dialogue: 5,3:15:25.39,3:15:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好
Dialogue: 4,3:15:25.39,3:15:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay.
