Dialogue: 4,3:15:28.55,3:15:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}God, we come before you
Dialogue: 5,3:15:31.26,3:15:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罪孽深重 忧伤不已
Dialogue: 4,3:15:31.26,3:15:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}sinful and sorrowful.
Dialogue: 5,3:15:33.85,3:15:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}罪孽深重 忧伤不已
Dialogue: 4,3:15:33.85,3:15:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Sinful and sorrowful.
Dialogue: 5,3:15:37.18,3:15:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们知道您善良仁慈
Dialogue: 4,3:15:37.18,3:15:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We know you are all good and all merciful.
Dialogue: 5,3:15:41.35,3:15:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我们知道您善良仁慈
Dialogue: 4,3:15:41.35,3:15:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We know you are all good and all merciful.
Dialogue: 5,3:15:45.85,3:15:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-我们请求您 -我们请求您
Dialogue: 4,3:15:45.85,3:15:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- We ask you... - We ask you...
Dialogue: 5,3:15:48.93,3:15:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}用您的眼光
Dialogue: 4,3:15:48.93,3:15:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to help us see ourselves...
Dialogue: 5,3:15:51.14,3:15:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}用您的眼光
Dialogue: 4,3:15:51.14,3:15:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to help us see ourselves...
Dialogue: 5,3:15:54.14,3:15:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-帮我们看清自己 -帮我们看清自己
Dialogue: 4,3:15:54.14,3:15:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- as you see us. - as you see us.
