Dialogue: 4,3:15:59.80,3:16:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's my daughter, Peggy.
Dialogue: 5,3:16:01.80,3:16:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-是吗 -是的
Dialogue: 4,3:16:01.80,3:16:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Is it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,3:16:03.35,3:16:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我好像还没见过她
Dialogue: 4,3:16:03.35,3:16:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I don't think I've met her yet.
Dialogue: 5,3:16:04.93,3:16:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她不怎么过来
Dialogue: 4,3:16:04.93,3:16:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, she... she ain't been around too much.
Dialogue: 5,3:16:08.01,3:16:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她是你的独生女吗
Dialogue: 4,3:16:08.01,3:16:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Is she your only child?
Dialogue: 5,3:16:09.64,3:16:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不是 我有四个女儿
Dialogue: 4,3:16:09.64,3:16:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No, I got four daughters.
Dialogue: 5,3:16:11.97,3:16:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你看
Dialogue: 4,3:16:11.97,3:16:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Over there. See?
