Dialogue: 4,3:16:13.76,3:16:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 5,3:16:15.47,3:16:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-大忙人 -是啊
Dialogue: 4,3:16:15.47,3:16:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Busy man. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,3:16:19.05,3:16:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是啊
Dialogue: 4,3:16:19.05,3:16:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,3:16:21.18,3:16:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}她身旁是谁
Dialogue: 4,3:16:21.18,3:16:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Who's that with her?
Dialogue: 5,3:16:23.93,3:16:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你不知道这是谁
Dialogue: 4,3:16:23.93,3:16:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You don't know who that is?
Dialogue: 5,3:16:27.39,3:16:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不知道
Dialogue: 4,3:16:27.39,3:16:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}No.
