Dialogue: 4,3:16:29.39,3:16:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Jimmy Hoffa.
Dialogue: 5,3:16:32.72,3:16:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是他啊
Dialogue: 4,3:16:32.72,3:16:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 5,3:16:33.47,3:16:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}得了吧 "是他啊"
Dialogue: 4,3:16:33.47,3:16:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah, right, "Oh, yeah."
Dialogue: 5,3:16:36.97,3:16:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你不知道他是谁
Dialogue: 4,3:16:36.97,3:16:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You don't know who he is.
Dialogue: 5,3:16:38.55,3:16:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好吧 我不知道
Dialogue: 4,3:16:38.55,3:16:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay, I don't.
Dialogue: 5,3:16:41.01,3:16:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是啊 你想不到时间过得有多快
Dialogue: 4,3:16:41.01,3:16:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Yeah. Boy, you don't know how fast time goes by
Dialogue: 5,3:16:44.05,3:16:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}明白了已经晚了
Dialogue: 4,3:16:44.05,3:16:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}until you get there.
Dialogue: 5,3:16:46.35,3:16:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不过你不用担心这个
Dialogue: 4,3:16:46.35,3:16:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But you don't have to worry about that
Dialogue: 5,3:16:48.05,3:16:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为你还有大把的好时光
Dialogue: 4,3:16:48.05,3:16:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}because you have your whole life ahead of you.
Dialogue: 5,3:16:50.85,3:16:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}长得很 时间过得太快...
Dialogue: 4,3:16:50.85,3:16:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Forever. It goes fast, time...
Dialogue: 5,3:16:53.68,3:16:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我跟你说
Dialogue: 4,3:16:53.68,3:16:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm tellin' ya.
Dialogue: 5,3:16:54.89,3:16:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我在给你量脉搏 希兰先生
Dialogue: 4,3:16:54.89,3:16:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm trying to take your pulse, Mr. Sheeran.
Dialogue: 5,3:16:56.64,3:16:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}请不要说话
Dialogue: 4,3:16:56.64,3:16:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Please, please don't talk.
Dialogue: 5,3:17:00.26,3:17:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}今天很不错
Dialogue: 4,3:17:00.26,3:17:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's great today.
Dialogue: 5,3:17:02.14,3:17:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我还活着
Dialogue: 4,3:17:02.14,3:17:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm still alive?
Dialogue: 5,3:17:03.35,3:17:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-是的 -真是好消息
Dialogue: 4,3:17:03.35,3:17:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Yes, you are. - That's good to know.
Dialogue: 5,3:17:06.18,3:17:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}活得好好的
Dialogue: 4,3:17:06.18,3:17:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Alive and well.
Dialogue: 5,3:17:07.60,3:17:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}现在没事了
Dialogue: 4,3:17:07.60,3:17:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And you're free
Dialogue: 5,3:17:09.05,3:17:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不过晚些时候还要再给你检查一遍
Dialogue: 4,3:17:09.05,3:17:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}till later today when we have to put you through all this again.
Dialogue: 5,3:17:11.55,3:17:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我哪都不去
Dialogue: 4,3:17:11.55,3:17:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I'm here.
Dialogue: 5,3:17:31.68,3:17:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...教会之奉
Dialogue: 4,3:17:31.68,3:17:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...ministry of the church.
Dialogue: 5,3:17:33.30,3:17:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}愿上帝赐予你宽恕与平静 弗兰克
Dialogue: 4,3:17:33.30,3:17:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}May God grant you pardon and peace, Frank.
Dialogue: 5,3:17:36.35,3:17:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我赦免你的罪
Dialogue: 4,3:17:36.35,3:17:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And I absolve you from your sins.
Dialogue: 5,3:17:37.55,3:17:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}以圣父 圣子
Dialogue: 4,3:17:37.55,3:17:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}In the name of the Father, and of the Son,
Dialogue: 5,3:17:40.05,3:17:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}圣灵的名义 阿门
Dialogue: 4,3:17:40.05,3:17:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and of the Holy Spirit, amen.
Dialogue: 5,3:17:43.22,3:17:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}感谢上帝 因为上帝仁慈
Dialogue: 4,3:17:43.22,3:17:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Give thanks to the Lord, for he is good.
Dialogue: 5,3:17:46.05,3:17:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他的慈爱
Dialogue: 4,3:17:46.05,3:17:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}His mercy...
Dialogue: 5,3:17:47.14,3:17:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-他的慈爱永远长存 -永远长存
Dialogue: 4,3:17:47.14,3:17:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- His mercy endures forever. - endures forever.
Dialogue: 5,3:17:49.76,3:17:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好了 弗兰克 我很快就会再来看你
Dialogue: 4,3:17:49.76,3:17:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All right, Frank. I'll be back to visit, okay? Very soon.
Dialogue: 5,3:17:52.76,3:17:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}大概圣诞假期后
Dialogue: 4,3:17:52.76,3:17:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Probably after the Christmas holidays.
Dialogue: 5,3:17:56.18,3:17:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好的
Dialogue: 4,3:17:56.18,3:17:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Okay.
Dialogue: 5,3:17:57.10,3:17:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-弗兰克 上帝保佑你 -你也是 谢谢
Dialogue: 4,3:17:57.10,3:17:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Frank, God bless you. - You too. Thank you.
Dialogue: 5,3:18:02.14,3:18:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}圣诞节到了
Dialogue: 4,3:18:02.14,3:18:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It's Christmas?
Dialogue: 5,3:18:04.39,3:18:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}快了
Dialogue: 4,3:18:04.39,3:18:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Almost.
Dialogue: 5,3:18:06.47,3:18:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我哪也不去
Dialogue: 4,3:18:06.47,3:18:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Well, I ain't going nowhere.
Dialogue: 5,3:18:10.80,3:18:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-神父 -怎么
Dialogue: 4,3:18:10.80,3:18:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- Father? - Yup?
Dialogue: 5,3:18:13.47,3:18:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}帮我个忙好吗
Dialogue: 4,3:18:13.47,3:18:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Do me a favor?
Dialogue: 5,3:18:15.26,3:18:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}别把门关严 我不喜欢那样
Dialogue: 4,3:18:15.26,3:18:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Don't shut the door all the way. I don't like that. Just...
Dialogue: 5,3:18:18.22,3:18:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}-留一条缝 -好
Dialogue: 4,3:18:18.22,3:18:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}- leave it open a little bit. - Okay.
Dialogue: 5,3:18:56.93,3:19:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}In the Still of the Night - The Five Satins
Dialogue: 5,3:18:56.93,3:19:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ In the still of the night ♪
Dialogue: 5,3:19:02.80,3:19:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ I held you ♪
Dialogue: 5,3:19:05.97,3:19:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Held you tight ♪
Dialogue: 5,3:19:06.68,3:19:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}爱尔兰人
Dialogue: 5,3:19:09.51,3:19:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ 'Cause I love ♪
Dialogue: 5,3:19:11.18,3:19:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}听说你刷房子
Dialogue: 5,3:19:12.35,3:19:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Love you so ♪
Dialogue: 5,3:19:15.68,3:19:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Promise I'll never ♪
Dialogue: 5,3:19:18.93,3:19:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Let you go ♪
Dialogue: 5,3:19:20.80,3:19:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ In the still of the night ♪
Dialogue: 5,3:19:28.72,3:19:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ I remember ♪
Dialogue: 5,3:19:31.85,3:19:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ That night in May ♪
Dialogue: 5,3:19:35.39,3:19:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ The stars were bright above ♪
Dialogue: 5,3:19:41.93,3:19:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ I'll hope and I'll pray ♪
Dialogue: 5,3:19:48.97,3:19:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ To keep Your precious love ♪
Dialogue: 5,3:19:54.93,3:20:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Well before the light ♪
Dialogue: 5,3:20:01.60,3:20:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Hold me again ♪
Dialogue: 5,3:20:04.55,3:20:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ With all of your might ♪
Dialogue: 5,3:20:06.72,3:20:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ In the still of the night ♪
Dialogue: 5,3:20:47.89,3:20:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ So before the light ♪
Dialogue: 5,3:20:54.60,3:20:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ Hold me again ♪
Dialogue: 5,3:20:57.76,3:20:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}♪ With all of your might ♪
